(typeof window !== "undefined" ? window : global).ENGLISH_LOOK_SUBJECTS = {"T1":{"key":"T1","title":"T1 I have no fear of that. I…","paras":[{"text":"I have no fear of that. I think contact with other theater can only enrich our own work as we see ourselves in an international context.","tokens":["I","have","no","fear","of","that.","I","think","contact","with","other","theater","can","only","enrich","our","own","work","as","we","see","ourselves","in","an","international","context."]},{"text":"Beckett, who wrote in France, is an example of that sort of enrichment. There is a history in Irish theater of our writers viewing Ireland from abroad.","tokens":["Beckett,","who","wrote","in","France,","is","an","example","of","that","sort","of","enrichment.","There","is","a","history","in","Irish","theater","of","our","writers","viewing","Ireland","from","abroad."]},{"text":"I think it's a terrible thing that they felt they were forced to. But no one can say it's a bad thing. Well, for instance, last summer's Abbey production of \"Hedda Gabler\" by Ibsen, a Norwegian, was hailed as a","tokens":["I","think","it's","a","terrible","thing","that","they","felt","they","were","forced","to.","But","no","one","can","say","it's","a","bad","thing.","Well,","for","instance,","last","summer's","Abbey","production","of","\"Hedda","Gabler\"","by","Ibsen,","a","Norwegian,","was","hailed","as","a"]},{"text":"major reinterpretation of that work. The Abbey's production of the play was viewed in international terms. That is part of a process that can continue.","tokens":["major","reinterpretation","of","that","work.","The","Abbey's","production","of","the","play","was","viewed","in","international","terms.","That","is","part","of","a","process","that","can","continue."]},{"text":"For the Irish to have access to theater that is not just English or American is important to European theater, not just in terms of showing how the Irish play those works, but in bringing them to Ireland.","tokens":["For","the","Irish","to","have","access","to","theater","that","is","not","just","English","or","American","is","important","to","European","theater,","not","just","in","terms","of","showing","how","the","Irish","play","those","works,","but","in","bringing","them","to","Ireland."]},{"text":"It shows us ways of making theater available in other places. I think all of that will affect the climate in which we work.","tokens":["It","shows","us","ways","of","making","theater","available","in","other","places.","I","think","all","of","that","will","affect","the","climate","in","which","we","work."]},{"text":"Many in the United states, particularly staunch free-traders, still vigorously oppose efforts by the government to aid and abet U.S. business. Their favorite pose last week was to say Bush's trip \"demeans the presi- dency,\" as William Niskanen, a former","tokens":["Many","in","the","United","states,","particularly","staunch","free-traders,","still","vigorously","oppose","efforts","by","the","government","to","aid","and","abet","U.S.","business.","Their","favorite","pose","last","week","was","to","say","Bush's","trip","\"demeans","the","presi-","dency,\"","as","William","Niskanen,","a","former"]},{"text":"Reagan administration economist, told one reporter. In this view, the president, all leader of the free world, should devote his foreign trips to high-minded subjects like arms control, environmental protection and human rights.","tokens":["Reagan","administration","economist,","told","one","reporter.","In","this","view,","the","president,","all","leader","of","the","free","world,","should","devote","his","foreign","trips","to","high-minded","subjects","like","arms","control,","environmental","protection","and","human","rights."]},{"text":"The implication tection and human rights. The implication is that issues of trade and commerce are secondary, if not downright grubby. The Long Island school's quietly eloquent founder, Henry Viscardi, Jr., saluted them: \"As permanently, totally disabled persons, you could","tokens":["The","implication","tection","and","human","rights.","The","implication","is","that","issues","of","trade","and","commerce","are","secondary,","if","not","downright","grubby.","The","Long","Island","school's","quietly","eloquent","founder,","Henry","Viscardi,","Jr.,","saluted","them:","\"As","permanently,","totally","disabled","persons,","you","could"]},{"text":"have remained at home to be supported. Instead, you have sought the chall- enges of life. You go forth with an optimism that accepts life's often un- favorable odds-but will not stop hoping and trying.","tokens":["have","remained","at","home","to","be","supported.","Instead,","you","have","sought","the","chall-","enges","of","life.","You","go","forth","with","an","optimism","that","accepts","life's","often","un-","favorable","odds-but","will","not","stop","hoping","and","trying."]},{"text":"What a lesson you re- present for the young people of America!\" The above findings might prove interesting to working parents who must find day care for their babies.","tokens":["What","a","lesson","you","re-","present","for","the","young","people","of","America!\"","The","above","findings","might","prove","interesting","to","working","parents","who","must","find","day","care","for","their","babies."]},{"text":"Family care in a private home, with se- veral babies together, is probably the ideal way to care for babies under three. Dr. Benjamin Spock, well-known pediatrician and author of books about babies, supports the idea.","tokens":["Family","care","in","a","private","home,","with","se-","veral","babies","together,","is","probably","the","ideal","way","to","care","for","babies","under","three.","Dr.","Benjamin","Spock,","well-known","pediatrician","and","author","of","books","about","babies,","supports","the","idea."]},{"text":"He says the family day care is sounder in theory than hiring a housekeeper or a babysitter. Last spring, for the fourth successive year, an unusual graduation took place at a unique high school in Albertson, N.Y.","tokens":["He","says","the","family","day","care","is","sounder","in","theory","than","hiring","a","housekeeper","or","a","babysitter.","Last","spring,","for","the","fourth","successive","year,","an","unusual","graduation","took","place","at","a","unique","high","school","in","Albertson,","N.Y."]},{"text":"as the smiling seniors, wearing traditional cap and gown, lined up for their diplomas, all were in wheelchairs. The electronic computer is contributing to advancements in science, technology, business, industry, education, and government.","tokens":["as","the","smiling","seniors,","wearing","traditional","cap","and","gown,","lined","up","for","their","diplomas,","all","were","in","wheelchairs.","The","electronic","computer","is","contributing","to","advancements","in","science,","technology,","business,","industry,","education,","and","government."]},{"text":"A computer plan the orbit of a satellite. It controls the lift-off of a rocket. The elec- tronic computer can also write checks, run machines, make predictions, han- dle payrolls, fight against crimes, maintain air safety, book tickets and keep","tokens":["A","computer","plan","the","orbit","of","a","satellite.","It","controls","the","lift-off","of","a","rocket.","The","elec-","tronic","computer","can","also","write","checks,","run","machines,","make","predictions,","han-","dle","payrolls,","fight","against","crimes,","maintain","air","safety,","book","tickets","and","keep"]},{"text":"track of reservation, and even match job-seeking men with man-seeking jobs. A day seldom passes without another job being assigned to the elec- tronic computer.","tokens":["track","of","reservation,","and","even","match","job-seeking","men","with","man-seeking","jobs.","A","day","seldom","passes","without","another","job","being","assigned","to","the","elec-","tronic","computer."]},{"text":"Businesses have long used machines of one type or another in their accounting and sales departments. The cash register, adding ma- chine, and simple desk or pocket calculator are all computers.","tokens":["Businesses","have","long","used","machines","of","one","type","or","another","in","their","accounting","and","sales","departments.","The","cash","register,","adding","ma-","chine,","and","simple","desk","or","pocket","calculator","are","all","computers."]},{"text":"The tran- sistorized computer can run other machines. It is the nerve center of automation. Automation has been defined as the use of a machine to run other machines.","tokens":["The","tran-","sistorized","computer","can","run","other","machines.","It","is","the","nerve","center","of","automation.","Automation","has","been","defined","as","the","use","of","a","machine","to","run","other","machines."]},{"text":"In the past, we assumed that only a man could operate a rolling mill in a steel plant or keep things going in an oil refinery.","tokens":["In","the","past,","we","assumed","that","only","a","man","could","operate","a","rolling","mill","in","a","steel","plant","or","keep","things","going","in","an","oil","refinery."]},{"text":"Computers have now taken over such responsibilities. One summer afternoon, a farmer was walking through a forest. He was carrying a big bag of rice home.","tokens":["Computers","have","now","taken","over","such","responsibilities.","One","summer","afternoon,","a","farmer","was","walking","through","a","forest.","He","was","carrying","a","big","bag","of","rice","home."]},{"text":"When he was resting under a big tree, he saw a lion running to him. He was much afraid. But the lion said, \"Please help me.","tokens":["When","he","was","resting","under","a","big","tree,","he","saw","a","lion","running","to","him.","He","was","much","afraid.","But","the","lion","said,","\"Please","help","me."]},{"text":"Let me go into your bag and they won't find me. \"The farmer was very kind and he helped the lion. After the hunters went away, the lion went out and said, \"I am hungry now.","tokens":["Let","me","go","into","your","bag","and","they","won't","find","me.","\"The","farmer","was","very","kind","and","he","helped","the","lion.","After","the","hunters","went","away,","the","lion","went","out","and","said,","\"I","am","hungry","now."]},{"text":"I want to eat you for my lunch. \"The farmer was afraid again and didn't know what to do. He said, \"don't eat me, Mr.","tokens":["I","want","to","eat","you","for","my","lunch.","\"The","farmer","was","afraid","again","and","didn't","know","what","to","do.","He","said,","\"don't","eat","me,","Mr."]},{"text":"Lion. Please let me go.\" The lion didn't want to let the farmer go. Just then an old man came. The farmer told the old man about the story.","tokens":["Lion.","Please","let","me","go.\"","The","lion","didn't","want","to","let","the","farmer","go.","Just","then","an","old","man","came.","The","farmer","told","the","old","man","about","the","story."]},{"text":"The old man said, \"Please go back into the bag, Mr. Lion. Then I will know who is right.\" After the lion went into the bag, the old man and the farmer tied up the bag.","tokens":["The","old","man","said,","\"Please","go","back","into","the","bag,","Mr.","Lion.","Then","I","will","know","who","is","right.\"","After","the","lion","went","into","the","bag,","the","old","man","and","the","farmer","tied","up","the","bag."]},{"text":"They hit the lion and killed the lion. Once upon a time, there was a poor family. They had one son. This son often went out to steal things.","tokens":["They","hit","the","lion","and","killed","the","lion.","Once","upon","a","time,","there","was","a","poor","family.","They","had","one","son.","This","son","often","went","out","to","steal","things."]},{"text":"Every time he brought something home, his mother was happy. Once he brought her some apples. She did not ask him how and where he got them.","tokens":["Every","time","he","brought","something","home,","his","mother","was","happy.","Once","he","brought","her","some","apples.","She","did","not","ask","him","how","and","where","he","got","them."]},{"text":"She just said, \"That's very good.\" Many years passed, the little boy grew up and became a full-time thief. One day the police caught him to jail.","tokens":["She","just","said,","\"That's","very","good.\"","Many","years","passed,","the","little","boy","grew","up","and","became","a","full-time","thief.","One","day","the","police","caught","him","to","jail."]},{"text":"The court said that he must die for his crimes. But before dying, he could have one last wish. The son asked for his mother.","tokens":["The","court","said","that","he","must","die","for","his","crimes.","But","before","dying,","he","could","have","one","last","wish.","The","son","asked","for","his","mother."]},{"text":"He said that he wanted to see her tongue. The mother came and stuck her tongue. Then son cut his mother's tongue until it was bleeding.","tokens":["He","said","that","he","wanted","to","see","her","tongue.","The","mother","came","and","stuck","her","tongue.","Then","son","cut","his","mother's","tongue","until","it","was","bleeding."]},{"text":"Everyone was surprised. They wanted to know why he had hurt his mother. When I was walked down the street the other day, I picked up a purse.","tokens":["Everyone","was","surprised.","They","wanted","to","know","why","he","had","hurt","his","mother.","When","I","was","walked","down","the","street","the","other","day,","I","picked","up","a","purse."]},{"text":"There was nothing inside it except some change and an old picture of a wo- man and a young girl about twelve years old, who looked like the woman's daughter.","tokens":["There","was","nothing","inside","it","except","some","change","and","an","old","picture","of","a","wo-","man","and","a","young","girl","about","twelve","years","old,","who","looked","like","the","woman's","daughter."]},{"text":"I gave it to a policeman in the station, who took down my name and address in case the owner might want to write and thank me.","tokens":["I","gave","it","to","a","policeman","in","the","station,","who","took","down","my","name","and","address","in","case","the","owner","might","want","to","write","and","thank","me."]},{"text":"That evening I went to have dinner with my aunt and uncle, who also invited a young woman whose face was known to me.","tokens":["That","evening","I","went","to","have","dinner","with","my","aunt","and","uncle,","who","also","invited","a","young","woman","whose","face","was","known","to","me."]},{"text":"I was quite sure that we had not met before. She said that she had lost her purse that had not met before. She was the young girl in the picture although she was now much older.","tokens":["I","was","quite","sure","that","we","had","not","met","before.","She","said","that","she","had","lost","her","purse","that","had","not","met","before.","She","was","the","young","girl","in","the","picture","although","she","was","now","much","older."]},{"text":"After dinner, we went to the police station. As the policeman gave the purse back, he said that I had found the purse and the person who had lost it.","tokens":["After","dinner,","we","went","to","the","police","station.","As","the","policeman","gave","the","purse","back,","he","said","that","I","had","found","the","purse","and","the","person","who","had","lost","it."]},{"text":"In short, our universities and colleges are concerned only with the development of specialized skills and abilities, and do little to develop of character among students.","tokens":["In","short,","our","universities","and","colleges","are","concerned","only","with","the","development","of","specialized","skills","and","abilities,","and","do","little","to","develop","of","character","among","students."]},{"text":"This is one of the crises facing education in this country today. Was sincerely hope that educational officials and uni- versity authorities will give serious thought to this problem.","tokens":["This","is","one","of","the","crises","facing","education","in","this","country","today.","Was","sincerely","hope","that","educational","officials","and","uni-","versity","authorities","will","give","serious","thought","to","this","problem."]},{"text":"An educa- tion reform movement is under way and gathering momentum in this country. Most of the reforms being sought, we believe, are really superficial and touch only the surface of the educational problems currently in existence.","tokens":["An","educa-","tion","reform","movement","is","under","way","and","gathering","momentum","in","this","country.","Most","of","the","reforms","being","sought,","we","believe,","are","really","superficial","and","touch","only","the","surface","of","the","educational","problems","currently","in","existence."]},{"text":"It is essential to probe deeper and find the real issues. Each university and college has a student counseling center to aid depressed students.","tokens":["It","is","essential","to","probe","deeper","and","find","the","real","issues.","Each","university","and","college","has","a","student","counseling","center","to","aid","depressed","students."]},{"text":"Generally speaking, however, the service does not seem to help very much. Some fundamental changes should be made in college education to make college students more emotionally stable individuals.","tokens":["Generally","speaking,","however,","the","service","does","not","seem","to","help","very","much.","Some","fundamental","changes","should","be","made","in","college","education","to","make","college","students","more","emotionally","stable","individuals."]},{"text":"Above all, the schools must stop neglecting their responsibility to teach values. The program at local universities are on the whole too specialized and therefore fail to turn out well-rounded individuals.","tokens":["Above","all,","the","schools","must","stop","neglecting","their","responsibility","to","teach","values.","The","program","at","local","universities","are","on","the","whole","too","specialized","and","therefore","fail","to","turn","out","well-rounded","individuals."]},{"text":"The programs fail to help students grow emotionally and morally as well as intellectually. College teachers are too busy with research duties to care about students' moral and emotional lives.","tokens":["The","programs","fail","to","help","students","grow","emotionally","and","morally","as","well","as","intellectually.","College","teachers","are","too","busy","with","research","duties","to","care","about","students'","moral","and","emotional","lives."]},{"text":"And school officials too concerned with administration to heed the personal problems of students. The recent stu- dent suicides indicate that the cultivation of a positive outlook on life among students is a task much neglected.","tokens":["And","school","officials","too","concerned","with","administration","to","heed","the","personal","problems","of","students.","The","recent","stu-","dent","suicides","indicate","that","the","cultivation","of","a","positive","outlook","on","life","among","students","is","a","task","much","neglected."]},{"text":"Re-emphasizing this task is urgently needed to improve education here. All the world's a stage. \"So wrote william Shakespeare, the world's greatest dramatist.\" Shakespeare went on to say that all of us are actors on this stage.","tokens":["Re-emphasizing","this","task","is","urgently","needed","to","improve","education","here.","All","the","world's","a","stage.","\"So","wrote","william","Shakespeare,","the","world's","greatest","dramatist.\"","Shakespeare","went","on","to","say","that","all","of","us","are","actors","on","this","stage."]},{"text":"We are, indeed, actors in the great drama called history, which is written by the deeds of mankind. The same is true of this most imoportant of all dramas-the one played by mankind.","tokens":["We","are,","indeed,","actors","in","the","great","drama","called","history,","which","is","written","by","the","deeds","of","mankind.","The","same","is","true","of","this","most","imoportant","of","all","dramas-the","one","played","by","mankind."]},{"text":"You were born in the midst of the \"play.\" Much went on before you stepped into the present scene. In order, therefore, to play your part intelligently and well, you must know what men have been doing up to your time.","tokens":["You","were","born","in","the","midst","of","the","\"play.\"","Much","went","on","before","you","stepped","into","the","present","scene.","In","order,","therefore,","to","play","your","part","intelligently","and","well,","you","must","know","what","men","have","been","doing","up","to","your","time."]}]},"T2":{"key":"T2","title":"T2 Precisely what Dunkel wants to avoid is…","paras":[{"text":"Precisely what Dunkel wants to avoid is any modification of his large, carefully balanced package, which proposes new rules governing trade in services and high technology, intellectual property, dumping and the settlement of trade disputes.","tokens":["Precisely","what","Dunkel","wants","to","avoid","is","any","modification","of","his","large,","carefully","balanced","package,","which","proposes","new","rules","governing","trade","in","services","and","high","technology,","intellectual","property,","dumping","and","the","settlement","of","trade","disputes."]},{"text":"At apress conference Friday, the director general warned negotiators they could not \"pick and choose\" from his text without unraveling the whole package. But the EC seemed intent on reopen- ing the agriculture chapter, no matter what the risks.","tokens":["At","apress","conference","Friday,","the","director","general","warned","negotiators","they","could","not","\"pick","and","choose\"","from","his","text","without","unraveling","the","whole","package.","But","the","EC","seemed","intent","on","reopen-","ing","the","agriculture","chapter,","no","matter","what","the","risks."]},{"text":"Early Saturday EC ministers repeated their earlier objections to the Dunkel paper. They ordered their negotiators to bargain for \"substantial amendments and necessary modifications\" in the draft.","tokens":["Early","Saturday","EC","ministers","repeated","their","earlier","objections","to","the","Dunkel","paper.","They","ordered","their","negotiators","to","bargain","for","\"substantial","amendments","and","necessary","modifications\"","in","the","draft."]},{"text":"In the early 1950s, party telephone lines were common in homes across America, and even author James Michener shared his phone line with several families in rural Bucks County, Pennsylvania.","tokens":["In","the","early","1950s,","party","telephone","lines","were","common","in","homes","across","America,","and","even","author","James","Michener","shared","his","phone","line","with","several","families","in","rural","Bucks","County,","Pennsylvania."]},{"text":"One day, publisher Bennett Cerf of Random House called Michener to discuss a complicated book contract that Cerf hoped Michener would sign. Cerf said that he needed a yes or no answer immediately and proceeded to explain the details.","tokens":["One","day,","publisher","Bennett","Cerf","of","Random","House","called","Michener","to","discuss","a","complicated","book","contract","that","Cerf","hoped","Michener","would","sign.","Cerf","said","that","he","needed","a","yes","or","no","answer","immediately","and","proceeded","to","explain","the","details."]},{"text":"Michener listen- ed, and then asked several questions. Cerf followed with additional expla- nation and finally asked for Michener's answer. Michener paused because he did not fully understand the contract yet.","tokens":["Michener","listen-","ed,","and","then","asked","several","questions.","Cerf","followed","with","additional","expla-","nation","and","finally","asked","for","Michener's","answer.","Michener","paused","because","he","did","not","fully","understand","the","contract","yet."]},{"text":"But after several seconds his silence was interrupted by a third, unknown party, who whispered, \"michen- er, you're a fool if you don't say yes.\"","tokens":["But","after","several","seconds","his","silence","was","interrupted","by","a","third,","unknown","party,","who","whispered,","\"michen-","er,","you're","a","fool","if","you","don't","say","yes.\""]},{"text":"Suppose you were an actor in an infinitely lesser drama, a play writ- ten by one man or woman. Let us suppose also that you appeared on the stage for the first time in the middle of the second or","tokens":["Suppose","you","were","an","actor","in","an","infinitely","lesser","drama,","a","play","writ-","ten","by","one","man","or","woman.","Let","us","suppose","also","that","you","appeared","on","the","stage","for","the","first","time","in","the","middle","of","the","second","or"]},{"text":"third ace. In that case you would be well aware of the fact that to do a good job of acting, you would need to know what other performers who had appeared on the stage in earlier scenes had said","tokens":["third","ace.","In","that","case","you","would","be","well","aware","of","the","fact","that","to","do","a","good","job","of","acting,","you","would","need","to","know","what","other","performers","who","had","appeared","on","the","stage","in","earlier","scenes","had","said"]},{"text":"and done. In other words, you would need to know the story up to the time of your entrance. The same is true of this most important of all dramas-the one played by mankind.","tokens":["and","done.","In","other","words,","you","would","need","to","know","the","story","up","to","the","time","of","your","entrance.","The","same","is","true","of","this","most","important","of","all","dramas-the","one","played","by","mankind."]},{"text":"You were born in the midst of the \"play.\" Much went on before you stepped into the present scene. In order, therefore, to play your part intelligently and well, you must know what men have been doing up to your","tokens":["You","were","born","in","the","midst","of","the","\"play.\"","Much","went","on","before","you","stepped","into","the","present","scene.","In","order,","therefore,","to","play","your","part","intelligently","and","well,","you","must","know","what","men","have","been","doing","up","to","your"]},{"text":"time. Such theaters (in which the talented young actors and actresses who entertain guests after dinner also serve as waiters and waitresses) have become increasingly popular throughout the country.","tokens":["time.","Such","theaters","(in","which","the","talented","young","actors","and","actresses","who","entertain","guests","after","dinner","also","serve","as","waiters","and","waitresses)","have","become","increasingly","popular","throughout","the","country."]},{"text":"Recently, visitors to Boulder from Europe attended the theater and said, \"This is something we do not have in our country. It simply could not be!","tokens":["Recently,","visitors","to","Boulder","from","Europe","attended","the","theater","and","said,","\"This","is","something","we","do","not","have","in","our","country.","It","simply","could","not","be!"]},{"text":"In our country actors feel above waiters, and waiters would not stop to do something like clean- ing streets. When we go home and tell people that the actors and dancers are the same people who bring your dinner to","tokens":["In","our","country","actors","feel","above","waiters,","and","waiters","would","not","stop","to","do","something","like","clean-","ing","streets.","When","we","go","home","and","tell","people","that","the","actors","and","dancers","are","the","same","people","who","bring","your","dinner","to"]},{"text":"your table. Many observers have commented on what seems to be the fact that fear plays a much smaller part than we should think it must in the life of an animal which lives dangerously.","tokens":["your","table.","Many","observers","have","commented","on","what","seems","to","be","the","fact","that","fear","plays","a","much","smaller","part","than","we","should","think","it","must","in","the","life","of","an","animal","which","lives","dangerously."]},{"text":"Terror he can know, and perhaps he knows it frequently. But it seems to last only a little longer than the immedi- ate danger it helps him to avoid, instead of lingering, as in the human being it does until","tokens":["Terror","he","can","know,","and","perhaps","he","knows","it","frequently.","But","it","seems","to","last","only","a","little","longer","than","the","immedi-","ate","danger","it","helps","him","to","avoid,","instead","of","lingering,","as","in","the","human","being","it","does","until"]},{"text":"it becomes a burden and a threat. The frightened bird resumes his song as soon as danger has passed and so does the frightened rabbit his games.","tokens":["it","becomes","a","burden","and","a","threat.","The","frightened","bird","resumes","his","song","as","soon","as","danger","has","passed","and","so","does","the","frightened","rabbit","his","games."]},{"text":"It is almost as if they knew that \"cowards die many times before their deaths'the brave never taste of death but once.\" I am a 17-year-old girl, and will graduate from senior high school next year.","tokens":["It","is","almost","as","if","they","knew","that","\"cowards","die","many","times","before","their","deaths'the","brave","never","taste","of","death","but","once.\"","I","am","a","17-year-old","girl,","and","will","graduate","from","senior","high","school","next","year."]},{"text":"It has come time for me to make a decision about entering a higher level school. I am interested in foreign languages and crave for studying in either America or Canada.","tokens":["It","has","come","time","for","me","to","make","a","decision","about","entering","a","higher","level","school.","I","am","interested","in","foreign","languages","and","crave","for","studying","in","either","America","or","Canada."]},{"text":"However, my mother is against it because the tuition is too great an amount for my family. I have a part- time job at a local convenience store to help save for school expenses.","tokens":["However,","my","mother","is","against","it","because","the","tuition","is","too","great","an","amount","for","my","family.","I","have","a","part-","time","job","at","a","local","convenience","store","to","help","save","for","school","expenses."]},{"text":"But the tuition is just too much of a burden for my family. I am helpless, for I cannot decide what to do. If you were me, what would you do, study in Taiwan or America?","tokens":["But","the","tuition","is","just","too","much","of","a","burden","for","my","family.","I","am","helpless,","for","I","cannot","decide","what","to","do.","If","you","were","me,","what","would","you","do,","study","in","Taiwan","or","America?"]},{"text":"In fact, if I were determined to be disapproving of the Messrs. Cerf and Cartmell, one of my chief criticisms would be that they had included too few Irish plays in their collection.","tokens":["In","fact,","if","I","were","determined","to","be","disapproving","of","the","Messrs.","Cerf","and","Cartmell,","one","of","my","chief","criticisms","would","be","that","they","had","included","too","few","Irish","plays","in","their","collection."]},{"text":"It is my dogmatic opinion that Synge's Riders to the Sea is not only the finest drama in this volume, but is the most eloquently powerful one-act play that has ever been written.","tokens":["It","is","my","dogmatic","opinion","that","Synge's","Riders","to","the","Sea","is","not","only","the","finest","drama","in","this","volume,","but","is","the","most","eloquently","powerful","one-act","play","that","has","ever","been","written."]},{"text":"Lady Gergory's The Rising of the Moon is a delightful little play and I am glad that it has been included, but I wish that space could likewise have been found for the selfsame Lady Gregoty's The Gaol Gate and","tokens":["Lady","Gergory's","The","Rising","of","the","Moon","is","a","delightful","little","play","and","I","am","glad","that","it","has","been","included,","but","I","wish","that","space","could","likewise","have","been","found","for","the","selfsame","Lady","Gregoty's","The","Gaol","Gate","and"]},{"text":"possibly for her Spareading the News; certainly for W.B. Yeats's stirring Cathleen in Houlihan. I am a bit dubious about including St. John Ervine among the Irish playwrights, but I wish there had been room for his short work called","tokens":["possibly","for","her","Spareading","the","News;","certainly","for","W.B.","Yeats's","stirring","Cathleen","in","Houlihan.","I","am","a","bit","dubious","about","including","St.","John","Ervine","among","the","Irish","playwrights,","but","I","wish","there","had","been","room","for","his","short","work","called"]},{"text":"The Magnanimous Lover. My name is Joe King and I am from Texas. I have live in Taiwan for one year. Teaching English is my job.","tokens":["The","Magnanimous","Lover.","My","name","is","Joe","King","and","I","am","from","Texas.","I","have","live","in","Taiwan","for","one","year.","Teaching","English","is","my","job."]},{"text":"After one year's teaching, I would like to tell you something about English learning. I know English is hard for you to learn, but you'll enjoy learning the language when you become interested in it.","tokens":["After","one","year's","teaching,","I","would","like","to","tell","you","something","about","English","learning.","I","know","English","is","hard","for","you","to","learn,","but","you'll","enjoy","learning","the","language","when","you","become","interested","in","it."]},{"text":"However, if you really want to learn it well, you have to practice every day. What I mean is that you have to spend much time on it and have to study hard.","tokens":["However,","if","you","really","want","to","learn","it","well,","you","have","to","practice","every","day.","What","I","mean","is","that","you","have","to","spend","much","time","on","it","and","have","to","study","hard."]},{"text":"Don't give up. Try hard. I believe you'll learn it. Bill was studying at a college. Like most students, he didn't have much money.","tokens":["Don't","give","up.","Try","hard.","I","believe","you'll","learn","it.","Bill","was","studying","at","a","college.","Like","most","students,","he","didn't","have","much","money."]},{"text":"His mother's birthday was coming soon, and he planned to buy her a present that should be nice, but not too expensive. He went shoppp- ing in a department store and bought a beautiful umbrella.","tokens":["His","mother's","birthday","was","coming","soon,","and","he","planned","to","buy","her","a","present","that","should","be","nice,","but","not","too","expensive.","He","went","shoppp-","ing","in","a","department","store","and","bought","a","beautiful","umbrella."]},{"text":"On his way back home, he walked by a pond and saw may children playing in the water. Su- ddenly, he heard a strange sound from the pond and something caught his eye.","tokens":["On","his","way","back","home,","he","walked","by","a","pond","and","saw","may","children","playing","in","the","water.","Su-","ddenly,","he","heard","a","strange","sound","from","the","pond","and","something","caught","his","eye."]},{"text":"A child was trying hard to get out of the water, but he could not. Bill thought of the umbrella and asked the child to hold it.","tokens":["A","child","was","trying","hard","to","get","out","of","the","water,","but","he","could","not.","Bill","thought","of","the","umbrella","and","asked","the","child","to","hold","it."]},{"text":"Finally, the child was out of the water. Bill felt quite happy and thought that his um- brella was really a good choice. There's no doubt that the Eastern commonwealth's road to a mutually satisfying and stable union will be","tokens":["Finally,","the","child","was","out","of","the","water.","Bill","felt","quite","happy","and","thought","that","his","um-","brella","was","really","a","good","choice.","There's","no","doubt","that","the","Eastern","commonwealth's","road","to","a","mutually","satisfying","and","stable","union","will","be"]},{"text":"a much rougher one than that taken by its West European counterpart. But in spite of the obvious obstacles, it may not lag far behind.","tokens":["a","much","rougher","one","than","that","taken","by","its","West","European","counterpart.","But","in","spite","of","the","obvious","obstacles,","it","may","not","lag","far","behind."]},{"text":"Though they lack the strong market and mature de- mocracy of the West, the former Soviet republics have other advantages the Europeans lack, such as a common language, integrated transportation, edu- cational and energy systems and unified industrial standards.","tokens":["Though","they","lack","the","strong","market","and","mature","de-","mocracy","of","the","West,","the","former","Soviet","republics","have","other","advantages","the","Europeans","lack,","such","as","a","common","language,","integrated","transportation,","edu-","cational","and","energy","systems","and","unified","industrial","standards."]},{"text":"These are all reasons to believe that after the members of the Eastern commonwealth pass the present stage of nationalist fever and economic turmoil, their pace of integration will speed up.","tokens":["These","are","all","reasons","to","believe","that","after","the","members","of","the","Eastern","commonwealth","pass","the","present","stage","of","nationalist","fever","and","economic","turmoil,","their","pace","of","integration","will","speed","up."]},{"text":"Don't treat me cruelly, Moo Moo. You don't understand me. No man ever really understands a woman. There are terrible depths to my nature.","tokens":["Don't","treat","me","cruelly,","Moo","Moo.","You","don't","understand","me.","No","man","ever","really","understands","a","woman.","There","are","terrible","depths","to","my","nature."]},{"text":"I had a long talk with Dr. Esculapius only last week, and he told me I'm too introspective. It's the curse of us emotional women.","tokens":["I","had","a","long","talk","with","Dr.","Esculapius","only","last","week,","and","he","told","me","I'm","too","introspective.","It's","the","curse","of","us","emotional","women."]},{"text":"I'm really quite worried, but much you care, much you care. (A note of tears comes into her voice) I'm sure you don't love me any more, Moo Moo.","tokens":["I'm","really","quite","worried,","but","much","you","care,","much","you","care.","(A","note","of","tears","comes","into","her","voice)","I'm","sure","you","don't","love","me","any","more,","Moo","Moo."]},{"text":"No! No! Don't an- swer me! If you did you couldn't speak to me the way you do. I've never wronged you in deed or in thought.","tokens":["No!","No!","Don't","an-","swer","me!","If","you","did","you","couldn't","speak","to","me","the","way","you","do.","I've","never","wronged","you","in","deed","or","in","thought."]},{"text":"No, never-never. I've given up my hopes and aspirations, because I knew you wanted me around you. And now. NOW-(she can contain the tears no longer) Because I have neglected my beauty and because I am old and ugly, you","tokens":["No,","never-never.","I've","given","up","my","hopes","and","aspirations,","because","I","knew","you","wanted","me","around","you.","And","now.","NOW-(she","can","contain","the","tears","no","longer)","Because","I","have","neglected","my","beauty","and","because","I","am","old","and","ugly,","you"]},{"text":"regret that Ulysses of Agamemnon didn't marry me when you all wanted me, and I know you curse the day you ever saw me.","tokens":["regret","that","Ulysses","of","Agamemnon","didn't","marry","me","when","you","all","wanted","me,","and","I","know","you","curse","the","day","you","ever","saw","me."]},{"text":"(She is breathless.) As the proverb says, \"the voice of the people is the voice of God.\" But this proverb is by no means invariably true.","tokens":["(She","is","breathless.)","As","the","proverb","says,","\"the","voice","of","the","people","is","the","voice","of","God.\"","But","this","proverb","is","by","no","means","invariably","true."]},{"text":"In any case, what it really means is, I think, that the feeling or instinct of the people is usually right, if it is spontaneous.","tokens":["In","any","case,","what","it","really","means","is,","I","think,","that","the","feeling","or","instinct","of","the","people","is","usually","right,","if","it","is","spontaneous."]},{"text":"On the other hand, the opinions of the people at large especially when artificially stimulated by mass media are usually shallow and mistaken. Here, it seems to me, is the greatest danger of the democratic form of government: in that","tokens":["On","the","other","hand,","the","opinions","of","the","people","at","large","especially","when","artificially","stimulated","by","mass","media","are","usually","shallow","and","mistaken.","Here,","it","seems","to","me,","is","the","greatest","danger","of","the","democratic","form","of","government:","in","that"]},{"text":"important issues are often decided by popular prejudice, based on insufficient knowledge and de- ficient judgment. Whereas the opinion of a few persons, possessed of de- tailed knowledge and sound judgment, is surely far more reliable.","tokens":["important","issues","are","often","decided","by","popular","prejudice,","based","on","insufficient","knowledge","and","de-","ficient","judgment.","Whereas","the","opinion","of","a","few","persons,","possessed","of","de-","tailed","knowledge","and","sound","judgment,","is","surely","far","more","reliable."]},{"text":"This is a major reason for the aristocratic form of government.","tokens":["This","is","a","major","reason","for","the","aristocratic","form","of","government."]}]},"T3":{"key":"T3","title":"T3 Sunday, for my part, is a precious…","paras":[{"text":"Sunday, for my part, is a precious period of time. To be more accur- ate, it is a luxury in that I am now in the last year of my college life -- my weekdays are occupied with a heavy","tokens":["Sunday,","for","my","part,","is","a","precious","period","of","time.","To","be","more","accur-","ate,","it","is","a","luxury","in","that","I","am","now","in","the","last","year","of","my","college","life","--","my","weekdays","are","occupied","with","a","heavy"]},{"text":"workload. Only on Sundays can I have a change of pace and embark upon what I like to do. I am an intro- vert.","tokens":["workload.","Only","on","Sundays","can","I","have","a","change","of","pace","and","embark","upon","what","I","like","to","do.","I","am","an","intro-","vert."]},{"text":"Unlike many others who enjoy such outdoor activities as mountain- climbing and swimming, I prefer to stay home listening to some lyrical mu- sic to ward off those troubling thoughts.","tokens":["Unlike","many","others","who","enjoy","such","outdoor","activities","as","mountain-","climbing","and","swimming,","I","prefer","to","stay","home","listening","to","some","lyrical","mu-","sic","to","ward","off","those","troubling","thoughts."]},{"text":"Once in a while, I will browse through a good novel should I have one at hand. I take to translation. If I happen to have read a well-written essay, I will render it into English.","tokens":["Once","in","a","while,","I","will","browse","through","a","good","novel","should","I","have","one","at","hand.","I","take","to","translation.","If","I","happen","to","have","read","a","well-written","essay,","I","will","render","it","into","English."]},{"text":"I am quite satisfied with the way I arrange my Sundays. It refreshes my energy and enables me to face the challenge of another busy week with joy.","tokens":["I","am","quite","satisfied","with","the","way","I","arrange","my","Sundays.","It","refreshes","my","energy","and","enables","me","to","face","the","challenge","of","another","busy","week","with","joy."]},{"text":"It is curious that, while swimming comes natural to most animals, men have to learn to swim. Such animals as dogs, horses, deer, and cattle can swim when they first go into the water, but a man will sink unless","tokens":["It","is","curious","that,","while","swimming","comes","natural","to","most","animals,","men","have","to","learn","to","swim.","Such","animals","as","dogs,","horses,","deer,","and","cattle","can","swim","when","they","first","go","into","the","water,","but","a","man","will","sink","unless"]},{"text":"he has learned the art. And, when we consider how necessary it may be to most people at some time in their lives to know how to swim, it is still more curious that comparatively few people take the trouble","tokens":["he","has","learned","the","art.","And,","when","we","consider","how","necessary","it","may","be","to","most","people","at","some","time","in","their","lives","to","know","how","to","swim,","it","is","still","more","curious","that","comparatively","few","people","take","the","trouble"]},{"text":"to learn the art. It is even said that many sailors and fishermen, who are in daily risk of drowning, are not swimmers. It is no secret that I am not one of those naturalists who suffer from cities, or","tokens":["to","learn","the","art.","It","is","even","said","that","many","sailors","and","fishermen,","who","are","in","daily","risk","of","drowning,","are","not","swimmers.","It","is","no","secret","that","I","am","not","one","of","those","naturalists","who","suffer","from","cities,","or"]},{"text":"affect to do so; nor do I find a city unnatural or un- interesting, or a rubbish heap of follies. It has always seemed to me that there is something more than mechanically admirable about a train that arrives on","tokens":["affect","to","do","so;","nor","do","I","find","a","city","unnatural","or","un-","interesting,","or","a","rubbish","heap","of","follies.","It","has","always","seemed","to","me","that","there","is","something","more","than","mechanically","admirable","about","a","train","that","arrives","on"]},{"text":"time, a fire department that comes when you call it, a light that health of a penniless man and provide for him the agencies of mercy, the X ray, the precious radium, the anesthetics and the surgical skill.","tokens":["time,","a","fire","department","that","comes","when","you","call","it,","a","light","that","health","of","a","penniless","man","and","provide","for","him","the","agencies","of","mercy,","the","X","ray,","the","precious","radium,","the","anesthetics","and","the","surgical","skill."]},{"text":"For, beyond any pay these services receive, there stands out the pride in perfect performance. And above all, I admire the noble impersonality of civilization that does not inquire where the recipient stands on religion or politics or race.","tokens":["For,","beyond","any","pay","these","services","receive,","there","stands","out","the","pride","in","perfect","performance.","And","above","all,","I","admire","the","noble","impersonality","of","civilization","that","does","not","inquire","where","the","recipient","stands","on","religion","or","politics","or","race."]},{"text":"I call this beauty, and I call it spirit--not some mystical soulfulness that nobody can define, but the spirit of man, that has been growing a million years.","tokens":["I","call","this","beauty,","and","I","call","it","spirit--not","some","mystical","soulfulness","that","nobody","can","define,","but","the","spirit","of","man,","that","has","been","growing","a","million","years."]},{"text":"At the end of 1989, the world saw the downfall of Communist govern- ments in Eastern Europe. Now people are watching the Soviet Union.","tokens":["At","the","end","of","1989,","the","world","saw","the","downfall","of","Communist","govern-","ments","in","Eastern","Europe.","Now","people","are","watching","the","Soviet","Union."]},{"text":"Could the same thing happen there? To many people, it seems unlikely. Eastern Europe became Communist in the 1940's. By contrast, the Soviet system is over 70 years old.","tokens":["Could","the","same","thing","happen","there?","To","many","people,","it","seems","unlikely.","Eastern","Europe","became","Communist","in","the","1940's.","By","contrast,","the","Soviet","system","is","over","70","years","old."]},{"text":"Few people in the Soviet Union even remember the days before Communism. In 1917, Vladimir Lenin and the Communists seize power. They believed that capitalism was bad.","tokens":["Few","people","in","the","Soviet","Union","even","remember","the","days","before","Communism.","In","1917,","Vladimir","Lenin","and","the","Communists","seize","power.","They","believed","that","capitalism","was","bad."]},{"text":"Workers were not treated well. Too many people were poor and illiterate. If the people themselve owned every- thing, their lives would be better.","tokens":["Workers","were","not","treated","well.","Too","many","people","were","poor","and","illiterate.","If","the","people","themselve","owned","every-","thing,","their","lives","would","be","better."]},{"text":"The Communists claimed to represent all the people. They took control of banks, factories and schools. Since then, the Communist Party had controlled almost every part of the people's lives.","tokens":["The","Communists","claimed","to","represent","all","the","people.","They","took","control","of","banks,","factories","and","schools.","Since","then,","the","Communist","Party","had","controlled","almost","every","part","of","the","people's","lives."]},{"text":"Clothmaking was greatly increased by the invention of a machine to remove the seed from the cotton which grew abundantly in the southern area of the United States.","tokens":["Clothmaking","was","greatly","increased","by","the","invention","of","a","machine","to","remove","the","seed","from","the","cotton","which","grew","abundantly","in","the","southern","area","of","the","United","States."]},{"text":"This machine was the work of Eli Whitney, a young man from New England who had gone south to teach school. While visiting a plantation, he heard a good deal of talk about the cost of separating co- tton fiber","tokens":["This","machine","was","the","work","of","Eli","Whitney,","a","young","man","from","New","England","who","had","gone","south","to","teach","school.","While","visiting","a","plantation,","he","heard","a","good","deal","of","talk","about","the","cost","of","separating","co-","tton","fiber"]},{"text":"from the seed. He was told that a man, working all day, could separate only a pound of cotton from the seed. Both Georgia and South Ca- rolina had offered a prize for a machine that could do the work,","tokens":["from","the","seed.","He","was","told","that","a","man,","working","all","day,","could","separate","only","a","pound","of","cotton","from","the","seed.","Both","Georgia","and","South","Ca-","rolina","had","offered","a","prize","for","a","machine","that","could","do","the","work,"]},{"text":"but no one had claimed it. Whitney became so much interested in the problem that the quit teaching and put all his time into the effort of inventing a co- tton gin.","tokens":["but","no","one","had","claimed","it.","Whitney","became","so","much","interested","in","the","problem","that","the","quit","teaching","and","put","all","his","time","into","the","effort","of","inventing","a","co-","tton","gin."]},{"text":"In 1793 he completed a machine with which a man could clean fif- ty pounds of cotton a day. He wrote his father proudly: it makes the la- bor fifty times less without throwing any class of people out or","tokens":["In","1793","he","completed","a","machine","with","which","a","man","could","clean","fif-","ty","pounds","of","cotton","a","day.","He","wrote","his","father","proudly:","it","makes","the","la-","bor","fifty","times","less","without","throwing","any","class","of","people","out","or"]},{"text":"business. He continued no work on his machine, improving it so that it would clean more and more cotton. But his hopes of making a great fortune with the co- tton gin were never realize because many people, after learning","tokens":["business.","He","continued","no","work","on","his","machine,","improving","it","so","that","it","would","clean","more","and","more","cotton.","But","his","hopes","of","making","a","great","fortune","with","the","co-","tton","gin","were","never","realize","because","many","people,","after","learning"]},{"text":"how, simply built gins and paid Whitney nothing for his invention. The New York outposts of the Japanese firms have been among the biggest beneficiaries of that time-honored back-scratching formula.","tokens":["how,","simply","built","gins","and","paid","Whitney","nothing","for","his","invention.","The","New","York","outposts","of","the","Japanese","firms","have","been","among","the","biggest","beneficiaries","of","that","time-honored","back-scratching","formula."]},{"text":"As Tokuro Isoda, president of Daiwa Securities America, Inc., notes, for years their main mission was to sell Japanese stocks to American institutional investors and U.S.","tokens":["As","Tokuro","Isoda,","president","of","Daiwa","Securities","America,","Inc.,","notes,","for","years","their","main","mission","was","to","sell","Japanese","stocks","to","American","institutional","investors","and","U.S."]},{"text":"stocks to the Japanese. The American side of the equation was a pretty hard sell, partly because the depositary receipt market in some Japanese stocks here tends to be thin.","tokens":["stocks","to","the","Japanese.","The","American","side","of","the","equation","was","a","pretty","hard","sell,","partly","because","the","depositary","receipt","market","in","some","Japanese","stocks","here","tends","to","be","thin."]},{"text":"It's halfway through 1990. Has your English improved? Your teachers at Studio Classroom hope so! If your English hasn't improved as much as you would like, listen to \"Running the Language Marathon.\"","tokens":["It's","halfway","through","1990.","Has","your","English","improved?","Your","teachers","at","Studio","Classroom","hope","so!","If","your","English","hasn't","improved","as","much","as","you","would","like,","listen","to","\"Running","the","Language","Marathon.\""]},{"text":"Maybe you can get some new ideas. Does your pronunciation need help? We give you some useful tips in \"How to Improve Your Pronunciation.\"","tokens":["Maybe","you","can","get","some","new","ideas.","Does","your","pronunciation","need","help?","We","give","you","some","useful","tips","in","\"How","to","Improve","Your","Pronunciation.\""]},{"text":"Each month we try to hive you many interesting topics to study. This month is no exception. Visit the landmarks of the world with Victor in Basic, or travel with your Advanced teachers to Antarctica.","tokens":["Each","month","we","try","to","hive","you","many","interesting","topics","to","study.","This","month","is","no","exception.","Visit","the","landmarks","of","the","world","with","Victor","in","Basic,","or","travel","with","your","Advanced","teachers","to","Antarctica."]},{"text":"It's the cool place to be. Speaking of changes, there's a big surprise for you in next month's Studio Classroom. Beginning in July, Studio Classroom is going to be completely in color!","tokens":["It's","the","cool","place","to","be.","Speaking","of","changes,","there's","a","big","surprise","for","you","in","next","month's","Studio","Classroom.","Beginning","in","July,","Studio","Classroom","is","going","to","be","completely","in","color!"]},{"text":"We hope you will enjoy all the beautiful pictures. Let us know how you like our new look. Their priests noticed that when a very bright star rose above the horizon concurrently with the sun, they could expect the river","tokens":["We","hope","you","will","enjoy","all","the","beautiful","pictures.","Let","us","know","how","you","like","our","new","look.","Their","priests","noticed","that","when","a","very","bright","star","rose","above","the","horizon","concurrently","with","the","sun,","they","could","expect","the","river"]},{"text":"to overflow within a matter of days. The importance of the Nile in their lives led the priests to study more carefully the motions of the sun.","tokens":["to","overflow","within","a","matter","of","days.","The","importance","of","the","Nile","in","their","lives","led","the","priests","to","study","more","carefully","the","motions","of","the","sun."]},{"text":"The pharaoh Ptole- my ordered astronomical tables compiled, which were used until well into the Middle Ages. The precinct itself was painted in what appears a standard apple green no Big Apple, a very flaked and faded apple thought by","tokens":["The","pharaoh","Ptole-","my","ordered","astronomical","tables","compiled,","which","were","used","until","well","into","the","Middle","Ages.","The","precinct","itself","was","painted","in","what","appears","a","standard","apple","green","no","Big","Apple,","a","very","flaked","and","faded","apple","thought","by"]},{"text":"experts from the Metropolitan Museum to have been applied circa 1924. A policeman is on permanent guard outside because of the increase in terrorist attacks.","tokens":["experts","from","the","Metropolitan","Museum","to","have","been","applied","circa","1924.","A","policeman","is","on","permanent","guard","outside","because","of","the","increase","in","terrorist","attacks."]},{"text":"Inside the blinds are drawn permanently on account of the habit of unfriendly neighbors in the apartments across the vacant lot of taking pot shots.","tokens":["Inside","the","blinds","are","drawn","permanently","on","account","of","the","habit","of","unfriendly","neighbors","in","the","apartments","across","the","vacant","lot","of","taking","pot","shots."]},{"text":"Around the corner were, at a conservative estimate, a hundred pushers: this district has the worst drug problem in the city. The operators move from one abandoned building to another.","tokens":["Around","the","corner","were,","at","a","conservative","estimate,","a","hundred","pushers:","this","district","has","the","worst","drug","problem","in","the","city.","The","operators","move","from","one","abandoned","building","to","another."]},{"text":"There are enough to last for years: the controlled rent policy has brought about landlord neglect and the terminal spiral of building decay insultingly camouflaged by the city's new policy of popping up gaily painted blinds over the windowless holes","tokens":["There","are","enough","to","last","for","years:","the","controlled","rent","policy","has","brought","about","landlord","neglect","and","the","terminal","spiral","of","building","decay","insultingly","camouflaged","by","the","city's","new","policy","of","popping","up","gaily","painted","blinds","over","the","windowless","holes"]},{"text":"in the walls. Bellow's life journey has left its physical and spiritual mark. His wispy hair is white. His handsome, almost feminine face, with its promi- nent nose and deep-set brown eyes, is marked by crow's feet and creases.","tokens":["in","the","walls.","Bellow's","life","journey","has","left","its","physical","and","spiritual","mark.","His","wispy","hair","is","white.","His","handsome,","almost","feminine","face,","with","its","promi-","nent","nose","and","deep-set","brown","eyes,","is","marked","by","crow's","feet","and","creases."]},{"text":"Pouches of flesh hang below his chin. He thinks and writes frequently of mortality nowadays, since the death of his cousin Louis Gameroff several years ago and the critical illness last winter of Louis' younger brother Meyer, Bellow's last surviving","tokens":["Pouches","of","flesh","hang","below","his","chin.","He","thinks","and","writes","frequently","of","mortality","nowadays,","since","the","death","of","his","cousin","Louis","Gameroff","several","years","ago","and","the","critical","illness","last","winter","of","Louis'","younger","brother","Meyer,","Bellow's","last","surviving"]},{"text":"cousin from Lachine. Yet when Bellow laughs, as he does often a hearty, joyous guffaw, back arched, head thrown back, the boyish gap between his front teeth exposed-the decades seem to drop away, swept off in a wave of infectious","tokens":["cousin","from","Lachine.","Yet","when","Bellow","laughs,","as","he","does","often","a","hearty,","joyous","guffaw,","back","arched,","head","thrown","back,","the","boyish","gap","between","his","front","teeth","exposed-the","decades","seem","to","drop","away,","swept","off","in","a","wave","of","infectious"]},{"text":"exuberance and vitality. Gifted children often look at things differently from the average child. Many like to spend time alone or just \"daydreaming.\" Unless your child is unhappy, try not to worry too much about the ways in which she","tokens":["exuberance","and","vitality.","Gifted","children","often","look","at","things","differently","from","the","average","child.","Many","like","to","spend","time","alone","or","just","\"daydreaming.\"","Unless","your","child","is","unhappy,","try","not","to","worry","too","much","about","the","ways","in","which","she"]},{"text":"or he is different. Precocious youngsters also often find themselves in a conflict between the approval they receive for their accomplishments and the disapproval they feel for being different.","tokens":["or","he","is","different.","Precocious","youngsters","also","often","find","themselves","in","a","conflict","between","the","approval","they","receive","for","their","accomplishments","and","the","disapproval","they","feel","for","being","different."]},{"text":"Help your children work this through by letting them know of your pride in their accomplishments and of your love for them as individuals.","tokens":["Help","your","children","work","this","through","by","letting","them","know","of","your","pride","in","their","accomplishments","and","of","your","love","for","them","as","individuals."]}]},"T4":{"key":"T4","title":"T4 Thanksgiving dates back to the days of…","paras":[{"text":"Thanksgiving dates back to the days of the early New England colonists who were having difficulty living in the New Land. According to the le- gend, without the help of the native American Indians, the settlers would have perished.","tokens":["Thanksgiving","dates","back","to","the","days","of","the","early","New","England","colonists","who","were","having","difficulty","living","in","the","New","Land.","According","to","the","le-","gend,","without","the","help","of","the","native","American","Indians,","the","settlers","would","have","perished."]},{"text":"The Indians showed the colonists how to hunt wild turkeys and how to grow corn. In the fall, the Indians and colonists gathered for a feast to honor their friendship.","tokens":["The","Indians","showed","the","colonists","how","to","hunt","wild","turkeys","and","how","to","grow","corn.","In","the","fall,","the","Indians","and","colonists","gathered","for","a","feast","to","honor","their","friendship."]},{"text":"In reality, the colonists and Indians never got along very well, and this first Thanksgiving dinner probably never took place. Even so, Americans today follow the tradition by invit- ing friends and relatives for a turkey dinner on the fourth","tokens":["In","reality,","the","colonists","and","Indians","never","got","along","very","well,","and","this","first","Thanksgiving","dinner","probably","never","took","place.","Even","so,","Americans","today","follow","the","tradition","by","invit-","ing","friends","and","relatives","for","a","turkey","dinner","on","the","fourth"]},{"text":"Thursday of November. I live in a small country community which is very far away from the main street of the village. The junior high school which I went to is 10 kilometers away from my home.","tokens":["Thursday","of","November.","I","live","in","a","small","country","community","which","is","very","far","away","from","the","main","street","of","the","village.","The","junior","high","school","which","I","went","to","is","10","kilometers","away","from","my","home."]},{"text":"There were only two scheduled trips of bus services-one in the early morning and one in the afternoon-only to carry commuter students to and from school along the route.","tokens":["There","were","only","two","scheduled","trips","of","bus","services-one","in","the","early","morning","and","one","in","the","afternoon-only","to","carry","commuter","students","to","and","from","school","along","the","route."]},{"text":"I was the only one in my community who went to school by bicycle. My father wanted me to take more exercise. One car passed by me.","tokens":["I","was","the","only","one","in","my","community","who","went","to","school","by","bicycle.","My","father","wanted","me","to","take","more","exercise.","One","car","passed","by","me."]},{"text":"It was the commuter bus. Of course it wouldn't stop to pick me up. Those on the bus seemed to be very comfortable. How lucky they were, I thought.","tokens":["It","was","the","commuter","bus.","Of","course","it","wouldn't","stop","to","pick","me","up.","Those","on","the","bus","seemed","to","be","very","comfortable.","How","lucky","they","were,","I","thought."]},{"text":"Unexpectedly, about half an hour later, my mother came by motorcycle to help me. It so happened that a girl classmate of mine who had been on the bus recognized me.","tokens":["Unexpectedly,","about","half","an","hour","later,","my","mother","came","by","motorcycle","to","help","me.","It","so","happened","that","a","girl","classmate","of","mine","who","had","been","on","the","bus","recognized","me."]},{"text":"As soon as she got home, she telephoned my mother to tell her about my situation. The early history of the human race is most clearly and readily studied by observing the a stages of human technological progress.","tokens":["As","soon","as","she","got","home,","she","telephoned","my","mother","to","tell","her","about","my","situation.","The","early","history","of","the","human","race","is","most","clearly","and","readily","studied","by","observing","the","a","stages","of","human","technological","progress."]},{"text":"That is why it was a long-standing convention to divide early history into broad periods according to the hard materials-stone, copper, bronze, and iron, in that order-from which cutting tools and weapons were made.","tokens":["That","is","why","it","was","a","long-standing","convention","to","divide","early","history","into","broad","periods","according","to","the","hard","materials-stone,","copper,","bronze,","and","iron,","in","that","order-from","which","cutting","tools","and","weapons","were","made."]},{"text":"Then, as know- ledge of the past increased, the broad periods were further subdivided. The Stone Age was divided into the Old period and the New period when it was noticed that the technique of sharpening flint and other stones","tokens":["Then,","as","know-","ledge","of","the","past","increased,","the","broad","periods","were","further","subdivided.","The","Stone","Age","was","divided","into","the","Old","period","and","the","New","period","when","it","was","noticed","that","the","technique","of","sharpening","flint","and","other","stones"]},{"text":"changed from flaking to grinding. During early Roman history all physicians were either slaves or representatives of lower Roman society. Medicine was a Greek science, and many Greek physicians, attracted by the prospect of great profit at the capital of","tokens":["changed","from","flaking","to","grinding.","During","early","Roman","history","all","physicians","were","either","slaves","or","representatives","of","lower","Roman","society.","Medicine","was","a","Greek","science,","and","many","Greek","physicians,","attracted","by","the","prospect","of","great","profit","at","the","capital","of"]},{"text":"the empire, migrated to Rome to establish their practice. As a consequence, many doctors were foreigners, and as such were considered in a very low position by the people of high social rank.","tokens":["the","empire,","migrated","to","Rome","to","establish","their","practice.","As","a","consequence,","many","doctors","were","foreigners,","and","as","such","were","considered","in","a","very","low","position","by","the","people","of","high","social","rank."]},{"text":"Frequently, a wealthy Roman supplied one of his slaves with a medical education for the sake of covenience. Having one's own physician was obviously an advantage not to be overlooked, and slaves who had a knowledge of the healing art","tokens":["Frequently,","a","wealthy","Roman","supplied","one","of","his","slaves","with","a","medical","education","for","the","sake","of","covenience.","Having","one's","own","physician","was","obviously","an","advantage","not","to","be","overlooked,","and","slaves","who","had","a","knowledge","of","the","healing","art"]},{"text":"commanded the highest prices in the Roman slave market. Recognizing the importance of the medical profession, however, Julius Caesar conferred citizenship on all who practiced medicine at Rome to make them more desirous of living in the city, and to","tokens":["commanded","the","highest","prices","in","the","Roman","slave","market.","Recognizing","the","importance","of","the","medical","profession,","however,","Julius","Caesar","conferred","citizenship","on","all","who","practiced","medicine","at","Rome","to","make","them","more","desirous","of","living","in","the","city,","and","to"]},{"text":"induce others to come to it. Despite this encouragement, medicine never came to be considered the proper profession for the upper classes. Today, Taiwanese society has evolved to become one of Asia's booming centers of trade, business, and industrialization.","tokens":["induce","others","to","come","to","it.","Despite","this","encouragement,","medicine","never","came","to","be","considered","the","proper","profession","for","the","upper","classes.","Today,","Taiwanese","society","has","evolved","to","become","one","of","Asia's","booming","centers","of","trade,","business,","and","industrialization."]},{"text":"As such, it is cons- tantly immersed in matters of a profit-oriented, commercial society. And this phenomenon has drastically altered the character of missionary work.","tokens":["As","such,","it","is","cons-","tantly","immersed","in","matters","of","a","profit-oriented,","commercial","society.","And","this","phenomenon","has","drastically","altered","the","character","of","missionary","work."]},{"text":"For whereas before it was enough for missionaries to be priests or relig- ious engaging the work of God's kingdom through catechism, administering the sacraments, and other spiritual works, today's missionaries have to to learn to \"incarnate\" the Word of","tokens":["For","whereas","before","it","was","enough","for","missionaries","to","be","priests","or","relig-","ious","engaging","the","work","of","God's","kingdom","through","catechism,","administering","the","sacraments,","and","other","spiritual","works,","today's","missionaries","have","to","to","learn","to","\"incarnate\"","the","Word","of"]},{"text":"God even in the technical books of modern science and contemporary psychology, in systems analysis and computer programs, in mass media, in business contracts and legal systems, etc.","tokens":["God","even","in","the","technical","books","of","modern","science","and","contemporary","psychology,","in","systems","analysis","and","computer","programs,","in","mass","media,","in","business","contracts","and","legal","systems,","etc."]},{"text":"Even the local government has applied stricter regulations for allow- ing missionaries into Taiwan, with preference given to those holding doctorate degrees. In other words, even missionary work is becoming more and more specialized.","tokens":["Even","the","local","government","has","applied","stricter","regulations","for","allow-","ing","missionaries","into","Taiwan,","with","preference","given","to","those","holding","doctorate","degrees.","In","other","words,","even","missionary","work","is","becoming","more","and","more","specialized."]},{"text":"So we ask, and shat them of the good old missionary activity of talking directly to people about God, or of sharing one's experience of Christ in his or her life as St.","tokens":["So","we","ask,","and","shat","them","of","the","good","old","missionary","activity","of","talking","directly","to","people","about","God,","or","of","sharing","one's","experience","of","Christ","in","his","or","her","life","as","St."]},{"text":"Paul did? The ecclesiasti- cal scenario is tense; we walk on this tightrope of change. English is the most widely spoken language in the world today, (which is) a fact that everyone knows.","tokens":["Paul","did?","The","ecclesiasti-","cal","scenario","is","tense;","we","walk","on","this","tightrope","of","change.","English","is","the","most","widely","spoken","language","in","the","world","today,","(which","is)","a","fact","that","everyone","knows."]},{"text":"Whatever one does, he cannot do without knowing something about English. A good command spoken English enables us to travel around the world without difficulties.","tokens":["Whatever","one","does,","he","cannot","do","without","knowing","something","about","English.","A","good","command","spoken","English","enables","us","to","travel","around","the","world","without","difficulties."]},{"text":"If we can read English, we may expose ourselves to the latest information about technology, cul- ture, and so on, which can enrich our knowledge.","tokens":["If","we","can","read","English,","we","may","expose","ourselves","to","the","latest","information","about","technology,","cul-","ture,","and","so","on,","which","can","enrich","our","knowledge."]},{"text":"There are so many advan- tages about learning English that we should not miss any opportunity to master it. It goes without saying that what we do today has much to do with a bright future.","tokens":["There","are","so","many","advan-","tages","about","learning","English","that","we","should","not","miss","any","opportunity","to","master","it.","It","goes","without","saying","that","what","we","do","today","has","much","to","do","with","a","bright","future."]},{"text":"To put it differently, yesterday is gone, tomorrow is yet to come, and today is the only time within our control. The background of the episodes, a strike meeting, is not an excuse.","tokens":["To","put","it","differently,","yesterday","is","gone,","tomorrow","is","yet","to","come,","and","today","is","the","only","time","within","our","control.","The","background","of","the","episodes,","a","strike","meeting,","is","not","an","excuse."]},{"text":"Each of the committeemen shows in his episode the crucial moment of his life which brought him to this very platform. The dramatic structure on which the play has been built is simple but highly effective.","tokens":["Each","of","the","committeemen","shows","in","his","episode","the","crucial","moment","of","his","life","which","brought","him","to","this","very","platform.","The","dramatic","structure","on","which","the","play","has","been","built","is","simple","but","highly","effective."]},{"text":"The form used is the old black-face minstrel form of chorus, end men, specialty men and interlocutor. The strike committee on the platform during the acting out of the play let should be used as chorus.","tokens":["The","form","used","is","the","old","black-face","minstrel","form","of","chorus,","end","men,","specialty","men","and","interlocutor.","The","strike","committee","on","the","platform","during","the","acting","out","of","the","play","let","should","be","used","as","chorus."]},{"text":"Emotional, polictical, mu- sical, they have in them possibilities of various comments on the scenes. This has been indicated once in the script in the place where Joe's wife is about to leave him.","tokens":["Emotional,","polictical,","mu-","sical,","they","have","in","them","possibilities","of","various","comments","on","the","scenes.","This","has","been","indicated","once","in","the","script","in","the","place","where","Joe's","wife","is","about","to","leave","him."]},{"text":"In the climaxes of each scene, slogans might very effectively be used a voice coming out of the dark. Such a voice might announce at the appropriate moments in the \"Young Interme's\" scene that the USSR is the only country","tokens":["In","the","climaxes","of","each","scene,","slogans","might","very","effectively","be","used","a","voice","coming","out","of","the","dark.","Such","a","voice","might","announce","at","the","appropriate","moments","in","the","\"Young","Interme's\"","scene","that","the","USSR","is","the","only","country"]},{"text":"in the world where Anti-Semitism is a crime again- st the State. Don't hesitate to use music wherever possible. It is very valuable in emotionally stirring an audience.","tokens":["in","the","world","where","Anti-Semitism","is","a","crime","again-","st","the","State.","Don't","hesitate","to","use","music","wherever","possible.","It","is","very","valuable","in","emotionally","stirring","an","audience."]},{"text":"The most amazing thing about crack cocaine is that it did not begin rotting America's urban landscape sooner. It has been recognized as a scourge in cities-and none too few suburban and rural areas-for only five years.","tokens":["The","most","amazing","thing","about","crack","cocaine","is","that","it","did","not","begin","rotting","America's","urban","landscape","sooner.","It","has","been","recognized","as","a","scourge","in","cities-and","none","too","few","suburban","and","rural","areas-for","only","five","years."]},{"text":"But the supercharged cocaine, sometimes called \"rock,\" wasn't real- ly new. References to the recipe that used heat and baking soda to turn cocaine hydrochloride, or powder, into the smokable form of freebase called crack appear throughout the 1970's in","tokens":["But","the","supercharged","cocaine,","sometimes","called","\"rock,\"","wasn't","real-","ly","new.","References","to","the","recipe","that","used","heat","and","baking","soda","to","turn","cocaine","hydrochloride,","or","powder,","into","the","smokable","form","of","freebase","called","crack","appear","throughout","the","1970's","in"]},{"text":"underground literature, media inter- views and congressional testimony. It did not catch on back then, resear- chers believe, because it was not as pure as other, more processed forms of freebase.","tokens":["underground","literature,","media","inter-","views","and","congressional","testimony.","It","did","not","catch","on","back","then,","resear-","chers","believe,","because","it","was","not","as","pure","as","other,","more","processed","forms","of","freebase."]},{"text":"Freebasers, who fancied themselves connoisseurs in those by- gone days, called it \"garbage rock.\" The working group's recommendations, which were presented to an OSTP advisory committee on 30 November, are described by one university official who has seen them as","tokens":["Freebasers,","who","fancied","themselves","connoisseurs","in","those","by-","gone","days,","called","it","\"garbage","rock.\"","The","working","group's","recommendations,","which","were","presented","to","an","OSTP","advisory","committee","on","30","November,","are","described","by","one","university","official","who","has","seen","them","as"]},{"text":"\"an ingenious piece of bureaucratic writing that will almost certainly solve the problem.\" In a brief open session of the OSTP committee meeting, Pettifor said that the regulations would exempt from the license requirements information that is publicly available in","tokens":["\"an","ingenious","piece","of","bureaucratic","writing","that","will","almost","certainly","solve","the","problem.\"","In","a","brief","open","session","of","the","OSTP","committee","meeting,","Pettifor","said","that","the","regulations","would","exempt","from","the","license","requirements","information","that","is","publicly","available","in"]},{"text":"books, scientific journals, and conference proceedings; fundamental research, which is defined to include virtually all university research; educational materials' and patent applications.","tokens":["books,","scientific","journals,","and","conference","proceedings;","fundamental","research,","which","is","defined","to","include","virtually","all","university","research;","educational","materials'","and","patent","applications."]}]},"T5":{"key":"T5","title":"T5 I sit a mutated tropical bird? A…","paras":[{"text":"I sit a mutated tropical bird? A monstrous preying insect? A shuttle craft at rest on its launching pad? A sculpture derived from a futuristic scrap yard?","tokens":["I","sit","a","mutated","tropical","bird?","A","monstrous","preying","insect?","A","shuttle","craft","at","rest","on","its","launching","pad?","A","sculpture","derived","from","a","futuristic","scrap","yard?"]},{"text":"A giant-sized plough, threatening to gobble up the buildings opposite, and everything beyond in its path? Or is it simply that the aliens have landed...","tokens":["A","giant-sized","plough,","threatening","to","gobble","up","the","buildings","opposite,","and","everything","beyond","in","its","path?","Or","is","it","simply","that","the","aliens","have","landed..."]},{"text":"is this an unnatural encounter of the third kind? Perhaps when all is said and done, it is someone's idea of a practical joke.","tokens":["is","this","an","unnatural","encounter","of","the","third","kind?","Perhaps","when","all","is","said","and","done,","it","is","someone's","idea","of","a","practical","joke."]},{"text":"After all, it was unwrapped to the public gaze on April 1 last year, as if deliberately daring to make a fool of everyone.","tokens":["After","all,","it","was","unwrapped","to","the","public","gaze","on","April","1","last","year,","as","if","deliberately","daring","to","make","a","fool","of","everyone."]},{"text":"Archit- ect Makoto Sei Watanabe (he added the unusual middle name because his best friend was also Makoto Watanabe and everyone was always getting them mixed up) smilingly shrugs off these and the many other visual associations that have been","tokens":["Archit-","ect","Makoto","Sei","Watanabe","(he","added","the","unusual","middle","name","because","his","best","friend","was","also","Makoto","Watanabe","and","everyone","was","always","getting","them","mixed","up)","smilingly","shrugs","off","these","and","the","many","other","visual","associations","that","have","been"]},{"text":"made of his controversial masterpiece, the Aoyama Technical College in central Tokyo. \"It's supposed to be ambiguous,\" he explained in surprisingly good English, considering he only studied at university and has never worked outside Japan (though he'd like to.)","tokens":["made","of","his","controversial","masterpiece,","the","Aoyama","Technical","College","in","central","Tokyo.","\"It's","supposed","to","be","ambiguous,\"","he","explained","in","surprisingly","good","English,","considering","he","only","studied","at","university","and","has","never","worked","outside","Japan","(though","he'd","like","to.)"]},{"text":"\"It's full of metaphors. The norm these days is what I call 'architecture by limitations'; architects are supposed to work within an approved set of rules.","tokens":["\"It's","full","of","metaphors.","The","norm","these","days","is","what","I","call","'architecture","by","limitations';","architects","are","supposed","to","work","within","an","approved","set","of","rules."]},{"text":"Well, I set out to deliberately break every one in the book.\" At the end of 1988, he noted in a specialist publication that the college was holding an international contest for the design of its new headquarters.","tokens":["Well,","I","set","out","to","deliberately","break","every","one","in","the","book.\"","At","the","end","of","1988,","he","noted","in","a","specialist","publication","that","the","college","was","holding","an","international","contest","for","the","design","of","its","new","headquarters."]},{"text":"Of the 87 entries, it was Watanabe's design on which the judges' eyes focused. A trio of Austra- lian architects, who ran second, designed the new Australian Embassy which recently opened in Tokyo.","tokens":["Of","the","87","entries,","it","was","Watanabe's","design","on","which","the","judges'","eyes","focused.","A","trio","of","Austra-","lian","architects,","who","ran","second,","designed","the","new","Australian","Embassy","which","recently","opened","in","Tokyo."]},{"text":"The entrance is on the second floor, with four levels of classrooms and lecture halls. The top storey--the area that elicits the most comment--is a gallery.","tokens":["The","entrance","is","on","the","second","floor,","with","four","levels","of","classrooms","and","lecture","halls.","The","top","storey--the","area","that","elicits","the","most","comment--is","a","gallery."]},{"text":"The dome on the roof? A water tower. The scarlet rods, like the handle of a lawn mower? Lightning conductors. It's constructed from aluminum and stainless steel, in three finishes, plus a plethora of both bold and subtle colour.","tokens":["The","dome","on","the","roof?","A","water","tower.","The","scarlet","rods,","like","the","handle","of","a","lawn","mower?","Lightning","conductors.","It's","constructed","from","aluminum","and","stainless","steel,","in","three","finishes,","plus","a","plethora","of","both","bold","and","subtle","colour."]},{"text":"Watanabe gave himself enormous problems turning his vision into a practical reality. To reproduce anything in 3-D is difficult, and elevations and plans communicate little.","tokens":["Watanabe","gave","himself","enormous","problems","turning","his","vision","into","a","practical","reality.","To","reproduce","anything","in","3-D","is","difficult,","and","elevations","and","plans","communicate","little."]},{"text":"A model can give an impression, he says, but is still not precise. And precision is the main element in this unique building. A second difficulty was that since every part and detail was original, he could not fall back","tokens":["A","model","can","give","an","impression,","he","says,","but","is","still","not","precise.","And","precision","is","the","main","element","in","this","unique","building.","A","second","difficulty","was","that","since","every","part","and","detail","was","original,","he","could","not","fall","back"]},{"text":"onto mass production. Japan has got the erection of a lot of its buildings off to a fine art--or rather onto the factory production line.","tokens":["onto","mass","production.","Japan","has","got","the","erection","of","a","lot","of","its","buildings","off","to","a","fine","art--or","rather","onto","the","factory","production","line."]},{"text":"Making basic components that can then be slotted together in a large but still limited number of permuta- tions helps keep costs down and maintains, in this society at least, a comforting conformity.","tokens":["Making","basic","components","that","can","then","be","slotted","together","in","a","large","but","still","limited","number","of","permuta-","tions","helps","keep","costs","down","and","maintains,","in","this","society","at","least,","a","comforting","conformity."]},{"text":"But Watanabe claims he was able to custom-order all the parts he needed at reasonable cost; his building hasn't been that much more expensive and is so much more rewarding.","tokens":["But","Watanabe","claims","he","was","able","to","custom-order","all","the","parts","he","needed","at","reasonable","cost;","his","building","hasn't","been","that","much","more","expensive","and","is","so","much","more","rewarding."]},{"text":"After all, it makes people think. \"I used the computer to work out all the elements, from the compo- nents of the basic structure, to all the exterior and interior detail, and even the furniture.","tokens":["After","all,","it","makes","people","think.","\"I","used","the","computer","to","work","out","all","the","elements,","from","the","compo-","nents","of","the","basic","structure,","to","all","the","exterior","and","interior","detail,","and","even","the","furniture."]},{"text":"The technique I utilised--computer graphics--is not new, but it hasn't been explored in architecture very much to date. Then I had to spread the work around to get what I wanted; the dome was made in one prefecture, the metal","tokens":["The","technique","I","utilised--computer","graphics--is","not","new,","but","it","hasn't","been","explored","in","architecture","very","much","to","date.","Then","I","had","to","spread","the","work","around","to","get","what","I","wanted;","the","dome","was","made","in","one","prefecture,","the","metal"]},{"text":"panels in another. I went to small highly specialised companies to get the quality and finish I required.\" Though appearing 100 per cent futuristic in its totality, Watanabe says this is deceptive.","tokens":["panels","in","another.","I","went","to","small","highly","specialised","companies","to","get","the","quality","and","finish","I","required.\"","Though","appearing","100","per","cent","futuristic","in","its","totality,","Watanabe","says","this","is","deceptive."]},{"text":"He deliberately incorporated traditional conventions in the lower levels of the building, while experimenting with ideas that hardly existed except in his imagination higher up.","tokens":["He","deliberately","incorporated","traditional","conventions","in","the","lower","levels","of","the","building,","while","experimenting","with","ideas","that","hardly","existed","except","in","his","imagination","higher","up."]},{"text":"He aimed to confront existing architectural vocabulary with a total lack of cliche, allowing the two concepts to meet, somewhere rather above the middle.","tokens":["He","aimed","to","confront","existing","architectural","vocabulary","with","a","total","lack","of","cliche,","allowing","the","two","concepts","to","meet,","somewhere","rather","above","the","middle."]},{"text":"He purposely left the structure open to interpretation, piling lots of ideas on top of another, like a modern-day Gaudi. Or maybe as only Makoto Watanabe can do.","tokens":["He","purposely","left","the","structure","open","to","interpretation,","piling","lots","of","ideas","on","top","of","another,","like","a","modern-day","Gaudi.","Or","maybe","as","only","Makoto","Watanabe","can","do."]},{"text":"Yet he aimed for logic in the overall design, and must have achieved his desired effect, because he won the commission. It took 3.5 months to design, then 10 months to build and furnish.","tokens":["Yet","he","aimed","for","logic","in","the","overall","design,","and","must","have","achieved","his","desired","effect,","because","he","won","the","commission.","It","took","3.5","months","to","design,","then","10","months","to","build","and","furnish."]},{"text":"Ask him if he regards himself trendy architect, and he'll suddenly look critical and rather severe. This is quite a feat for a slight, friendly but shy boyish-looking 38-year-old, but he acts out his response well.","tokens":["Ask","him","if","he","regards","himself","trendy","architect,","and","he'll","suddenly","look","critical","and","rather","severe.","This","is","quite","a","feat","for","a","slight,","friendly","but","shy","boyish-looking","38-year-old,","but","he","acts","out","his","response","well."]},{"text":"He hates trendy things. A trend is when an idea has reached the crest of a wave, from where it's creatively downhill all the way.","tokens":["He","hates","trendy","things.","A","trend","is","when","an","idea","has","reached","the","crest","of","a","wave,","from","where","it's","creatively","downhill","all","the","way."]},{"text":"No, he insists, this building is new--there's nothing like it anywhere else in the world today. It appears successful, too, having been featured in many publications, from the men's magazine Brutus, to an eight-page coverage in that most illustrious of","tokens":["No,","he","insists,","this","building","is","new--there's","nothing","like","it","anywhere","else","in","the","world","today.","It","appears","successful,","too,","having","been","featured","in","many","publications,","from","the","men's","magazine","Brutus,","to","an","eight-page","coverage","in","that","most","illustrious","of"]},{"text":"accolades The Japan Architect: 90, published by the Japanese Institute of Architects. Even more important, young people seem to like it. After promotional posters appeared in trains and busses advertising the fact that it was open for business, the college","tokens":["accolades","The","Japan","Architect:","90,","published","by","the","Japanese","Institute","of","Architects.","Even","more","important,","young","people","seem","to","like","it.","After","promotional","posters","appeared","in","trains","and","busses","advertising","the","fact","that","it","was","open","for","business,","the","college"]},{"text":"received double the number of applications to the year before. The secretary to the principal, however, dictated it was policy for staff not to discuss their feelings about the building; and that if I wanted a response from any students,","tokens":["received","double","the","number","of","applications","to","the","year","before.","The","secretary","to","the","principal,","however,","dictated","it","was","policy","for","staff","not","to","discuss","their","feelings","about","the","building;","and","that","if","I","wanted","a","response","from","any","students,"]},{"text":"I would have to fill out a form. Such is bureaucracy in Japan. Born in Yokohama in 1952, and a graduate of the Master Course in Architecture at the National University in the city, Watanabe spent three years working with","tokens":["I","would","have","to","fill","out","a","form.","Such","is","bureaucracy","in","Japan.","Born","in","Yokohama","in","1952,","and","a","graduate","of","the","Master","Course","in","Architecture","at","the","National","University","in","the","city,","Watanabe","spent","three","years","working","with"]},{"text":"Masato Ohtaka, and then five with Arata Isozaki, under whom he worked on the Science Centre at Tsukuba. He established his own three-man practice, Architect's Office (03-829 3221, fax 3837) in 1984, and has since won any number of design","tokens":["Masato","Ohtaka,","and","then","five","with","Arata","Isozaki,","under","whom","he","worked","on","the","Science","Centre","at","Tsukuba.","He","established","his","own","three-man","practice,","Architect's","Office","(03-829","3221,","fax","3837)","in","1984,","and","has","since","won","any","number","of","design"]},{"text":"awards. \"A matter of keeping my eyes open and ears flapping,\" he explained. He always loved art--drawing, painting and sculpture--even as a child. But he was drawn by science, too, so architecture seemed a natural route to choose at 17","tokens":["awards.","\"A","matter","of","keeping","my","eyes","open","and","ears","flapping,\"","he","explained.","He","always","loved","art--drawing,","painting","and","sculpture--even","as","a","child.","But","he","was","drawn","by","science,","too,","so","architecture","seemed","a","natural","route","to","choose","at","17"]},{"text":"or so. He still favors the surrealists, like Dali and Magritte (which seems in order somehow) yet claims to be most influenced by Italian Renaissance and Baroque architects like Bernini and Borromini.","tokens":["or","so.","He","still","favors","the","surrealists,","like","Dali","and","Magritte","(which","seems","in","order","somehow)","yet","claims","to","be","most","influenced","by","Italian","Renaissance","and","Baroque","architects","like","Bernini","and","Borromini."]},{"text":"Ask where in the world today architecture is generally the most interesting and adventurous and he'll smilingly not hesitate a second: To- kyo, of course.","tokens":["Ask","where","in","the","world","today","architecture","is","generally","the","most","interesting","and","adventurous","and","he'll","smilingly","not","hesitate","a","second:","To-","kyo,","of","course."]},{"text":"\"Am I critical of other projects? Well, naturally. But I'm never rude and judge my words carefully. It's a small world after all, and human relationships are all-important in Japan.","tokens":["\"Am","I","critical","of","other","projects?","Well,","naturally.","But","I'm","never","rude","and","judge","my","words","carefully.","It's","a","small","world","after","all,","and","human","relationships","are","all-important","in","Japan."]},{"text":"\"The Sprial Building where we are now sitting, in Omoto-sando? I often work here with artists. I find it very calm, very quiet. \"The Asahi Beer building in Askausa?","tokens":["\"The","Sprial","Building","where","we","are","now","sitting,","in","Omoto-sando?","I","often","work","here","with","artists.","I","find","it","very","calm,","very","quiet.","\"The","Asahi","Beer","building","in","Askausa?"]},{"text":"Interesting. I used to work near the site. Personally, I'm not wild about it and feel no great sympathy. But I do understand the architects' ways of thinking.","tokens":["Interesting.","I","used","to","work","near","the","site.","Personally,","I'm","not","wild","about","it","and","feel","no","great","sympathy.","But","I","do","understand","the","architects'","ways","of","thinking."]}]},"T6":{"key":"T6","title":"T6 Insurance executive Clement Cho Kwok-yin is one…","paras":[{"text":"Insurance executive Clement Cho Kwok-yin is one of a small but growing group of Hong Kong residents who have chosen to live on a boat.","tokens":["Insurance","executive","Clement","Cho","Kwok-yin","is","one","of","a","small","but","growing","group","of","Hong","Kong","residents","who","have","chosen","to","live","on","a","boat."]},{"text":"He swapped his comfortable family apartment for a cramped home afloat because he loves the tranquility and freedom of marina living. \"I love boats and I would need to have a multi-million-dollar house in a prime spot to get views","tokens":["He","swapped","his","comfortable","family","apartment","for","a","cramped","home","afloat","because","he","loves","the","tranquility","and","freedom","of","marina","living.","\"I","love","boats","and","I","would","need","to","have","a","multi-million-dollar","house","in","a","prime","spot","to","get","views"]},{"text":"like these,\" he says, sweeping a sun-tanned arm towards the colourful flotilla tied up at Aberdeen Marina on the southern side of Hong Kong island.","tokens":["like","these,\"","he","says,","sweeping","a","sun-tanned","arm","towards","the","colourful","flotilla","tied","up","at","Aberdeen","Marina","on","the","southern","side","of","Hong","Kong","island."]},{"text":"\"Boating is great for my wife and children, who come over several times a year from New Zealand where they are fulfilling residency requirements.","tokens":["\"Boating","is","great","for","my","wife","and","children,","who","come","over","several","times","a","year","from","New","Zealand","where","they","are","fulfilling","residency","requirements."]},{"text":"We love to go cruising around the islands. I give my two sons important jobs in advance of a cruise, such as preparing the safety equipment, and that's how they learn how to take care of themselves.","tokens":["We","love","to","go","cruising","around","the","islands.","I","give","my","two","sons","important","jobs","in","advance","of","a","cruise,","such","as","preparing","the","safety","equipment,","and","that's","how","they","learn","how","to","take","care","of","themselves."]},{"text":"\"At the same time, I can keep fit by doing regular boat maintenance.\" Cho regrets that Hong Kong waters are \"a bit polluted, especially during the summer.\"","tokens":["\"At","the","same","time,","I","can","keep","fit","by","doing","regular","boat","maintenance.\"","Cho","regrets","that","Hong","Kong","waters","are","\"a","bit","polluted,","especially","during","the","summer.\""]},{"text":"That aside, however, \"there is no better life-style than boating. I can recommend it to everybody,\" he says. Clement Cho is among a new wave of sea-faring Asians.","tokens":["That","aside,","however,","\"there","is","no","better","life-style","than","boating.","I","can","recommend","it","to","everybody,\"","he","says.","Clement","Cho","is","among","a","new","wave","of","sea-faring","Asians."]},{"text":"Buoyed by the tide of wealth in the region, the nouveaux riches of Asia have developed a taste for brisk winds and salt spray.","tokens":["Buoyed","by","the","tide","of","wealth","in","the","region,","the","nouveaux","riches","of","Asia","have","developed","a","taste","for","brisk","winds","and","salt","spray."]},{"text":"Where the Bahamas and the Costa del Sol were names that tripped off the tongue in the boating world, Hong Kong, Singapore, Phuket, Langkawi, Puerto Galera and Tokyo have become the latest buzzwords in the cruising vocabulary.","tokens":["Where","the","Bahamas","and","the","Costa","del","Sol","were","names","that","tripped","off","the","tongue","in","the","boating","world,","Hong","Kong,","Singapore,","Phuket,","Langkawi,","Puerto","Galera","and","Tokyo","have","become","the","latest","buzzwords","in","the","cruising","vocabulary."]},{"text":"And the images flashed around the world of US President Bill Cinton yachting with Jackie Onassis can only boost the appeal of the sport to more and more Asians--as a symbol of money and power.","tokens":["And","the","images","flashed","around","the","world","of","US","President","Bill","Cinton","yachting","with","Jackie","Onassis","can","only","boost","the","appeal","of","the","sport","to","more","and","more","Asians--as","a","symbol","of","money","and","power."]},{"text":"Sailing is now seen as the choice pursuit of people who have arrived. Further enhancing the region's boating reputation is the growth of races such as the Tokyo Cup, Osaka-Melbourne, Sydney-Hobart, Hong Kong-Macau, Pedro Blanco, the China Sea Race and","tokens":["Sailing","is","now","seen","as","the","choice","pursuit","of","people","who","have","arrived.","Further","enhancing","the","region's","boating","reputation","is","the","growth","of","races","such","as","the","Tokyo","Cup,","Osaka-Melbourne,","Sydney-Hobart,","Hong","Kong-Macau,","Pedro","Blanco,","the","China","Sea","Race","and"]},{"text":"Thailand's King's Cup Regatta. But it didn't just happen overnight. From the days of the Bugis people's migration from Sulawesi to Selangor and then to Riau, the Acheh sultanate of Sumatra, the historic voy-ages of the Chinese admiral Cheng Ho","tokens":["Thailand's","King's","Cup","Regatta.","But","it","didn't","just","happen","overnight.","From","the","days","of","the","Bugis","people's","migration","from","Sulawesi","to","Selangor","and","then","to","Riau,","the","Acheh","sultanate","of","Sumatra,","the","historic","voy-ages","of","the","Chinese","admiral","Cheng","Ho"]},{"text":"and the Spanish armada's sweep through the Philip-pines, the China coast and island-studded waters of Southeast Asia have been busy sea lanes. Love of the sea runs all the way from the humblest sampan fisherman to kings and em-perors.","tokens":["and","the","Spanish","armada's","sweep","through","the","Philip-pines,","the","China","coast","and","island-studded","waters","of","Southeast","Asia","have","been","busy","sea","lanes.","Love","of","the","sea","runs","all","the","way","from","the","humblest","sampan","fisherman","to","kings","and","em-perors."]},{"text":"A number of Asian royals, including the Crown Prince of Johore, are enthusiastic sailors. For instance, King Bhumibol Adulyadej of Thailand won the OK Dinghy class gold medal in the 1967 Southeast Asian Peninsular Games.","tokens":["A","number","of","Asian","royals,","including","the","Crown","Prince","of","Johore,","are","enthusiastic","sailors.","For","instance,","King","Bhumibol","Adulyadej","of","Thailand","won","the","OK","Dinghy","class","gold","medal","in","the","1967","Southeast","Asian","Peninsular","Games."]},{"text":"And over the years, Asian sailors have pulled off some incredible maritime feats. In 1974, Japanese yachtsman Yoh Aoki sailed the tiny 20ft Ahodon III around the world, becoming the 37th person to make a solo voyageround the world since","tokens":["And","over","the","years,","Asian","sailors","have","pulled","off","some","incredible","maritime","feats.","In","1974,","Japanese","yachtsman","Yoh","Aoki","sailed","the","tiny","20ft","Ahodon","III","around","the","world,","becoming","the","37th","person","to","make","a","solo","voyageround","the","world","since"]},{"text":"American Joshua Slocum first did it in 1898. Aoki was followed a few months later by fellow Japanese Ruysuke Ushijima in Gin Gitsune and Kenichi Horie in Mermaid II, completing the 40th and 41st solo circumnavigations.","tokens":["American","Joshua","Slocum","first","did","it","in","1898.","Aoki","was","followed","a","few","months","later","by","fellow","Japanese","Ruysuke","Ushijima","in","Gin","Gitsune","and","Kenichi","Horie","in","Mermaid","II,","completing","the","40th","and","41st","solo","circumnavigations."]},{"text":"Japan also cast a large wind shadow during the last America's Cup when the 12-metre Nippon gave the competitors a bit of a sumo shake.","tokens":["Japan","also","cast","a","large","wind","shadow","during","the","last","America's","Cup","when","the","12-metre","Nippon","gave","the","competitors","a","bit","of","a","sumo","shake."]},{"text":"To put more wind in their sails, Yamaha, the biggest boat-builder in the Land of the Rising Sun, is gearing up to sponsor a Japanese entry in the upcoming Whitbread around-the-world yacht race.","tokens":["To","put","more","wind","in","their","sails,","Yamaha,","the","biggest","boat-builder","in","the","Land","of","the","Rising","Sun,","is","gearing","up","to","sponsor","a","Japanese","entry","in","the","upcoming","Whitbread","around-the-world","yacht","race."]},{"text":"Hong Kong, meanwhile, will host an around-the-world challenge race in 1997, just before the Fragrant Harbour returns to Chinese rule (see box this page).","tokens":["Hong","Kong,","meanwhile,","will","host","an","around-the-world","challenge","race","in","1997,","just","before","the","Fragrant","Harbour","returns","to","Chinese","rule","(see","box","this","page)."]},{"text":"And it's not just Asians, but Asian concepts that are setting the seas on fire. British adventurer Tim Severin is crossing the Pacific Ocean on a bamboo raft to prove that Chinese sailors may have successfully sailed from Asia to","tokens":["And","it's","not","just","Asians,","but","Asian","concepts","that","are","setting","the","seas","on","fire.","British","adventurer","Tim","Severin","is","crossing","the","Pacific","Ocean","on","a","bamboo","raft","to","prove","that","Chinese","sailors","may","have","successfully","sailed","from","Asia","to"]},{"text":"America, 1,700 years ago. And Hong Kong-based physician Dr Wayne Moran hopes to retrace Marco Polo's voyage to Europe on the replica deepsea junk Cocachin.","tokens":["America,","1,700","years","ago.","And","Hong","Kong-based","physician","Dr","Wayne","Moran","hopes","to","retrace","Marco","Polo's","voyage","to","Europe","on","the","replica","deepsea","junk","Cocachin."]},{"text":"Taking on a more modern challenge, British millionaire-adventurer Richard Branson hopes to break the offshore powerboat speed record be-tween Port Klang in Malaysia and the holiday island of Langkawi.","tokens":["Taking","on","a","more","modern","challenge,","British","millionaire-adventurer","Richard","Branson","hopes","to","break","the","offshore","powerboat","speed","record","be-tween","Port","Klang","in","Malaysia","and","the","holiday","island","of","Langkawi."]},{"text":"Meanwhile, Malaysia and Thailand are turning into a pleasure boat paradise and hope to become to Asia what the Caribbean is to America--a warm-water playground.","tokens":["Meanwhile,","Malaysia","and","Thailand","are","turning","into","a","pleasure","boat","paradise","and","hope","to","become","to","Asia","what","the","Caribbean","is","to","America--a","warm-water","playground."]},{"text":"To bolster this effort, Kuala Lumpur has dropped the import duty of up to 35 per cent on boats under 26 tonnes, and is wooing Euro-pean and American boat-builders with gener-ous incentives.","tokens":["To","bolster","this","effort,","Kuala","Lumpur","has","dropped","the","import","duty","of","up","to","35","per","cent","on","boats","under","26","tonnes,","and","is","wooing","Euro-pean","and","American","boat-builders","with","gener-ous","incentives."]},{"text":"Tourism minister Datuk Sabbaruddin Chik said Malaysia might also get large charter yachts currently cruising the Mediterranean and the Caribbean to establish their base in the country.","tokens":["Tourism","minister","Datuk","Sabbaruddin","Chik","said","Malaysia","might","also","get","large","charter","yachts","currently","cruising","the","Mediterranean","and","the","Caribbean","to","establish","their","base","in","the","country."]},{"text":"Brooke Yachts, a UK-based company which has supplied boats to Hollywood stars and the Saudiroyalfamily, is rumoured to be setting up shop in Johore.","tokens":["Brooke","Yachts,","a","UK-based","company","which","has","supplied","boats","to","Hollywood","stars","and","the","Saudiroyalfamily,","is","rumoured","to","be","setting","up","shop","in","Johore."]},{"text":"According to marina development con-sultant Muhaimi Mustapha, Malaysia accounts for nearly one third of the $3 billion marina industry in Southeast Asia, with at least six operating by the end of this year and about 20 within the next five","tokens":["According","to","marina","development","con-sultant","Muhaimi","Mustapha,","Malaysia","accounts","for","nearly","one","third","of","the","$3","billion","marina","industry","in","Southeast","Asia,","with","at","least","six","operating","by","the","end","of","this","year","and","about","20","within","the","next","five"]},{"text":"years. Thailand, in particular Phuket, is also get-ting an international cruising reputation even though the government has imposed a high import duty (35 per cent) on some yachts and spare parts.","tokens":["years.","Thailand,","in","particular","Phuket,","is","also","get-ting","an","international","cruising","reputation","even","though","the","government","has","imposed","a","high","import","duty","(35","per","cent)","on","some","yachts","and","spare","parts."]},{"text":"Three fully-fledged new marinas are planned for the next three to five years. Phuket's fa-mous King's Cup Regatta is based on the popular Antigua Week in the Caribbean, a family-styleevent.","tokens":["Three","fully-fledged","new","marinas","are","planned","for","the","next","three","to","five","years.","Phuket's","fa-mous","King's","Cup","Regatta","is","based","on","the","popular","Antigua","Week","in","the","Caribbean,","a","family-styleevent."]},{"text":"Meanwhile, in Singapore, proof that boating is one of the Lion City's fastest growing lei-sure activities is evident in the increasing number of boat owners.","tokens":["Meanwhile,","in","Singapore,","proof","that","boating","is","one","of","the","Lion","City's","fastest","growing","lei-sure","activities","is","evident","in","the","increasing","number","of","boat","owners."]},{"text":"According to the Port of Singapore Authority, the number of licensed pleasure craft has swelled from 4,096 three years ago to 4,945 in December last year.","tokens":["According","to","the","Port","of","Singapore","Authority,","the","number","of","licensed","pleasure","craft","has","swelled","from","4,096","three","years","ago","to","4,945","in","December","last","year."]},{"text":"Malaysia, by comparison, has about 3,000 boat owners. Meanwhile, the Philippines has nowhere to go but up. The nation of more than 7,000 islands, with idyllic boltholes such as Boracay, Puerto Galera in Mindoro and Puerto Princesa in Palawan, is","tokens":["Malaysia,","by","comparison,","has","about","3,000","boat","owners.","Meanwhile,","the","Philippines","has","nowhere","to","go","but","up.","The","nation","of","more","than","7,000","islands,","with","idyllic","boltholes","such","as","Boracay,","Puerto","Galera","in","Mindoro","and","Puerto","Princesa","in","Palawan,","is"]},{"text":"becoming an island-hoppers' paradise. Many avid yachtsmen are starting to cruise the Philippines fulltime rather than sail on to other parts of the world.","tokens":["becoming","an","island-hoppers'","paradise.","Many","avid","yachtsmen","are","starting","to","cruise","the","Philippines","fulltime","rather","than","sail","on","to","other","parts","of","the","world."]},{"text":"But the world's fastest-growing yachting nation of all is Japan. According to the Japan Marina Association, there are 450 marinas dotted around the country's 34,000-kilometre coastline, with 62 more under construction.","tokens":["But","the","world's","fastest-growing","yachting","nation","of","all","is","Japan.","According","to","the","Japan","Marina","Association,","there","are","450","marinas","dotted","around","the","country's","34,000-kilometre","coastline,","with","62","more","under","construction."]},{"text":"Nearly a quarter of a million Japanese own boats, which occupy about 80 per cent of available marina space; in Tokyo and Osaka, the figure is zooming up to 90 per cent.","tokens":["Nearly","a","quarter","of","a","million","Japanese","own","boats,","which","occupy","about","80","per","cent","of","available","marina","space;","in","Tokyo","and","Osaka,","the","figure","is","zooming","up","to","90","per","cent."]},{"text":"In the Philippines, although a few beach resorts have put up their own small marinas and yacht clubs, the Manila Yacht Club, which was formed by five expatriate yachtsmen in 1927, remains the nation's largest.","tokens":["In","the","Philippines,","although","a","few","beach","resorts","have","put","up","their","own","small","marinas","and","yacht","clubs,","the","Manila","Yacht","Club,","which","was","formed","by","five","expatriate","yachtsmen","in","1927,","remains","the","nation's","largest."]}]},"T7":{"key":"T7","title":"T7 NAME THARMALINGAM HAS BEEN leading parties of…","paras":[{"text":"NAME THARMALINGAM HAS BEEN leading parties of bird-watchers and nature enthusiasts to Taman Negara for almost 14 years. He is co-director of Kingfisher Tours, a wildlife tour company based in Kuala Lumpur.","tokens":["NAME","THARMALINGAM","HAS","BEEN","leading","parties","of","bird-watchers","and","nature","enthusiasts","to","Taman","Negara","for","almost","14","years.","He","is","co-director","of","Kingfisher","Tours,","a","wildlife","tour","company","based","in","Kuala","Lumpur."]},{"text":"Most of his clients are well-heeled Westerners, but there is an increasing number of locals. The passions that bird-watching can rouse never fail to amaze him -- he has known dedicated \"birdies\" to charter helicopters just to get into remote","tokens":["Most","of","his","clients","are","well-heeled","Westerners,","but","there","is","an","increasing","number","of","locals.","The","passions","that","bird-watching","can","rouse","never","fail","to","amaze","him","--","he","has","known","dedicated","\"birdies\"","to","charter","helicopters","just","to","get","into","remote"]},{"text":"regions where a single rare species might exist. \"For me, Taman Negara's importance is as one of the premier bird- watching spots in Malaysia.","tokens":["regions","where","a","single","rare","species","might","exist.","\"For","me,","Taman","Negara's","importance","is","as","one","of","the","premier","bird-","watching","spots","in","Malaysia."]},{"text":"There are 350 species within its boundaries -- one of the highest counts in the world. \"Of course, there are many interesting animals, too, and these days, with rainforests such as you find in Taman Negara disappearing fast, the park","tokens":["There","are","350","species","within","its","boundaries","--","one","of","the","highest","counts","in","the","world.","\"Of","course,","there","are","many","interesting","animals,","too,","and","these","days,","with","rainforests","such","as","you","find","in","Taman","Negara","disappearing","fast,","the","park"]},{"text":"is their best hope of survival. \"It's very sad that several of the bird species I've seen over the year are now probably extinct, or very close to it.","tokens":["is","their","best","hope","of","survival.","\"It's","very","sad","that","several","of","the","bird","species","I've","seen","over","the","year","are","now","probably","extinct,","or","very","close","to","it."]},{"text":"\"When I take people around the park, I tell them that this is not a tourist spectacle but the real virgin forest, exactly as it is.","tokens":["\"When","I","take","people","around","the","park,","I","tell","them","that","this","is","not","a","tourist","spectacle","but","the","real","virgin","forest,","exactly","as","it","is."]},{"text":"Their reactions are a bonus for me--complete fascination and excitement at the diversity and variety of life forms.\" THE 4,343 SQUARE KILOMETRES OF the park are criss-brossed by trails that all eventually lead back to park headquarters at Kuala Tahan.","tokens":["Their","reactions","are","a","bonus","for","me--complete","fascination","and","excitement","at","the","diversity","and","variety","of","life","forms.\"","THE","4,343","SQUARE","KILOMETRES","OF","the","park","are","criss-brossed","by","trails","that","all","eventually","lead","back","to","park","headquarters","at","Kuala","Tahan."]},{"text":"Some take just half an hour, while others require more effort. For example, the round trip to the summit of Gunung Tahan, Malaysia's highest peak, takes eight days and is suitable only for the fit and hardy.","tokens":["Some","take","just","half","an","hour,","while","others","require","more","effort.","For","example,","the","round","trip","to","the","summit","of","Gunung","Tahan,","Malaysia's","highest","peak,","takes","eight","days","and","is","suitable","only","for","the","fit","and","hardy."]},{"text":"In between these extremes are distances to suit all physiques, though the going is invariably hot and sticky--humidity rarely drops below 90 percent. In fact, the air is so perpetually damp that it hardly seems worth carrying waterproofs.","tokens":["In","between","these","extremes","are","distances","to","suit","all","physiques,","though","the","going","is","invariably","hot","and","sticky--humidity","rarely","drops","below","90","percent.","In","fact,","the","air","is","so","perpetually","damp","that","it","hardly","seems","worth","carrying","waterproofs."]},{"text":"A great advantage of Taman Negara is that almost as much wildlife can be seen close to Kuala Tahan as in the more remote areas.","tokens":["A","great","advantage","of","Taman","Negara","is","that","almost","as","much","wildlife","can","be","seen","close","to","Kuala","Tahan","as","in","the","more","remote","areas."]},{"text":"The last sighting of a tiger was on the path by the Tahan River, just 30 minute's walk from headquarters. A further plus is that wild animals, like most humans, prefer to lead orderly lives, which is quite convenient if","tokens":["The","last","sighting","of","a","tiger","was","on","the","path","by","the","Tahan","River,","just","30","minute's","walk","from","headquarters.","A","further","plus","is","that","wild","animals,","like","most","humans,","prefer","to","lead","orderly","lives,","which","is","quite","convenient","if"]},{"text":"you want to see them. The flying squirrel leaps from the same tree at the same time every night and a certain herd of elephants returns every two months to its favourite coconut palms because that is how long it","tokens":["you","want","to","see","them.","The","flying","squirrel","leaps","from","the","same","tree","at","the","same","time","every","night","and","a","certain","herd","of","elephants","returns","every","two","months","to","its","favourite","coconut","palms","because","that","is","how","long","it"]},{"text":"takes the plants to recover from being dined upon. The park rangers, in particular, are a mine of such inside information. Want to see a scorpion?","tokens":["takes","the","plants","to","recover","from","being","dined","upon.","The","park","rangers,","in","particular,","are","a","mine","of","such","inside","information.","Want","to","see","a","scorpion?"]},{"text":"There's a certain tree where one likes to sun himself. A slow Loris? Halfway up Teresek Hill at about ll pm. Flying Foxes? Behind chalet nine at dusk.","tokens":["There's","a","certain","tree","where","one","likes","to","sun","himself.","A","slow","Loris?","Halfway","up","Teresek","Hill","at","about","ll","pm.","Flying","Foxes?","Behind","chalet","nine","at","dusk."]},{"text":"However, in the end, quite what is seen in the park depends very much on how you search. One man's park is full of birds and animals, another's is not.","tokens":["However,","in","the","end,","quite","what","is","seen","in","the","park","depends","very","much","on","how","you","search.","One","man's","park","is","full","of","birds","and","animals,","another's","is","not."]},{"text":"The Wildlife Department guide to Taman Negara lets the visitor in on a simple secret--walk slowly and silently. There are no red lights to beat or deadlines to meet in the jungle, so relax and linger--what could take two hours","tokens":["The","Wildlife","Department","guide","to","Taman","Negara","lets","the","visitor","in","on","a","simple","secret--walk","slowly","and","silently.","There","are","no","red","lights","to","beat","or","deadlines","to","meet","in","the","jungle,","so","relax","and","linger--what","could","take","two","hours"]},{"text":"should take four. Accessible from Kuala Tahan are a number of hides located near salt-licks. These vantage points open up an extra dimension-the rainforest by night.","tokens":["should","take","four.","Accessible","from","Kuala","Tahan","are","a","number","of","hides","located","near","salt-licks.","These","vantage","points","open","up","an","extra","dimension-the","rainforest","by","night."]},{"text":"Sambar deer, barking deer and tapir are seen often, while elephants, tigers and sun bears are less common. To view the animals a powerful flash-light is needed--they can be hired from headquarters.","tokens":["Sambar","deer,","barking","deer","and","tapir","are","seen","often,","while","elephants,","tigers","and","sun","bears","are","less","common.","To","view","the","animals","a","powerful","flash-light","is","needed--they","can","be","hired","from","headquarters."]},{"text":"A good pair of binoculars is also useful as the hides are generally quite a distance above the salt-lick. The same flashlight is handy for night walks and cave exploration.","tokens":["A","good","pair","of","binoculars","is","also","useful","as","the","hides","are","generally","quite","a","distance","above","the","salt-lick.","The","same","flashlight","is","handy","for","night","walks","and","cave","exploration."]},{"text":"There are a number of the latter in the park: each has its own character and all have lots of bats. Caves are certainly not to everyone's taste but there is a great sense of achieve-ment to be had when","tokens":["There","are","a","number","of","the","latter","in","the","park:","each","has","its","own","character","and","all","have","lots","of","bats.","Caves","are","certainly","not","to","everyone's","taste","but","there","is","a","great","sense","of","achieve-ment","to","be","had","when"]},{"text":"you make it through the \"crawling\" section of Gua Telinga cave--\"crawling\" because you do and it is--with various small creatures which this particular visitor did not hang around to examine closely.","tokens":["you","make","it","through","the","\"crawling\"","section","of","Gua","Telinga","cave--\"crawling\"","because","you","do","and","it","is--with","various","small","creatures","which","this","particular","visitor","did","not","hang","around","to","examine","closely."]},{"text":"A less-strenuous activity, and one everyone can enjoy, is a river journey. Perhaps the most atmospheric is the two-hour ride up the Tahan River to the rapids of Lata Berkoh.","tokens":["A","less-strenuous","activity,","and","one","everyone","can","enjoy,","is","a","river","journey.","Perhaps","the","most","atmospheric","is","the","two-hour","ride","up","the","Tahan","River","to","the","rapids","of","Lata","Berkoh."]},{"text":"The water is tea-coloured by natural dyes and tannins and huge near trees provide shade for the fish to laze in. This is a jungle river untouched by man.","tokens":["The","water","is","tea-coloured","by","natural","dyes","and","tannins","and","huge","near","trees","provide","shade","for","the","fish","to","laze","in.","This","is","a","jungle","river","untouched","by","man."]},{"text":"A lesser fish eagle-eyes your boat warily from his favourite perch; a stork-billed kingfish-er cries a raucous warning and bolts down-stream while a monitor lizard slips quietly into the water.","tokens":["A","lesser","fish","eagle-eyes","your","boat","warily","from","his","favourite","perch;","a","stork-billed","kingfish-er","cries","a","raucous","warning","and","bolts","down-stream","while","a","monitor","lizard","slips","quietly","into","the","water."]},{"text":"The rapids themselves are lovely, and there is a camp site and a lodge should you want to stay the night. The journey up the much larger River Tembeling is not quite so peaceful.","tokens":["The","rapids","themselves","are","lovely,","and","there","is","a","camp","site","and","a","lodge","should","you","want","to","stay","the","night.","The","journey","up","the","much","larger","River","Tembeling","is","not","quite","so","peaceful."]},{"text":"The fast-moving choppy waters often rise up and drench travellers--prepare to get wet. But the trip is worth the soaking for it opens up a whole new area of the park.","tokens":["The","fast-moving","choppy","waters","often","rise","up","and","drench","travellers--prepare","to","get","wet.","But","the","trip","is","worth","the","soaking","for","it","opens","up","a","whole","new","area","of","the","park."]},{"text":"There are fishing lodges that are rarely visited and some of the best bird-watching to be had. The trails are less well-trodden and it's not unusual to spot tracks of tiger, elephant and, with more luck, the rare Su-matran rhino.","tokens":["There","are","fishing","lodges","that","are","rarely","visited","and","some","of","the","best","bird-watching","to","be","had.","The","trails","are","less","well-trodden","and","it's","not","unusual","to","spot","tracks","of","tiger,","elephant","and,","with","more","luck,","the","rare","Su-matran","rhino."]},{"text":"However, don't build up any hopes for a sighting of this highly-secretive beast--no one has ever seen any of the estimated 15 to 20 individuals that roam the park's more remote parts.","tokens":["However,","don't","build","up","any","hopes","for","a","sighting","of","this","highly-secretive","beast--no","one","has","ever","seen","any","of","the","estimated","15","to","20","individuals","that","roam","the","park's","more","remote","parts."]},{"text":"Much more easily found are the troops of dusky leaf monkeys. Gibbons are plentiful, too, but are usually only heard--theircurious looping cries echoing all around but never so much as a shaking leaf to ad-vertise their presence.","tokens":["Much","more","easily","found","are","the","troops","of","dusky","leaf","monkeys.","Gibbons","are","plentiful,","too,","but","are","usually","only","heard--theircurious","looping","cries","echoing","all","around","but","never","so","much","as","a","shaking","leaf","to","ad-vertise","their","presence."]},{"text":"It is a wariness based on a healthy sense of self-preservation as the people of the rainforest, the Orang Asli, still occasionally hunt them with blow pipes.","tokens":["It","is","a","wariness","based","on","a","healthy","sense","of","self-preservation","as","the","people","of","the","rainforest,","the","Orang","Asli,","still","occasionally","hunt","them","with","blow","pipes."]},{"text":"By the trails, tell-tale cuts in the rough bark of the era berths tree show where the hunters obtain the poison-ous sap for their lethal darts.","tokens":["By","the","trails,","tell-tale","cuts","in","the","rough","bark","of","the","era","berths","tree","show","where","the","hunters","obtain","the","poison-ous","sap","for","their","lethal","darts."]},{"text":"It is a reminder that this is not a zoo.","tokens":["It","is","a","reminder","that","this","is","not","a","zoo."]}]},"T8":{"key":"T8","title":"T8 At the height of the low-cost textiles…","paras":[{"text":"At the height of the low-cost textiles crisis last year, a Singapore statesman angrily suggested that the advanced nations should dismantle their textile industry and leave it entirely to the developing countries.","tokens":["At","the","height","of","the","low-cost","textiles","crisis","last","year,","a","Singapore","statesman","angrily","suggested","that","the","advanced","nations","should","dismantle","their","textile","industry","and","leave","it","entirely","to","the","developing","countries."]},{"text":"Sure, a western wag said, but we could cripple them simply by denying dyestuffs. For, without colour, there won't be fabrics; without fabrics, there won't be fashion; and without fashion, there won't be dollars.","tokens":["Sure,","a","western","wag","said,","but","we","could","cripple","them","simply","by","denying","dyestuffs.","For,","without","colour,","there","won't","be","fabrics;","without","fabrics,","there","won't","be","fashion;","and","without","fashion,","there","won't","be","dollars."]},{"text":"This may be a highly cynical view, but it underlines how critical colour is to Asia's gigantic textile industry. Yet, hardly any developing country in Asia, with the notable exception of India, Pakistan and Taiwan, manufactures dyes.","tokens":["This","may","be","a","highly","cynical","view,","but","it","underlines","how","critical","colour","is","to","Asia's","gigantic","textile","industry.","Yet,","hardly","any","developing","country","in","Asia,","with","the","notable","exception","of","India,","Pakistan","and","Taiwan,","manufactures","dyes."]},{"text":"Even as Asia's textile industry grew to incredible proportions during the sixties, its dyes imp- orts nearly doubled from US$35 million to almost US$70 million a year.","tokens":["Even","as","Asia's","textile","industry","grew","to","incredible","proportions","during","the","sixties,","its","dyes","imp-","orts","nearly","doubled","from","US$35","million","to","almost","US$70","million","a","year."]},{"text":"The wag who quipped about the importance of colour is forgotten, but the point he made has certainly stung Asian planners. Already, the Asian Ind- ustrial Development Council (AIDC) has started preliminary studies to find out whether the developing countries","tokens":["The","wag","who","quipped","about","the","importance","of","colour","is","forgotten,","but","the","point","he","made","has","certainly","stung","Asian","planners.","Already,","the","Asian","Ind-","ustrial","Development","Council","(AIDC)","has","started","preliminary","studies","to","find","out","whether","the","developing","countries"]},{"text":"in this region can make a beg- inning in the production of dyestuffs. With rare exceptions, almost all dyes in modern use are synthetic.","tokens":["in","this","region","can","make","a","beg-","inning","in","the","production","of","dyestuffs.","With","rare","exceptions,","almost","all","dyes","in","modern","use","are","synthetic."]},{"text":"Till the advent of petrochemicals, they were popularly called coal tar dyes because they were synthesised from such hydrocarbons as benzene which were derived directly from coal tar.","tokens":["Till","the","advent","of","petrochemicals,","they","were","popularly","called","coal","tar","dyes","because","they","were","synthesised","from","such","hydrocarbons","as","benzene","which","were","derived","directly","from","coal","tar."]},{"text":"These hydrocarbons are converted in- to intermediates like aniline and naphthols, and then combined to form a fantastic range of colouring substances. Consequently, the manufacture of dyestuffs is highly research-oriented and capital-intensive.","tokens":["These","hydrocarbons","are","converted","in-","to","intermediates","like","aniline","and","naphthols,","and","then","combined","to","form","a","fantastic","range","of","colouring","substances.","Consequently,","the","manufacture","of","dyestuffs","is","highly","research-oriented","and","capital-intensive."]},{"text":"Monopoly. Ironically enough, the production of dyestuffs is closely associated with the production of explosives. For this reason, this ind- ustry enjoyed (and, in some ways, continues to enjoy) a strategic position in West Germany, the United Kingdom, the United","tokens":["Monopoly.","Ironically","enough,","the","production","of","dyestuffs","is","closely","associated","with","the","production","of","explosives.","For","this","reason,","this","ind-","ustry","enjoyed","(and,","in","some","ways,","continues","to","enjoy)","a","strategic","position","in","West","Germany,","the","United","Kingdom,","the","United"]},{"text":"States and Japan. Before World War I, for example, Germany was an undisputed leader in the product- ion of coal tar chemicals and of dyestuffs based on them.","tokens":["States","and","Japan.","Before","World","War","I,","for","example,","Germany","was","an","undisputed","leader","in","the","product-","ion","of","coal","tar","chemicals","and","of","dyestuffs","based","on","them."]},{"text":"She was also the most important supplier of intermediates to other manufacturers. But the two World Wars which the Germans precipitated underlined their critical dependence on German supplies and spurred them on to greater research and greater production.","tokens":["She","was","also","the","most","important","supplier","of","intermediates","to","other","manufacturers.","But","the","two","World","Wars","which","the","Germans","precipitated","underlined","their","critical","dependence","on","German","supplies","and","spurred","them","on","to","greater","research","and","greater","production."]},{"text":"In the early twenties, their total production was barely a few thousand tons. Thanks to sustained research and investment, their output soared during the sixties.","tokens":["In","the","early","twenties,","their","total","production","was","barely","a","few","thousand","tons.","Thanks","to","sustained","research","and","investment,","their","output","soared","during","the","sixties."]},{"text":"By 1968, they were manufacturing and marketing considerably more than they ever did: some 115,000 tons in the U.S., 78,000 tons in West Germany, 41,000 tons in Japan and 37,000 tons in the U.K.","tokens":["By","1968,","they","were","manufacturing","and","marketing","considerably","more","than","they","ever","did:","some","115,000","tons","in","the","U.S.,","78,000","tons","in","West","Germany,","41,000","tons","in","Japan","and","37,000","tons","in","the","U.K."]},{"text":"This period also saw the emergence of minimal facilities in India, Pakistan and Taiwan. Typically, India produces over 5,000 tons of dyes- tuffs (mainly, sulphur black, vat, dyes and azo dyes), Pakistan 2,000 tons (mainly, direct dyes,) and Taiwan 1,500","tokens":["This","period","also","saw","the","emergence","of","minimal","facilities","in","India,","Pakistan","and","Taiwan.","Typically,","India","produces","over","5,000","tons","of","dyes-","tuffs","(mainly,","sulphur","black,","vat,","dyes","and","azo","dyes),","Pakistan","2,000","tons","(mainly,","direct","dyes,)","and","Taiwan","1,500"]},{"text":"tons. The development of the dye- stuffs industry in any country (more strongly so in any developing country) follows there stages: first, production from imported intermediates; sec- ond, production of intermediates; and, third, production of basic organic chemicals from which","tokens":["tons.","The","development","of","the","dye-","stuffs","industry","in","any","country","(more","strongly","so","in","any","developing","country)","follows","there","stages:","first,","production","from","imported","intermediates;","sec-","ond,","production","of","intermediates;","and,","third,","production","of","basic","organic","chemicals","from","which"]},{"text":"intermediates are derived. Projects. On the assum- ption that few developing countries possess the requisite research facil- ities, knowhow or capital, experts suggest that Asian nations must be mode- st in their initial ambitions.","tokens":["intermediates","are","derived.","Projects.","On","the","assum-","ption","that","few","developing","countries","possess","the","requisite","research","facil-","ities,","knowhow","or","capital,","experts","suggest","that","Asian","nations","must","be","mode-","st","in","their","initial","ambitions."]},{"text":"The problem is, however, complicated by the fact that new plants must be versatile enough to produce as wide a range of dyes as possible--and thus give textile mills (and other colour users) the amplitude of choice they require to","tokens":["The","problem","is,","however,","complicated","by","the","fact","that","new","plants","must","be","versatile","enough","to","produce","as","wide","a","range","of","dyes","as","possible--and","thus","give","textile","mills","(and","other","colour","users)","the","amplitude","of","choice","they","require","to"]},{"text":"survive. Mindful of these consider- ations, United Nations and industry experts have framed three possible pilot projects of interest to intending investors. The first project is designed to produce 750 tons of direct dyes, 400 tons of direct dyes, 400","tokens":["survive.","Mindful","of","these","consider-","ations,","United","Nations","and","industry","experts","have","framed","three","possible","pilot","projects","of","interest","to","intending","investors.","The","first","project","is","designed","to","produce","750","tons","of","direct","dyes,","400","tons","of","direct","dyes,","400"]},{"text":"tons of acid dyes, and 600 tons of sulphur black annually. It calls for a total investment of US$4 million, some 65% of it in foreign exchange.","tokens":["tons","of","acid","dyes,","and","600","tons","of","sulphur","black","annually.","It","calls","for","a","total","investment","of","US$4","million,","some","65%","of","it","in","foreign","exchange."]},{"text":"Its products will yield a gross turnover of US$2.7 million and (allowing for a tax holiday of five years) a net profit of around US$610,000.","tokens":["Its","products","will","yield","a","gross","turnover","of","US$2.7","million","and","(allowing","for","a","tax","holiday","of","five","years)","a","net","profit","of","around","US$610,000."]},{"text":"Thus, the pay-out time will be about five years. The second project is designed to manufacture 1,200 tons of naphthol dyes a year. This requires a local investment of US$1.2 million and a foreign component of US$2.1 million.","tokens":["Thus,","the","pay-out","time","will","be","about","five","years.","The","second","project","is","designed","to","manufacture","1,200","tons","of","naphthol","dyes","a","year.","This","requires","a","local","investment","of","US$1.2","million","and","a","foreign","component","of","US$2.1","million."]},{"text":"With an estimated turnover of US$4.2 million and a profit of US$720,000, the payout time will be less than four years. The third project aims at an annual output of 1,000 tons of organic pigment dyes.","tokens":["With","an","estimated","turnover","of","US$4.2","million","and","a","profit","of","US$720,000,","the","payout","time","will","be","less","than","four","years.","The","third","project","aims","at","an","annual","output","of","1,000","tons","of","organic","pigment","dyes."]},{"text":"It will cost US$2.5 million (half of it in foreign exchange) to set up. With gross sales of US$3.6 million and a net profit of US$327,000, the pay-out time will be little more than four years.","tokens":["It","will","cost","US$2.5","million","(half","of","it","in","foreign","exchange)","to","set","up.","With","gross","sales","of","US$3.6","million","and","a","net","profit","of","US$327,000,","the","pay-out","time","will","be","little","more","than","four","years."]},{"text":"For the more daring, a fourth project offers a very promising sideline. Designed to produce 250 tons of optical bleaches, this project envisages a modest investment of less than US$1 million, which can be recovered in three years at most.","tokens":["For","the","more","daring,","a","fourth","project","offers","a","very","promising","sideline.","Designed","to","produce","250","tons","of","optical","bleaches,","this","project","envisages","a","modest","investment","of","less","than","US$1","million,","which","can","be","recovered","in","three","years","at","most."]},{"text":"Market. AIDC experts, who are screening these projects, say that the production of dyestuffs from imported intermediates could be profitable in the developing countries of Asia.","tokens":["Market.","AIDC","experts,","who","are","screening","these","projects,","say","that","the","production","of","dyestuffs","from","imported","intermediates","could","be","profitable","in","the","developing","countries","of","Asia."]},{"text":"An additional attraction is that all these plants will not only provide a fairly steady and large supply of es- sential colours but also result in substantial foreign exchange savings through import substitution.","tokens":["An","additional","attraction","is","that","all","these","plants","will","not","only","provide","a","fairly","steady","and","large","supply","of","es-","sential","colours","but","also","result","in","substantial","foreign","exchange","savings","through","import","substitution."]},{"text":"The latter advantage is based on a very rou- gh estimate of current levels of consumption. For instance, Hong Kong imports over 3,500 tons a year, Taiwan and South Korea together import some 2,500 tons, and the Philippines, Thailand and","tokens":["The","latter","advantage","is","based","on","a","very","rou-","gh","estimate","of","current","levels","of","consumption.","For","instance,","Hong","Kong","imports","over","3,500","tons","a","year,","Taiwan","and","South","Korea","together","import","some","2,500","tons,","and","the","Philippines,","Thailand","and"]},{"text":"Indonesia together buy around 5,000 tons. Of course, their production costs can be substantially trimmed down if two or more countries are willing to enter into joint ventures and thus enjoy economies of scale.","tokens":["Indonesia","together","buy","around","5,000","tons.","Of","course,","their","production","costs","can","be","substantially","trimmed","down","if","two","or","more","countries","are","willing","to","enter","into","joint","ventures","and","thus","enjoy","economies","of","scale."]},{"text":"Admittedly, these projects can only underwrite very limited objec- tives: to give Asian fabric and garment producers some facility of oper- ation, and to provide their traditional dyers and printers a ready, modern medium to work in.","tokens":["Admittedly,","these","projects","can","only","underwrite","very","limited","objec-","tives:","to","give","Asian","fabric","and","garment","producers","some","facility","of","oper-","ation,","and","to","provide","their","traditional","dyers","and","printers","a","ready,","modern","medium","to","work","in."]},{"text":"It would be wholly imprudent to jump to the conclusion that the developing countries can set up a vibrant dyestuffs industry or acquire the requisite technology on their own.","tokens":["It","would","be","wholly","imprudent","to","jump","to","the","conclusion","that","the","developing","countries","can","set","up","a","vibrant","dyestuffs","industry","or","acquire","the","requisite","technology","on","their","own."]},{"text":"For, the evolution of colouring substances, and dyes that adhere to the bewildering range of fibers in use now, is wholly the product of patient and prolonged re- search.","tokens":["For,","the","evolution","of","colouring","substances,","and","dyes","that","adhere","to","the","bewildering","range","of","fibers","in","use","now,","is","wholly","the","product","of","patient","and","prolonged","re-","search."]}]},"T9":{"key":"T9","title":"T9 War is a struggle that destroys a…","paras":[{"text":"War is a struggle that destroys a soldier's mind, thoughts, friends, and family. Young, idealistic men patriotically go off to fight but learn quickly about the harsh reality of war.","tokens":["War","is","a","struggle","that","destroys","a","soldier's","mind,","thoughts,","friends,","and","family.","Young,","idealistic","men","patriotically","go","off","to","fight","but","learn","quickly","about","the","harsh","reality","of","war."]},{"text":"Paul Baumer, the main character in All Quiet on the Western Front has suffered the \"struggle\". After ex- periencing the error of war, Paul view of life changes not only does he feels alienated from his family but also alone","tokens":["Paul","Baumer,","the","main","character","in","All","Quiet","on","the","Western","Front","has","suffered","the","\"struggle\".","After","ex-","periencing","the","error","of","war,","Paul","view","of","life","changes","not","only","does","he","feels","alienated","from","his","family","but","also","alone"]},{"text":"in a world of death and destruction. It is through this characterization of Paul who demonstrates his theme the destructiveness. The meaningless, useless war does no good to everyone who is alive.","tokens":["in","a","world","of","death","and","destruction.","It","is","through","this","characterization","of","Paul","who","demonstrates","his","theme","the","destructiveness.","The","meaningless,","useless","war","does","no","good","to","everyone","who","is","alive."]},{"text":"Paul's thoughts change once he joins the military. \"Killing each separate louse is a tedious business when a man has hundreds\"(75). When Paul is in the camp on the moors with the army, he often images about the war and","tokens":["Paul's","thoughts","change","once","he","joins","the","military.","\"Killing","each","separate","louse","is","a","tedious","business","when","a","man","has","hundreds\"(75).","When","Paul","is","in","the","camp","on","the","moors","with","the","army,","he","often","images","about","the","war","and"]},{"text":"what it does to other people. Killing innocent people is not too difficult to the soldiers. \"The little beasts are hard and the everlasting cracking with one's fingernails very soon becomes wearisome\"(77).","tokens":["what","it","does","to","other","people.","Killing","innocent","people","is","not","too","difficult","to","the","soldiers.","\"The","little","beasts","are","hard","and","the","everlasting","cracking","with","one's","fingernails","very","soon","becomes","wearisome\"(77)."]},{"text":"Paul realizes that the \"beasts\" are the symbolic enemies who stand ready to attack at all time. These enemy soldiers are compared to the everlasting cracking fingernails, which represent the crackings in their lives.","tokens":["Paul","realizes","that","the","\"beasts\"","are","the","symbolic","enemies","who","stand","ready","to","attack","at","all","time.","These","enemy","soldiers","are","compared","to","the","everlasting","cracking","fingernails,","which","represent","the","crackings","in","their","lives."]},{"text":"Each day Paul's feelings are changed as his friends die. \"I am young, yet I know nothing of life but despair, death, fear, and fatuous superficiality cast over an abyss of sorrow.","tokens":["Each","day","Paul's","feelings","are","changed","as","his","friends","die.","\"I","am","young,","yet","I","know","nothing","of","life","but","despair,","death,","fear,","and","fatuous","superficiality","cast","over","an","abyss","of","sorrow."]},{"text":"I see how peoples are set against are another, and in silence, unknowingly, foolishly, obediently, innocently slay on another. I see that the keenest brains of the world invent weapons and words to make it yet more refined and enduring\"(263).","tokens":["I","see","how","peoples","are","set","against","are","another,","and","in","silence,","unknowingly,","foolishly,","obediently,","innocently","slay","on","another.","I","see","that","the","keenest","brains","of","the","world","invent","weapons","and","words","to","make","it","yet","more","refined","and","enduring\"(263)."]},{"text":"Paul's thoughts are getting more understandable than before, because he knows the darkness of the war; he totally understands the situation of a role in the miserable war.","tokens":["Paul's","thoughts","are","getting","more","understandable","than","before,","because","he","knows","the","darkness","of","the","war;","he","totally","understands","the","situation","of","a","role","in","the","miserable","war."]},{"text":"Once the war ends, all the soldiers will no longer have an occupa- tion; they can no longer be fit to do anything but a soldier.","tokens":["Once","the","war","ends,","all","the","soldiers","will","no","longer","have","an","occupa-","tion;","they","can","no","longer","be","fit","to","do","anything","but","a","soldier."]},{"text":"Paul's thoughts have been destroyed by the war, and he cannot think about anything else except despair, death, and fear. The brutal war worries Paul whole family only the emptiness of separa- tion when he is gone.","tokens":["Paul's","thoughts","have","been","destroyed","by","the","war,","and","he","cannot","think","about","anything","else","except","despair,","death,","and","fear.","The","brutal","war","worries","Paul","whole","family","only","the","emptiness","of","separa-","tion","when","he","is","gone."]},{"text":"\"It is the kitchen door that was opened, they are cooking potato-cakes, the house reeks of it, and to-day of course is Saturday; that will be my sister leaning over.","tokens":["\"It","is","the","kitchen","door","that","was","opened,","they","are","cooking","potato-cakes,","the","house","reeks","of","it,","and","to-day","of","course","is","Saturday;","that","will","be","my","sister","leaning","over."]},{"text":"For a moment I am shy and lower my head, then I take off my helmet and look up. Yes, it is my eldest sister(157).\"","tokens":["For","a","moment","I","am","shy","and","lower","my","head,","then","I","take","off","my","helmet","and","look","up.","Yes,","it","is","my","eldest","sister(157).\""]},{"text":"Paul no longer fits into the family unit, his experiences at war leave him shy and crazy for the normality of their lives. \"She looks at me.","tokens":["Paul","no","longer","fits","into","the","family","unit,","his","experiences","at","war","leave","him","shy","and","crazy","for","the","normality","of","their","lives.","\"She","looks","at","me."]},{"text":"Her hands are white and sickly and frail compared with mine. We say very little and I am thankful that she asks nothing. What ought I to say?","tokens":["Her","hands","are","white","and","sickly","and","frail","compared","with","mine.","We","say","very","little","and","I","am","thankful","that","she","asks","nothing.","What","ought","I","to","say?"]},{"text":"Everything I could have wished for has happened. I have come out of it safely and sit here beside her. And in the kitchen stands my sister preparing supper and signing(159).\"","tokens":["Everything","I","could","have","wished","for","has","happened.","I","have","come","out","of","it","safely","and","sit","here","beside","her.","And","in","the","kitchen","stands","my","sister","preparing","supper","and","signing(159).\""]},{"text":"Paul has been waiting for this moment since joining the military, now he can finally talk to his dear mother and be gathering together harmony of his family.","tokens":["Paul","has","been","waiting","for","this","moment","since","joining","the","military,","now","he","can","finally","talk","to","his","dear","mother","and","be","gathering","together","harmony","of","his","family."]},{"text":"However, the war has separated Paul from his mother. His pale, sick mother does not want to ask anything about the war but watches her son and hoping that he will come back alive.","tokens":["However,","the","war","has","separated","Paul","from","his","mother.","His","pale,","sick","mother","does","not","want","to","ask","anything","about","the","war","but","watches","her","son","and","hoping","that","he","will","come","back","alive."]},{"text":"\"Before my mother's tremulous anxiety I recover my composure. Now I can walk about and talk and answer questions without fear of having suddenly to lean against the wall because the world turns soft as rubber and my veins become","tokens":["\"Before","my","mother's","tremulous","anxiety","I","recover","my","composure.","Now","I","can","walk","about","and","talk","and","answer","questions","without","fear","of","having","suddenly","to","lean","against","the","wall","because","the","world","turns","soft","as","rubber","and","my","veins","become"]},{"text":"brimstone(161-2).\" Once Paul tells his mother that he is well, he does not have to worry about the rest of the conversations, because all he wants is make his mother happy and feel safe.","tokens":["brimstone(161-2).\"","Once","Paul","tells","his","mother","that","he","is","well,","he","does","not","have","to","worry","about","the","rest","of","the","conversations,","because","all","he","wants","is","make","his","mother","happy","and","feel","safe."]},{"text":"However, his attempts to ease his mother worries causes him to feel alienated; he has no one to share the horror of the war.","tokens":["However,","his","attempts","to","ease","his","mother","worries","causes","him","to","feel","alienated;","he","has","no","one","to","share","the","horror","of","the","war."]},{"text":"He is left to face it alone. Paul will have a difficult time surviving without his comrades. \"There I drop down on my knees, but have still enough strength to fall on to the side where Kat's sound leg is.","tokens":["He","is","left","to","face","it","alone.","Paul","will","have","a","difficult","time","surviving","without","his","comrades.","\"There","I","drop","down","on","my","knees,","but","have","still","enough","strength","to","fall","on","to","the","side","where","Kat's","sound","leg","is."]},{"text":"After a few minutes I straighten my- self up again. My leg and my hands tremble. I have trouble in finding my water bottle, to take a pull.","tokens":["After","a","few","minutes","I","straighten","my-","self","up","again.","My","leg","and","my","hands","tremble.","I","have","trouble","in","finding","my","water","bottle,","to","take","a","pull."]},{"text":"My lips tremble as I try to think. But I smile-Kat is saved.\" Paul is very nervous about Kat's wound, because he does not want to lose his last friend in the army.","tokens":["My","lips","tremble","as","I","try","to","think.","But","I","smile-Kat","is","saved.\"","Paul","is","very","nervous","about","Kat's","wound,","because","he","does","not","want","to","lose","his","last","friend","in","the","army."]},{"text":"The only good thing to come out of this horror is the friendship. \"On the way without my having notices it, Kat has caught a splinter in the head.","tokens":["The","only","good","thing","to","come","out","of","this","horror","is","the","friendship.","\"On","the","way","without","my","having","notices","it,","Kat","has","caught","a","splinter","in","the","head."]},{"text":"There is just one little hole, it must have been a ver tiny, stray splinter. But is has sufficed. Kat is dead(290-1).\" Kat's death makes Paul feel even more iso- lated.","tokens":["There","is","just","one","little","hole,","it","must","have","been","a","ver","tiny,","stray","splinter.","But","is","has","sufficed.","Kat","is","dead(290-1).\"","Kat's","death","makes","Paul","feel","even","more","iso-","lated."]},{"text":"Now, he is truly alone. \"Do I walk? Have I feet still? I raise my eyes, I let them move round, and turn myself with them, one circle, one circle, and I stand in the midst.","tokens":["Now,","he","is","truly","alone.","\"Do","I","walk?","Have","I","feet","still?","I","raise","my","eyes,","I","let","them","move","round,","and","turn","myself","with","them,","one","circle,","one","circle,","and","I","stand","in","the","midst."]},{"text":"All is as usual. Only the Militiaman Stanislaus Katczinsky has died(291).\" The death of Katczinsky destroys the last thing that is important to Paul rather than his family.","tokens":["All","is","as","usual.","Only","the","Militiaman","Stanislaus","Katczinsky","has","died(291).\"","The","death","of","Katczinsky","destroys","the","last","thing","that","is","important","to","Paul","rather","than","his","family."]},{"text":"The war has left him nothing. A war determines the fate as if some 3-year-old children are playing sandcastles, so innocent, so easily to destroy.","tokens":["The","war","has","left","him","nothing.","A","war","determines","the","fate","as","if","some","3-year-old","children","are","playing","sandcastles,","so","innocent,","so","easily","to","destroy."]},{"text":"War destroys all that men hold dear. Paul Baumer learns to distrust all that he believed in; he fells alienated from his family; and ultimately he is left without hope.","tokens":["War","destroys","all","that","men","hold","dear.","Paul","Baumer","learns","to","distrust","all","that","he","believed","in;","he","fells","alienated","from","his","family;","and","ultimately","he","is","left","without","hope."]},{"text":"The destructiveness of war strips men of everything leaving them with nothing. Four people-the Belgian bus driver, two women from the United States and a Canadian man-died at the scene, said a police spokesman in nearby Scheifling.","tokens":["The","destructiveness","of","war","strips","men","of","everything","leaving","them","with","nothing.","Four","people-the","Belgian","bus","driver,","two","women","from","the","United","States","and","a","Canadian","man-died","at","the","scene,","said","a","police","spokesman","in","nearby","Scheifling."]},{"text":"An American man died later in the hospital, he added, speak- ing on condition of anonymity.","tokens":["An","American","man","died","later","in","the","hospital,","he","added,","speak-","ing","on","condition","of","anonymity."]}]},"T10":{"key":"T10","title":"T10 President Lee Teng-hei and his entourage arrived…","paras":[{"text":"President Lee Teng-hei and his entourage arrived in Pretoria last night for the upcoming inauguration of South Africa's first black president, Nelson Mandela. Lee took a China Airlines chartered flight to South Africa, on the third and probably most-important leg","tokens":["President","Lee","Teng-hei","and","his","entourage","arrived","in","Pretoria","last","night","for","the","upcoming","inauguration","of","South","Africa's","first","black","president,","Nelson","Mandela.","Lee","took","a","China","Airlines","chartered","flight","to","South","Africa,","on","the","third","and","probably","most-important","leg"]},{"text":"of his global trip, following a five-day visit to Nicaragua and Costa Rica in Central America. Lee's presence at Mandela's swearing-in ceremony highlights the 71 year-old ROC president's aggressive efforts to promote Taiwan's presence in the international arena.","tokens":["of","his","global","trip,","following","a","five-day","visit","to","Nicaragua","and","Costa","Rica","in","Central","America.","Lee's","presence","at","Mandela's","swearing-in","ceremony","highlights","the","71","year-old","ROC","president's","aggressive","efforts","to","promote","Taiwan's","presence","in","the","international","arena."]},{"text":"Official delegations from more than 100 coun- tries will attend the presidential inauguration ceremony of South Aftrica. Lee's presence indicates Taipei's Temporary victoiry in its ongoing po- litical struggle with Beijing, which only sent a low-key unofficial repre- sentative from","tokens":["Official","delegations","from","more","than","100","coun-","tries","will","attend","the","presidential","inauguration","ceremony","of","South","Aftrica.","Lee's","presence","indicates","Taipei's","Temporary","victoiry","in","its","ongoing","po-","litical","struggle","with","Beijing,","which","only","sent","a","low-key","unofficial","repre-","sentative","from"]},{"text":"the private mainland China's African Friendship Association. Beijing, which regards Taiwan a renegade province, has consistently sought to undermine Taiwan in the international diplomatic arena.","tokens":["the","private","mainland","China's","African","Friendship","Association.","Beijing,","which","regards","Taiwan","a","renegade","province,","has","consistently","sought","to","undermine","Taiwan","in","the","international","diplomatic","arena."]},{"text":"Lee, of course, will take the opportunity to consolidate Taiwan's official relations with the new South African government. President elect Mandela has called Beijing an old friend he will not forget.","tokens":["Lee,","of","course,","will","take","the","opportunity","to","consolidate","Taiwan's","official","relations","with","the","new","South","African","government.","President","elect","Mandela","has","called","Beijing","an","old","friend","he","will","not","forget."]},{"text":"\"Given the status of our ties with the ROC in the past... I think it is a good thing that President Lee will be present when we change governments, to show the ROC also regards its ties with South Africa,\"","tokens":["\"Given","the","status","of","our","ties","with","the","ROC","in","the","past...","I","think","it","is","a","good","thing","that","President","Lee","will","be","present","when","we","change","governments,","to","show","the","ROC","also","regards","its","ties","with","South","Africa,\""]},{"text":"South African ambassador to the ROC Johannes Lodewikus Viljoen told local reporters yesterday. South Africa is the largest among 29 nations diplomatically allied with the ROC.","tokens":["South","African","ambassador","to","the","ROC","Johannes","Lodewikus","Viljoen","told","local","reporters","yesterday.","South","Africa","is","the","largest","among","29","nations","diplomatically","allied","with","the","ROC."]},{"text":"Beijing is trying to induce such nations to switch their official recogni- tion to the mainland. Right after his arrival, Lee and his entourage went from the Johannesburg airport to Pretoria City Hall, where Pretoria Mayor Nico Stofberg hosted a","tokens":["Beijing","is","trying","to","induce","such","nations","to","switch","their","official","recogni-","tion","to","the","mainland.","Right","after","his","arrival,","Lee","and","his","entourage","went","from","the","Johannesburg","airport","to","Pretoria","City","Hall,","where","Pretoria","Mayor","Nico","Stofberg","hosted","a"]},{"text":"banquet in honor of all the foreign delegates. To strengthen friendly relations be tween the two nations, the ROC embassy in pretoria has arranged for president Lee to meet with Mandela and his predecessor F.W.","tokens":["banquet","in","honor","of","all","the","foreign","delegates.","To","strengthen","friendly","relations","be","tween","the","two","nations,","the","ROC","embassy","in","pretoria","has","arranged","for","president","Lee","to","meet","with","Mandela","and","his","predecessor","F.W."]},{"text":"de Klerk, as well as with the new governors of south Africa's nie provinces. Analysts here said South Africa is the last major ROC diplomatic ally considered likely to officially recognize both Beijing and Taipei, a prece dent for dual","tokens":["de","Klerk,","as","well","as","with","the","new","governors","of","south","Africa's","nie","provinces.","Analysts","here","said","South","Africa","is","the","last","major","ROC","diplomatic","ally","considered","likely","to","officially","recognize","both","Beijing","and","Taipei,","a","prece","dent","for","dual"]},{"text":"recognition of both Chinese governments. Beijing succeeded in pressuring both Saudi Arabia and South Korea into dropping their recognition of Taipei when they established diplomatic ties with the mainland.","tokens":["recognition","of","both","Chinese","governments.","Beijing","succeeded","in","pressuring","both","Saudi","Arabia","and","South","Korea","into","dropping","their","recognition","of","Taipei","when","they","established","diplomatic","ties","with","the","mainland."]},{"text":"The Atomic Energy Council yesterday denied withholding early information on radiation contamination in the Minsheng Villas housingproject, but failed to answer lingering questions. AEC chairman Hsu Yih-yun made pubic previously withheld records of the Minsheng Villa contamination and declared the","tokens":["The","Atomic","Energy","Council","yesterday","denied","withholding","early","information","on","radiation","contamination","in","the","Minsheng","Villas","housingproject,","but","failed","to","answer","lingering","questions.","AEC","chairman","Hsu","Yih-yun","made","pubic","previously","withheld","records","of","the","Minsheng","Villa","contamination","and","declared","the"]},{"text":"councils handling of the case to have beenabove the board. But questions persisted as to why information on the affair was not released previously.","tokens":["councils","handling","of","the","case","to","have","beenabove","the","board.","But","questions","persisted","as","to","why","information","on","the","affair","was","not","released","previously."]},{"text":"Hsu said conflicting versions of events were behind the non-disclosure. But the head of the Minsheng Villa residents' committee, Wang Yu-lin, has accused the AEC of suppressing the true results of those tests.","tokens":["Hsu","said","conflicting","versions","of","events","were","behind","the","non-disclosure.","But","the","head","of","the","Minsheng","Villa","residents'","committee,","Wang","Yu-lin,","has","accused","the","AEC","of","suppressing","the","true","results","of","those","tests."]},{"text":"At a press conference last Thursday Wang accused officials of faking the X-ray machine's reports to hide an earlier cover-up. Three AEC officials are under invesitigation for repressing evidence of radiation contamination at Minsheng Villa discovered in 1985, nearly eight","tokens":["At","a","press","conference","last","Thursday","Wang","accused","officials","of","faking","the","X-ray","machine's","reports","to","hide","an","earlier","cover-up.","Three","AEC","officials","are","under","invesitigation","for","repressing","evidence","of","radiation","contamination","at","Minsheng","Villa","discovered","in","1985,","nearly","eight"]},{"text":"years before residents learned of the dangers. According to AEC Vice Chairman wang Manchao, testing procedures were designed to detect radiation leaks from the machine and did not measure dangerously high background radiation levels.","tokens":["years","before","residents","learned","of","the","dangers.","According","to","AEC","Vice","Chairman","wang","Manchao,","testing","procedures","were","designed","to","detect","radiation","leaks","from","the","machine","and","did","not","measure","dangerously","high","background","radiation","levels."]},{"text":"The Kaohsiung side alleged that the Saturday vote was illegal, as the standing sub-committee's decision should be final according to the group's normal practice.","tokens":["The","Kaohsiung","side","alleged","that","the","Saturday","vote","was","illegal,","as","the","standing","sub-committee's","decision","should","be","final","according","to","the","group's","normal","practice."]},{"text":"\"we hope the Control Yuan can investigate the vote-vote is necessary, the Olympic committee should arrange one,\" Kaohsiung Legis- lator Huang Chaoshun told reporter after meeting with Control Yuan member.","tokens":["\"we","hope","the","Control","Yuan","can","investigate","the","vote-vote","is","necessary,","the","Olympic","committee","should","arrange","one,\"","Kaohsiung","Legis-","lator","Huang","Chaoshun","told","reporter","after","meeting","with","Control","Yuan","member."]},{"text":"Whereas Mayor Huang Tachou denied any irregularities, the Olympic committee ruled out the possibility of a revote. Officials with Taipei's Education Department, which oversees sports activities, said Huang had lobbied the committee members in the last week be fore the","tokens":["Whereas","Mayor","Huang","Tachou","denied","any","irregularities,","the","Olympic","committee","ruled","out","the","possibility","of","a","revote.","Officials","with","Taipei's","Education","Department,","which","oversees","sports","activities,","said","Huang","had","lobbied","the","committee","members","in","the","last","week","be","fore","the"]},{"text":"committee cast their votes. But the mayor never promised any subsidies. The officials alleged that it was the Kaohsiung side that had off ered \"bribes.\"","tokens":["committee","cast","their","votes.","But","the","mayor","never","promised","any","subsidies.","The","officials","alleged","that","it","was","the","Kaohsiung","side","that","had","off","ered","\"bribes.\""]},{"text":"But the Taipei mayor has been unable to win full support from his own front. Although the comm- ittee's decision is unlikely to be reversed, some Taipei city councilors questioned the city's ability to host such large scale sports events.","tokens":["But","the","Taipei","mayor","has","been","unable","to","win","full","support","from","his","own","front.","Although","the","comm-","ittee's","decision","is","unlikely","to","be","reversed,","some","Taipei","city","councilors","questioned","the","city's","ability","to","host","such","large","scale","sports","events."]},{"text":"Five councilors have threatened to withhold funds for the games budget, which may range from NT$120 billion to NT$150 billion, four to five times the annual budget for the Education Department.","tokens":["Five","councilors","have","threatened","to","withhold","funds","for","the","games","budget,","which","may","range","from","NT$120","billion","to","NT$150","billion,","four","to","five","times","the","annual","budget","for","the","Education","Department."]},{"text":"The councilors poilted out that the event will worsen the City's debt, which already stands at more than NT$100 billion. The construction of the sports park in Kuantu needs some NT$100 billion, which means Taipei will have to pay a","tokens":["The","councilors","poilted","out","that","the","event","will","worsen","the","City's","debt,","which","already","stands","at","more","than","NT$100","billion.","The","construction","of","the","sports","park","in","Kuantu","needs","some","NT$100","billion,","which","means","Taipei","will","have","to","pay","a"]},{"text":"daily interest of NT$20 million if the money is loaned from banks, said Chang Ling. Chang questioned whether it isworthy to host an Asian Games that may be boycotted by mainland China, the best Asian sports nation.","tokens":["daily","interest","of","NT$20","million","if","the","money","is","loaned","from","banks,","said","Chang","Ling.","Chang","questioned","whether","it","isworthy","to","host","an","Asian","Games","that","may","be","boycotted","by","mainland","China,","the","best","Asian","sports","nation."]},{"text":"But the City'streasurer, Liao Cheng-chin, said the city may cover the expense by issuing a lottery. Although the road to hosting the game is still long, Education Department head Lin Chao-hsien said Taipei stand a great chance.","tokens":["But","the","City'streasurer,","Liao","Cheng-chin,","said","the","city","may","cover","the","expense","by","issuing","a","lottery.","Although","the","road","to","hosting","the","game","is","still","long,","Education","Department","head","Lin","Chao-hsien","said","Taipei","stand","a","great","chance."]},{"text":"\"Of the four Asian little dragons, South Korea has hosted the games in the past. Hong Kong and Singapore ande not interested. Therefore we stand a great chance.\"","tokens":["\"Of","the","four","Asian","little","dragons,","South","Korea","has","hosted","the","games","in","the","past.","Hong","Kong","and","Singapore","ande","not","interested.","Therefore","we","stand","a","great","chance.\""]},{"text":"said Lin. A well-lit model home promoting sales of similar models in the Taipei suburb of Neihu becomes a local night spot at- traction.","tokens":["said","Lin.","A","well-lit","model","home","promoting","sales","of","similar","models","in","the","Taipei","suburb","of","Neihu","becomes","a","local","night","spot","at-","traction."]},{"text":"A deueloper reportedly spent more than NT$1 million on the decor of the model home. Kaohsiung police said yesterday they found a charred male body and a gasoline bottle on a beach near the Chichin tunnel.","tokens":["A","deueloper","reportedly","spent","more","than","NT$1","million","on","the","decor","of","the","model","home.","Kaohsiung","police","said","yesterday","they","found","a","charred","male","body","and","a","gasoline","bottle","on","a","beach","near","the","Chichin","tunnel."]}]},"T11":{"key":"T11","title":"T11 A special fact-finding delegation sent to the…","paras":[{"text":"A special fact-finding delegation sent to the mainland by Taipei said yesterday it had learned nothing new from briefings with beijing authorities on the Qiandao Lake incident.","tokens":["A","special","fact-finding","delegation","sent","to","the","mainland","by","Taipei","said","yesterday","it","had","learned","nothing","new","from","briefings","with","beijing","authorities","on","the","Qiandao","Lake","incident."]},{"text":"\"The briefings given by experts from the Association for Relations Across the Taiwan Strait were basically consistent with written material we received earlier, with a little more oral description\" said Shi Hwei-you, deputy secretary-general of the Straits Exchange Foundation (SEF).","tokens":["\"The","briefings","given","by","experts","from","the","Association","for","Relations","Across","the","Taiwan","Strait","were","basically","consistent","with","written","material","we","received","earlier,","with","a","little","more","oral","description\"","said","Shi","Hwei-you,","deputy","secretary-general","of","the","Straits","Exchange","Foundation","(SEF)."]},{"text":"Taipei sent the delegates to the east- ern mainland city of Hangzhou in an attempt to find out the truth behind the Qiandao Lake boat fire in which 24 Taiwan tourists were killed.","tokens":["Taipei","sent","the","delegates","to","the","east-","ern","mainland","city","of","Hangzhou","in","an","attempt","to","find","out","the","truth","behind","the","Qiandao","Lake","boat","fire","in","which","24","Taiwan","tourists","were","killed."]},{"text":"Shi has requested permission to see and interview the three mainland suspects caught in connection with the robbery-arson-murder case, and to take some physical evidence back to Taipei.","tokens":["Shi","has","requested","permission","to","see","and","interview","the","three","mainland","suspects","caught","in","connection","with","the","robbery-arson-murder","case,","and","to","take","some","physical","evidence","back","to","Taipei."]},{"text":"But the ARATS was noncommittal on the request, indicating it would have to get permission from higher author- ities. \"We will determine whether the handling of the case is appropriate after visiting the accident site and examining the relevant evidence,\"","tokens":["But","the","ARATS","was","noncommittal","on","the","request,","indicating","it","would","have","to","get","permission","from","higher","author-","ities.","\"We","will","determine","whether","the","handling","of","the","case","is","appropriate","after","visiting","the","accident","site","and","examining","the","relevant","evidence,\""]},{"text":"said Shi, who is heading the delegation. The delegation includes victims' relatives, lawyers, and forensic and criminal investigation experts. This was the first time since the March 31 boat fire that SEF officials and experts were allowed to visit the","tokens":["said","Shi,","who","is","heading","the","delegation.","The","delegation","includes","victims'","relatives,","lawyers,","and","forensic","and","criminal","investigation","experts.","This","was","the","first","time","since","the","March","31","boat","fire","that","SEF","officials","and","experts","were","allowed","to","visit","the"]},{"text":"mainland to learn about the mainland's in vestigation into the case. \"Only by doing so can the fragile Taiwan-mainland ties return to normal,\" the semi-official Central News Agency cited Shi as saying.","tokens":["mainland","to","learn","about","the","mainland's","in","vestigation","into","the","case.","\"Only","by","doing","so","can","the","fragile","Taiwan-mainland","ties","return","to","normal,\"","the","semi-official","Central","News","Agency","cited","Shi","as","saying."]},{"text":"Shi's ARATS counterpart, Lii Yafei, said peo- ple in the mainland feel as sad as the people in Taiwan about the accient, and that the mainland authorities have tried their utmost to solve the case, the CNA reported.","tokens":["Shi's","ARATS","counterpart,","Lii","Yafei,","said","peo-","ple","in","the","mainland","feel","as","sad","as","the","people","in","Taiwan","about","the","accient,","and","that","the","mainland","authorities","have","tried","their","utmost","to","solve","the","case,","the","CNA","reported."]},{"text":"But despite these good intention, mainland author- ities at yesterday's briefings turned down a request by the delegation to see autopsy reports, and instead showed them slides and taped records about the condition of the bodies.","tokens":["But","despite","these","good","intention,","mainland","author-","ities","at","yesterday's","briefings","turned","down","a","request","by","the","delegation","to","see","autopsy","reports,","and","instead","showed","them","slides","and","taped","records","about","the","condition","of","the","bodies."]},{"text":"In a question-and-answer session after the briefings, the SEF delegation pointed out about 100 suspicious points in the case, however, the ARATS' responses were only sufficient for a \"preliminary understanding\" of the case, Shi told reporters.","tokens":["In","a","question-and-answer","session","after","the","briefings,","the","SEF","delegation","pointed","out","about","100","suspicious","points","in","the","case,","however,","the","ARATS'","responses","were","only","sufficient","for","a","\"preliminary","understanding\"","of","the","case,","Shi","told","reporters."]},{"text":"The special delegation is expected to travel today to the site of the accident, some 200 kilometers from Hangzhou, where it hopes to find more information of the cause of the tragedy.","tokens":["The","special","delegation","is","expected","to","travel","today","to","the","site","of","the","accident,","some","200","kilometers","from","Hangzhou,","where","it","hopes","to","find","more","information","of","the","cause","of","the","tragedy."]},{"text":"The delegation will return to Taipei Saturday. Taiwan's top labor policy official yesterday strongly defended the recent deportation of two Thai workers for their participation in an illegal strike, but indicatedthe ROC will continue to import foreign labor as long","tokens":["The","delegation","will","return","to","Taipei","Saturday.","Taiwan's","top","labor","policy","official","yesterday","strongly","defended","the","recent","deportation","of","two","Thai","workers","for","their","participation","in","an","illegal","strike,","but","indicatedthe","ROC","will","continue","to","import","foreign","labor","as","long"]},{"text":"as the necessity is clear. The chairman of the Council of Labor Affairs, Chao Shoupo, said two years into its experiment with recruiting for sign labor that the government must exercise a firm hand with imported workers.","tokens":["as","the","necessity","is","clear.","The","chairman","of","the","Council","of","Labor","Affairs,","Chao","Shoupo,","said","two","years","into","its","experiment","with","recruiting","for","sign","labor","that","the","government","must","exercise","a","firm","hand","with","imported","workers."]},{"text":"He called illegal and unregistered foreign workers in Taiwan a \"time bomb for the social order.\" \"I'd like to very seriously remind foreign workers that ROC law appilies to all workers, foreign and domestic,\" he said.","tokens":["He","called","illegal","and","unregistered","foreign","workers","in","Taiwan","a","\"time","bomb","for","the","social","order.\"","\"I'd","like","to","very","seriously","remind","foreign","workers","that","ROC","law","appilies","to","all","workers,","foreign","and","domestic,\"","he","said."]},{"text":"\"We are not inviting problems.\" In a meeting with the English language press to head off \"misunderstandings\" between foreign labor and the government, Chao said labor-exporting nations including Thailand and the Philippine must educate their citizens about ROC law before","tokens":["\"We","are","not","inviting","problems.\"","In","a","meeting","with","the","English","language","press","to","head","off","\"misunderstandings\"","between","foreign","labor","and","the","government,","Chao","said","labor-exporting","nations","including","Thailand","and","the","Philippine","must","educate","their","citizens","about","ROC","law","before"]},{"text":"coming to Taiwan. He said countries of origin were entirely responsible for such orientation programs and other such services for their nationals' stay in Taiwan.","tokens":["coming","to","Taiwan.","He","said","countries","of","origin","were","entirely","responsible","for","such","orientation","programs","and","other","such","services","for","their","nationals'","stay","in","Taiwan."]},{"text":"Chao said the two Thai workers, deported after leading a strike of some 600 Thailaborers at a factory in Taichung on Feb. 24-25, had illegally initiated the labor action.","tokens":["Chao","said","the","two","Thai","workers,","deported","after","leading","a","strike","of","some","600","Thailaborers","at","a","factory","in","Taichung","on","Feb.","24-25,","had","illegally","initiated","the","labor","action."]},{"text":"He said foreign workers have as much right to join unions and strike as local workers, but that such action must be undertaken through a union or addressed as a labor dispute for arbitration by the CLA.","tokens":["He","said","foreign","workers","have","as","much","right","to","join","unions","and","strike","as","local","workers,","but","that","such","action","must","be","undertaken","through","a","union","or","addressed","as","a","labor","dispute","for","arbitration","by","the","CLA."]},{"text":"He added the employer had exercise his option not to renew the workers' contracts and work permits. \"Legally, therefore, neither the government nor the employers were guity of wrong doing,\" Chao said.","tokens":["He","added","the","employer","had","exercise","his","option","not","to","renew","the","workers'","contracts","and","work","permits.","\"Legally,","therefore,","neither","the","government","nor","the","employers","were","guity","of","wrong","doing,\"","Chao","said."]},{"text":"But the chairman also took pains to emphasize that the ROC's stance on foreign labor was little different from that of the United States and other Countries that operate under a \"double standard\" for foreign workers.","tokens":["But","the","chairman","also","took","pains","to","emphasize","that","the","ROC's","stance","on","foreign","labor","was","little","different","from","that","of","the","United","States","and","other","Countries","that","operate","under","a","\"double","standard\"","for","foreign","workers."]},{"text":"Chao said the CLA was pushing a revision of the labor standards law to extend for eign workers' permits form two years to three.","tokens":["Chao","said","the","CLA","was","pushing","a","revision","of","the","labor","standards","law","to","extend","for","eign","workers'","permits","form","two","years","to","three."]},{"text":"But he also said a freeze on the importation of Thai workers remains a possibility in the ongoing dispute over the practices of employment brokers.","tokens":["But","he","also","said","a","freeze","on","the","importation","of","Thai","workers","remains","a","possibility","in","the","ongoing","dispute","over","the","practices","of","employment","brokers."]},{"text":"Chao vehemently be nounced brokers which charge foreign workers exorbitant fees to locate jobs in Taiwan. He said indenturement to broker, who are allowed by Thai law to deduct up to NT$38,000 from workers' salaries, had a harmful effect on","tokens":["Chao","vehemently","be","nounced","brokers","which","charge","foreign","workers","exorbitant","fees","to","locate","jobs","in","Taiwan.","He","said","indenturement","to","broker,","who","are","allowed","by","Thai","law","to","deduct","up","to","NT$38,000","from","workers'","salaries,","had","a","harmful","effect","on"]},{"text":"morale and prompted foreign workers to join the lucrative illegal labor market. Chao said foreign laborers help boost the local economy but said the integration of those workers into Taiwan's society has never been the CLA's intention.","tokens":["morale","and","prompted","foreign","workers","to","join","the","lucrative","illegal","labor","market.","Chao","said","foreign","laborers","help","boost","the","local","economy","but","said","the","integration","of","those","workers","into","Taiwan's","society","has","never","been","the","CLA's","intention."]},{"text":"Roughly 8,000 foreign laborers have joined the ROC workforce since the opening of the labor market in 1992 in a bid to ease a critical labor shortage.","tokens":["Roughly","8,000","foreign","laborers","have","joined","the","ROC","workforce","since","the","opening","of","the","labor","market","in","1992","in","a","bid","to","ease","a","critical","labor","shortage."]},{"text":"Chao reiterated that for eign labor must not infringe upon job opportunities for Taiwan Workers, cannot be allowed to lead to immigration or creation of Social disorder, and must not interfere with the industrial upgrading and production automation.","tokens":["Chao","reiterated","that","for","eign","labor","must","not","infringe","upon","job","opportunities","for","Taiwan","Workers,","cannot","be","allowed","to","lead","to","immigration","or","creation","of","Social","disorder,","and","must","not","interfere","with","the","industrial","upgrading","and","production","automation."]},{"text":"But in an addendum to these underlying principles, Chao said the government held a deliberately \"strice\" policy to ward blue collar foreign workers while it was \"relaxed\" to ward those categorized as white collar.","tokens":["But","in","an","addendum","to","these","underlying","principles,","Chao","said","the","government","held","a","deliberately","\"strice\"","policy","to","ward","blue","collar","foreign","workers","while","it","was","\"relaxed\"","to","ward","those","categorized","as","white","collar."]},{"text":"Chao based his reasoning on the relative numbers and educational back ground of either category, and said he believed white collar workers will not bring \"other problems,\" such as crime and social instability, into Taiwan.","tokens":["Chao","based","his","reasoning","on","the","relative","numbers","and","educational","back","ground","of","either","category,","and","said","he","believed","white","collar","workers","will","not","bring","\"other","problems,\"","such","as","crime","and","social","instability,","into","Taiwan."]},{"text":"Chao Championed labor condition in the R.O.C. Unlike many countries, he claimed foreign laborers, whose primary attraction is a willingness to work for considerably lower wages than Taiwan workers, were protected by local labor law.","tokens":["Chao","Championed","labor","condition","in","the","R.O.C.","Unlike","many","countries,","he","claimed","foreign","laborers,","whose","primary","attraction","is","a","willingness","to","work","for","considerably","lower","wages","than","Taiwan","workers,","were","protected","by","local","labor","law."]},{"text":"Except in the case of housemaids and nursing aides, the ROc demands foreign workers receive the minimum monthly wage of NT$13,350.","tokens":["Except","in","the","case","of","housemaids","and","nursing","aides,","the","ROc","demands","foreign","workers","receive","the","minimum","monthly","wage","of","NT$13,350."]}]},"T12":{"key":"T12","title":"T12 An employee of the national Assembly wears…","paras":[{"text":"An employee of the national Assembly wears sunglasses to hide her tearful eyes irritated by sulfur gas-as she works inside the meeting hall yesterday.","tokens":["An","employee","of","the","national","Assembly","wears","sunglasses","to","hide","her","tearful","eyes","irritated","by","sulfur","gas-as","she","works","inside","the","meeting","hall","yesterday."]},{"text":"The Yangmingshan area is full of Sulfuric spings, and there's one just outside the meeting hall every time the assembly meets there many deputies and employee suffer from sore eyes.","tokens":["The","Yangmingshan","area","is","full","of","Sulfuric","spings,","and","there's","one","just","outside","the","meeting","hall","every","time","the","assembly","meets","there","many","deputies","and","employee","suffer","from","sore","eyes."]},{"text":"The state-run Chinese petroleum Corp. will pay part of its business taxes to the Kaohsiung city and county governments if it sets up subsidiaries in Kaohsiung, Economic Minister P.K.","tokens":["The","state-run","Chinese","petroleum","Corp.","will","pay","part","of","its","business","taxes","to","the","Kaohsiung","city","and","county","governments","if","it","sets","up","subsidiaries","in","Kaohsiung,","Economic","Minister","P.K."]},{"text":"Chiang said yesterday. Chiang said the CPC has no intention to move its head quarters to Kaohsiung from Taipei, adding that the CPC had better continue paying business taxes to the Taipei City Government be fore establishing subsidiaries in Kaohsiung","tokens":["Chiang","said","yesterday.","Chiang","said","the","CPC","has","no","intention","to","move","its","head","quarters","to","Kaohsiung","from","Taipei,","adding","that","the","CPC","had","better","continue","paying","business","taxes","to","the","Taipei","City","Government","be","fore","establishing","subsidiaries","in","Kaohsiung"]},{"text":"city and county. Chiang made the remarks in response to the controversy over which city government the CPC should pay business taxes to The controversy was rekindled by Kaohsiung City's recent failure to win the ROC's choice in a bid","tokens":["city","and","county.","Chiang","made","the","remarks","in","response","to","the","controversy","over","which","city","government","the","CPC","should","pay","business","taxes","to","The","controversy","was","rekindled","by","Kaohsiung","City's","recent","failure","to","win","the","ROC's","choice","in","a","bid"]},{"text":"to host the 2002 Asian Games. The minister said that based on a conclusion reached during a recent coordination meeting to settle the controversy, it will be totally up to the Ministry of Economic Affairs and the CPC to determine","tokens":["to","host","the","2002","Asian","Games.","The","minister","said","that","based","on","a","conclusion","reached","during","a","recent","coordination","meeting","to","settle","the","controversy,","it","will","be","totally","up","to","the","Ministry","of","Economic","Affairs","and","the","CPC","to","determine"]},{"text":"whether to pay all its business taxes to Taipei City Government or split the tax payments to Taipei and Kaohsiung governments. But whether Chiang's brainchild can be accepted remains to be seen.","tokens":["whether","to","pay","all","its","business","taxes","to","Taipei","City","Government","or","split","the","tax","payments","to","Taipei","and","Kaohsiung","governments.","But","whether","Chiang's","brainchild","can","be","accepted","remains","to","be","seen."]},{"text":"The Kaohsiung City and County governments have repeatedly pressed CPC to pay business taxes in Kaohsiung, since the company uses Kaohsiung's resources and Kaohsiung's environment.","tokens":["The","Kaohsiung","City","and","County","governments","have","repeatedly","pressed","CPC","to","pay","business","taxes","in","Kaohsiung,","since","the","company","uses","Kaohsiung's","resources","and","Kaohsiung's","environment."]},{"text":"Following the selection of Taipei over Kaohsiung on Saturday as the ROC's choice in a bid to host the 2002 Asian Games, both Kaohsiung city and county governments have geared up further to force CPC and other state-run enterprises with","tokens":["Following","the","selection","of","Taipei","over","Kaohsiung","on","Saturday","as","the","ROC's","choice","in","a","bid","to","host","the","2002","Asian","Games,","both","Kaohsiung","city","and","county","governments","have","geared","up","further","to","force","CPC","and","other","state-run","enterprises","with"]},{"text":"plants in Kaohsiung to pay business taxes in Kaohsiung. The Kaohsiung county government, for in stance, yesterday instructed its taxation units and environmental protection department to collect business taxes and pollution fees from those enterprises whose headquarters are located in","tokens":["plants","in","Kaohsiung","to","pay","business","taxes","in","Kaohsiung.","The","Kaohsiung","county","government,","for","in","stance,","yesterday","instructed","its","taxation","units","and","environmental","protection","department","to","collect","business","taxes","and","pollution","fees","from","those","enterprises","whose","headquarters","are","located","in"]},{"text":"Taipei but have maintained manufacturing plants in Kaohsiung County, starting today. The Kaohsiung City Government will also step up collection of fines from CPC for pollutants generated by the firm's Kaohsiung and Talin oil refineries.","tokens":["Taipei","but","have","maintained","manufacturing","plants","in","Kaohsiung","County,","starting","today.","The","Kaohsiung","City","Government","will","also","step","up","collection","of","fines","from","CPC","for","pollutants","generated","by","the","firm's","Kaohsiung","and","Talin","oil","refineries."]},{"text":"Earlier last month, the Kaohsiung City Council threatened to stage a massive protest at the two refineries if the CPC failed to respond positively to the tax payment issue before the end of June.","tokens":["Earlier","last","month,","the","Kaohsiung","City","Council","threatened","to","stage","a","massive","protest","at","the","two","refineries","if","the","CPC","failed","to","respond","positively","to","the","tax","payment","issue","before","the","end","of","June."]},{"text":"But a member of the Taipei City Council Also said yesterday that it would be unfair to Taipei if the CPC moves its headquarters to Kaohsiung and pays business taxes in Kaohsiung, given the fact that Taipei residents are the","tokens":["But","a","member","of","the","Taipei","City","Council","Also","said","yesterday","that","it","would","be","unfair","to","Taipei","if","the","CPC","moves","its","headquarters","to","Kaohsiung","and","pays","business","taxes","in","Kaohsiung,","given","the","fact","that","Taipei","residents","are","the"]},{"text":"most numerous consumers of CPC's oil products. But, during the first all-race presidential campaign, Mandela told reporters from Taiwan that he would cherish the longstanding relations be tween Pretoria and Taipei.","tokens":["most","numerous","consumers","of","CPC's","oil","products.","But,","during","the","first","all-race","presidential","campaign,","Mandela","told","reporters","from","Taiwan","that","he","would","cherish","the","longstanding","relations","be","tween","Pretoria","and","Taipei."]},{"text":"In the short-run, Mandela's government is not expected to establish formal ties with Beijing, according to the analysts. Meanwhile, local reports said the president of an unidentfied African state will meet Lee in Pretoria to discuss establishing official ties.","tokens":["In","the","short-run,","Mandela's","government","is","not","expected","to","establish","formal","ties","with","Beijing,","according","to","the","analysts.","Meanwhile,","local","reports","said","the","president","of","an","unidentfied","African","state","will","meet","Lee","in","Pretoria","to","discuss","establishing","official","ties."]},{"text":"When speaking in San Jose Costa Rica, on Sunday, Lee stressed Taiwan would actively participate in international affairs as a sovereign nation The ROC is a sovereign nation and the world should recognize that China is divided and ruled by","tokens":["When","speaking","in","San","Jose","Costa","Rica,","on","Sunday,","Lee","stressed","Taiwan","would","actively","participate","in","international","affairs","as","a","sovereign","nation","The","ROC","is","a","sovereign","nation","and","the","world","should","recognize","that","China","is","divided","and","ruled","by"]},{"text":"separate governments, Lee said. An unsuitable loca- tion of workplace has replaced poor pay as the foremost reason for people to change their jobs, according to an investigative re port released yes- terday by the Directorate General of Budget Accounting","tokens":["separate","governments,","Lee","said.","An","unsuitable","loca-","tion","of","workplace","has","replaced","poor","pay","as","the","foremost","reason","for","people","to","change","their","jobs,","according","to","an","investigative","re","port","released","yes-","terday","by","the","Directorate","General","of","Budget","Accounting"]},{"text":"and Statistics. The report showed that 22.1 percent of local employees polled changed their jobs mainly for a better location of work-place, while a lower number of 19 percent changed jobs mainly to seek higher monthly pay.","tokens":["and","Statistics.","The","report","showed","that","22.1","percent","of","local","employees","polled","changed","their","jobs","mainly","for","a","better","location","of","work-place,","while","a","lower","number","of","19","percent","changed","jobs","mainly","to","seek","higher","monthly","pay."]},{"text":"The figures indicated that location of the workplace, rather than the rate of pay, is the top consideration made by local employees when choosing jobs, DGBAS officials said.","tokens":["The","figures","indicated","that","location","of","the","workplace,","rather","than","the","rate","of","pay,","is","the","top","consideration","made","by","local","employees","when","choosing","jobs,","DGBAS","officials","said."]},{"text":"Meanwhile, a DGBAS study report on manpower utilization indicated that as many as 1.54 local employees were not properly utilized in 1993. Of that number, some 488,000 employees failed to have a match between their levels of education and their","tokens":["Meanwhile,","a","DGBAS","study","report","on","manpower","utilization","indicated","that","as","many","as","1.54","local","employees","were","not","properly","utilized","in","1993.","Of","that","number,","some","488,000","employees","failed","to","have","a","match","between","their","levels","of","education","and","their"]},{"text":"job responsibilities. This demonstrated a waste of educational resources, the officials noted. DGBAS tallies also showed that a total of 170,000 local residents are willing to join the domestic job market in the upcoming year.","tokens":["job","responsibilities.","This","demonstrated","a","waste","of","educational","resources,","the","officials","noted.","DGBAS","tallies","also","showed","that","a","total","of","170,000","local","residents","are","willing","to","join","the","domestic","job","market","in","the","upcoming","year."]},{"text":"This potential labor force, coupled with the release of a massive amount of labor from the agricultural sector expected upon Taiwan's entry into the General Agreement on Tariffs and TRade, will lead to a sharp increase in labor suply and","tokens":["This","potential","labor","force,","coupled","with","the","release","of","a","massive","amount","of","labor","from","the","agricultural","sector","expected","upon","Taiwan's","entry","into","the","General","Agreement","on","Tariffs","and","TRade,","will","lead","to","a","sharp","increase","in","labor","suply","and"]},{"text":"ease the labor shortage presently plaguing the construction and manufacturing industries. A deep-sea fishing boat carrying six anglers and three crew members on a fihing trip off the coast of southeast Taiwan remained unaccounted for, police in Taiung said yesterday.","tokens":["ease","the","labor","shortage","presently","plaguing","the","construction","and","manufacturing","industries.","A","deep-sea","fishing","boat","carrying","six","anglers","and","three","crew","members","on","a","fihing","trip","off","the","coast","of","southeast","Taiwan","remained","unaccounted","for,","police","in","Taiung","said","yesterday."]},{"text":"Redhead No. 1 failed to return to its native village at Lanyu, or Orchid Island, an off-shore island southeast of Taiwan, at 9 A.M.","tokens":["Redhead","No.","1","failed","to","return","to","its","native","village","at","Lanyu,","or","Orchid","Island,","an","off-shore","island","southeast","of","Taiwan,","at","9","A.M."]},{"text":"yesterday as scheduled, said owner. The Taitung county police department requested the Navy's seagull Unit to help locate the miss in boat, but rescue workers said a search yesterday amounted to nothing.","tokens":["yesterday","as","scheduled,","said","owner.","The","Taitung","county","police","department","requested","the","Navy's","seagull","Unit","to","help","locate","the","miss","in","boat,","but","rescue","workers","said","a","search","yesterday","amounted","to","nothing."]},{"text":"The boat company's operator said the Navy found four small freezers on a rocky seashore at Little Lanyu, but found no traces of the fishermen or the crew.","tokens":["The","boat","company's","operator","said","the","Navy","found","four","small","freezers","on","a","rocky","seashore","at","Little","Lanyu,","but","found","no","traces","of","the","fishermen","or","the","crew."]},{"text":"At least three men broke into a changhua company and carted away a safety deposit box containing more than NT$1.9 million in cash, police said yesterday.","tokens":["At","least","three","men","broke","into","a","changhua","company","and","carted","away","a","safety","deposit","box","containing","more","than","NT$1.9","million","in","cash,","police","said","yesterday."]},{"text":"An alarm system installed in the firm in center Taiwan did not go off during the Burglary, said the police, who did not rule out company workers as suspects in the theft.","tokens":["An","alarm","system","installed","in","the","firm","in","center","Taiwan","did","not","go","off","during","the","Burglary,","said","the","police,","who","did","not","rule","out","company","workers","as","suspects","in","the","theft."]},{"text":"The burglars forced their way into the office with iron bars and screwdrivers, which were found abandoned at the company along with some suspicious.","tokens":["The","burglars","forced","their","way","into","the","office","with","iron","bars","and","screwdrivers,","which","were","found","abandoned","at","the","company","along","with","some","suspicious."]}]},"T13":{"key":"T13","title":"T13 In the course of the centuries, the…","paras":[{"text":"In the course of the centuries, the hill underwent various transform- ations and alterations, until it took on its present aspect which is mainly the result of Michelangelo's plan.","tokens":["In","the","course","of","the","centuries,","the","hill","underwent","various","transform-","ations","and","alterations,","until","it","took","on","its","present","aspect","which","is","mainly","the","result","of","Michelangelo's","plan."]},{"text":"The geometric pattern on the pavement of the square, conceived in the form of expanding and crossing elliptical shapes was also designed by him, and harmonises well with the architecture of the whole.","tokens":["The","geometric","pattern","on","the","pavement","of","the","square,","conceived","in","the","form","of","expanding","and","crossing","elliptical","shapes","was","also","designed","by","him,","and","harmonises","well","with","the","architecture","of","the","whole."]},{"text":"In 1535, Miche- langelo took the statue of Marcus Aurelius from the Lateran and set it up in the center of the square; it is the sole remaining example of the eques- trian statues of the Roman imperial period.","tokens":["In","1535,","Miche-","langelo","took","the","statue","of","Marcus","Aurelius","from","the","Lateran","and","set","it","up","in","the","center","of","the","square;","it","is","the","sole","remaining","example","of","the","eques-","trian","statues","of","the","Roman","imperial","period."]},{"text":"There are various theories and legends to explain the reasons which made it possible for this monument to come down to us. The main reason, however, is to be found in the fact that it was long thought to represent","tokens":["There","are","various","theories","and","legends","to","explain","the","reasons","which","made","it","possible","for","this","monument","to","come","down","to","us.","The","main","reason,","however,","is","to","be","found","in","the","fact","that","it","was","long","thought","to","represent"]},{"text":"the Emperor Constantine, the first to allow the practice of the Christian religion. The Computation Center is principally housed in the Computer Building located in the northeast section of the campus near the East residence halls, and operates branch stations","tokens":["the","Emperor","Constantine,","the","first","to","allow","the","practice","of","the","Christian","religion.","The","Computation","Center","is","principally","housed","in","the","Computer","Building","located","in","the","northeast","section","of","the","campus","near","the","East","residence","halls,","and","operates","branch","stations"]},{"text":"in the Hammond, Boucke and Willard Buildings. The Computer Building is open 24 hours a day, and the branch stations are open during the day and evening hours, 7 days a week.","tokens":["in","the","Hammond,","Boucke","and","Willard","Buildings.","The","Computer","Building","is","open","24","hours","a","day,","and","the","branch","stations","are","open","during","the","day","and","evening","hours,","7","days","a","week."]},{"text":"The main computer at the Computation Center is an IBM 3081 Processor with sixteen million bytes of memory, three billion bytes of disk storage, and 12 tape drives.","tokens":["The","main","computer","at","the","Computation","Center","is","an","IBM","3081","Processor","with","sixteen","million","bytes","of","memory,","three","billion","bytes","of","disk","storage,","and","12","tape","drives."]},{"text":"The System 370/3081 is used primarily as a batch pro- cessor, supported by OS/VS2 MVS with JES 2. Batch jobs may be entered re- mote batch stations, or they may be entered at a terminal through use of INTERACT, an","tokens":["The","System","370/3081","is","used","primarily","as","a","batch","pro-","cessor,","supported","by","OS/VS2","MVS","with","JES","2.","Batch","jobs","may","be","entered","re-","mote","batch","stations,","or","they","may","be","entered","at","a","terminal","through","use","of","INTERACT,","an"]},{"text":"interactive text editor with a flexible file storage system. In the world of high finance, where billion-dollar deals can be struck between cocktails and dessert, the hottest play these days is once obscure transaction known as the leveraged buyout.","tokens":["interactive","text","editor","with","a","flexible","file","storage","system.","In","the","world","of","high","finance,","where","billion-dollar","deals","can","be","struck","between","cocktails","and","dessert,","the","hottest","play","these","days","is","once","obscure","transaction","known","as","the","leveraged","buyout."]},{"text":"In such operations, corporate officers are turning publicly held firms into private businesses that are free from the demands of short-term investors and the unwanted attention of corporate raiders.","tokens":["In","such","operations,","corporate","officers","are","turning","publicly","held","firms","into","private","businesses","that","are","free","from","the","demands","of","short-term","investors","and","the","unwanted","attention","of","corporate","raiders."]},{"text":"In the process, many of them make vast profits for shareholders and themselves. One of the largest and most ambitious buyouts yet was proposed last week by executives of R.H.","tokens":["In","the","process,","many","of","them","make","vast","profits","for","shareholders","and","themselves.","One","of","the","largest","and","most","ambitious","buyouts","yet","was","proposed","last","week","by","executives","of","R.H."]},{"text":"Macy / Co. (discal 1985 sales: $4.4 billion), the eleventh-biggest U.S. retailer. Led by Chairman Edward Finkelstein, a group of top officers offered $70 a share, or $3.58 billion, for Macy's stock, which had been selling for about $50 a","tokens":["Macy","/","Co.","(discal","1985","sales:","$4.4","billion),","the","eleventh-biggest","U.S.","retailer.","Led","by","Chairman","Edward","Finkelstein,","a","group","of","top","officers","offered","$70","a","share,","or","$3.58","billion,","for","Macy's","stock,","which","had","been","selling","for","about","$50","a"]},{"text":"share. The Macy's executives were working last week with the Wall Street firm of Goldman Sachs to line up virtually all that money. The high buyout price, apparently designed to repel rival offers and avoid a bidding war for the","tokens":["share.","The","Macy's","executives","were","working","last","week","with","the","Wall","Street","firm","of","Goldman","Sachs","to","line","up","virtually","all","that","money.","The","high","buyout","price,","apparently","designed","to","repel","rival","offers","and","avoid","a","bidding","war","for","the"]},{"text":"company, drove up the value of other retailing issues as investors specu- lated that a wave of buyouts was about to break over the department-store industry.","tokens":["company,","drove","up","the","value","of","other","retailing","issues","as","investors","specu-","lated","that","a","wave","of","buyouts","was","about","to","break","over","the","department-store","industry."]},{"text":"Indeed, merchandising firms are much in vogue with acquisition- minded managers. One day after the Macy's announcement, officers of House hold International agreed to pay $700 million for the Chicago-based cong- lomerate's retailing units, which include Coast-to-Coast hardware and the","tokens":["Indeed,","merchandising","firms","are","much","in","vogue","with","acquisition-","minded","managers.","One","day","after","the","Macy's","announcement,","officers","of","House","hold","International","agreed","to","pay","$700","million","for","the","Chicago-based","cong-","lomerate's","retailing","units,","which","include","Coast-to-Coast","hardware","and","the"]},{"text":"Ben Franklin variety chain. Even small Wieboldt Stores, a 102-year-old Chicago concern, last week announced a $37.4 million deal that turned the firm into a private company.","tokens":["Ben","Franklin","variety","chain.","Even","small","Wieboldt","Stores,","a","102-year-old","Chicago","concern,","last","week","announced","a","$37.4","million","deal","that","turned","the","firm","into","a","private","company."]},{"text":"Market penetration can be accomplished, in some cases, by getting the consumer to try a product through the distribution of free samples, direct mail advertising, or door to door promotion.","tokens":["Market","penetration","can","be","accomplished,","in","some","cases,","by","getting","the","consumer","to","try","a","product","through","the","distribution","of","free","samples,","direct","mail","advertising,","or","door","to","door","promotion."]},{"text":"Packaging is an important part of product identification, especially in the cases of food and household items. An eye-catching package will stand out on a store shelf, giving it an edge over its competitors.","tokens":["Packaging","is","an","important","part","of","product","identification,","especially","in","the","cases","of","food","and","household","items.","An","eye-catching","package","will","stand","out","on","a","store","shelf,","giving","it","an","edge","over","its","competitors."]},{"text":"Have you ever heard of the Golden Gate Bridge in California? Have you ever seen the picture of it? Perhaps someone in your family has seen this bridge.","tokens":["Have","you","ever","heard","of","the","Golden","Gate","Bridge","in","California?","Have","you","ever","seen","the","picture","of","it?","Perhaps","someone","in","your","family","has","seen","this","bridge."]},{"text":"It is one of the first sights people see if they are coming to the west coast of the United States. Suppose you are sailing into San Francisco, you are near the coast of California.","tokens":["It","is","one","of","the","first","sights","people","see","if","they","are","coming","to","the","west","coast","of","the","United","States.","Suppose","you","are","sailing","into","San","Francisco,","you","are","near","the","coast","of","California."]},{"text":"The bridge is straight ahead of you. At first, it looks like a piece of steel lace across the bay from north to south.","tokens":["The","bridge","is","straight","ahead","of","you.","At","first,","it","looks","like","a","piece","of","steel","lace","across","the","bay","from","north","to","south."]},{"text":"Then your ship sails closer, and the bridge appears larger and larger. At last, your ship passes under the bridge. If you look behind, you can see this huge struc- ture from the bay.","tokens":["Then","your","ship","sails","closer,","and","the","bridge","appears","larger","and","larger.","At","last,","your","ship","passes","under","the","bridge.","If","you","look","behind,","you","can","see","this","huge","struc-","ture","from","the","bay."]},{"text":"On your right, you can see the city of San Francisco. On your left, you can see the cities of Berkeley and Oakland. The main section of the Golden Gate Bridge is a suspension span.","tokens":["On","your","right,","you","can","see","the","city","of","San","Francisco.","On","your","left,","you","can","see","the","cities","of","Berkeley","and","Oakland.","The","main","section","of","the","Golden","Gate","Bridge","is","a","suspension","span."]},{"text":"In a suspension bridge the span does not rest on posts. It hangs from cables. Huge towers support two long steel cables. The cables are over three feet thick.","tokens":["In","a","suspension","bridge","the","span","does","not","rest","on","posts.","It","hangs","from","cables.","Huge","towers","support","two","long","steel","cables.","The","cables","are","over","three","feet","thick."]},{"text":"Smaller cables hang vertically every few feet from the large cables and support the main span of the bridge. The towers, the cables, large and small, and all in red, together with the blue water below as well as the","tokens":["Smaller","cables","hang","vertically","every","few","feet","from","the","large","cables","and","support","the","main","span","of","the","bridge.","The","towers,","the","cables,","large","and","small,","and","all","in","red,","together","with","the","blue","water","below","as","well","as","the"]},{"text":"flying sea gulls constitute a combination of beauty. The suspension span of this bridge is 4,200 feet long between the tow- ers. It is the longest suspension span in the world.","tokens":["flying","sea","gulls","constitute","a","combination","of","beauty.","The","suspension","span","of","this","bridge","is","4,200","feet","long","between","the","tow-","ers.","It","is","the","longest","suspension","span","in","the","world."]},{"text":"The floor of this bridge is over ninety feet wide, and six lanes of cars--three in each di- rection--can pass over it at the same time.","tokens":["The","floor","of","this","bridge","is","over","ninety","feet","wide,","and","six","lanes","of","cars--three","in","each","di-","rection--can","pass","over","it","at","the","same","time."]},{"text":"There are also side walks. It is a very long walk across the bridge, but if you would like to walk, you can watch the ships below.","tokens":["There","are","also","side","walks.","It","is","a","very","long","walk","across","the","bridge,","but","if","you","would","like","to","walk,","you","can","watch","the","ships","below."]},{"text":"You can see ships from all over the world sailing into and out of the bay. The bridge is 220 feet above the water, and even the biggest ships can easily sail under it.","tokens":["You","can","see","ships","from","all","over","the","world","sailing","into","and","out","of","the","bay.","The","bridge","is","220","feet","above","the","water,","and","even","the","biggest","ships","can","easily","sail","under","it."]}]},"T14":{"key":"T14","title":"T14 Mickey Mouse celebrated his 50th birthday in…","paras":[{"text":"Mickey Mouse celebrated his 50th birthday in 1978, and there were special events all over the country. There was even a party at the White House.","tokens":["Mickey","Mouse","celebrated","his","50th","birthday","in","1978,","and","there","were","special","events","all","over","the","country.","There","was","even","a","party","at","the","White","House."]},{"text":"Walt Disney and his partner Ub Iwerks created Mickey in 1928. At first, Mickey looked a little like Oswald the Rabbit, an old Disney charac- ter.","tokens":["Walt","Disney","and","his","partner","Ub","Iwerks","created","Mickey","in","1928.","At","first,","Mickey","looked","a","little","like","Oswald","the","Rabbit,","an","old","Disney","charac-","ter."]},{"text":"This funny-looking little mouse was called Mortimer. Disney's wife didn't like the name, and her friends didn't either, so Disney changed it to Mickey.","tokens":["This","funny-looking","little","mouse","was","called","Mortimer.","Disney's","wife","didn't","like","the","name,","and","her","friends","didn't","either,","so","Disney","changed","it","to","Mickey."]},{"text":"After 1938, Mickey's looks changed too. By 1929, Mickey Mouse was as popular as Coca-Cola. Mickey Mouse clubs started up all over the United States.","tokens":["After","1938,","Mickey's","looks","changed","too.","By","1929,","Mickey","Mouse","was","as","popular","as","Coca-Cola.","Mickey","Mouse","clubs","started","up","all","over","the","United","States."]},{"text":"By 1931, the Mickey Mouse Club had a million members. Mickey Mouse was popular all over the world. Italians called him Topolino. In London, Madame Tussaud's Wax Museum made Mickey in wax.","tokens":["By","1931,","the","Mickey","Mouse","Club","had","a","million","members.","Mickey","Mouse","was","popular","all","over","the","world.","Italians","called","him","Topolino.","In","London,","Madame","Tussaud's","Wax","Museum","made","Mickey","in","wax."]},{"text":"From the White House in Washington, Eleanor Roosevelt wrote a letter to Walt Disney. She told him that President Roosevelt loved Mickey Mouse: \"We are all most grateful to you for many delightful evenings.\"","tokens":["From","the","White","House","in","Washington,","Eleanor","Roosevelt","wrote","a","letter","to","Walt","Disney.","She","told","him","that","President","Roosevelt","loved","Mickey","Mouse:","\"We","are","all","most","grateful","to","you","for","many","delightful","evenings.\""]},{"text":"Why do people all over the world, young and old, like Mickey Mouse? Maybe it is just because he is a nice guy. Microwaves are a type of electromagnetic radiation; they are a very mild form of electrical or magnetic","tokens":["Why","do","people","all","over","the","world,","young","and","old,","like","Mickey","Mouse?","Maybe","it","is","just","because","he","is","a","nice","guy.","Microwaves","are","a","type","of","electromagnetic","radiation;","they","are","a","very","mild","form","of","electrical","or","magnetic"]},{"text":"wave that moves through space. Unlike X rays and gamma rays, which are very powerful waves of radiation, micro- waves are rather weak and are much more like the waves of radiation used in radio broadcasting.","tokens":["wave","that","moves","through","space.","Unlike","X","rays","and","gamma","rays,","which","are","very","powerful","waves","of","radiation,","micro-","waves","are","rather","weak","and","are","much","more","like","the","waves","of","radiation","used","in","radio","broadcasting."]},{"text":"In microwave ovens, the use of microwaves with which most people are familiar, the waves are produced by an electronic tube called a magnetron.","tokens":["In","microwave","ovens,","the","use","of","microwaves","with","which","most","people","are","familiar,","the","waves","are","produced","by","an","electronic","tube","called","a","magnetron."]},{"text":"Microwaves produce heat in any food placed inside the oven by causing the water in the food to vibrate rapidly and thus heat up.","tokens":["Microwaves","produce","heat","in","any","food","placed","inside","the","oven","by","causing","the","water","in","the","food","to","vibrate","rapidly","and","thus","heat","up."]},{"text":"Food that have more water in them take less time to cook and probably have more of their nu- trients left intact when cooked in a microwave oven.","tokens":["Food","that","have","more","water","in","them","take","less","time","to","cook","and","probably","have","more","of","their","nu-","trients","left","intact","when","cooked","in","a","microwave","oven."]},{"text":"Microwaves do not pass through metal, so the microwaves are retained inside the oven. Microwaves pass immediately through glass, paper, and plastic with no effect on these materials or on the microwave oven; nothing inside a microwave oven is heated","tokens":["Microwaves","do","not","pass","through","metal,","so","the","microwaves","are","retained","inside","the","oven.","Microwaves","pass","immediately","through","glass,","paper,","and","plastic","with","no","effect","on","these","materials","or","on","the","microwave","oven;","nothing","inside","a","microwave","oven","is","heated"]},{"text":"except the food itself, so the cooking process is much efficient than in conventional ovens. Sometimes a pan or container is heated because it is touching the hot food, though; some users of microwave ovens have been burned by hot","tokens":["except","the","food","itself,","so","the","cooking","process","is","much","efficient","than","in","conventional","ovens.","Sometimes","a","pan","or","container","is","heated","because","it","is","touching","the","hot","food,","though;","some","users","of","microwave","ovens","have","been","burned","by","hot"]},{"text":"food, by hot pans, or steam es- caping from the food. No documented case of radiation burns from a micro- wave oven has ever been reported.","tokens":["food,","by","hot","pans,","or","steam","es-","caping","from","the","food.","No","documented","case","of","radiation","burns","from","a","micro-","wave","oven","has","ever","been","reported."]},{"text":"Japan is perhaps the most seismically active country in the world with over 10,000 earthquakes hitting each year. Of these 10,000, one thousand are strong for people to feel.","tokens":["Japan","is","perhaps","the","most","seismically","active","country","in","the","world","with","over","10,000","earthquakes","hitting","each","year.","Of","these","10,000,","one","thousand","are","strong","for","people","to","feel."]},{"text":"Recently, Tokyo was hit by two earthquakes registering over 6 on the Richter scale two nights in a row. Japan expects even larger earthquakes in the future, so the Japanese government, scien- tists, and people are making numerous preparations.","tokens":["Recently,","Tokyo","was","hit","by","two","earthquakes","registering","over","6","on","the","Richter","scale","two","nights","in","a","row.","Japan","expects","even","larger","earthquakes","in","the","future,","so","the","Japanese","government,","scien-","tists,","and","people","are","making","numerous","preparations."]},{"text":"The 1980 quake in Algeria was 7.5 on the Richter scale and devastated the country, killing over 200,000 people. The residents of Tokyo remember the earthquake of 1923, which killed 100,000 Japanese.","tokens":["The","1980","quake","in","Algeria","was","7.5","on","the","Richter","scale","and","devastated","the","country,","killing","over","200,000","people.","The","residents","of","Tokyo","remember","the","earthquake","of","1923,","which","killed","100,000","Japanese."]},{"text":"These instances of the devastation an earthquake can cause are foremost in the Japanese people minds and are the reasons for their extensive preparations.","tokens":["These","instances","of","the","devastation","an","earthquake","can","cause","are","foremost","in","the","Japanese","people","minds","and","are","the","reasons","for","their","extensive","preparations."]},{"text":"More than any other earthquake-prone country, Japan is prepared for a strong earthquake. For example, the Japanese government spends as much on earthquake preparations as it does on national defense.","tokens":["More","than","any","other","earthquake-prone","country,","Japan","is","prepared","for","a","strong","earthquake.","For","example,","the","Japanese","government","spends","as","much","on","earthquake","preparations","as","it","does","on","national","defense."]},{"text":"The city of Tokyo is destroying thousands of wooden homes and replacing them with concrete structures. The city hopes this will help eliminate destruction by fire after a major earthquake.","tokens":["The","city","of","Tokyo","is","destroying","thousands","of","wooden","homes","and","replacing","them","with","concrete","structures.","The","city","hopes","this","will","help","eliminate","destruction","by","fire","after","a","major","earthquake."]},{"text":"Furthermore, the city is storing food, blankets, baby bottles, and 400,000 tons of water in preparation for the expected quake. The water (stored in earthquake-proof storage houses) is sufficient for all 12 million Tokyo residents for 10 days.","tokens":["Furthermore,","the","city","is","storing","food,","blankets,","baby","bottles,","and","400,000","tons","of","water","in","preparation","for","the","expected","quake.","The","water","(stored","in","earthquake-proof","storage","houses)","is","sufficient","for","all","12","million","Tokyo","residents","for","10","days."]},{"text":"The Bill of Lading (its abbreviation is B/L) is an essential document in international trade and shipment. It is important in law, in finance, and in insurance.","tokens":["The","Bill","of","Lading","(its","abbreviation","is","B/L)","is","an","essential","document","in","international","trade","and","shipment.","It","is","important","in","law,","in","finance,","and","in","insurance."]},{"text":"A clean Bill of Lading means that the ship owners agree that the goods were received on board in good condition. If the goods are not in good order and condition, the Bills of Lading are described as \"dirty,\" \"un-","tokens":["A","clean","Bill","of","Lading","means","that","the","ship","owners","agree","that","the","goods","were","received","on","board","in","good","condition.","If","the","goods","are","not","in","good","order","and","condition,","the","Bills","of","Lading","are","described","as","\"dirty,\"","\"un-"]},{"text":"clean\" or \"foul.\" A Bill of Lading is a negotiable document. An importer can endorse the Bill of Lading and sell the good in this way, even before they arrive.","tokens":["clean\"","or","\"foul.\"","A","Bill","of","Lading","is","a","negotiable","document.","An","importer","can","endorse","the","Bill","of","Lading","and","sell","the","good","in","this","way,","even","before","they","arrive."]},{"text":"An importer can endorse a Bill of Lading by signing across the back. In this way, ownership of the goods can be transferred to another buyer simply by handing the endorsed Bill of Lading to him.","tokens":["An","importer","can","endorse","a","Bill","of","Lading","by","signing","across","the","back.","In","this","way,","ownership","of","the","goods","can","be","transferred","to","another","buyer","simply","by","handing","the","endorsed","Bill","of","Lading","to","him."]},{"text":"A Bill of Lading can state that the goods must be delivered to a certain person or company, or it may state \"to order\".","tokens":["A","Bill","of","Lading","can","state","that","the","goods","must","be","delivered","to","a","certain","person","or","company,","or","it","may","state","\"to","order\"."]},{"text":"(This phrase is also printed on checks and Bills of Ex- change.) A Letter of Credit may demand that the Bill of Lading should be made out \"to order\" and endorsed \"in blake.\"","tokens":["(This","phrase","is","also","printed","on","checks","and","Bills","of","Ex-","change.)","A","Letter","of","Credit","may","demand","that","the","Bill","of","Lading","should","be","made","out","\"to","order\"","and","endorsed","\"in","blake.\""]},{"text":"This means that the sellers place no restrictions on the right to transfer ownership. International trade develops because certain countries are able to produce some goods more efficiently than other countries.","tokens":["This","means","that","the","sellers","place","no","restrictions","on","the","right","to","transfer","ownership.","International","trade","develops","because","certain","countries","are","able","to","produce","some","goods","more","efficiently","than","other","countries."]},{"text":"They exchange goods to satisfy their needs and wants. Efficient production may be the result of several factors. A certain climate in a particular country may allow that country to grow agricultural products in abundance.","tokens":["They","exchange","goods","to","satisfy","their","needs","and","wants.","Efficient","production","may","be","the","result","of","several","factors.","A","certain","climate","in","a","particular","country","may","allow","that","country","to","grow","agricultural","products","in","abundance."]},{"text":"For ins- tance, the climates in the United States and Canada are suitable for pro- duction of large amounts of wheat. Natural resources such as oil or coal are abundant in other countries.","tokens":["For","ins-","tance,","the","climates","in","the","United","States","and","Canada","are","suitable","for","pro-","duction","of","large","amounts","of","wheat.","Natural","resources","such","as","oil","or","coal","are","abundant","in","other","countries."]},{"text":"Countries with a large pool of unskilled laborers are able to produce products which are labor intensive more cheap- ly than countries with highly paid, skilled labor forces.","tokens":["Countries","with","a","large","pool","of","unskilled","laborers","are","able","to","produce","products","which","are","labor","intensive","more","cheap-","ly","than","countries","with","highly","paid,","skilled","labor","forces."]},{"text":"Another factor is geographical location. Countries like Singapore and Panama engage in banking and trading because they are located on world trade routes.","tokens":["Another","factor","is","geographical","location.","Countries","like","Singapore","and","Panama","engage","in","banking","and","trading","because","they","are","located","on","world","trade","routes."]}]},"T15":{"key":"T15","title":"T15 The expression \"a thriving business\" is one…","paras":[{"text":"The expression \"a thriving business\" is one that you may have heard many times. Think for a moment what it means; a company that is healthy, shows a profit, and goes forward with the times.","tokens":["The","expression","\"a","thriving","business\"","is","one","that","you","may","have","heard","many","times.","Think","for","a","moment","what","it","means;","a","company","that","is","healthy,","shows","a","profit,","and","goes","forward","with","the","times."]},{"text":"A company that does not thrive can not exist very long. Communication has become one of the most important aspects of modern business life.","tokens":["A","company","that","does","not","thrive","can","not","exist","very","long.","Communication","has","become","one","of","the","most","important","aspects","of","modern","business","life."]},{"text":"No matter what the size of the company, communication is most significant. Even the smallest enterprise would be hard hit if the owner could not convey correct orders to his suppliers or communicate con- vincingly with his customers.","tokens":["No","matter","what","the","size","of","the","company,","communication","is","most","significant.","Even","the","smallest","enterprise","would","be","hard","hit","if","the","owner","could","not","convey","correct","orders","to","his","suppliers","or","communicate","con-","vincingly","with","his","customers."]},{"text":"Medium-sized companies and larger ones, with their multiplicity of employees, rely even more heavily on the art of com- munication. Every level of a firm is involved.","tokens":["Medium-sized","companies","and","larger","ones,","with","their","multiplicity","of","employees,","rely","even","more","heavily","on","the","art","of","com-","munication.","Every","level","of","a","firm","is","involved."]},{"text":"The board of directors must clearly communicate its policy decisions to executives, who in turn must communicate with supervisors. Supervisors have departments. Com- munication must be effective if a firm is to function as an organic whole.","tokens":["The","board","of","directors","must","clearly","communicate","its","policy","decisions","to","executives,","who","in","turn","must","communicate","with","supervisors.","Supervisors","have","departments.","Com-","munication","must","be","effective","if","a","firm","is","to","function","as","an","organic","whole."]},{"text":"The first coin was made in China. Some Chinese businessman must have gotten tired of carrying a heavy load of fishhooks and knives and shirts to pay a large bill.","tokens":["The","first","coin","was","made","in","China.","Some","Chinese","businessman","must","have","gotten","tired","of","carrying","a","heavy","load","of","fishhooks","and","knives","and","shirts","to","pay","a","large","bill."]},{"text":"So he made a model of the top part of a shirt on metal. It was round and had a hole in the center.","tokens":["So","he","made","a","model","of","the","top","part","of","a","shirt","on","metal.","It","was","round","and","had","a","hole","in","the","center."]},{"text":"The money was round, according to one story, so that it could roll from place to place. Stone money was one of the most curious kinds.","tokens":["The","money","was","round,","according","to","one","story,","so","that","it","could","roll","from","place","to","place.","Stone","money","was","one","of","the","most","curious","kinds."]},{"text":"It was made on the is- land of Yap in the Pacific. A stone \"coin\" measured 5 feet in diameter and was 7 inches thick.","tokens":["It","was","made","on","the","is-","land","of","Yap","in","the","Pacific.","A","stone","\"coin\"","measured","5","feet","in","diameter","and","was","7","inches","thick."]},{"text":"There was a hole at the center so that the \"coin\" could be carried on a pole by two men. It must have been heavy to carry around.","tokens":["There","was","a","hole","at","the","center","so","that","the","\"coin\"","could","be","carried","on","a","pole","by","two","men.","It","must","have","been","heavy","to","carry","around."]},{"text":"A stone coin was worth 10,000 coconuts or one wife. Different countries have used different metals and designs for their money. The first coins in England were made of tin.","tokens":["A","stone","coin","was","worth","10,000","coconuts","or","one","wife.","Different","countries","have","used","different","metals","and","designs","for","their","money.","The","first","coins","in","England","were","made","of","tin."]},{"text":"Sweden and Russia used copper to make their money. Some of the Swedish copper money weighed more than 30 pounds. It must have been inconvenient.","tokens":["Sweden","and","Russia","used","copper","to","make","their","money.","Some","of","the","Swedish","copper","money","weighed","more","than","30","pounds.","It","must","have","been","inconvenient."]},{"text":"When people wanted to pay a big bill, they had to use an oxcart. The Letter of Credit (its abbreviation is L/C) is essential in the fi- nance of international trade.","tokens":["When","people","wanted","to","pay","a","big","bill,","they","had","to","use","an","oxcart.","The","Letter","of","Credit","(its","abbreviation","is","L/C)","is","essential","in","the","fi-","nance","of","international","trade."]},{"text":"It is a reliable and safe method of payment, and it protects the seller as well as the buyer. The seller (or exporter) needs the Letter of Credit because the buyer may be a new customer, and the exporter may","tokens":["It","is","a","reliable","and","safe","method","of","payment,","and","it","protects","the","seller","as","well","as","the","buyer.","The","seller","(or","exporter)","needs","the","Letter","of","Credit","because","the","buyer","may","be","a","new","customer,","and","the","exporter","may"]},{"text":"know nothing about his credit status. Even if the buyer is a regular customer, his credit with his bank may change from time to time and the seller's bank may not have enough information from the buyer's bank to arrange","tokens":["know","nothing","about","his","credit","status.","Even","if","the","buyer","is","a","regular","customer,","his","credit","with","his","bank","may","change","from","time","to","time","and","the","seller's","bank","may","not","have","enough","information","from","the","buyer's","bank","to","arrange"]},{"text":"a banker's transfer, which is the other major method of financing international trade. A banker's transfer is usually made through sending a telegraphic message, that is an order, called a telegraphic transfer, sent from a bank by telegraph or cable","tokens":["a","banker's","transfer,","which","is","the","other","major","method","of","financing","international","trade.","A","banker's","transfer","is","usually","made","through","sending","a","telegraphic","message,","that","is","an","order,","called","a","telegraphic","transfer,","sent","from","a","bank","by","telegraph","or","cable"]},{"text":"to an overseas bank to pay money to an exporter in the overseas country. The overseas bank is usually a corres- pondent or agent bank, although sometimes banks have a branch in the over- seas country.","tokens":["to","an","overseas","bank","to","pay","money","to","an","exporter","in","the","overseas","country.","The","overseas","bank","is","usually","a","corres-","pondent","or","agent","bank,","although","sometimes","banks","have","a","branch","in","the","over-","seas","country."]},{"text":"Expanded academic exchanges between Taiwan and the mainland should be allowed and encouraged. They benefit both sides. Scholars and scientists in Taiwan have the advantages of greater academic freedom and financial re- sources than their counterparts on the mainland.","tokens":["Expanded","academic","exchanges","between","Taiwan","and","the","mainland","should","be","allowed","and","encouraged.","They","benefit","both","sides.","Scholars","and","scientists","in","Taiwan","have","the","advantages","of","greater","academic","freedom","and","financial","re-","sources","than","their","counterparts","on","the","mainland."]},{"text":"The academics on the mainland, on the other hand, especially those who study humanities subject, have access to valuable data not easily available in Taiwan.","tokens":["The","academics","on","the","mainland,","on","the","other","hand,","especially","those","who","study","humanities","subject,","have","access","to","valuable","data","not","easily","available","in","Taiwan."]},{"text":"The condition on the two sides, therefore, complement each other. The prosperity of our society has greatly heightened the life expect- ancy of our people in recent decades, with the result that the proportion of aged people in the population","tokens":["The","condition","on","the","two","sides,","therefore,","complement","each","other.","The","prosperity","of","our","society","has","greatly","heightened","the","life","expect-","ancy","of","our","people","in","recent","decades,","with","the","result","that","the","proportion","of","aged","people","in","the","population"]},{"text":"has increased considerably. The propor- tion, according to the authorities, will grow to 8.4 percent by the year 2000. Problems stemming from the presence of a large number of senior citizens have begun to surface.","tokens":["has","increased","considerably.","The","propor-","tion,","according","to","the","authorities,","will","grow","to","8.4","percent","by","the","year","2000.","Problems","stemming","from","the","presence","of","a","large","number","of","senior","citizens","have","begun","to","surface."]},{"text":"All levels of government in Taiwan recently imposed restrictions to force local KTV, MTV and sauna bath center to close at 3 a.m. In the first few days of this new policy, police did not encounter many violent reaction from","tokens":["All","levels","of","government","in","Taiwan","recently","imposed","restrictions","to","force","local","KTV,","MTV","and","sauna","bath","center","to","close","at","3","a.m.","In","the","first","few","days","of","this","new","policy,","police","did","not","encounter","many","violent","reaction","from"]},{"text":"business owners. But as expected many operators were strongly dis- satisfied with the new measure and simply gave the impression that they had stopped business only to continue to provide service to customers.","tokens":["business","owners.","But","as","expected","many","operators","were","strongly","dis-","satisfied","with","the","new","measure","and","simply","gave","the","impression","that","they","had","stopped","business","only","to","continue","to","provide","service","to","customers."]},{"text":"Management buyouts are evolving into offensive weapons too. \"They can be viewed as offers made by internal raiders.\" notes Alfred Rappaport, pro- fessor of accounting at Northwestern University's Kellogg School of Manage- ment.","tokens":["Management","buyouts","are","evolving","into","offensive","weapons","too.","\"They","can","be","viewed","as","offers","made","by","internal","raiders.\"","notes","Alfred","Rappaport,","pro-","fessor","of","accounting","at","Northwestern","University's","Kellogg","School","of","Manage-","ment."]},{"text":"In one snarled battle, investors, led by the former chairman of a Beatrice acquisiton, offered nearly $5 billion for Beatrice, which last month reject the bid.","tokens":["In","one","snarled","battle,","investors,","led","by","the","former","chairman","of","a","Beatrice","acquisiton,","offered","nearly","$5","billion","for","Beatrice,","which","last","month","reject","the","bid."]},{"text":"Now Beatrice may be turning to outsiders for help. Said one Chicogo lawyer: \"Their investment bankers are burning up the phone lines looking for a white knight.\"","tokens":["Now","Beatrice","may","be","turning","to","outsiders","for","help.","Said","one","Chicogo","lawyer:","\"Their","investment","bankers","are","burning","up","the","phone","lines","looking","for","a","white","knight.\""]},{"text":"Beatrice last week received word of a different kind of proposal that the firm may wish to ponder. It came from Warren Avis, founder of the Avis car rental company.","tokens":["Beatrice","last","week","received","word","of","a","different","kind","of","proposal","that","the","firm","may","wish","to","ponder.","It","came","from","Warren","Avis,","founder","of","the","Avis","car","rental","company."]},{"text":"The entrepreneur, who sold Avis in 1954, said he wants to buy it back from Beatrice, which has owned the business for little more than a year.","tokens":["The","entrepreneur,","who","sold","Avis","in","1954,","said","he","wants","to","buy","it","back","from","Beatrice,","which","has","owned","the","business","for","little","more","than","a","year."]},{"text":"Avis said he has assembled a group of private, international investors who hope to acquire the auto concern, which operates in more than 100 countries and is worth an estimated $400 million.","tokens":["Avis","said","he","has","assembled","a","group","of","private,","international","investors","who","hope","to","acquire","the","auto","concern,","which","operates","in","more","than","100","countries","and","is","worth","an","estimated","$400","million."]},{"text":"Management buyouts are hot and growing hotter because they have so far produced countless winners and few if any losers. A typical deal involves bankers, institutional investors, Wall Street firms that specialize in buyouts, and the managers of acquired companies.","tokens":["Management","buyouts","are","hot","and","growing","hotter","because","they","have","so","far","produced","countless","winners","and","few","if","any","losers.","A","typical","deal","involves","bankers,","institutional","investors,","Wall","Street","firms","that","specialize","in","buyouts,","and","the","managers","of","acquired","companies."]},{"text":"To start a transaction, the executives turn to Wall Street experts to arrange financing. \"We look for three things,\" says Leonard Shaykin, managing partner of Adler / Shay- kin, an investment house that specializes in buyouts.","tokens":["To","start","a","transaction,","the","executives","turn","to","Wall","Street","experts","to","arrange","financing.","\"We","look","for","three","things,\"","says","Leonard","Shaykin,","managing","partner","of","Adler","/","Shay-","kin,","an","investment","house","that","specializes","in","buyouts."]},{"text":"\"They are consistent past profits, predictable future and quality management.\"","tokens":["\"They","are","consistent","past","profits,","predictable","future","and","quality","management.\""]}]},"T16":{"key":"T16","title":"T16 Dear President: I think that you should…","paras":[{"text":"Dear President: I think that you should build a rescue mission for those poor, homeless black people a place to live after their freedom.","tokens":["Dear","President:","I","think","that","you","should","build","a","rescue","mission","for","those","poor,","homeless","black","people","a","place","to","live","after","their","freedom."]},{"text":"Also try to find some jobs for them so they can earn some salaries to have a living. Please take this seriously, because I really hope that those people can have a happy lifetime since they already had a miserable","tokens":["Also","try","to","find","some","jobs","for","them","so","they","can","earn","some","salaries","to","have","a","living.","Please","take","this","seriously,","because","I","really","hope","that","those","people","can","have","a","happy","lifetime","since","they","already","had","a","miserable"]},{"text":"life before. Dear Adam: Guess what? I have talked to the President of the United States of America, Abraham Lincoln about your misfortune. President Lincoln will have warrants and search everyone's house and find out other poor men like you,","tokens":["life","before.","Dear","Adam:","Guess","what?","I","have","talked","to","the","President","of","the","United","States","of","America,","Abraham","Lincoln","about","your","misfortune.","President","Lincoln","will","have","warrants","and","search","everyone's","house","and","find","out","other","poor","men","like","you,"]},{"text":"before you and others can find a job, you and others will live in a rescue mission that I have suggested to the President Lincoln.","tokens":["before","you","and","others","can","find","a","job,","you","and","others","will","live","in","a","rescue","mission","that","I","have","suggested","to","the","President","Lincoln."]},{"text":"So please do not worry about yourself, your second half of life will be like normal people. I think that President Lincoln did the right thing to save all the black people back to the 18th century.","tokens":["So","please","do","not","worry","about","yourself,","your","second","half","of","life","will","be","like","normal","people.","I","think","that","President","Lincoln","did","the","right","thing","to","save","all","the","black","people","back","to","the","18th","century."]},{"text":"If President Lincoln didn't make such a concise choice, maybe there will still be slavery problems going on in this futuristic world of 21st century.","tokens":["If","President","Lincoln","didn't","make","such","a","concise","choice,","maybe","there","will","still","be","slavery","problems","going","on","in","this","futuristic","world","of","21st","century."]},{"text":"I guess that those black people really loved Lincoln's 14th and 15th Amendment . I hope there will not be any slavery or slavery-like activities in the future, we should all get along.","tokens":["I","guess","that","those","black","people","really","loved","Lincoln's","14th","and","15th","Amendment",".","I","hope","there","will","not","be","any","slavery","or","slavery-like","activities","in","the","future,","we","should","all","get","along."]},{"text":"If anyone who needs to buy a brand new bike or any other useful furniture, please contact me, Adam White, 883-9393, thank you! President Lincoln, was born in August 23, 1824.","tokens":["If","anyone","who","needs","to","buy","a","brand","new","bike","or","any","other","useful","furniture,","please","contact","me,","Adam","White,","883-9393,","thank","you!","President","Lincoln,","was","born","in","August","23,","1824."]},{"text":"His luck in June is very lucky, he did everything so fast, everything that he wanted was there for him. His goals all came true, he had a good time with his family, he didn't have to worry much about","tokens":["His","luck","in","June","is","very","lucky,","he","did","everything","so","fast,","everything","that","he","wanted","was","there","for","him.","His","goals","all","came","true,","he","had","a","good","time","with","his","family,","he","didn't","have","to","worry","much","about"]},{"text":"the events that happened in United States of America. Adam White, was born in December 11, 1832. His luck in June is also very lucky that the President just gave warrant to search everyone's house and took out all the","tokens":["the","events","that","happened","in","United","States","of","America.","Adam","White,","was","born","in","December","11,","1832.","His","luck","in","June","is","also","very","lucky","that","the","President","just","gave","warrant","to","search","everyone's","house","and","took","out","all","the"]},{"text":"black people who were secretly hidden under the basement, in the secret closet and so on. Adam began with a new wonderful life in June, he started to work and had his own house.","tokens":["black","people","who","were","secretly","hidden","under","the","basement,","in","the","secret","closet","and","so","on.","Adam","began","with","a","new","wonderful","life","in","June,","he","started","to","work","and","had","his","own","house."]},{"text":"Nervousness and the pressure surround my body and my mind. The Vietnam's mighty artillery is ready for the fire as the neutral whistles. At this moment, I can feel the sharp confidence of my the enemy, but they pretend nothing","tokens":["Nervousness","and","the","pressure","surround","my","body","and","my","mind.","The","Vietnam's","mighty","artillery","is","ready","for","the","fire","as","the","neutral","whistles.","At","this","moment,","I","can","feel","the","sharp","confidence","of","my","the","enemy,","but","they","pretend","nothing"]},{"text":"really matters except the deep concentration of their artillery. Every soldier on my side waits for each other's communication and encouragement. Longs beeps, and then a canon is sent from the opposite side of the field.","tokens":["really","matters","except","the","deep","concentration","of","their","artillery.","Every","soldier","on","my","side","waits","for","each","other's","communication","and","encouragement.","Longs","beeps,","and","then","a","canon","is","sent","from","the","opposite","side","of","the","field."]},{"text":"It sends us into the heat of the battle and the misery of the competition. The round, white, and shinny leather object comes toward me first; I do not panic, I store all my energy in my hands to defend","tokens":["It","sends","us","into","the","heat","of","the","battle","and","the","misery","of","the","competition.","The","round,","white,","and","shinny","leather","object","comes","toward","me","first;","I","do","not","panic,","I","store","all","my","energy","in","my","hands","to","defend"]},{"text":"myself. Next, our most powerful soldier, whose arms as strong as Hercules, passes the bomb to our captain. Without any consideration, the captain jumps up like Michael Jordan and spikes the bomb back to Vietnam.","tokens":["myself.","Next,","our","most","powerful","soldier,","whose","arms","as","strong","as","Hercules,","passes","the","bomb","to","our","captain.","Without","any","consideration,","the","captain","jumps","up","like","Michael","Jordan","and","spikes","the","bomb","back","to","Vietnam."]},{"text":"The captain's efforts and resources prove inadequate; he cannot withstand the harshness of the enemy's attack. Finally, we win the first round of the battle, but nobody knows how many more rounds we will have to suffer.","tokens":["The","captain's","efforts","and","resources","prove","inadequate;","he","cannot","withstand","the","harshness","of","the","enemy's","attack.","Finally,","we","win","the","first","round","of","the","battle,","but","nobody","knows","how","many","more","rounds","we","will","have","to","suffer."]},{"text":"My mind refocuses during the battle. The smell of sweat in the air tortures me as if I am in hell. This is our last chance to conquer our foe and win the battle.","tokens":["My","mind","refocuses","during","the","battle.","The","smell","of","sweat","in","the","air","tortures","me","as","if","I","am","in","hell.","This","is","our","last","chance","to","conquer","our","foe","and","win","the","battle."]},{"text":"Our commander gathers our soldiers and has a fast meeting. The strategy is clear; everyone has to remain calm and concen- trate on the white bomb when our artillery fires.","tokens":["Our","commander","gathers","our","soldiers","and","has","a","fast","meeting.","The","strategy","is","clear;","everyone","has","to","remain","calm","and","concen-","trate","on","the","white","bomb","when","our","artillery","fires."]},{"text":"After he fires, the enemy becomes nervous and loses their tempers. Finally, they lose this WWI battle and cry out for their country. It's good that we are not like the enemy, because half of our soldiers are wounded.","tokens":["After","he","fires,","the","enemy","becomes","nervous","and","loses","their","tempers.","Finally,","they","lose","this","WWI","battle","and","cry","out","for","their","country.","It's","good","that","we","are","not","like","the","enemy,","because","half","of","our","soldiers","are","wounded."]},{"text":"We shake hands with the weak enemy with humble pride pity on our countenance, but hidden inside our hearts are the greatest happiness. On November 2, 1863, several months after the battle of Gettysburg, David Wills invited President Lincoln to","tokens":["We","shake","hands","with","the","weak","enemy","with","humble","pride","pity","on","our","countenance,","but","hidden","inside","our","hearts","are","the","greatest","happiness.","On","November","2,","1863,","several","months","after","the","battle","of","Gettysburg,","David","Wills","invited","President","Lincoln","to"]},{"text":"make a \"few appropriate remarks\" at the consecration of a cemetery for the Union war dead. In early July, Pennsylvania governor Andrew Curtin had charged Wills, a successful local citizen and judge, with cleaning up the horrible aftermath of the","tokens":["make","a","\"few","appropriate","remarks\"","at","the","consecration","of","a","cemetery","for","the","Union","war","dead.","In","early","July,","Pennsylvania","governor","Andrew","Curtin","had","charged","Wills,","a","successful","local","citizen","and","judge,","with","cleaning","up","the","horrible","aftermath","of","the"]},{"text":"battle: wounded soldiers crammed into every available building, and thousands of swollen dead strewn among hundreds of bloated dead horses. Abraham Lincoln, the President of the United States had an eloquent address at Gettysburg on November 19, 1863.","tokens":["battle:","wounded","soldiers","crammed","into","every","available","building,","and","thousands","of","swollen","dead","strewn","among","hundreds","of","bloated","dead","horses.","Abraham","Lincoln,","the","President","of","the","United","States","had","an","eloquent","address","at","Gettysburg","on","November","19,","1863."]},{"text":"Adam White, the slave who first asked President Lincoln a favor to save all the black people. The President Lincoln had declared two very important amendments to black people.","tokens":["Adam","White,","the","slave","who","first","asked","President","Lincoln","a","favor","to","save","all","the","black","people.","The","President","Lincoln","had","declared","two","very","important","amendments","to","black","people."]},{"text":"The 14th Amendment, which guaranteed black Americans all rights of citizens, no slavery allows, all people who are born in the U.S. are American citizens for their lifetimes.","tokens":["The","14th","Amendment,","which","guaranteed","black","Americans","all","rights","of","citizens,","no","slavery","allows,","all","people","who","are","born","in","the","U.S.","are","American","citizens","for","their","lifetimes."]},{"text":"The 15th Amendment, which guaranteed black men the right to vote. President also let the native-born Americans, flocked to the cities in search of jobs.","tokens":["The","15th","Amendment,","which","guaranteed","black","men","the","right","to","vote.","President","also","let","the","native-born","Americans,","flocked","to","the","cities","in","search","of","jobs."]},{"text":"President Lincoln said \"I, Abraham Lincoln, President of the United States, by virtue of the power in me vested as Commander-in-Chief do order and declare that all persons held as slaves within said designated States and parts of States are,","tokens":["President","Lincoln","said","\"I,","Abraham","Lincoln,","President","of","the","United","States,","by","virtue","of","the","power","in","me","vested","as","Commander-in-Chief","do","order","and","declare","that","all","persons","held","as","slaves","within","said","designated","States","and","parts","of","States","are,"]},{"text":"and henceforward shall be, free; and that the Executive Government of the United States, including the military and naval authorities thereof, will recognize and maintain the freedom of said persons.","tokens":["and","henceforward","shall","be,","free;","and","that","the","Executive","Government","of","the","United","States,","including","the","military","and","naval","authorities","thereof,","will","recognize","and","maintain","the","freedom","of","said","persons."]},{"text":"And I hereby enjoin upon the people so declared to be free to abstain from all violence, unless in necessary self-defense; and I recommend to them that, in all cases when allowed, they labor faithfully for reasonable wages\".","tokens":["And","I","hereby","enjoin","upon","the","people","so","declared","to","be","free","to","abstain","from","all","violence,","unless","in","necessary","self-defense;","and","I","recommend","to","them","that,","in","all","cases","when","allowed,","they","labor","faithfully","for","reasonable","wages\"."]},{"text":"John Lennon didn't invent it rock and roll, nor did he embody it as John toweringly as figures like Elvis and Little Richard, but he did more than anyone else to shake it up, move it forward and instill it","tokens":["John","Lennon","didn't","invent","it","rock","and","roll,","nor","did","he","embody","it","as","John","toweringly","as","figures","like","Elvis","and","Little","Richard,","but","he","did","more","than","anyone","else","to","shake","it","up,","move","it","forward","and","instill","it"]},{"text":"with a conscience. As the most daring and outspoken of the four Beatles, he help shape the agenda of the Sixties - socially and politically, no less than musically.","tokens":["with","a","conscience.","As","the","most","daring","and","outspoken","of","the","four","Beatles,","he","help","shape","the","agenda","of","the","Sixties","-","socially","and","politically,","no","less","than","musically."]},{"text":"As a solo artist, he made music that alternately disturbed and soothed provoked and sought community. As a human being, he served as an exemplar of honesty in his art and life.","tokens":["As","a","solo","artist,","he","made","music","that","alternately","disturbed","and","soothed","provoked","and","sought","community.","As","a","human","being,","he","served","as","an","exemplar","of","honesty","in","his","art","and","life."]},{"text":"Lennon did what he needed to do to make his life complete. He did not strive for perfection, nor did he try and make everyone happy.","tokens":["Lennon","did","what","he","needed","to","do","to","make","his","life","complete.","He","did","not","strive","for","perfection,","nor","did","he","try","and","make","everyone","happy."]},{"text":"Lennon remarked at one time, \"I don't intend to be a performing flea any more. I was a dreamweaver, but although I'll be around I don't intend to be running at 20,000 miles an hour trying to prove myself.","tokens":["Lennon","remarked","at","one","time,","\"I","don't","intend","to","be","a","performing","flea","any","more.","I","was","a","dreamweaver,","but","although","I'll","be","around","I","don't","intend","to","be","running","at","20,000","miles","an","hour","trying","to","prove","myself."]},{"text":"I don't want to die at 40.\" Again, Lennon connected with society by sharing the same types of views as the people, like this one.","tokens":["I","don't","want","to","die","at","40.\"","Again,","Lennon","connected","with","society","by","sharing","the","same","types","of","views","as","the","people,","like","this","one."]},{"text":"Ironically, Lennon did die at 40 and the death affected the world. Lennon's life was a great journey but his death affected society greatly.","tokens":["Ironically,","Lennon","did","die","at","40","and","the","death","affected","the","world.","Lennon's","life","was","a","great","journey","but","his","death","affected","society","greatly."]},{"text":"Lennon's death emotionally shook thousand and traumatized America people and still plays a role in lives today. We can only \"imagine\" where we be if Lennon were with us today.","tokens":["Lennon's","death","emotionally","shook","thousand","and","traumatized","America","people","and","still","plays","a","role","in","lives","today.","We","can","only","\"imagine\"","where","we","be","if","Lennon","were","with","us","today."]},{"text":"Spencer established, \"We are a better people because of Lennon but lost without him.\" J. Lehmann; June 1997.","tokens":["Spencer","established,","\"We","are","a","better","people","because","of","Lennon","but","lost","without","him.\"","J.","Lehmann;","June","1997."]}]},"T17":{"key":"T17","title":"T17 Born of the Sun and one of…","paras":[{"text":"Born of the Sun and one of the Atlantides (note Shelley's familiar symbolism of light and the water of universal life), the witch lives in a cave amidst the Atlas mountains.","tokens":["Born","of","the","Sun","and","one","of","the","Atlantides","(note","Shelley's","familiar","symbolism","of","light","and","the","water","of","universal","life),","the","witch","lives","in","a","cave","amidst","the","Atlas","mountains."]},{"text":"Lovely, gentle, and powerful, she attracts gods, men, and beasts to her marvelous storehouse of treasures. The Naiads, Hamadryads, and Oreads (spirits in natural objects such as streams and trees) would be her familiars, but she is immortal and each","tokens":["Lovely,","gentle,","and","powerful,","she","attracts","gods,","men,","and","beasts","to","her","marvelous","storehouse","of","treasures.","The","Naiads,","Hamadryads,","and","Oreads","(spirits","in","natural","objects","such","as","streams","and","trees)","would","be","her","familiars,","but","she","is","immortal","and","each"]},{"text":"of them will eventually die. In a magic boat that can sail on air or water, the witch is conducted everywhere by a hermaphroditic pilot.","tokens":["of","them","will","eventually","die.","In","a","magic","boat","that","can","sail","on","air","or","water,","the","witch","is","conducted","everywhere","by","a","hermaphroditic","pilot."]},{"text":"She sends helpful or imaginative dream. At other times she plays merry pranks. Among the longer poems by Shelley, this displays perhaps the rich- est and most graceful of consistent imagery and lyricism.","tokens":["She","sends","helpful","or","imaginative","dream.","At","other","times","she","plays","merry","pranks.","Among","the","longer","poems","by","Shelley,","this","displays","perhaps","the","rich-","est","and","most","graceful","of","consistent","imagery","and","lyricism."]},{"text":"Keats thought the watch was beauty; others have interpreted her as Creative Imagination, Venus Genetrix, and even as the spirit of electricity. She seems defi- nitely to be spiritualized love, eternal but lending beauty to mortals and beauty, sympathy and","tokens":["Keats","thought","the","watch","was","beauty;","others","have","interpreted","her","as","Creative","Imagination,","Venus","Genetrix,","and","even","as","the","spirit","of","electricity.","She","seems","defi-","nitely","to","be","spiritualized","love,","eternal","but","lending","beauty","to","mortals","and","beauty,","sympathy","and"]},{"text":"wisdom. Perhaps the withch might be thought of as Asia before she meets Prometheus; she is the ideal of love before it is personified in human flesh.","tokens":["wisdom.","Perhaps","the","withch","might","be","thought","of","as","Asia","before","she","meets","Prometheus;","she","is","the","ideal","of","love","before","it","is","personified","in","human","flesh."]},{"text":"Sexless herself, the witch creates in the hermaphrodite the perfect union of male and female. In this frank escapism to a dream world and dream symbolism, Shelley sought a respite from the real world that was increasingly pressing upon him.","tokens":["Sexless","herself,","the","witch","creates","in","the","hermaphrodite","the","perfect","union","of","male","and","female.","In","this","frank","escapism","to","a","dream","world","and","dream","symbolism,","Shelley","sought","a","respite","from","the","real","world","that","was","increasingly","pressing","upon","him."]},{"text":"EPIPSYCHIDION (1821, 1822) in title is a coined Greek wording to mean \"this soul out of my soul\" carrying on the psyche-epipsyche theme from Alastor.","tokens":["EPIPSYCHIDION","(1821,","1822)","in","title","is","a","coined","Greek","wording","to","mean","\"this","soul","out","of","my","soul\"","carrying","on","the","psyche-epipsyche","theme","from","Alastor."]},{"text":"With the Defence of Poetry and Adonais, both completed soon thereafter, it forms a triad contemplating the process of creati- vity in the poet, the forces contributing to his achievement, and the forces corrupting and negating him.","tokens":["With","the","Defence","of","Poetry","and","Adonais,","both","completed","soon","thereafter,","it","forms","a","triad","contemplating","the","process","of","creati-","vity","in","the","poet,","the","forces","contributing","to","his","achievement,","and","the","forces","corrupting","and","negating","him."]},{"text":"This heroic-couplet poem arose from Shelley's profound sympathy for Teresa (known to the Shelleys as Emilia or Emily) Viviani, daughter of the governor of Pisa.","tokens":["This","heroic-couplet","poem","arose","from","Shelley's","profound","sympathy","for","Teresa","(known","to","the","Shelleys","as","Emilia","or","Emily)","Viviani,","daughter","of","the","governor","of","Pisa."]},{"text":"Her stingy father had virtually imprisoned her at the convent of St. Anna in Pisa while seeking for her a husband who would ask no dowry.","tokens":["Her","stingy","father","had","virtually","imprisoned","her","at","the","convent","of","St.","Anna","in","Pisa","while","seeking","for","her","a","husband","who","would","ask","no","dowry."]},{"text":"A beautiful nineteen- year-old brunette with some facility in writing poetry, she powerfully appealed to Shelley as the victim of parental tyranny. She extravagantly praised Shelley and fascinated him throughout the writing of Epipsychi- dion, but even before the publication","tokens":["A","beautiful","nineteen-","year-old","brunette","with","some","facility","in","writing","poetry,","she","powerfully","appealed","to","Shelley","as","the","victim","of","parental","tyranny.","She","extravagantly","praised","Shelley","and","fascinated","him","throughout","the","writing","of","Epipsychi-","dion,","but","even","before","the","publication"]},{"text":"of the poem, she disillusioned Shelley by meekly submitting to her father's choice of a husband. He mused: \"The person whom it celebrates was a cloud instead of a Juno.\"","tokens":["of","the","poem,","she","disillusioned","Shelley","by","meekly","submitting","to","her","father's","choice","of","a","husband.","He","mused:","\"The","person","whom","it","celebrates","was","a","cloud","instead","of","a","Juno.\""]},{"text":"This section seems to start with strong autobiographical references, to proceed to Platonic implications and then to dwell especially upon astronomical conjectures. The Platonism seems based upon a threefold division of soul enunciated in Plato's Phaedrus, Republic, and Timaeus: (1)","tokens":["This","section","seems","to","start","with","strong","autobiographical","references,","to","proceed","to","Platonic","implications","and","then","to","dwell","especially","upon","astronomical","conjectures.","The","Platonism","seems","based","upon","a","threefold","division","of","soul","enunciated","in","Plato's","Phaedrus,","Republic,","and","Timaeus:","(1)"]},{"text":"Immortal spirit to which Shelley aspires. Emilia is the anima or epipsyche embodying this highest realm of the soul. (2) Higher rational or mortal soul, which Shelley believes represented by Mary.","tokens":["Immortal","spirit","to","which","Shelley","aspires.","Emilia","is","the","anima","or","epipsyche","embodying","this","highest","realm","of","the","soul.","(2)","Higher","rational","or","mortal","soul,","which","Shelley","believes","represented","by","Mary."]},{"text":"(3) Lower appetitive soul, apparently symboized by \"Claire.\" Characteristic of a yet unformed genre, its practitioners frequ- ently tried to offer it as what it was not in essence: Defoe tried to masqueade fiction as fact, Richardson staked his achievement","tokens":["(3)","Lower","appetitive","soul,","apparently","symboized","by","\"Claire.\"","Characteristic","of","a","yet","unformed","genre,","its","practitioners","frequ-","ently","tried","to","offer","it","as","what","it","was","not","in","essence:","Defoe","tried","to","masqueade","fiction","as","fact,","Richardson","staked","his","achievement"]},{"text":"upon moral preaching, and Sterne cavorted willfully. Part of this uncertain quality of 18th-century novels arose from their incredibly mixed ancestry of form, an examination of which is given below.","tokens":["upon","moral","preaching,","and","Sterne","cavorted","willfully.","Part","of","this","uncertain","quality","of","18th-century","novels","arose","from","their","incredibly","mixed","ancestry","of","form,","an","examination","of","which","is","given","below."]},{"text":"The primary impulse of the novel came from the Spanish picaresque tales, apparently burgles of the courtly romance, substituting a low scoundrel for the questing knight.","tokens":["The","primary","impulse","of","the","novel","came","from","the","Spanish","picaresque","tales,","apparently","burgles","of","the","courtly","romance,","substituting","a","low","scoundrel","for","the","questing","knight."]},{"text":"Largely composed of a string of episodes, these accounts were mainly held together by the racy personality of the central figure, and the atmosphere of actual tangible things and genuine earthy experience was pervasive.","tokens":["Largely","composed","of","a","string","of","episodes,","these","accounts","were","mainly","held","together","by","the","racy","personality","of","the","central","figure,","and","the","atmosphere","of","actual","tangible","things","and","genuine","earthy","experience","was","pervasive."]},{"text":"Also, as mentioned before, through much of the 17th century the fashionable English aristocrats were addicted to the French into such notable collections as Boccaccio's Decameron.","tokens":["Also,","as","mentioned","before,","through","much","of","the","17th","century","the","fashionable","English","aristocrats","were","addicted","to","the","French","into","such","notable","collections","as","Boccaccio's","Decameron."]},{"text":"The pastoral romance from Hellenistic Greeks such as Apuleius, with Italian and Spanish imitations in the Renaissance, stimulated the arti- fictions of Malory and Mandeville, generating a tase for recitals of adventurous action.","tokens":["The","pastoral","romance","from","Hellenistic","Greeks","such","as","Apuleius,","with","Italian","and","Spanish","imitations","in","the","Renaissance,","stimulated","the","arti-","fictions","of","Malory","and","Mandeville,","generating","a","tase","for","recitals","of","adventurous","action."]},{"text":"The domestic literature of roguery, in Greene and Dekker of the Renaissance and later in the 17th century from Tom Briwn and Ned Ward, strengthened the picaresque influence and provided a bouncy, vivacious narrative of low life.","tokens":["The","domestic","literature","of","roguery,","in","Greene","and","Dekker","of","the","Renaissance","and","later","in","the","17th","century","from","Tom","Briwn","and","Ned","Ward,","strengthened","the","picaresque","influence","and","provided","a","bouncy,","vivacious","narrative","of","low","life."]},{"text":"Though the sketches of \"char\" by Sir Thomas Overbury and John Eare belong with the essay rather than with the novel, their astute appraisals of personalities provide a stimulus for the revelation of character in the later novel.","tokens":["Though","the","sketches","of","\"char\"","by","Sir","Thomas","Overbury","and","John","Eare","belong","with","the","essay","rather","than","with","the","novel,","their","astute","appraisals","of","personalities","provide","a","stimulus","for","the","revelation","of","character","in","the","later","novel."]},{"text":"Allegories such as Pilgrim's Progress provided fiction with a compelling seriousness it had previously lacked and also offered an imaginative ingenuity and flashes of realism.","tokens":["Allegories","such","as","Pilgrim's","Progress","provided","fiction","with","a","compelling","seriousness","it","had","previously","lacked","and","also","offered","an","imaginative","ingenuity","and","flashes","of","realism."]},{"text":"Lesser domestic sources of fiction were the hest books and chapbooks of unprofessional liter- ateurs, which perpetuated the storytelling faculties of the people which Chaucer had employed so well.","tokens":["Lesser","domestic","sources","of","fiction","were","the","hest","books","and","chapbooks","of","unprofessional","liter-","ateurs,","which","perpetuated","the","storytelling","faculties","of","the","people","which","Chaucer","had","employed","so","well."]},{"text":"According to the Digest of Educational Statistics, the total ex- penditures for public and nonpublic schools at all levels of edu- cation from kindergarten through the graduate curriculum doubled in seven years.","tokens":["According","to","the","Digest","of","Educational","Statistics,","the","total","ex-","penditures","for","public","and","nonpublic","schools","at","all","levels","of","edu-","cation","from","kindergarten","through","the","graduate","curriculum","doubled","in","seven","years."]},{"text":"The estimate for the recent academic year 1972-73 is $90,200 million. The defense budget, on the other hand, is about $76,000 million this year.","tokens":["The","estimate","for","the","recent","academic","year","1972-73","is","$90,200","million.","The","defense","budget,","on","the","other","hand,","is","about","$76,000","million","this","year."]},{"text":"\"The Structure of 'Tssing p'ing TIIAO' is classical; the inter- pretation is individualistic,\" explains young Chinese choreographer Maleina Yung, She is speaking of her Chinese dance drama which was staged recently in New York's Carnegie Hall.","tokens":["\"The","Structure","of","'Tssing","p'ing","TIIAO'","is","classical;","the","inter-","pretation","is","individualistic,\"","explains","young","Chinese","choreographer","Maleina","Yung,","She","is","speaking","of","her","Chinese","dance","drama","which","was","staged","recently","in","New","York's","Carnegie","Hall."]}]},"T18":{"key":"T18","title":"T18 Because of its enormous size, the Pacific…","paras":[{"text":"Because of its enormous size, the Pacific Ocean is often considered the principal physical feature of the earth. It extends from Bering Strait to 60 south latitude--a northsouth distance of about 13,500 kilo- meters (8,400 miles).","tokens":["Because","of","its","enormous","size,","the","Pacific","Ocean","is","often","considered","the","principal","physical","feature","of","the","earth.","It","extends","from","Bering","Strait","to","60","south","latitude--a","northsouth","distance","of","about","13,500","kilo-","meters","(8,400","miles)."]},{"text":"Its width along the equator is about 16,900 kilome- ters (10,500 miles). The total surface area of the Pacific is about 180,000,000 square kilometers (70,000,000 square miles), or about one third of the earth's surface.","tokens":["Its","width","along","the","equator","is","about","16,900","kilome-","ters","(10,500","miles).","The","total","surface","area","of","the","Pacific","is","about","180,000,000","square","kilometers","(70,000,000","square","miles),","or","about","one","third","of","the","earth's","surface."]},{"text":"The Pacific is the world's deepest ocean. About 70 percent of its total bottom area is more than 3,900 meters (13,000 feet) below sea level.","tokens":["The","Pacific","is","the","world's","deepest","ocean.","About","70","percent","of","its","total","bottom","area","is","more","than","3,900","meters","(13,000","feet)","below","sea","level."]},{"text":"This deep area-larger than the entire surface area of the Atlantic Ocean--is usually called the Pacific Basin. Boundaries. The coastlines of North and South America form the eastern boundary of the Pacific.","tokens":["This","deep","area-larger","than","the","entire","surface","area","of","the","Atlantic","Ocean--is","usually","called","the","Pacific","Basin.","Boundaries.","The","coastlines","of","North","and","South","America","form","the","eastern","boundary","of","the","Pacific."]},{"text":"The western boundary is more difficult to define because of the presence of many large islands separated from the Asian and Australian mainland's by shallow seas.","tokens":["The","western","boundary","is","more","difficult","to","define","because","of","the","presence","of","many","large","islands","separated","from","the","Asian","and","Australian","mainland's","by","shallow","seas."]},{"text":"Temperature of the Surface Waters. The Pacific is a warm ocean. Most of the surface water between the tropics of Cancer and Capricorn has a tem- perature of well above 216XC (706XF).","tokens":["Temperature","of","the","Surface","Waters.","The","Pacific","is","a","warm","ocean.","Most","of","the","surface","water","between","the","tropics","of","Cancer","and","Capricorn","has","a","tem-","perature","of","well","above","216XC","(706XF)."]},{"text":"Little cold water from the Arctic Ocean enters the Pacific through the Bering Strait. But in the Southern Hemisphere, the Humboldt Current moves masses of cold water from the Ant- arctic Ocean through the eastern Pacific toward the equator.","tokens":["Little","cold","water","from","the","Arctic","Ocean","enters","the","Pacific","through","the","Bering","Strait.","But","in","the","Southern","Hemisphere,","the","Humboldt","Current","moves","masses","of","cold","water","from","the","Ant-","arctic","Ocean","through","the","eastern","Pacific","toward","the","equator."]},{"text":"Most of the Pacific islands are on the western side of the ocean between the Tropic of Cancer and the Tropic of Capricorn. They enjoy warm temperatures that change little from season to season.","tokens":["Most","of","the","Pacific","islands","are","on","the","western","side","of","the","ocean","between","the","Tropic","of","Cancer","and","the","Tropic","of","Capricorn.","They","enjoy","warm","temperatures","that","change","little","from","season","to","season."]},{"text":"The Pacific Islands The Pacific islands fall into two very different groups_continental islands and oceanic islands. The continental islands rise from the continental shelves and are composed of the same kinds of rocks that are found on the nearby continents-igneous,","tokens":["The","Pacific","Islands","The","Pacific","islands","fall","into","two","very","different","groups_continental","islands","and","oceanic","islands.","The","continental","islands","rise","from","the","continental","shelves","and","are","composed","of","the","same","kinds","of","rocks","that","are","found","on","the","nearby","continents-igneous,"]},{"text":"metamorphic, and sedimentary rocks. Oceanic islands rise from the deep floor of the Pacific Basin. They are composed of volcanic materials, coral, and limestone.","tokens":["metamorphic,","and","sedimentary","rocks.","Oceanic","islands","rise","from","the","deep","floor","of","the","Pacific","Basin.","They","are","composed","of","volcanic","materials,","coral,","and","limestone."]},{"text":"There are thousands of volcanic islands and coral and limestone reefs spread throughout the Pacific Basin. The continental Islands of the Pacific. These islands are really partially submerged mountain chains.","tokens":["There","are","thousands","of","volcanic","islands","and","coral","and","limestone","reefs","spread","throughout","the","Pacific","Basin.","The","continental","Islands","of","the","Pacific.","These","islands","are","really","partially","submerged","mountain","chains."]},{"text":"They belong to the long chain of mountains and volcanoes that border the Pacific Basin. Because this mountain chain contains many volcanoes, it is often called the Circle of Fire or Ring of Fire.","tokens":["They","belong","to","the","long","chain","of","mountains","and","volcanoes","that","border","the","Pacific","Basin.","Because","this","mountain","chain","contains","many","volcanoes,","it","is","often","called","the","Circle","of","Fire","or","Ring","of","Fire."]},{"text":"The continental islands have a greater variety of rocks and more complex structures than do the oceanic islands. Therefore they are more likely to contain mineral ores of value.","tokens":["The","continental","islands","have","a","greater","variety","of","rocks","and","more","complex","structures","than","do","the","oceanic","islands.","Therefore","they","are","more","likely","to","contain","mineral","ores","of","value."]},{"text":"Oceanic Islands of the Pacific. Two different processes helped to form the Pacific oceanic islands. These processes are volcanism and sub- sidence. Volcanism extrudes (pours out) lava from the interior of the earth.","tokens":["Oceanic","Islands","of","the","Pacific.","Two","different","processes","helped","to","form","the","Pacific","oceanic","islands.","These","processes","are","volcanism","and","sub-","sidence.","Volcanism","extrudes","(pours","out)","lava","from","the","interior","of","the","earth."]},{"text":"Volcanism produces an island if enough lava is poured out to form a mass that reaches above sea level. Hawaii is the largest and highest island formed by volcanism.","tokens":["Volcanism","produces","an","island","if","enough","lava","is","poured","out","to","form","a","mass","that","reaches","above","sea","level.","Hawaii","is","the","largest","and","highest","island","formed","by","volcanism."]},{"text":"It has an area of 10,414 square kilometers (4,021 square miles). Its summit, Mauna Kea, rises 4,208 meters (13,796 feet) above sea level. The great weight of the lava forces the crust of the Pacific Basin to sink.","tokens":["It","has","an","area","of","10,414","square","kilometers","(4,021","square","miles).","Its","summit,","Mauna","Kea,","rises","4,208","meters","(13,796","feet)","above","sea","level.","The","great","weight","of","the","lava","forces","the","crust","of","the","Pacific","Basin","to","sink."]},{"text":"This process is called subsidence. The older an island, the more it has sunk and the smaller it has become. But while the volcanic island sinks, coral colonies living just below the surface sometimes build masses of coral on the","tokens":["This","process","is","called","subsidence.","The","older","an","island,","the","more","it","has","sunk","and","the","smaller","it","has","become.","But","while","the","volcanic","island","sinks,","coral","colonies","living","just","below","the","surface","sometimes","build","masses","of","coral","on","the"]},{"text":"sinking volcano. In time the volcanic material may disa- ppear beneath the ocean. But the corals go on building upward, forming reefs just below the ocean surface.","tokens":["sinking","volcano.","In","time","the","volcanic","material","may","disa-","ppear","beneath","the","ocean.","But","the","corals","go","on","building","upward,","forming","reefs","just","below","the","ocean","surface."]},{"text":"If sand, formed by breakup of the coral rock, collects on top of the rock, a low sandy island results. If this sandy island is shaped like a ring, it is called an atoll.","tokens":["If","sand,","formed","by","breakup","of","the","coral","rock,","collects","on","top","of","the","rock,","a","low","sandy","island","results.","If","this","sandy","island","is","shaped","like","a","ring,","it","is","called","an","atoll."]},{"text":"In some cases masses of coral rock have been lifted above the surface by upward movement of the earth's crust. Many islands of the Tonga group were formed in this way.","tokens":["In","some","cases","masses","of","coral","rock","have","been","lifted","above","the","surface","by","upward","movement","of","the","earth's","crust.","Many","islands","of","the","Tonga","group","were","formed","in","this","way."]},{"text":"It is easy to see a pattern in the distribution of these oceanic islands. Volcanic activity has occurred along parallel cracks on the floor of the ocean.","tokens":["It","is","easy","to","see","a","pattern","in","the","distribution","of","these","oceanic","islands.","Volcanic","activity","has","occurred","along","parallel","cracks","on","the","floor","of","the","ocean."]},{"text":"In the Northern Hemisphere the most noticeable ridge forms the base of the Hawaiian Islands. These islands spread along the ridge for about 2,400 kilometers (1,500 miles).","tokens":["In","the","Northern","Hemisphere","the","most","noticeable","ridge","forms","the","base","of","the","Hawaiian","Islands.","These","islands","spread","along","the","ridge","for","about","2,400","kilometers","(1,500","miles)."]},{"text":"At the southeastern end of the is- land chain is the highest island (Hawaii), which still contains several active volcanoes. At the northwestern end of the chain are coral reefs and isolated rocks.","tokens":["At","the","southeastern","end","of","the","is-","land","chain","is","the","highest","island","(Hawaii),","which","still","contains","several","active","volcanoes.","At","the","northwestern","end","of","the","chain","are","coral","reefs","and","isolated","rocks."]},{"text":"2. PACIFIC OCEAN AND ISLANDS Oceania The islands of the Pacific are often called Oceania. New Zealand, Australia, and the islands and island groups in the shallow waters off the Asian mainland (such as the Philippine Islands) are generally not","tokens":["2.","PACIFIC","OCEAN","AND","ISLANDS","Oceania","The","islands","of","the","Pacific","are","often","called","Oceania.","New","Zealand,","Australia,","and","the","islands","and","island","groups","in","the","shallow","waters","off","the","Asian","mainland","(such","as","the","Philippine","Islands)","are","generally","not"]},{"text":"considered part of Oceania. The islands of Oce- ania are divided into three main groups-Polynesia (\"many islands\"), Melan- esia (\"black islands\"), and Micronesia (\"small islands\").","tokens":["considered","part","of","Oceania.","The","islands","of","Oce-","ania","are","divided","into","three","main","groups-Polynesia","(\"many","islands\"),","Melan-","esia","(\"black","islands\"),","and","Micronesia","(\"small","islands\")."]},{"text":"Polynesia, the largest division, is made up of a large triangle of islands in the central and southeastern Pacific. It includes French Pol- ynesia; the Hawaiian Islands; Tonga; Tuvalu; American Samoa and Western Samoa; part of Kiribati; Easter, Midway, and","tokens":["Polynesia,","the","largest","division,","is","made","up","of","a","large","triangle","of","islands","in","the","central","and","southeastern","Pacific.","It","includes","French","Pol-","ynesia;","the","Hawaiian","Islands;","Tonga;","Tuvalu;","American","Samoa","and","Western","Samoa;","part","of","Kiribati;","Easter,","Midway,","and"]},{"text":"Niue islands; and the Tokelau, Cook, Pitcairn, and Wallis and Futuna island groups. New Zealand is some- times included because the original Maori population is Polynesian.","tokens":["Niue","islands;","and","the","Tokelau,","Cook,","Pitcairn,","and","Wallis","and","Futuna","island","groups.","New","Zealand","is","some-","times","included","because","the","original","Maori","population","is","Polynesian."]},{"text":"Many Polynesian islands are the tops of volcanic mountains. Others are atolls or coral islands. Melanesia, in the southwestern Pacific, includes Irian Jaya, in Indo- nesia; New Caledonia; and the nations of Papua New Guinea, Vanuatu, the Solomon Islands, and","tokens":["Many","Polynesian","islands","are","the","tops","of","volcanic","mountains.","Others","are","atolls","or","coral","islands.","Melanesia,","in","the","southwestern","Pacific,","includes","Irian","Jaya,","in","Indo-","nesia;","New","Caledonia;","and","the","nations","of","Papua","New","Guinea,","Vanuatu,","the","Solomon","Islands,","and"]},{"text":"Fiji. The larger Melanesian islands are mountainous, and many of them are densely forested. The many small islands in northwestern Oceania are known as Micro- nesia.","tokens":["Fiji.","The","larger","Melanesian","islands","are","mountainous,","and","many","of","them","are","densely","forested.","The","many","small","islands","in","northwestern","Oceania","are","known","as","Micro-","nesia."]},{"text":"This region includes Naurn; Wake Island; part of Kiribati; and the Marshall, Caroline, and Marianas island groups. Most of the islands of Mi- cronesia are low-lying coral atolls.","tokens":["This","region","includes","Naurn;","Wake","Island;","part","of","Kiribati;","and","the","Marshall,","Caroline,","and","Marianas","island","groups.","Most","of","the","islands","of","Mi-","cronesia","are","low-lying","coral","atolls."]},{"text":"The People. The peopleof Oceania are often divided into three ethnic groups that parallel the geographic division of the Polynesians form a distinct ethnic group.","tokens":["The","People.","The","peopleof","Oceania","are","often","divided","into","three","ethnic","groups","that","parallel","the","geographic","division","of","the","Polynesians","form","a","distinct","ethnic","group."]},{"text":"Melanesians and Micronesians include peoples of many different origins. The largestther groups on the islands are the Americans and the Japanese on the Hawaiian Islands and people of Indian descent, who outnumber the native Melanesians on Fiji.","tokens":["Melanesians","and","Micronesians","include","peoples","of","many","different","origins.","The","largestther","groups","on","the","islands","are","the","Americans","and","the","Japanese","on","the","Hawaiian","Islands","and","people","of","Indian","descent,","who","outnumber","the","native","Melanesians","on","Fiji."]},{"text":"Polynesians share the same basic language and have common physical and cultural characteristics. Before Europeans came to Oceania, Polynesians occupied almost all the islands of the South Pacific, as well as Hawaii and New Zealand.","tokens":["Polynesians","share","the","same","basic","language","and","have","common","physical","and","cultural","characteristics.","Before","Europeans","came","to","Oceania,","Polynesians","occupied","almost","all","the","islands","of","the","South","Pacific,","as","well","as","Hawaii","and","New","Zealand."]}]},"T19":{"key":"T19","title":"T19 \"Experimental Theater Enters New Era\" Often holding…","paras":[{"text":"\"Experimental Theater Enters New Era\" Often holding up a mirror to human development, experimental theater has played a creative role in Taiwan society over the past decade.","tokens":["\"Experimental","Theater","Enters","New","Era\"","Often","holding","up","a","mirror","to","human","development,","experimental","theater","has","played","a","creative","role","in","Taiwan","society","over","the","past","decade."]},{"text":"As it takes on the challenges of the 1990's, it is poised to enter a new phase of progress. Experimental theater was introduced to Taiwan, about 11 years ago by a group of enthusiastic young people.","tokens":["As","it","takes","on","the","challenges","of","the","1990's,","it","is","poised","to","enter","a","new","phase","of","progress.","Experimental","theater","was","introduced","to","Taiwan,","about","11","years","ago","by","a","group","of","enthusiastic","young","people."]},{"text":"Dr. Wu Ching-chi, who had previously joined the \"Ramama Theater\" while he was studying in the U.S.A. brought this new form of performing art back to Taiwan, and started the first experimental theater.","tokens":["Dr.","Wu","Ching-chi,","who","had","previously","joined","the","\"Ramama","Theater\"","while","he","was","studying","in","the","U.S.A.","brought","this","new","form","of","performing","art","back","to","Taiwan,","and","started","the","first","experimental","theater."]},{"text":"The most important feature of \"experimental theater\" is that it can be performed without a stage and without traditional audience seats. It can be performed in the streets, in train stations, parks and public squares and other makeshift venues.","tokens":["The","most","important","feature","of","\"experimental","theater\"","is","that","it","can","be","performed","without","a","stage","and","without","traditional","audience","seats.","It","can","be","performed","in","the","streets,","in","train","stations,","parks","and","public","squares","and","other","makeshift","venues."]},{"text":"It first started in New York, as a movement against the commercialized broadway plays, and it was first known as the \"Out of Broadway\" movement.","tokens":["It","first","started","in","New","York,","as","a","movement","against","the","commercialized","broadway","plays,","and","it","was","first","known","as","the","\"Out","of","Broadway\"","movement."]},{"text":"Since it is not restricted by stage or venue, its style tends to be impromptu and with free association, which is quite popular with young people.","tokens":["Since","it","is","not","restricted","by","stage","or","venue,","its","style","tends","to","be","impromptu","and","with","free","association,","which","is","quite","popular","with","young","people."]},{"text":"Not much attention was paid to experimental theater when it was first introduced into Taiwan, but when the play \"Ho Chu Shin Pei\" performed by Lan Ling Theater Workshop won widespread acclaim in 1980, the format began to boom in","tokens":["Not","much","attention","was","paid","to","experimental","theater","when","it","was","first","introduced","into","Taiwan,","but","when","the","play","\"Ho","Chu","Shin","Pei\"","performed","by","Lan","Ling","Theater","Workshop","won","widespread","acclaim","in","1980,","the","format","began","to","boom","in"]},{"text":"university campuses. The success of \"Ho Chu Shin Pei\" encouraged young performers, and aroused the curiosity of the general public. In 1981, at the close of the Second Annual Experimental Theater Festi- val, it was suggested that a small experimental","tokens":["university","campuses.","The","success","of","\"Ho","Chu","Shin","Pei\"","encouraged","young","performers,","and","aroused","the","curiosity","of","the","general","public.","In","1981,","at","the","close","of","the","Second","Annual","Experimental","Theater","Festi-","val,","it","was","suggested","that","a","small","experimental"]},{"text":"theater should be set up for use by all people interested in the field, to train performers and stage workers through practical experience. In the spring of 1982, the Hong Kong theater group \"Twenty-sided Idea\" performed two experimental theater acts","tokens":["theater","should","be","set","up","for","use","by","all","people","interested","in","the","field,","to","train","performers","and","stage","workers","through","practical","experience.","In","the","spring","of","1982,","the","Hong","Kong","theater","group","\"Twenty-sided","Idea\"","performed","two","experimental","theater","acts"]},{"text":"when it attended the First Asian Theater Festival held in Taiwan. This success further interested enthusi- asts in Taiwan, and boosted their confidence and inspiration.","tokens":["when","it","attended","the","First","Asian","Theater","Festival","held","in","Taiwan.","This","success","further","interested","enthusi-","asts","in","Taiwan,","and","boosted","their","confidence","and","inspiration."]},{"text":"In Taiwan, the development of experimental theater coincided with the easing of political and social restrictions and taboos, and the venting of dissent and grievances.","tokens":["In","Taiwan,","the","development","of","experimental","theater","coincided","with","the","easing","of","political","and","social","restrictions","and","taboos,","and","the","venting","of","dissent","and","grievances."]},{"text":"Thus, experimental theater, with its anti-institutional nature and contents, became a new force in the litera- ture and art circles. Although the performances were crude, a lively atmosphere was created by enthusiastic young people, and thus a theater with an","tokens":["Thus,","experimental","theater,","with","its","anti-institutional","nature","and","contents,","became","a","new","force","in","the","litera-","ture","and","art","circles.","Although","the","performances","were","crude,","a","lively","atmosphere","was","created","by","enthusiastic","young","people,","and","thus","a","theater","with","an"]},{"text":"esthetic content was firmly rooted between 1980 and 1986. As society has become more liberal since 1986, people began to care more about politics and society as a whole, and thus many small experi- mental theater groups joined the social","tokens":["esthetic","content","was","firmly","rooted","between","1980","and","1986.","As","society","has","become","more","liberal","since","1986,","people","began","to","care","more","about","politics","and","society","as","a","whole,","and","thus","many","small","experi-","mental","theater","groups","joined","the","social"]},{"text":"movements, and provided performers with another method to show their conern for the environment. However, during that period, most experimental theater group faced the problem of not having enough talented performers, script-writers, directors and other stage workers, and thus the","tokens":["movements,","and","provided","performers","with","another","method","to","show","their","conern","for","the","environment.","However,","during","that","period,","most","experimental","theater","group","faced","the","problem","of","not","having","enough","talented","performers,","script-writers,","directors","and","other","stage","workers,","and","thus","the"]},{"text":"experimental theater of that era had to be attached to the numerous social or political movements to survive. In consequence, the tough question finally came; \"What is the ultimate goal?","tokens":["experimental","theater","of","that","era","had","to","be","attached","to","the","numerous","social","or","political","movements","to","survive.","In","consequence,","the","tough","question","finally","came;","\"What","is","the","ultimate","goal?"]},{"text":"Is it the social movements themselves or the experimental theater per se?\" Theatrical scholar Chung Ming-teh pointed out that members of small experimental theater groups lack professional training in the first place.","tokens":["Is","it","the","social","movements","themselves","or","the","experimental","theater","per","se?\"","Theatrical","scholar","Chung","Ming-teh","pointed","out","that","members","of","small","experimental","theater","groups","lack","professional","training","in","the","first","place."]},{"text":"If they participate in social movements before they achieve professional finesse, they may obtain some sense of achievement, but they are only par- ticipating in the movements in an indirect way, and subsequently will have to give up this method","tokens":["If","they","participate","in","social","movements","before","they","achieve","professional","finesse,","they","may","obtain","some","sense","of","achievement,","but","they","are","only","par-","ticipating","in","the","movements","in","an","indirect","way,","and","subsequently","will","have","to","give","up","this","method"]},{"text":"of participation. This is quite true, because during the past year the number of exper- imental theater groups in Taiwan reduced sharply and remaining ones have been forced to rethink their positions and directions.","tokens":["of","participation.","This","is","quite","true,","because","during","the","past","year","the","number","of","exper-","imental","theater","groups","in","Taiwan","reduced","sharply","and","remaining","ones","have","been","forced","to","rethink","their","positions","and","directions."]},{"text":"Despite the expansion and development of the 1970s, which earned small experimental theater the epithet \"star of tomorrow,\" when it concerns the quality of perfomers and the performing environment, it is still the most arid field in the art world","tokens":["Despite","the","expansion","and","development","of","the","1970s,","which","earned","small","experimental","theater","the","epithet","\"star","of","tomorrow,\"","when","it","concerns","the","quality","of","perfomers","and","the","performing","environment,","it","is","still","the","most","arid","field","in","the","art","world"]},{"text":"of Taiwan. Thus after a glorious decade, the experimental theater became dormant last year. Nevertheless what is heart-warming is that during the decade a few theater groups became mature, experienced and even found a sense of direc- tion.","tokens":["of","Taiwan.","Thus","after","a","glorious","decade,","the","experimental","theater","became","dormant","last","year.","Nevertheless","what","is","heart-warming","is","that","during","the","decade","a","few","theater","groups","became","mature,","experienced","and","even","found","a","sense","of","direc-","tion."]},{"text":"For instance some of the performances introduced by \"Mew Image\" in- cluded top perfomers and artists who showed considerable professionalism. \"Performer's Workshop\" and \"The Screen\" employ permanent performers, professional directors and uses scripts written by art college students, to create","tokens":["For","instance","some","of","the","performances","introduced","by","\"Mew","Image\"","in-","cluded","top","perfomers","and","artists","who","showed","considerable","professionalism.","\"Performer's","Workshop\"","and","\"The","Screen\"","employ","permanent","performers,","professional","directors","and","uses","scripts","written","by","art","college","students,","to","create"]},{"text":"continuous change. Mr. Lee' director of the \"Screen\" lamented that even though he had been performing in plays for more than 10 years, not even one professional theater group was established in Taiwan.","tokens":["continuous","change.","Mr.","Lee'","director","of","the","\"Screen\"","lamented","that","even","though","he","had","been","performing","in","plays","for","more","than","10","years,","not","even","one","professional","theater","group","was","established","in","Taiwan."]},{"text":"He said that this was because nobody had thought of running a theater group as a serious business enter- prise. Mr. Lee has since quit his lilustrious performance career in the movie and TV, to dedicate his efforts solely to","tokens":["He","said","that","this","was","because","nobody","had","thought","of","running","a","theater","group","as","a","serious","business","enter-","prise.","Mr.","Lee","has","since","quit","his","lilustrious","performance","career","in","the","movie","and","TV,","to","dedicate","his","efforts","solely","to"]},{"text":"the theater. Since the beginning of this year, theater enthusiasts such as Lee Kuo- Shiu, Lee Li-chun and Lai Shen-chuan have been working hard to inspire the theater in Taiwan.","tokens":["the","theater.","Since","the","beginning","of","this","year,","theater","enthusiasts","such","as","Lee","Kuo-","Shiu,","Lee","Li-chun","and","Lai","Shen-chuan","have","been","working","hard","to","inspire","the","theater","in","Taiwan."]},{"text":"Moreover, with Lin Hwai-ming determined to revive past glories, his dance troupe \"Cloud Gate\" is now performing again after years of inaction. All this indicates that the theater in Taiwan is about to enter a new era.","tokens":["Moreover,","with","Lin","Hwai-ming","determined","to","revive","past","glories,","his","dance","troupe","\"Cloud","Gate\"","is","now","performing","again","after","years","of","inaction.","All","this","indicates","that","the","theater","in","Taiwan","is","about","to","enter","a","new","era."]},{"text":"Most of the experimental theater groups are facing financial hardship, and according to Mr. Chung Ming-teh, who is concerned about the growth and development of theater, the financial hardships of the groups will not be eased within the next five","tokens":["Most","of","the","experimental","theater","groups","are","facing","financial","hardship,","and","according","to","Mr.","Chung","Ming-teh,","who","is","concerned","about","the","growth","and","development","of","theater,","the","financial","hardships","of","the","groups","will","not","be","eased","within","the","next","five"]},{"text":"to 10 years. He believes that only those groups in the forming production companies can survive. Professional theater groups, with permanent performing venues and proper administration organization, can only be sustained by government subsidies or corporate sponsorships.","tokens":["to","10","years.","He","believes","that","only","those","groups","in","the","forming","production","companies","can","survive.","Professional","theater","groups,","with","permanent","performing","venues","and","proper","administration","organization,","can","only","be","sustained","by","government","subsidies","or","corporate","sponsorships."]},{"text":"\"The Screen\" avows to become the first professional theater company in Taiwan, and it has now obtained a permanent \"home.\" It is also gradually building up its own data archives, and trying to rehearse and perform systematically and on a","tokens":["\"The","Screen\"","avows","to","become","the","first","professional","theater","company","in","Taiwan,","and","it","has","now","obtained","a","permanent","\"home.\"","It","is","also","gradually","building","up","its","own","data","archives,","and","trying","to","rehearse","and","perform","systematically","and","on","a"]},{"text":"long term basis. At the moment, is reinvesting all its box-office earnings to pur- chase lighting, sound systems and stage equipment. It plans to do an is- landwide tour, and if need be, will set up its own temporary stages.","tokens":["long","term","basis.","At","the","moment,","is","reinvesting","all","its","box-office","earnings","to","pur-","chase","lighting,","sound","systems","and","stage","equipment.","It","plans","to","do","an","is-","landwide","tour,","and","if","need","be,","will","set","up","its","own","temporary","stages."]}]},"T20":{"key":"T20","title":"T20 \"The run-up to my trip (to Beijing)…","paras":[{"text":"\"The run-up to my trip (to Beijing) leads me to be concerned that they're going in the wrong direction with these detentions of dissidents,\" he said on Wednesday in Australia.","tokens":["\"The","run-up","to","my","trip","(to","Beijing)","leads","me","to","be","concerned","that","they're","going","in","the","wrong","direction","with","these","detentions","of","dissidents,\"","he","said","on","Wednesday","in","Australia."]},{"text":"Christopher voiced his \"strong distaste\" for the roundups and said they may end up quashing plans to broaden Washington's security dialogue with Beijing. The lates known detention was on Tuesday when police accused ex- student leader Wang Dan of rumormongering","tokens":["Christopher","voiced","his","\"strong","distaste\"","for","the","roundups","and","said","they","may","end","up","quashing","plans","to","broaden","Washington's","security","dialogue","with","Beijing.","The","lates","known","detention","was","on","Tuesday","when","police","accused","ex-","student","leader","Wang","Dan","of","rumormongering"]},{"text":"and warned he would \"pay the price\" if his outspokenness hurt mainland China. Foreign Minister Qian Qichien flatly rejects the formula of MFN in exchange for human rights progress.","tokens":["and","warned","he","would","\"pay","the","price\"","if","his","outspokenness","hurt","mainland","China.","Foreign","Minister","Qian","Qichien","flatly","rejects","the","formula","of","MFN","in","exchange","for","human","rights","progress."]},{"text":"\"Human rights and MFN are completely separate issues,\" Qian reiterat- ed on Sunday. \"We strongly oppose linking them.\" The Foreign Ministry on Tuesday rebuked Clinton for voicing sympathy for mainland China's dissidents.","tokens":["\"Human","rights","and","MFN","are","completely","separate","issues,\"","Qian","reiterat-","ed","on","Sunday.","\"We","strongly","oppose","linking","them.\"","The","Foreign","Ministry","on","Tuesday","rebuked","Clinton","for","voicing","sympathy","for","mainland","China's","dissidents."]},{"text":"\"No foreign country, organization or individual has the right to make irresponsible remarks or interfere,\" a ministry statement said. Ask virtually any businessman, Chinese or American, whether mainland China should enjoy most favored nation tariffs and the answer is emphatic","tokens":["\"No","foreign","country,","organization","or","individual","has","the","right","to","make","irresponsible","remarks","or","interfere,\"","a","ministry","statement","said.","Ask","virtually","any","businessman,","Chinese","or","American,","whether","mainland","China","should","enjoy","most","favored","nation","tariffs","and","the","answer","is","emphatic"]},{"text":"--yes. Sino-U.S. trade is blooming at a world-beating clip and U.S. busines- ses, whose exports to mainland China reached US$8 billion last year, are finally piercing formidable barriers to reach mainland China's 1.2 billion increasingly wealthy consumers.","tokens":["--yes.","Sino-U.S.","trade","is","blooming","at","a","world-beating","clip","and","U.S.","busines-","ses,","whose","exports","to","mainland","China","reached","US$8","billion","last","year,","are","finally","piercing","formidable","barriers","to","reach","mainland","China's","1.2","billion","increasingly","wealthy","consumers."]},{"text":"America is even more crucial to mainland China, sucking up 34 percent of all Chinese exports in 1993--about U.S. worries about a 25 percent leap in its bilateral trade deficit to US$23 billion.","tokens":["America","is","even","more","crucial","to","mainland","China,","sucking","up","34","percent","of","all","Chinese","exports","in","1993--about","U.S.","worries","about","a","25","percent","leap","in","its","bilateral","trade","deficit","to","US$23","billion."]},{"text":"Hong Kong would also be throttled by a trade war. Officials in the British colony that finance and manage much of mainland China's trade said of mainland China's MFN status would cost 75,000 local jobs, swipe up to nine percent","tokens":["Hong","Kong","would","also","be","throttled","by","a","trade","war.","Officials","in","the","British","colony","that","finance","and","manage","much","of","mainland","China's","trade","said","of","mainland","China's","MFN","status","would","cost","75,000","local","jobs,","swipe","up","to","nine","percent"]},{"text":"from the territory's overall trade and slash 3.1 percentage points from its economic growth rate. Editorials Reunifying the Chinese language. At a recent symposium on the Chinese language held in Taiwan, participat scholar urged that people on the two sides","tokens":["from","the","territory's","overall","trade","and","slash","3.1","percentage","points","from","its","economic","growth","rate.","Editorials","Reunifying","the","Chinese","language.","At","a","recent","symposium","on","the","Chinese","language","held","in","Taiwan,","participat","scholar","urged","that","people","on","the","two","sides"]},{"text":"of the Taiwan Strait should strive to reunify the written form of the Chinese language. The call deserves a hearty response. Until 221 B.C., when the first emperor of the Chin-dynasty unified China, many different forms of the Chinese language","tokens":["of","the","Taiwan","Strait","should","strive","to","reunify","the","written","form","of","the","Chinese","language.","The","call","deserves","a","hearty","response.","Until","221","B.C.,","when","the","first","emperor","of","the","Chin-dynasty","unified","China,","many","different","forms","of","the","Chinese","language"]},{"text":"existed in China. Uni- fication of the country created a need to unify the language. The emperor ordered a common written form be used throughout the land.","tokens":["existed","in","China.","Uni-","fication","of","the","country","created","a","need","to","unify","the","language.","The","emperor","ordered","a","common","written","form","be","used","throughout","the","land."]},{"text":"The move, tyrannical as it may seem from the viewpoint of modern peo- ple, proved a gread success and a blessing for the Chinese.","tokens":["The","move,","tyrannical","as","it","may","seem","from","the","viewpoint","of","modern","peo-","ple,","proved","a","gread","success","and","a","blessing","for","the","Chinese."]},{"text":"The use of a common written language has enabled people in various areas of the country to communicate with one another with little difficulty despite the different ways they talk.","tokens":["The","use","of","a","common","written","language","has","enabled","people","in","various","areas","of","the","country","to","communicate","with","one","another","with","little","difficulty","despite","the","different","ways","they","talk."]},{"text":"The people in Shandong, for example, talk as differently from the people in Guangdong as the English do from the French. The people from the French.","tokens":["The","people","in","Shandong,","for","example,","talk","as","differently","from","the","people","in","Guangdong","as","the","English","do","from","the","French.","The","people","from","the","French."]},{"text":"The people from the two provinces can make themselves understood easily by writing. The unification of written Chinese, therefore, has been tremendously helpful in keeping the nation united throughout the centuries.","tokens":["The","people","from","the","two","provinces","can","make","themselves","understood","easily","by","writing.","The","unification","of","written","Chinese,","therefore,","has","been","tremendously","helpful","in","keeping","the","nation","united","throughout","the","centuries."]},{"text":"However, the Chinese Communists' attempt to revolutionize the Chinese language by adopting a simplified form of the language has created a lin- guistic split.","tokens":["However,","the","Chinese","Communists'","attempt","to","revolutionize","the","Chinese","language","by","adopting","a","simplified","form","of","the","language","has","created","a","lin-","guistic","split."]},{"text":"Used on the mainland now is a simplified system much different from the traditional characters, which are used in Taiwan. The difference is not so great as to make either system entirely unrecognizable to users of the other system.","tokens":["Used","on","the","mainland","now","is","a","simplified","system","much","different","from","the","traditional","characters,","which","are","used","in","Taiwan.","The","difference","is","not","so","great","as","to","make","either","system","entirely","unrecognizable","to","users","of","the","other","system."]},{"text":"Yet those who habitually use one do have considerable difficulty understanding passages written in the other form. This, without a doubt, is one of the obstacles to Chinese reunification.","tokens":["Yet","those","who","habitually","use","one","do","have","considerable","difficulty","understanding","passages","written","in","the","other","form.","This,","without","a","doubt,","is","one","of","the","obstacles","to","Chinese","reunification."]},{"text":"The reasons given by Peking for adopting the simplified characters are that the simplification facilitates the writing and learning of the language and learning of the language and helps reduce illiteracy.","tokens":["The","reasons","given","by","Peking","for","adopting","the","simplified","characters","are","that","the","simplification","facilitates","the","writing","and","learning","of","the","language","and","learning","of","the","language","and","helps","reduce","illiteracy."]},{"text":"Illiteracy is as widespread as ever on the mainland since the sim- plification of the characters. In Taiwan, where the traditional chara- cters are used, fewer than 6 percent of the people are illiterate, and the vast majority of these","tokens":["Illiteracy","is","as","widespread","as","ever","on","the","mainland","since","the","sim-","plification","of","the","characters.","In","Taiwan,","where","the","traditional","chara-","cters","are","used,","fewer","than","6","percent","of","the","people","are","illiterate,","and","the","vast","majority","of","these"]},{"text":"individuals grew up before the island reverted from Japanese rule to China in 1945. The simplified characters, besides being deprived of the artistic value of the traditional characters, are actually harder to read.","tokens":["individuals","grew","up","before","the","island","reverted","from","Japanese","rule","to","China","in","1945.","The","simplified","characters,","besides","being","deprived","of","the","artistic","value","of","the","traditional","characters,","are","actually","harder","to","read."]},{"text":"The reason is simple. Simplification of the strokes has made the characters look more similar, so distinguishing one from the other has become more difficult.","tokens":["The","reason","is","simple.","Simplification","of","the","strokes","has","made","the","characters","look","more","similar,","so","distinguishing","one","from","the","other","has","become","more","difficult."]},{"text":"And in this era of the computer, when the need to write in long- hand is decreasing rapidly, simplification of the characters hardly makes writing easier and faster.","tokens":["And","in","this","era","of","the","computer,","when","the","need","to","write","in","long-","hand","is","decreasing","rapidly,","simplification","of","the","characters","hardly","makes","writing","easier","and","faster."]},{"text":"We hope that authorities on the mainland will abandon the use of the simplified characters and re-adopt the much more beautiful traditional traditional form of the language.","tokens":["We","hope","that","authorities","on","the","mainland","will","abandon","the","use","of","the","simplified","characters","and","re-adopt","the","much","more","beautiful","traditional","traditional","form","of","the","language."]},{"text":"Persisting in using the simplified characters is hampering the reunification of the nation. Intel introduces new Pentium processors. Intel Corp. introduced new Pentium processors running at frequencies of 90 and 100 MHz.","tokens":["Persisting","in","using","the","simplified","characters","is","hampering","the","reunification","of","the","nation.","Intel","introduces","new","Pentium","processors.","Intel","Corp.","introduced","new","Pentium","processors","running","at","frequencies","of","90","and","100","MHz."]},{"text":"The 100-MHz version of the Pentium processor runs todays'PC software faster than any other processor available. It is 50 percent faster than the original version announced one year ago and has an iCOMP index rating of 815 with a SPECint92","tokens":["The","100-MHz","version","of","the","Pentium","processor","runs","todays'PC","software","faster","than","any","other","processor","available.","It","is","50","percent","faster","than","the","original","version","announced","one","year","ago","and","has","an","iCOMP","index","rating","of","815","with","a","SPECint92"]},{"text":"rating of 100.0. These new Pentium processors will be manufactured in volume at Intel's most advanced microprocessor production factories in Ireland and Santa Clara.","tokens":["rating","of","100.0.","These","new","Pentium","processors","will","be","manufactured","in","volume","at","Intel's","most","advanced","microprocessor","production","factories","in","Ireland","and","Santa","Clara."]},{"text":"With the 3.3 volt, 0.6 micron, 4-layer metal advanced process tech- nology, the size of other members of the Pentium processor family. This announcement comes on the heels of demonstrating a 150-MHz Pentium proces- sor at the IEEE International Solid","tokens":["With","the","3.3","volt,","0.6","micron,","4-layer","metal","advanced","process","tech-","nology,","the","size","of","other","members","of","the","Pentium","processor","family.","This","announcement","comes","on","the","heels","of","demonstrating","a","150-MHz","Pentium","proces-","sor","at","the","IEEE","International","Solid"]},{"text":"State Circuits Conference (ISSCC) in San Francisco approximately two weeks ago.","tokens":["State","Circuits","Conference","(ISSCC)","in","San","Francisco","approximately","two","weeks","ago."]}]},"T21":{"key":"T21","title":"T21 Finally, of course, just as it is…","paras":[{"text":"Finally, of course, just as it is possible to have any number of indexes over a given stored file, so it is equally possible to have any number of pointer chains running through a given stored file.","tokens":["Finally,","of","course,","just","as","it","is","possible","to","have","any","number","of","indexes","over","a","given","stored","file,","so","it","is","equally","possible","to","have","any","number","of","pointer","chains","running","through","a","given","stored","file."]},{"text":"A common compression technique is thus to replace each individual data value by some representation of the difference between it and the value that immediately precedes it.","tokens":["A","common","compression","technique","is","thus","to","replace","each","individual","data","value","by","some","representation","of","the","difference","between","it","and","the","value","that","immediately","precedes","it."]},{"text":"Another possible compression technique for this set of data is simply to eliminate all trailing blanks. Further rear compression can be achieved by dropping all characters to the right of the one required to distinguish the entry in question from","tokens":["Another","possible","compression","technique","for","this","set","of","data","is","simply","to","eliminate","all","trailing","blanks.","Further","rear","compression","can","be","achieved","by","dropping","all","characters","to","the","right","of","the","one","required","to","distinguish","the","entry","in","question","from"]},{"text":"its two immediate neighbors. We were very pleased to receive your inquiry or January 15 and enclose our illustrated catalogue and print-list giving the details you ask for.","tokens":["its","two","immediate","neighbors.","We","were","very","pleased","to","receive","your","inquiry","or","January","15","and","enclose","our","illustrated","catalogue","and","print-list","giving","the","details","you","ask","for."]},{"text":"Also by separate post we are sending you a full range of samples and, when you have had an opportunity to examine them, feel confident you will agree that the goods are both excellent in quality and very reasonable in","tokens":["Also","by","separate","post","we","are","sending","you","a","full","range","of","samples","and,","when","you","have","had","an","opportunity","to","examine","them,","feel","confident","you","will","agree","that","the","goods","are","both","excellent","in","quality","and","very","reasonable","in"]},{"text":"price. We invite your attention to our other nylon products, details of which you will find in the catalog, and look forward to receiving your first order.","tokens":["price.","We","invite","your","attention","to","our","other","nylon","products,","details","of","which","you","will","find","in","the","catalog,","and","look","forward","to","receiving","your","first","order."]},{"text":"Will you please send me a copy of your current typewriter catalog and pricelist? I am particularly interested in portables, but require a machine suitable for fairly heavy duty including stencil-cutting.","tokens":["Will","you","please","send","me","a","copy","of","your","current","typewriter","catalog","and","pricelist?","I","am","particularly","interested","in","portables,","but","require","a","machine","suitable","for","fairly","heavy","duty","including","stencil-cutting."]},{"text":"Enclose the catalog of typewriters for which you ask in your letter of February 8. It includes particulars of portables by a number of makes.","tokens":["Enclose","the","catalog","of","typewriters","for","which","you","ask","in","your","letter","of","February","8.","It","includes","particulars","of","portables","by","a","number","of","makes."]},{"text":"We think the Olivetti \"Studio 44\" is a machine that would suit your purpose very well. This machine weighs 15 lbs. and is heavier than most portables, but even so it is conveniently portable when carried in its case.","tokens":["We","think","the","Olivetti","\"Studio","44\"","is","a","machine","that","would","suit","your","purpose","very","well.","This","machine","weighs","15","lbs.","and","is","heavier","than","most","portables,","but","even","so","it","is","conveniently","portable","when","carried","in","its","case."]},{"text":"A type-face suitable for stencil-cutting could be supplied. We have one of these machines in stock and, if it is convenient for you to call, we shall be pleased to let you try it.","tokens":["A","type-face","suitable","for","stencil-cutting","could","be","supplied.","We","have","one","of","these","machines","in","stock","and,","if","it","is","convenient","for","you","to","call,","we","shall","be","pleased","to","let","you","try","it."]},{"text":"The \"China Post\" has recommended your form as being interested in establishing business relations with a Chinese firm for the purpose of selling various products of your country and importing Chinese manufactured goods.","tokens":["The","\"China","Post\"","has","recommended","your","form","as","being","interested","in","establishing","business","relations","with","a","Chinese","firm","for","the","purpose","of","selling","various","products","of","your","country","and","importing","Chinese","manufactured","goods."]},{"text":"We specialize in central Europe trade, but we have had no contact wit your country. We address this letter to you in order to ascertain whether cooperation to the advantage of both our firms could be established.","tokens":["We","specialize","in","central","Europe","trade,","but","we","have","had","no","contact","wit","your","country.","We","address","this","letter","to","you","in","order","to","ascertain","whether","cooperation","to","the","advantage","of","both","our","firms","could","be","established."]},{"text":"We invite you to send us details and prices, possibly also samples, of such goods as you would be principally interested in selling, and we shall gladly study the sales possibilities in our market.","tokens":["We","invite","you","to","send","us","details","and","prices,","possibly","also","samples,","of","such","goods","as","you","would","be","principally","interested","in","selling,","and","we","shall","gladly","study","the","sales","possibilities","in","our","market."]},{"text":"On the other hand, please favor us with a list of those articles you are interested in obtaining from here, so that we might be in a position to quote on same and give you all the necessary information regarding","tokens":["On","the","other","hand,","please","favor","us","with","a","list","of","those","articles","you","are","interested","in","obtaining","from","here,","so","that","we","might","be","in","a","position","to","quote","on","same","and","give","you","all","the","necessary","information","regarding"]},{"text":"su- pply possibilities. We enclose herewith a list of goods for which we are representing the leading Chinese manufacturers for their exports or which we are now in a position to supply you from prime sources at the lowest possible","tokens":["su-","pply","possibilities.","We","enclose","herewith","a","list","of","goods","for","which","we","are","representing","the","leading","Chinese","manufacturers","for","their","exports","or","which","we","are","now","in","a","position","to","supply","you","from","prime","sources","at","the","lowest","possible"]},{"text":"prices. This list consists of only a limited selection of the goods which our various departments are regularly supplying, but we are fully equipped to handle your needs for any merchandise whatsoever.","tokens":["prices.","This","list","consists","of","only","a","limited","selection","of","the","goods","which","our","various","departments","are","regularly","supplying,","but","we","are","fully","equipped","to","handle","your","needs","for","any","merchandise","whatsoever."]},{"text":"Having already had experience in marketing products similar to your own we are familiar with customers' needs and are confident we could de- velop a good market for you in Scotland, we have spacious and well-equipped showrooms, not only at","tokens":["Having","already","had","experience","in","marketing","products","similar","to","your","own","we","are","familiar","with","customers'","needs","and","are","confident","we","could","de-","velop","a","good","market","for","you","in","Scotland,","we","have","spacious","and","well-equipped","showrooms,","not","only","at"]},{"text":"our Glasgow headquarters, but also in Edinburgh and Perth, and an experienced staff of sales representatives who would push your business. We should be glad to learn that you are interested in our proposal and on what terms you would","tokens":["our","Glasgow","headquarters,","but","also","in","Edinburgh","and","Perth,","and","an","experienced","staff","of","sales","representatives","who","would","push","your","business.","We","should","be","glad","to","learn","that","you","are","interested","in","our","proposal","and","on","what","terms","you","would"]},{"text":"be willing to conclude an agreement. Our Mr. Wormald would then call on you to discuss details, he will be visiting your town in two weeks' time.","tokens":["be","willing","to","conclude","an","agreement.","Our","Mr.","Wormald","would","then","call","on","you","to","discuss","details,","he","will","be","visiting","your","town","in","two","weeks'","time."]},{"text":"After studying the catalog and price list received with your letter of March 31, we have no doubt we could obtain good orders for many of the items, but feel you are placing both yourselves and us at a disadvantage","tokens":["After","studying","the","catalog","and","price","list","received","with","your","letter","of","March","31,","we","have","no","doubt","we","could","obtain","good","orders","for","many","of","the","items,","but","feel","you","are","placing","both","yourselves","and","us","at","a","disadvantage"]},{"text":"by adopting a cash-settlement basis. Nearly all business here is done on credit, the period varying from three to six months. Your prices on the other hand are reasonable and your manufactures sound in both design and quality.","tokens":["by","adopting","a","cash-settlement","basis.","Nearly","all","business","here","is","done","on","credit,","the","period","varying","from","three","to","six","months.","Your","prices","on","the","other","hand","are","reasonable","and","your","manufactures","sound","in","both","design","and","quality."]},{"text":"We therefore suggest that you could afford to raise your prices sufficiently to cover the cost and fall into line with your competitors in the matter of credit.","tokens":["We","therefore","suggest","that","you","could","afford","to","raise","your","prices","sufficiently","to","cover","the","cost","and","fall","into","line","with","your","competitors","in","the","matter","of","credit."]},{"text":"In our experience, to do so would be sound policy and greatly strengthen your hold on the market. With the best will in the world to serve you, we are afraid it would be neither worth your while, nor ours,","tokens":["In","our","experience,","to","do","so","would","be","sound","policy","and","greatly","strengthen","your","hold","on","the","market.","With","the","best","will","in","the","world","to","serve","you,","we","are","afraid","it","would","be","neither","worth","your","while,","nor","ours,"]},{"text":"to continue business on a cash basis. Would you please estimate for installing central heating in the bungalow at I Margggate Road, St. Annes-on-Sea.","tokens":["to","continue","business","on","a","cash","basis.","Would","you","please","estimate","for","installing","central","heating","in","the","bungalow","at","I","Margggate","Road,","St.","Annes-on-Sea."]},{"text":"I enclose a specification and a plan showing required positions of radiators. Cost is of course a matter of some importance but, as you will gather from the specification.","tokens":["I","enclose","a","specification","and","a","plan","showing","required","positions","of","radiators.","Cost","is","of","course","a","matter","of","some","importance","but,","as","you","will","gather","from","the","specification."]},{"text":"I am interested only in first-class workmanship and in the use of best qua- lity materials. Completion of the work is required by August 31 at the la- test, and I shall be glad if in your reply you will","tokens":["I","am","interested","only","in","first-class","workmanship","and","in","the","use","of","best","qua-","lity","materials.","Completion","of","the","work","is","required","by","August","31","at","the","la-","test,","and","I","shall","be","glad","if","in","your","reply","you","will"]},{"text":"give me a firm comple- tion date so that I can make arrangements for our removal from London. An estimated 25 other passengers on the British-chartered, Belgian- registered bus were injured, some seriously, police said.","tokens":["give","me","a","firm","comple-","tion","date","so","that","I","can","make","arrangements","for","our","removal","from","London.","An","estimated","25","other","passengers","on","the","British-chartered,","Belgian-","registered","bus","were","injured,","some","seriously,","police","said."]},{"text":"A police official in Neumarkt, 220 kilometers southwest of Vienna, said the bus sideswiped the tanker just north of Neumarkt, along a curving, rain-slicked stretch of highway in Austria's southern Alps.","tokens":["A","police","official","in","Neumarkt,","220","kilometers","southwest","of","Vienna,","said","the","bus","sideswiped","the","tanker","just","north","of","Neumarkt,","along","a","curving,","rain-slicked","stretch","of","highway","in","Austria's","southern","Alps."]},{"text":"The left front of the bus was torn off in the collision. The tanker was damaged, but it was not clear if its driver was among the injured.","tokens":["The","left","front","of","the","bus","was","torn","off","in","the","collision.","The","tanker","was","damaged,","but","it","was","not","clear","if","its","driver","was","among","the","injured."]}]},"T22":{"key":"T22","title":"T22 Thank you for your letter of July…","paras":[{"text":"Thank you for your letter of July 5 enclosing specification and plan for a solid fuel central heating system at the above address. We should be glad to carry out the work for a total of 360, with a 2","tokens":["Thank","you","for","your","letter","of","July","5","enclosing","specification","and","plan","for","a","solid","fuel","central","heating","system","at","the","above","address.","We","should","be","glad","to","carry","out","the","work","for","a","total","of","360,","with","a","2"]},{"text":"discount allowance for settlement within one month of the date of our account. We can promise to complete all work by the end of August if we receive your instructions by the end of this month.","tokens":["discount","allowance","for","settlement","within","one","month","of","the","date","of","our","account.","We","can","promise","to","complete","all","work","by","the","end","of","August","if","we","receive","your","instructions","by","the","end","of","this","month."]},{"text":"We would stress that the price quoted is based on present costs of materials and labour. Should these costs rise we would have to add the increased costs to our price.","tokens":["We","would","stress","that","the","price","quoted","is","based","on","present","costs","of","materials","and","labour.","Should","these","costs","rise","we","would","have","to","add","the","increased","costs","to","our","price."]},{"text":"We have installed many similar heating systems in your area. Our reputation for highclass work is well known, but if you would like to inspect one of our recent installations before deciding to accept our estimate, we would try to","tokens":["We","have","installed","many","similar","heating","systems","in","your","area.","Our","reputation","for","highclass","work","is","well","known,","but","if","you","would","like","to","inspect","one","of","our","recent","installations","before","deciding","to","accept","our","estimate,","we","would","try","to"]},{"text":"arrange this for you. If, as we hope, you are satisfied with the price quoted, please let us have your instruction soon. This would help us in making our other arrangements.","tokens":["arrange","this","for","you.","If,","as","we","hope,","you","are","satisfied","with","the","price","quoted,","please","let","us","have","your","instruction","soon.","This","would","help","us","in","making","our","other","arrangements."]},{"text":"Tenders are invited for the supply to the Council's power station at Bamford, during the year 1994 of approximately 2,000 tons of best qua- lity furnace coke, delivered in quantities as required.","tokens":["Tenders","are","invited","for","the","supply","to","the","Council's","power","station","at","Bamford,","during","the","year","1994","of","approximately","2,000","tons","of","best","qua-","lity","furnace","coke,","delivered","in","quantities","as","required."]},{"text":"Tenders must be submitted on the official form obtainable from County Hall to reach the Clerk of the Council not later than 900 noon on Friday, the 30th of June.","tokens":["Tenders","must","be","submitted","on","the","official","form","obtainable","from","County","Hall","to","reach","the","Clerk","of","the","Council","not","later","than","900","noon","on","Friday,","the","30th","of","June."]},{"text":"The council do not bind themselves to accept the lowest, or any, of the tenders submitted. Having read the terms and conditions in the official form supplied by you, I enclose my tender for the supply of coke to the","tokens":["The","council","do","not","bind","themselves","to","accept","the","lowest,","or","any,","of","the","tenders","submitted.","Having","read","the","terms","and","conditions","in","the","official","form","supplied","by","you,","I","enclose","my","tender","for","the","supply","of","coke","to","the"]},{"text":"Bamford power station during 1944 and shall be glad to learn that it has been accepted. Referring to our sales contract, dated October 25, we are pleased to inform you that we have sent to you the samples of the","tokens":["Bamford","power","station","during","1944","and","shall","be","glad","to","learn","that","it","has","been","accepted.","Referring","to","our","sales","contract,","dated","October","25,","we","are","pleased","to","inform","you","that","we","have","sent","to","you","the","samples","of","the"]},{"text":"AM/FM cassette tape recorder by are freighter. The shipment will be made ten days earlier than that in the contract. We have received a letter on October 19 fro your branch office, Macao, enclosing a specimen of guarantee cards for","tokens":["AM/FM","cassette","tape","recorder","by","are","freighter.","The","shipment","will","be","made","ten","days","earlier","than","that","in","the","contract.","We","have","received","a","letter","on","October","19","fro","your","branch","office,","Macao,","enclosing","a","specimen","of","guarantee","cards","for"]},{"text":"the phonographs of your order No. 904. We will have them printed without delay. We have business relationship with all the large plywood producers and door makers.","tokens":["the","phonographs","of","your","order","No.","904.","We","will","have","them","printed","without","delay.","We","have","business","relationship","with","all","the","large","plywood","producers","and","door","makers."]},{"text":"You may be certain that you will find their products competitive against those of other countries. Almost all the building materials here are exported to the United States, Japan and Southeast Asian Countries.","tokens":["You","may","be","certain","that","you","will","find","their","products","competitive","against","those","of","other","countries.","Almost","all","the","building","materials","here","are","exported","to","the","United","States,","Japan","and","Southeast","Asian","Countries."]},{"text":"I beg to send you by express a few little articles belong to you which my little sister Annie found in her room. Your somewhat hurried de- parture made both of us unable to remind you to bring them in","tokens":["I","beg","to","send","you","by","express","a","few","little","articles","belong","to","you","which","my","little","sister","Annie","found","in","her","room.","Your","somewhat","hurried","de-","parture","made","both","of","us","unable","to","remind","you","to","bring","them","in"]},{"text":"time. This, nevertheless, furnished me plausible excuse for writing to you. The house seemed quite deserted since you left. We all miss you. I believe my sis- ter is writing you something more than those expressed in this letter by","tokens":["time.","This,","nevertheless,","furnished","me","plausible","excuse","for","writing","to","you.","The","house","seemed","quite","deserted","since","you","left.","We","all","miss","you.","I","believe","my","sis-","ter","is","writing","you","something","more","than","those","expressed","in","this","letter","by"]},{"text":"me. Please accept my gift as you accept my respect, and that it may please you and couse you think of me sometimes. And I beg to add that in choosing the trifling present I have been happy enough to","tokens":["me.","Please","accept","my","gift","as","you","accept","my","respect,","and","that","it","may","please","you","and","couse","you","think","of","me","sometimes.","And","I","beg","to","add","that","in","choosing","the","trifling","present","I","have","been","happy","enough","to"]},{"text":"understand or guess your tastes. You made me the sweet confession of your love and your parents, to whom I have communicated my sentiments, have received my vows kindly.","tokens":["understand","or","guess","your","tastes.","You","made","me","the","sweet","confession","of","your","love","and","your","parents,","to","whom","I","have","communicated","my","sentiments,","have","received","my","vows","kindly."]},{"text":"I should be happy with all this, yet there is one thing wanting. Although my thoughts, which are always on you, present me with the feature of her who has my heart, yet I am desirous of possessing her portrait.","tokens":["I","should","be","happy","with","all","this,","yet","there","is","one","thing","wanting.","Although","my","thoughts,","which","are","always","on","you,","present","me","with","the","feature","of","her","who","has","my","heart,","yet","I","am","desirous","of","possessing","her","portrait."]},{"text":"It deems a necessity to have this token of love while I am contemplating the person whom I love and who is to give happiness to my existence.","tokens":["It","deems","a","necessity","to","have","this","token","of","love","while","I","am","contemplating","the","person","whom","I","love","and","who","is","to","give","happiness","to","my","existence."]},{"text":"I am sure you will not refuse my urgent request. It's wonderful to get a nice long letter from you, starting my day right.","tokens":["I","am","sure","you","will","not","refuse","my","urgent","request.","It's","wonderful","to","get","a","nice","long","letter","from","you,","starting","my","day","right."]},{"text":"A picture of mine for which you asked will be found in this letter. There I go talking in song title again! \"As long as I'm with you.\"","tokens":["A","picture","of","mine","for","which","you","asked","will","be","found","in","this","letter.","There","I","go","talking","in","song","title","again!","\"As","long","as","I'm","with","you.\""]},{"text":"Remember? It was on the air the other night, and we listened to it together. I think it's a lovely song and the words sound almost as though they were written for us.","tokens":["Remember?","It","was","on","the","air","the","other","night,","and","we","listened","to","it","together.","I","think","it's","a","lovely","song","and","the","words","sound","almost","as","though","they","were","written","for","us."]},{"text":"Are you still so busy? You didn't say in your letter whether you are still working late, like last week. Now, with my picture in front of you, you will keep my advice in mind, \"health is wealth.\"","tokens":["Are","you","still","so","busy?","You","didn't","say","in","your","letter","whether","you","are","still","working","late,","like","last","week.","Now,","with","my","picture","in","front","of","you,","you","will","keep","my","advice","in","mind,","\"health","is","wealth.\""]},{"text":"It is always so nice to find a letter from you when I come home from work, especially today, the one enclosing a nice picture of yours.","tokens":["It","is","always","so","nice","to","find","a","letter","from","you","when","I","come","home","from","work,","especially","today,","the","one","enclosing","a","nice","picture","of","yours."]},{"text":"I read your letter over and over again and each time I did so, I heard your voice calling me within my heart. To speak frankly, I am not rich.","tokens":["I","read","your","letter","over","and","over","again","and","each","time","I","did","so,","I","heard","your","voice","calling","me","within","my","heart.","To","speak","frankly,","I","am","not","rich."]},{"text":"I have no car, no house and no treasure to give you, but I have a great love for you. The only thing I want is to have you with me.","tokens":["I","have","no","car,","no","house","and","no","treasure","to","give","you,","but","I","have","a","great","love","for","you.","The","only","thing","I","want","is","to","have","you","with","me."]},{"text":"All I want is to make you happy, and I will do my best to make you happy, and I will do my best to make a happy home for us I am waiting for your acceptance!","tokens":["All","I","want","is","to","make","you","happy,","and","I","will","do","my","best","to","make","you","happy,","and","I","will","do","my","best","to","make","a","happy","home","for","us","I","am","waiting","for","your","acceptance!"]},{"text":"I shall see you tomorrow evening, but let me have one line if possible before then. I am writing this letter to reach you the first thing on your birthday.","tokens":["I","shall","see","you","tomorrow","evening,","but","let","me","have","one","line","if","possible","before","then.","I","am","writing","this","letter","to","reach","you","the","first","thing","on","your","birthday."]},{"text":"Many many happy returns of the day, dearest Ellen. When your next birthday comes round I hope I shall not have to write you my good wishes!","tokens":["Many","many","happy","returns","of","the","day,","dearest","Ellen.","When","your","next","birthday","comes","round","I","hope","I","shall","not","have","to","write","you","my","good","wishes!"]},{"text":"Belfast-Taiwan's Hualon Corporation and a British government agency formally launched a controversial textile factory project outside Belfast yesterday, the biggest investment in Northern Ireland for 12 years.","tokens":["Belfast-Taiwan's","Hualon","Corporation","and","a","British","government","agency","formally","launched","a","controversial","textile","factory","project","outside","Belfast","yesterday,","the","biggest","investment","in","Northern","Ireland","for","12","years."]},{"text":"Under the scheme, a 160 million pound sterling (US$240.8 million) factory will be built with 60 million pounds (US$90.32 million) from the government's Industrial Development Board (IDB), its biggest investment since its foundation in 1982.","tokens":["Under","the","scheme,","a","160","million","pound","sterling","(US$240.8","million)","factory","will","be","built","with","60","million","pounds","(US$90.32","million)","from","the","government's","Industrial","Development","Board","(IDB),","its","biggest","investment","since","its","foundation","in","1982."]},{"text":"\"This is excellent industrial news,\" Northern Ireland's Economy Minister Tim Smith said at a ground-breaking ceremony at Mallusk, on the outskirts of Belfast.","tokens":["\"This","is","excellent","industrial","news,\"","Northern","Ireland's","Economy","Minister","Tim","Smith","said","at","a","ground-breaking","ceremony","at","Mallusk,","on","the","outskirts","of","Belfast."]}]},"T23":{"key":"T23","title":"T23 It is my pleasure to learn from…","paras":[{"text":"It is my pleasure to learn from Mr. J. R. Miller, our business friend, of Hudson / Company of your city, that you have a well-established company and represent a good number of manufacturers of other countries and you have","tokens":["It","is","my","pleasure","to","learn","from","Mr.","J.","R.","Miller,","our","business","friend,","of","Hudson","/","Company","of","your","city,","that","you","have","a","well-established","company","and","represent","a","good","number","of","manufacturers","of","other","countries","and","you","have"]},{"text":"had very good business connections with all the large African import- ers of hand tools and hardware. Our company is the sales agent for the largest hand tool company of Taiwan.","tokens":["had","very","good","business","connections","with","all","the","large","African","import-","ers","of","hand","tools","and","hardware.","Our","company","is","the","sales","agent","for","the","largest","hand","tool","company","of","Taiwan."]},{"text":"I am pleased to enclose for your re- ference a list of the hand tools that our principal procures. Our catalog, free samples and the price list including your commission, will be sent to you as soon as we hear","tokens":["I","am","pleased","to","enclose","for","your","re-","ference","a","list","of","the","hand","tools","that","our","principal","procures.","Our","catalog,","free","samples","and","the","price","list","including","your","commission,","will","be","sent","to","you","as","soon","as","we","hear"]},{"text":"from you. The industries of Taiwan have produced a good variety of products for the world market in recent years, and the total exports amounted to us$ 5,600 million in 1974.","tokens":["from","you.","The","industries","of","Taiwan","have","produced","a","good","variety","of","products","for","the","world","market","in","recent","years,","and","the","total","exports","amounted","to","us$","5,600","million","in","1974."]},{"text":"According to a reliable source, the total will be about 6,500 million dollars this year. You will see that Taiwan's products are competitive against those produced in other countries.","tokens":["According","to","a","reliable","source,","the","total","will","be","about","6,500","million","dollars","this","year.","You","will","see","that","Taiwan's","products","are","competitive","against","those","produced","in","other","countries."]},{"text":"Recently two Japanese department stores have sent their buyers to Taiwan for competitive commodities. Many foreign buyers are here booking their requirements every day.","tokens":["Recently","two","Japanese","department","stores","have","sent","their","buyers","to","Taiwan","for","competitive","commodities.","Many","foreign","buyers","are","here","booking","their","requirements","every","day."]},{"text":"And, buying offices and agents of foreign importers are increasing in Taipei City. You will see that many Japanese products are not as competitive as they have been and that it may be the time for you to start the","tokens":["And,","buying","offices","and","agents","of","foreign","importers","are","increasing","in","Taipei","City.","You","will","see","that","many","Japanese","products","are","not","as","competitive","as","they","have","been","and","that","it","may","be","the","time","for","you","to","start","the"]},{"text":"push of the sales of Taiwan's products in your market. So far as I know, electrical and electronic products find a very good market in your country.","tokens":["push","of","the","sales","of","Taiwan's","products","in","your","market.","So","far","as","I","know,","electrical","and","electronic","products","find","a","very","good","market","in","your","country."]},{"text":"Should you find the two lines of business inter- esting, just let me know. You will be interested to hear that we have been able to obtain a further supply of Bragilian Coffee of the same quality as that supplied","tokens":["Should","you","find","the","two","lines","of","business","inter-","esting,","just","let","me","know.","You","will","be","interested","to","hear","that","we","have","been","able","to","obtain","a","further","supply","of","Bragilian","Coffee","of","the","same","quality","as","that","supplied"]},{"text":"to you last year. The total consignment is only 1,000 lb., and we are pleased to offer it to you at 300 per lb.","tokens":["to","you","last","year.","The","total","consignment","is","only","1,000","lb.,","and","we","are","pleased","to","offer","it","to","you","at","300","per","lb."]},{"text":"With the increase in freight costs which become effective this week, the next consignment will be dearer, so we recommend you to take prompt advantage of this offer, which is firm for three days only.","tokens":["With","the","increase","in","freight","costs","which","become","effective","this","week,","the","next","consignment","will","be","dearer,","so","we","recommend","you","to","take","prompt","advantage","of","this","offer,","which","is","firm","for","three","days","only."]},{"text":"Many auto manufacturers everywhere are scurrying to fill the demand for diesel powered sedans in this day of energy shortage. Mercedes-Benz has pioneered in this field since 1936 with the introduction of the 260D diesel sedan.","tokens":["Many","auto","manufacturers","everywhere","are","scurrying","to","fill","the","demand","for","diesel","powered","sedans","in","this","day","of","energy","shortage.","Mercedes-Benz","has","pioneered","in","this","field","since","1936","with","the","introduction","of","the","260D","diesel","sedan."]},{"text":"And today Mercedes-Benz diesel sedans are the most admired and sought after cars. Other manufacturers are also rushing to meet the demand. Taiwan presently ( as far as I know ) only manufactures one model diesel sedan, the Yue Loong","tokens":["And","today","Mercedes-Benz","diesel","sedans","are","the","most","admired","and","sought","after","cars.","Other","manufacturers","are","also","rushing","to","meet","the","demand.","Taiwan","presently","(","as","far","as","I","know",")","only","manufactures","one","model","diesel","sedan,","the","Yue","Loong"]},{"text":"2200. I'm sure it would constitute a blessing to the consumers and the energy conscious Industrial Development Bureau to develop and manufacture more fuel-efficient diesel cars in Taiwan, or at least, to encourage their importation over the importation of gasoline","tokens":["2200.","I'm","sure","it","would","constitute","a","blessing","to","the","consumers","and","the","energy","conscious","Industrial","Development","Bureau","to","develop","and","manufacture","more","fuel-efficient","diesel","cars","in","Taiwan,","or","at","least,","to","encourage","their","importation","over","the","importation","of","gasoline"]},{"text":"powered models. I can suggest some excellent choices: Mercedes-Benz die- sels. My office is situated at Chung Shan N. Rd. Sec. 2 and my house is at Chung Shan N.","tokens":["powered","models.","I","can","suggest","some","excellent","choices:","Mercedes-Benz","die-","sels.","My","office","is","situated","at","Chung","Shan","N.","Rd.","Sec.","2","and","my","house","is","at","Chung","Shan","N."]},{"text":"Rd. Sec. 6, Tein Mou. Everyday except holidays I open my office at 9:30 a.m. and close at 7:00 p.m. There is only one bus route No.220 operating between my house and office.","tokens":["Rd.","Sec.","6,","Tein","Mou.","Everyday","except","holidays","I","open","my","office","at","9:30","a.m.","and","close","at","7:00","p.m.","There","is","only","one","bus","route","No.220","operating","between","my","house","and","office."]},{"text":"In the morning the said bus is very crowded, but one manages to get into it, but in the evening it is very very crowded and one cannot get into it.","tokens":["In","the","morning","the","said","bus","is","very","crowded,","but","one","manages","to","get","into","it,","but","in","the","evening","it","is","very","very","crowded","and","one","cannot","get","into","it."]},{"text":"It is very surprising that there are many bus routes to Shih Lin and many of them are empty in the evening hours, for example route No.269,301,310 etc.","tokens":["It","is","very","surprising","that","there","are","many","bus","routes","to","Shih","Lin","and","many","of","them","are","empty","in","the","evening","hours,","for","example","route","No.269,301,310","etc."]},{"text":"I hope you will publish my letter in your newspaper to attract the attention of the transport department. As foreign residents in Taipei we have been happy to see the great progress made by this island nation.","tokens":["I","hope","you","will","publish","my","letter","in","your","newspaper","to","attract","the","attention","of","the","transport","department.","As","foreign","residents","in","Taipei","we","have","been","happy","to","see","the","great","progress","made","by","this","island","nation."]},{"text":"Progress under President Chiang towards democratization has been noteworthy, while economic and social progress has been especially impressive. Naturally we were happy to see similar cultural progress then the organization of the Taipei Philharmonic Orchestra was announced.","tokens":["Progress","under","President","Chiang","towards","democratization","has","been","noteworthy,","while","economic","and","social","progress","has","been","especially","impressive.","Naturally","we","were","happy","to","see","similar","cultural","progress","then","the","organization","of","the","Taipei","Philharmonic","Orchestra","was","announced."]},{"text":"It seemed that Taipei was about to make another step towards becoming the world city it should be, towards growing up musically. The several concerts given last year by the orchestra were full of promise; excellent progress in the difficult","tokens":["It","seemed","that","Taipei","was","about","to","make","another","step","towards","becoming","the","world","city","it","should","be,","towards","growing","up","musically.","The","several","concerts","given","last","year","by","the","orchestra","were","full","of","promise;","excellent","progress","in","the","difficult"]},{"text":"task of building an orchestra was being made. We were consequently very surprised and saddened when the Taipei Philharmonic Foundation precipitously decided to dissolve the orchestra.","tokens":["task","of","building","an","orchestra","was","being","made.","We","were","consequently","very","surprised","and","saddened","when","the","Taipei","Philharmonic","Foundation","precipitously","decided","to","dissolve","the","orchestra."]},{"text":"In spite of many rumors that your newspaper reported, the directors of the foundation have only claimed that their funds were insufficient. Why then did they refuse a substantial grant offered by the Ministry of Education, and why did they","tokens":["In","spite","of","many","rumors","that","your","newspaper","reported,","the","directors","of","the","foundation","have","only","claimed","that","their","funds","were","insufficient.","Why","then","did","they","refuse","a","substantial","grant","offered","by","the","Ministry","of","Education,","and","why","did","they"]},{"text":"allow the orchestra to perform charity concerts for the Police Radio Station and the Taipei City Music Season? Why were funds from other sources not sought, thus making it a real community orchestra?","tokens":["allow","the","orchestra","to","perform","charity","concerts","for","the","Police","Radio","Station","and","the","Taipei","City","Music","Season?","Why","were","funds","from","other","sources","not","sought,","thus","making","it","a","real","community","orchestra?"]},{"text":"As each concert was sold out, why were more concerts no scheduled to increase ticket income? And finally, if funds were not sufficient to support the orchestra, why are the foundation's directors now trying to expand the range of activities","tokens":["As","each","concert","was","sold","out,","why","were","more","concerts","no","scheduled","to","increase","ticket","income?","And","finally,","if","funds","were","not","sufficient","to","support","the","orchestra,","why","are","the","foundation's","directors","now","trying","to","expand","the","range","of","activities"]},{"text":"they wish to support? These are questions we find difficult to answer. \"It demonstrates clearly that Northern Ireland is a powerful contender for inward investment from the Far East...","tokens":["they","wish","to","support?","These","are","questions","we","find","difficult","to","answer.","\"It","demonstrates","clearly","that","Northern","Ireland","is","a","powerful","contender","for","inward","investment","from","the","Far","East..."]},{"text":"The province is now internationally recognized as an ideal foothold for servicing the European and other markets.\" The launch capped four years of negotiations to bring a major job- creating project to the province but it has been dogged by","tokens":["The","province","is","now","internationally","recognized","as","an","ideal","foothold","for","servicing","the","European","and","other","markets.\"","The","launch","capped","four","years","of","negotiations","to","bring","a","major","job-","creating","project","to","the","province","but","it","has","been","dogged","by"]},{"text":"allegations that the project is uneconomic and resulted from political pressure from the British government. It also evoked memories of an ill-starred project by John De Lorean to build futuristic cars in Northern Ireland.","tokens":["allegations","that","the","project","is","uneconomic","and","resulted","from","political","pressure","from","the","British","government.","It","also","evoked","memories","of","an","ill-starred","project","by","John","De","Lorean","to","build","futuristic","cars","in","Northern","Ireland."]},{"text":"The plan collapsed because of irregularities and a lack of cash in 1978.","tokens":["The","plan","collapsed","because","of","irregularities","and","a","lack","of","cash","in","1978."]}]},"T24":{"key":"T24","title":"T24 Instead of changing the purpose of the…","paras":[{"text":"Instead of changing the purpose of the Taipei Philharmonic Foundation and thus forcing others to duplicate their already well-accomplished work, would it not be easier for some of the foundation directors to retire honor- ably and to let others interested","tokens":["Instead","of","changing","the","purpose","of","the","Taipei","Philharmonic","Foundation","and","thus","forcing","others","to","duplicate","their","already","well-accomplished","work,","would","it","not","be","easier","for","some","of","the","foundation","directors","to","retire","honor-","ably","and","to","let","others","interested"]},{"text":"in Taipei's musical progress continuer the foundation's excellent beginnings? We are sure that the many problems the orchestra has faced can be overcome with sufficient diligence and pa- tience.","tokens":["in","Taipei's","musical","progress","continuer","the","foundation's","excellent","beginnings?","We","are","sure","that","the","many","problems","the","orchestra","has","faced","can","be","overcome","with","sufficient","diligence","and","pa-","tience."]},{"text":"I am sure you will be interested to hear that I am going to marry again. Since Louise's death I have been very lonely, and although I shall never forget her I feel she would not wish me to be","tokens":["I","am","sure","you","will","be","interested","to","hear","that","I","am","going","to","marry","again.","Since","Louise's","death","I","have","been","very","lonely,","and","although","I","shall","never","forget","her","I","feel","she","would","not","wish","me","to","be"]},{"text":"without companionship for the rest of my life. My fiancee, Mrs. Helen Tseng, was widowed two years ago, and now wants to make a new life.","tokens":["without","companionship","for","the","rest","of","my","life.","My","fiancee,","Mrs.","Helen","Tseng,","was","widowed","two","years","ago,","and","now","wants","to","make","a","new","life."]},{"text":"I am sure we are going to be very happy. We plan to be married quietly on July 2, and of course I hope very much that you will be able to come.","tokens":["I","am","sure","we","are","going","to","be","very","happy.","We","plan","to","be","married","quietly","on","July","2,","and","of","course","I","hope","very","much","that","you","will","be","able","to","come."]},{"text":"I beg to send you by express a few little articles belong to you which my little sister Annie found in her room. Your somewhat hur- ried departure made both of us unable to remind you to bring them in","tokens":["I","beg","to","send","you","by","express","a","few","little","articles","belong","to","you","which","my","little","sister","Annie","found","in","her","room.","Your","somewhat","hur-","ried","departure","made","both","of","us","unable","to","remind","you","to","bring","them","in"]},{"text":"time. This, nevertheless, furnished me a plausible excuse for writing to you. The house seemed quite deserted since you left. We all miss you.","tokens":["time.","This,","nevertheless,","furnished","me","a","plausible","excuse","for","writing","to","you.","The","house","seemed","quite","deserted","since","you","left.","We","all","miss","you."]},{"text":"I be- lieve my sister is writing you something more than those expressed in this letter by me. What a delightful surprise to receive your Christmas card!","tokens":["I","be-","lieve","my","sister","is","writing","you","something","more","than","those","expressed","in","this","letter","by","me.","What","a","delightful","surprise","to","receive","your","Christmas","card!"]},{"text":"It was so very, very kind of you to remember me. Our casual acquaintance on the bus was so short. I shouldn't have thought for a moment that you would remember.","tokens":["It","was","so","very,","very","kind","of","you","to","remember","me.","Our","casual","acquaintance","on","the","bus","was","so","short.","I","shouldn't","have","thought","for","a","moment","that","you","would","remember."]},{"text":"Each time I look at the lovely card, I am warmed by thoughts of that night. It was so good to have some one to talk to, someone who was interesting and gracious.","tokens":["Each","time","I","look","at","the","lovely","card,","I","am","warmed","by","thoughts","of","that","night.","It","was","so","good","to","have","some","one","to","talk","to,","someone","who","was","interesting","and","gracious."]},{"text":"I regret deeply that we did not have more time to talk. I feel I have been enriched, both culturally and personally. I told my family of our visit-that night on bus, and they were happy too; happy that I","tokens":["I","regret","deeply","that","we","did","not","have","more","time","to","talk.","I","feel","I","have","been","enriched,","both","culturally","and","personally.","I","told","my","family","of","our","visit-that","night","on","bus,","and","they","were","happy","too;","happy","that","I"]},{"text":"had met and spoken with so fine a man. To my students in school I mentioned only that I had met and talked with a man from Taiwan.","tokens":["had","met","and","spoken","with","so","fine","a","man.","To","my","students","in","school","I","mentioned","only","that","I","had","met","and","talked","with","a","man","from","Taiwan."]},{"text":"Being a teacher of Geography, I made very sure that each child learned something about Taiwan, where it is, its population, products, and what little I know of its beauties.","tokens":["Being","a","teacher","of","Geography,","I","made","very","sure","that","each","child","learned","something","about","Taiwan,","where","it","is,","its","population,","products,","and","what","little","I","know","of","its","beauties."]},{"text":"I wish that you could speak to my class! What a treat that world be! I take genuine pleasure in recommending Mr. Joseph Chen as office manager in your organization.","tokens":["I","wish","that","you","could","speak","to","my","class!","What","a","treat","that","world","be!","I","take","genuine","pleasure","in","recommending","Mr.","Joseph","Chen","as","office","manager","in","your","organization."]},{"text":"For many years I have known him personally, as well as his family, and during his five years in business I have follow- ed his progress with much interest.","tokens":["For","many","years","I","have","known","him","personally,","as","well","as","his","family,","and","during","his","five","years","in","business","I","have","follow-","ed","his","progress","with","much","interest."]},{"text":"He is a young man of culture and education. I honestly believe that your firm would be fortunate in obtaining his service. I am giving this letter to Howard Wu a very good friend of mine.","tokens":["He","is","a","young","man","of","culture","and","education.","I","honestly","believe","that","your","firm","would","be","fortunate","in","obtaining","his","service.","I","am","giving","this","letter","to","Howard","Wu","a","very","good","friend","of","mine."]},{"text":"He is going to be in Cincinnati to live with his uncle for some time, and I urge him to pay a visit to you.","tokens":["He","is","going","to","be","in","Cincinnati","to","live","with","his","uncle","for","some","time,","and","I","urge","him","to","pay","a","visit","to","you."]},{"text":"Howard is a handsome and talented young man and I feel certain you will enjoy to meet him. He has never been in the United States; and I'll be very grateful for any help and advice you can give him.","tokens":["Howard","is","a","handsome","and","talented","young","man","and","I","feel","certain","you","will","enjoy","to","meet","him.","He","has","never","been","in","the","United","States;","and","I'll","be","very","grateful","for","any","help","and","advice","you","can","give","him."]},{"text":"I know he, too, will deeply appreciate any courtesy. My sister-in-law, Jane Liu, will be in Chicago all next week at the Plaza Hotel.","tokens":["I","know","he,","too,","will","deeply","appreciate","any","courtesy.","My","sister-in-law,","Jane","Liu,","will","be","in","Chicago","all","next","week","at","the","Plaza","Hotel."]},{"text":"I've often wanted you two to meet, and this seems like the ideal opportunity. Jane is at the research board of Kuo Hwa Advertising Agency.","tokens":["I've","often","wanted","you","two","to","meet,","and","this","seems","like","the","ideal","opportunity.","Jane","is","at","the","research","board","of","Kuo","Hwa","Advertising","Agency."]},{"text":"I told her about the book Mr. Chen is writing on the Market Survey and she was completely fascinated-as I know she would be!","tokens":["I","told","her","about","the","book","Mr.","Chen","is","writing","on","the","Market","Survey","and","she","was","completely","fascinated-as","I","know","she","would","be!"]},{"text":"She said she'd like to know more about the American marketing situations; and I think your husband and you might find it interesting to talk with her.","tokens":["She","said","she'd","like","to","know","more","about","the","American","marketing","situations;","and","I","think","your","husband","and","you","might","find","it","interesting","to","talk","with","her."]},{"text":"So call her if you can-but not if it's an inconvenience. If she doesn't hear from you, she'll understand that it's because you both are tied up.","tokens":["So","call","her","if","you","can-but","not","if","it's","an","inconvenience.","If","she","doesn't","hear","from","you,","she'll","understand","that","it's","because","you","both","are","tied","up."]},{"text":"I suggest this meeting only because I know you and she are bound to enjly each other's company. Please forward my kindest regards to Mr.","tokens":["I","suggest","this","meeting","only","because","I","know","you","and","she","are","bound","to","enjly","each","other's","company.","Please","forward","my","kindest","regards","to","Mr."]},{"text":"Chen. I take liberty of asking you to interest yourself in my son. I am very desirous of obtaining a clerkship for him and entertain the hope that you would perhaps kindly remember if a vacancy should occur in your","tokens":["Chen.","I","take","liberty","of","asking","you","to","interest","yourself","in","my","son.","I","am","very","desirous","of","obtaining","a","clerkship","for","him","and","entertain","the","hope","that","you","would","perhaps","kindly","remember","if","a","vacancy","should","occur","in","your"]},{"text":"bank. Although I am aware you must have many applications of this nature, I can- not resist taking the chance of its being in your power to do something for us in this way.","tokens":["bank.","Although","I","am","aware","you","must","have","many","applications","of","this","nature,","I","can-","not","resist","taking","the","chance","of","its","being","in","your","power","to","do","something","for","us","in","this","way."]},{"text":"Attached to this letter is a brief statement of his exper- iences and I hope you will like to have it. How grateful I should be if you would consider this request.","tokens":["Attached","to","this","letter","is","a","brief","statement","of","his","exper-","iences","and","I","hope","you","will","like","to","have","it.","How","grateful","I","should","be","if","you","would","consider","this","request."]},{"text":"I beg to certify that Miss Annie Lu for three years a teacher English in this institution, that she has shown diligence and ability in the dis- charge of her duties, and that she has enjoyed the esteem alike of","tokens":["I","beg","to","certify","that","Miss","Annie","Lu","for","three","years","a","teacher","English","in","this","institution,","that","she","has","shown","diligence","and","ability","in","the","dis-","charge","of","her","duties,","and","that","she","has","enjoyed","the","esteem","alike","of"]},{"text":"her colleagues and pupils. Miss Lu was a student in several of my courses during her undergraduate career at National Cheng Kung University between 1974 and 1978, and in those courses she distinguished herself by the qua- lity of her","tokens":["her","colleagues","and","pupils.","Miss","Lu","was","a","student","in","several","of","my","courses","during","her","undergraduate","career","at","National","Cheng","Kung","University","between","1974","and","1978,","and","in","those","courses","she","distinguished","herself","by","the","qua-","lity","of","her"]},{"text":"analytical ability. In extra-curricular activities, her per- formance we equally impressive. Taiwan-based Hualon says the factory will employ 1,800 people when completed in nine years' time and produce both dye and fabrics for the EU and American markets, substitution imports","tokens":["analytical","ability.","In","extra-curricular","activities,","her","per-","formance","we","equally","impressive.","Taiwan-based","Hualon","says","the","factory","will","employ","1,800","people","when","completed","in","nine","years'","time","and","produce","both","dye","and","fabrics","for","the","EU","and","American","markets,","substitution","imports"]},{"text":"from the Far East which are subject to trade quotas. But the prospect of more jobs in an economy with an unemployment rate of more than 13 percent has been tempered by misgivings over the factory's economic justification raised in","tokens":["from","the","Far","East","which","are","subject","to","trade","quotas.","But","the","prospect","of","more","jobs","in","an","economy","with","an","unemployment","rate","of","more","than","13","percent","has","been","tempered","by","misgivings","over","the","factory's","economic","justification","raised","in"]},{"text":"articles in the respected Financial Times of London. It argued that the market for synthetic fabrics in Europe was shrink- ing and said the European Commission, which vets state-aided projects, had only reluctantly approved it because of heavy political pressure from Lon- don.","tokens":["articles","in","the","respected","Financial","Times","of","London.","It","argued","that","the","market","for","synthetic","fabrics","in","Europe","was","shrink-","ing","and","said","the","European","Commission,","which","vets","state-aided","projects,","had","only","reluctantly","approved","it","because","of","heavy","political","pressure","from","Lon-","don."]}]},"T25":{"key":"T25","title":"T25 Taking exercise is good for our health.…","paras":[{"text":"Taking exercise is good for our health. By taking exercise, we can relax our body and mind. We'll be in good spirits afterwards and then can work better.","tokens":["Taking","exercise","is","good","for","our","health.","By","taking","exercise,","we","can","relax","our","body","and","mind.","We'll","be","in","good","spirits","afterwards","and","then","can","work","better."]},{"text":"At the same time, we can strengthen our muscles and trim our figures. If we don't take exercise for long, we may easily fall ill or get fat.","tokens":["At","the","same","time,","we","can","strengthen","our","muscles","and","trim","our","figures.","If","we","don't","take","exercise","for","long,","we","may","easily","fall","ill","or","get","fat."]},{"text":"I enjoy several outdoor sports. To begin with, I like swimming in the sea. Swimming itself is not only a survival skill but a good way to put all the muscles at play.","tokens":["I","enjoy","several","outdoor","sports.","To","begin","with,","I","like","swimming","in","the","sea.","Swimming","itself","is","not","only","a","survival","skill","but","a","good","way","to","put","all","the","muscles","at","play."]},{"text":"Swimming in the sea is especially enjoyable, since you're close to nature and away from the crowds in a swimming pool. Playing badminton is also fun.","tokens":["Swimming","in","the","sea","is","especially","enjoyable,","since","you're","close","to","nature","and","away","from","the","crowds","in","a","swimming","pool.","Playing","badminton","is","also","fun."]},{"text":"It is a sport for my whole family. Early in the morning, my parents and I like to seek a quiet place in the nearby park for playing badminton.","tokens":["It","is","a","sport","for","my","whole","family.","Early","in","the","morning,","my","parents","and","I","like","to","seek","a","quiet","place","in","the","nearby","park","for","playing","badminton."]},{"text":"Besides, I enjoy dancing. Social dance is graceful but what really appeals to me is aerobics. I always sweat a lot and feel good about myself after a rigorous workout.","tokens":["Besides,","I","enjoy","dancing.","Social","dance","is","graceful","but","what","really","appeals","to","me","is","aerobics.","I","always","sweat","a","lot","and","feel","good","about","myself","after","a","rigorous","workout."]},{"text":"I've always been a basketball fan since my childhoods. I've been crazy about such NBA superstars as Michael Jordan, Magic Johnson, Chamber- lain, and so on.","tokens":["I've","always","been","a","basketball","fan","since","my","childhoods.","I've","been","crazy","about","such","NBA","superstars","as","Michael","Jordan,","Magic","Johnson,","Chamber-","lain,","and","so","on."]},{"text":"Even though I am only medium in height and build, I prac- tice playing basketball a lot and luckily I was picked as a member on my school team.","tokens":["Even","though","I","am","only","medium","in","height","and","build,","I","prac-","tice","playing","basketball","a","lot","and","luckily","I","was","picked","as","a","member","on","my","school","team."]},{"text":"We have a very strong basketball team in the northern school district and received several championships in the basketball tournaments. It takes a great deal of strength and skill to play basketball well.","tokens":["We","have","a","very","strong","basketball","team","in","the","northern","school","district","and","received","several","championships","in","the","basketball","tournaments.","It","takes","a","great","deal","of","strength","and","skill","to","play","basketball","well."]},{"text":"Certainly, the more you practice, the better skill you will have. Because of my height, I play front. As a front, I have to cover my teammates, or block or opponents.","tokens":["Certainly,","the","more","you","practice,","the","better","skill","you","will","have.","Because","of","my","height,","I","play","front.","As","a","front,","I","have","to","cover","my","teammates,","or","block","or","opponents."]},{"text":"I am good at dribbling and I am also a nice three- point shooter. Basketball is my favorite sport, and most importantly, I make some friends by playing games on the court.","tokens":["I","am","good","at","dribbling","and","I","am","also","a","nice","three-","point","shooter.","Basketball","is","my","favorite","sport,","and","most","importantly,","I","make","some","friends","by","playing","games","on","the","court."]},{"text":"The traffic problems in Taiwan have become more and more serious be- cause some people don't abide by traffic rules. Many terrible accidents result from reckless driving.","tokens":["The","traffic","problems","in","Taiwan","have","become","more","and","more","serious","be-","cause","some","people","don't","abide","by","traffic","rules.","Many","terrible","accidents","result","from","reckless","driving."]},{"text":"Let's take a look at what's happening on the streets. Drunk drivers weave in and out, showing no respect for (to) other people's lives.","tokens":["Let's","take","a","look","at","what's","happening","on","the","streets.","Drunk","drivers","weave","in","and","out,","showing","no","respect","for","(to)","other","people's","lives."]},{"text":"Speeding is forbidden but is (a) common practice in Tai- wan. Pedestrians are at risk while jaywalking. The pervasive disregard of traffic regulations makes people killers or victims.","tokens":["Speeding","is","forbidden","but","is","(a)","common","practice","in","Tai-","wan.","Pedestrians","are","at","risk","while","jaywalking.","The","pervasive","disregard","of","traffic","regulations","makes","people","killers","or","victims."]},{"text":"Ensuring the safety of every citizen's life should become our top pri- ority. In my opinion, we should, first, severely punish those drivers or riders who don't obey traffic rules.","tokens":["Ensuring","the","safety","of","every","citizen's","life","should","become","our","top","pri-","ority.","In","my","opinion,","we","should,","first,","severely","punish","those","drivers","or","riders","who","don't","obey","traffic","rules."]},{"text":"Traffic violators are responsible for the confusion of the road. Next our law should be strictly enforced; thus, those drivers or motorcyclists will think twice before running (through) a red light or parking their cars at random.","tokens":["Traffic","violators","are","responsible","for","the","confusion","of","the","road.","Next","our","law","should","be","strictly","enforced;","thus,","those","drivers","or","motorcyclists","will","think","twice","before","running","(through)","a","red","light","or","parking","their","cars","at","random."]},{"text":"As for pedestrians, they should not jaywalk at will, or they should be punished too. In all, only through the cooperation of both the driver and the pedestrian can safer traffic conditions be achieved.","tokens":["As","for","pedestrians,","they","should","not","jaywalk","at","will,","or","they","should","be","punished","too.","In","all,","only","through","the","cooperation","of","both","the","driver","and","the","pedestrian","can","safer","traffic","conditions","be","achieved."]},{"text":"Our environment is danger of serious pollution. However, many alar- ming reports in newspapers seem to have little effect on the offenders. As we know, most rivers in Taiwan today are polluted and the marine life is endangered, but still","tokens":["Our","environment","is","danger","of","serious","pollution.","However,","many","alar-","ming","reports","in","newspapers","seem","to","have","little","effect","on","the","offenders.","As","we","know,","most","rivers","in","Taiwan","today","are","polluted","and","the","marine","life","is","endangered,","but","still"]},{"text":"many factories and families discharge chemical and human waste into the rivers. Also, more and more people are suffering from respiratory diseases but cars and factories still keep emitting smoke.","tokens":["many","factories","and","families","discharge","chemical","and","human","waste","into","the","rivers.","Also,","more","and","more","people","are","suffering","from","respiratory","diseases","but","cars","and","factories","still","keep","emitting","smoke."]},{"text":"What's worse, piles of garbage have been an eyesore and a nuisance (a source of epidemics (diseases)) but so far we haven't done much about it.","tokens":["What's","worse,","piles","of","garbage","have","been","an","eyesore","and","a","nuisance","(a","source","of","epidemics","(diseases))","but","so","far","we","haven't","done","much","about","it."]},{"text":"[Taiwn has been polluted to such a degree that many people cannot stand it and some of them bring up several methods to improve this.]","tokens":["[Taiwn","has","been","polluted","to","such","a","degree","that","many","people","cannot","stand","it","and","some","of","them","bring","up","several","methods","to","improve","this.]"]},{"text":"There are many ways for us to protect our environment. First, every- one should share the consensus (/have a common sense) that environmental protection is everybody's business.","tokens":["There","are","many","ways","for","us","to","protect","our","environment.","First,","every-","one","should","share","the","consensus","(/have","a","common","sense)","that","environmental","protection","is","everybody's","business."]},{"text":"Besides, engineers as well as our government should find out the pollution sources and think (figure) out proper ways to halt the pollution. Finally, strict anti-pollution laws should be passed and enforced as soon as possible and heavy fines should","tokens":["Besides,","engineers","as","well","as","our","government","should","find","out","the","pollution","sources","and","think","(figure)","out","proper","ways","to","halt","the","pollution.","Finally,","strict","anti-pollution","laws","should","be","passed","and","enforced","as","soon","as","possible","and","heavy","fines","should"]},{"text":"be imposed on those offenders. A clean and healthy environment is good for everyone and it is a goal that we should work hard for.","tokens":["be","imposed","on","those","offenders.","A","clean","and","healthy","environment","is","good","for","everyone","and","it","is","a","goal","that","we","should","work","hard","for."]},{"text":"Food is not cooked on the airplane. It is cooked either in the air- line's own kirchens located near the airports or by special caterers in different cities.","tokens":["Food","is","not","cooked","on","the","airplane.","It","is","cooked","either","in","the","air-","line's","own","kirchens","located","near","the","airports","or","by","special","caterers","in","different","cities."]},{"text":"Private catering companies deliver the prepared meals to the airplanes, where they are help warm and ready to serve in the galley of each plane.","tokens":["Private","catering","companies","deliver","the","prepared","meals","to","the","airplanes,","where","they","are","help","warm","and","ready","to","serve","in","the","galley","of","each","plane."]},{"text":"Miss Wang turns on the public address system to speak to the pass- engers. \"We will be passing out special immigration and custom declaration cards to all of you.","tokens":["Miss","Wang","turns","on","the","public","address","system","to","speak","to","the","pass-","engers.","\"We","will","be","passing","out","special","immigration","and","custom","declaration","cards","to","all","of","you."]},{"text":"Please fill these out before we land. You must give them to the immigration and customs officials at the airport. We'll be happy to help you fill them out, thank you.\"","tokens":["Please","fill","these","out","before","we","land.","You","must","give","them","to","the","immigration","and","customs","officials","at","the","airport.","We'll","be","happy","to","help","you","fill","them","out,","thank","you.\""]},{"text":"On most commercial airlines, announcements to passengers are in English. When the plane belongs to the airline of a country where another language is spoken.","tokens":["On","most","commercial","airlines,","announcements","to","passengers","are","in","English.","When","the","plane","belongs","to","the","airline","of","a","country","where","another","language","is","spoken."]},{"text":"The declaration cards ask for information about the passengers that is needed by the immigration and tourism officials. Smith denied the charges in 1,000-work letter to the paper and said yesterday that he had \"every confidence in Hualon\" and added:","tokens":["The","declaration","cards","ask","for","information","about","the","passengers","that","is","needed","by","the","immigration","and","tourism","officials.","Smith","denied","the","charges","in","1,000-work","letter","to","the","paper","and","said","yesterday","that","he","had","\"every","confidence","in","Hualon\"","and","added:"]},{"text":"\"every pro- ject IDB supports involves a degree of risk.\" The factory mirrors a similar Hualon operation in Malaysia but the company believes competitive power and land costs will outweigh the fact that northern Ireland labor costs are 15 percent","tokens":["\"every","pro-","ject","IDB","supports","involves","a","degree","of","risk.\"","The","factory","mirrors","a","similar","Hualon","operation","in","Malaysia","but","the","company","believes","competitive","power","and","land","costs","will","outweigh","the","fact","that","northern","Ireland","labor","costs","are","15","percent"]},{"text":"higher than in Asia and give it a European foothold. We are quite certain that we can produce products here that will be internationally competitive for Europe and the US, Hualon Vice-chairman Andrew Oung told a news conference.","tokens":["higher","than","in","Asia","and","give","it","a","European","foothold.","We","are","quite","certain","that","we","can","produce","products","here","that","will","be","internationally","competitive","for","Europe","and","the","US,","Hualon","Vice-chairman","Andrew","Oung","told","a","news","conference."]}]},"T26":{"key":"T26","title":"T26 If I were a millionair (billionaire), I…","paras":[{"text":"If I were a millionair (billionaire), I would divide my wealth into two parts so that I can do what I desire to do.","tokens":["If","I","were","a","millionair","(billionaire),","I","would","divide","my","wealth","into","two","parts","so","that","I","can","do","what","I","desire","to","do."]},{"text":"With the first part of money, I would try to make my life better. First, I would buy a personal computer. In this modern world, a PC is necessary for the people who want to learn the latest information.","tokens":["With","the","first","part","of","money,","I","would","try","to","make","my","life","better.","First,","I","would","buy","a","personal","computer.","In","this","modern","world,","a","PC","is","necessary","for","the","people","who","want","to","learn","the","latest","information."]},{"text":"Besides, a student can educate himself/ herself through the help of many useful softwares. Second, I would buy good dictionaries and books worth reading, through which I can not only improve my grades but also broaden my vision.","tokens":["Besides,","a","student","can","educate","himself/","herself","through","the","help","of","many","useful","softwares.","Second,","I","would","buy","good","dictionaries","and","books","worth","reading,","through","which","I","can","not","only","improve","my","grades","but","also","broaden","my","vision."]},{"text":"Third, I would decorate my study to have myself a comfortable and pleasant place where I could read efficiently. With the rest part of money, I would try my best to help the weak and needy people.","tokens":["Third,","I","would","decorate","my","study","to","have","myself","a","comfortable","and","pleasant","place","where","I","could","read","efficiently.","With","the","rest","part","of","money,","I","would","try","my","best","to","help","the","weak","and","needy","people."]},{"text":"It is a good idea to build a hospital to take care of the people who are sick and a school to educate the youth who could not afford to go to school.","tokens":["It","is","a","good","idea","to","build","a","hospital","to","take","care","of","the","people","who","are","sick","and","a","school","to","educate","the","youth","who","could","not","afford","to","go","to","school."]},{"text":"As regards the orphans, they are help-less so that I would raise a fund for them to improve their life. Also, I would contri- bute some money to a charity fund to do more social work.","tokens":["As","regards","the","orphans,","they","are","help-less","so","that","I","would","raise","a","fund","for","them","to","improve","their","life.","Also,","I","would","contri-","bute","some","money","to","a","charity","fund","to","do","more","social","work."]},{"text":"In addition, if my friends were in need of financial aid, I would help them as much as I could. (All) in all, were I a millionaire (billionaire), I would do a lot of good things to make sure that","tokens":["In","addition,","if","my","friends","were","in","need","of","financial","aid,","I","would","help","them","as","much","as","I","could.","(All)","in","all,","were","I","a","millionaire","(billionaire),","I","would","do","a","lot","of","good","things","to","make","sure","that"]},{"text":"I would not live my life in vain. If I were given a million dollars, I would first buy my father a set of hi-fi stereo.","tokens":["I","would","not","live","my","life","in","vain.","If","I","were","given","a","million","dollars,","I","would","first","buy","my","father","a","set","of","hi-fi","stereo."]},{"text":"Father is every inch a classical music fan but he listens to it on the radio. You can imagine how awful a magnificent piece of music could turn out!","tokens":["Father","is","every","inch","a","classical","music","fan","but","he","listens","to","it","on","the","radio.","You","can","imagine","how","awful","a","magnificent","piece","of","music","could","turn","out!"]},{"text":"Sound distortions always ruin the joy and in-between com- mercials spoil the continuity of a symphony. If I had so much money, I would use a certain amount of it to buy Father a good set of stereo with high","tokens":["Sound","distortions","always","ruin","the","joy","and","in-between","com-","mercials","spoil","the","continuity","of","a","symphony.","If","I","had","so","much","money,","I","would","use","a","certain","amount","of","it","to","buy","Father","a","good","set","of","stereo","with","high"]},{"text":"fidelity and crystal-clear sound effects. As you pass by the railway station, you'll probably see some handi- capped people begging for money under the sun or in the rain.","tokens":["fidelity","and","crystal-clear","sound","effects.","As","you","pass","by","the","railway","station,","you'll","probably","see","some","handi-","capped","people","begging","for","money","under","the","sun","or","in","the","rain."]},{"text":"You'll see elder people strolling around, with emptiness in their eyes. Also, there are some homeless lying around. So if I were a millionaire, I would let the handicapped be taken good care of.","tokens":["You'll","see","elder","people","strolling","around,","with","emptiness","in","their","eyes.","Also,","there","are","some","homeless","lying","around.","So","if","I","were","a","millionaire,","I","would","let","the","handicapped","be","taken","good","care","of."]},{"text":"I would build shelters for the homeless and well-equipped elderly homes for the elders and I would build shelters for the homeless and well-equipped elderly homes for the elders and I would set up a good education program for the","tokens":["I","would","build","shelters","for","the","homeless","and","well-equipped","elderly","homes","for","the","elders","and","I","would","build","shelters","for","the","homeless","and","well-equipped","elderly","homes","for","the","elders","and","I","would","set","up","a","good","education","program","for","the"]},{"text":"homeless teenagers so that can start on their own someday. With the money I have, I hope I could build a brighter future for the poor and needy people around me.","tokens":["homeless","teenagers","so","that","can","start","on","their","own","someday.","With","the","money","I","have,","I","hope","I","could","build","a","brighter","future","for","the","poor","and","needy","people","around","me."]},{"text":"After five strong quakes Monday, northern Taiwan was jolted again yes- terday (May 24) with four more, including one that registered a 6.2 on the Richter scale around noon, the Central Weather Bureau said.","tokens":["After","five","strong","quakes","Monday,","northern","Taiwan","was","jolted","again","yes-","terday","(May","24)","with","four","more,","including","one","that","registered","a","6.2","on","the","Richter","scale","around","noon,","the","Central","Weather","Bureau","said."]},{"text":"In addition to the large quakes, there have been more than 300 minor earthquakes that could not be felt without sensors during a 32-hour period stretching from early Monday until last night.","tokens":["In","addition","to","the","large","quakes,","there","have","been","more","than","300","minor","earthquakes","that","could","not","be","felt","without","sensors","during","a","32-hour","period","stretching","from","early","Monday","until","last","night."]},{"text":"The first of yesterday's four strong quakes measured 6.2 on the Rich- ter scale, shaking northern Taiwan at 12:04 p.m. Just 9 minutes later, the second quake struck, measuring 5.3 on the scale.","tokens":["The","first","of","yesterday's","four","strong","quakes","measured","6.2","on","the","Rich-","ter","scale,","shaking","northern","Taiwan","at","12:04","p.m.","Just","9","minutes","later,","the","second","quake","struck,","measuring","5.3","on","the","scale."]},{"text":"The third quake struck 25 minutes later, measuring 5.5 on the scale. Then at 1:48 p.m. the fourth one hit, measuring 5.7 on the scale.","tokens":["The","third","quake","struck","25","minutes","later,","measuring","5.5","on","the","scale.","Then","at","1:48","p.m.","the","fourth","one","hit,","measuring","5.7","on","the","scale."]},{"text":"Almost all nine of the earthquakes felt on Monday and Tuesday were centered about 100 km off the coast of Hualien, bureau officials said.","tokens":["Almost","all","nine","of","the","earthquakes","felt","on","Monday","and","Tuesday","were","centered","about","100","km","off","the","coast","of","Hualien,","bureau","officials","said."]},{"text":"On May 20, 1986, an earthquake struck 15 km northwest of Hualien. That quake killed one person and injured 11. People fear this week's spate of earthquakes indicates a Big one is coming.","tokens":["On","May","20,","1986,","an","earthquake","struck","15","km","northwest","of","Hualien.","That","quake","killed","one","person","and","injured","11.","People","fear","this","week's","spate","of","earthquakes","indicates","a","Big","one","is","coming."]},{"text":"But Yeh Yung-tien, director of the Graduate School of Seismology at Chungcheng University, said this continuous earthquake activity off the coast of Hualien was normal.","tokens":["But","Yeh","Yung-tien,","director","of","the","Graduate","School","of","Seismology","at","Chungcheng","University,","said","this","continuous","earthquake","activity","off","the","coast","of","Hualien","was","normal."]},{"text":"There were reports of falling stones around Sanhsia area, northern Taiwan, but no casualties were reported. Yesterday's first quake measured 3 on the Richter scale in Taipei.","tokens":["There","were","reports","of","falling","stones","around","Sanhsia","area,","northern","Taiwan,","but","no","casualties","were","reported.","Yesterday's","first","quake","measured","3","on","the","Richter","scale","in","Taipei."]},{"text":"Many citizens were alarmed by it. De- partment of Rapid Transit Systems employees who work on the 13th floor of their building were screaming.","tokens":["Many","citizens","were","alarmed","by","it.","De-","partment","of","Rapid","Transit","Systems","employees","who","work","on","the","13th","floor","of","their","building","were","screaming."]},{"text":"So were city employees who work in the new city hall near the World Trade Center. Yeh Cheng, assistant manager of Howard Shyline Restaurant on the 44th and 45th floors of the 51-story Shin Kong Mitsukoshi building, Taiwan's tallest building,","tokens":["So","were","city","employees","who","work","in","the","new","city","hall","near","the","World","Trade","Center.","Yeh","Cheng,","assistant","manager","of","Howard","Shyline","Restaurant","on","the","44th","and","45th","floors","of","the","51-story","Shin","Kong","Mitsukoshi","building,","Taiwan's","tallest","building,"]},{"text":"on Chunghsiao West Road, said the shaking \"felt like I was in a cradle.\" One of nature's most terrifying forces is a powerful earthquake.","tokens":["on","Chunghsiao","West","Road,","said","the","shaking","\"felt","like","I","was","in","a","cradle.\"","One","of","nature's","most","terrifying","forces","is","a","powerful","earthquake."]},{"text":"A severe tremble will cause a nearly complete sense of helplessness. It would seem there is nothing you can do but pray that you will survive.","tokens":["A","severe","tremble","will","cause","a","nearly","complete","sense","of","helplessness.","It","would","seem","there","is","nothing","you","can","do","but","pray","that","you","will","survive."]},{"text":"But, in fact, there are several steps you can take, before, during and after a quake, which will help assure your survival. If you live in an area prone to earthquakes you should prepare in ad- vance a survival kit","tokens":["But,","in","fact,","there","are","several","steps","you","can","take,","before,","during","and","after","a","quake,","which","will","help","assure","your","survival.","If","you","live","in","an","area","prone","to","earthquakes","you","should","prepare","in","ad-","vance","a","survival","kit"]},{"text":"consisting of fresh water, first-aid supplies, and canned goods. It is also helpful to have a plan of action for an evacu- ation procedure, then; in the event of an actual earthquake, you should take shelter under a desk or","tokens":["consisting","of","fresh","water,","first-aid","supplies,","and","canned","goods.","It","is","also","helpful","to","have","a","plan","of","action","for","an","evacu-","ation","procedure,","then;","in","the","event","of","an","actual","earthquake,","you","should","take","shelter","under","a","desk","or"]},{"text":"table, away from windows, or alternatively, under a door frame. When the tremor has ended, if it is a major quake, you should turn off your source of gas, as this is a dangerous fire threat a dangerous fire threat","tokens":["table,","away","from","windows,","or","alternatively,","under","a","door","frame.","When","the","tremor","has","ended,","if","it","is","a","major","quake,","you","should","turn","off","your","source","of","gas,","as","this","is","a","dangerous","fire","threat","a","dangerous","fire","threat"]},{"text":"and post-earthquake fires can be as damaging as the quake itself. If taken, these steps can help you live through a major earthquake. Israel Radio said some 200 freed prisoners arrived in the autonomous Gaza Strip by early evening.","tokens":["and","post-earthquake","fires","can","be","as","damaging","as","the","quake","itself.","If","taken,","these","steps","can","help","you","live","through","a","major","earthquake.","Israel","Radio","said","some","200","freed","prisoners","arrived","in","the","autonomous","Gaza","Strip","by","early","evening."]},{"text":"The Mandela Institute, an East Jerusalem- based Palestinian watchdog group, said Israel has freed only some 2,000 of the 5,000 prisoners it had agreed to release by now.","tokens":["The","Mandela","Institute,","an","East","Jerusalem-","based","Palestinian","watchdog","group,","said","Israel","has","freed","only","some","2,000","of","the","5,000","prisoners","it","had","agreed","to","release","by","now."]},{"text":"The agreements on prisoner releases were part of the Gaza/Jericho autonomy accord signed May 4 in Cairo.","tokens":["The","agreements","on","prisoner","releases","were","part","of","the","Gaza/Jericho","autonomy","accord","signed","May","4","in","Cairo."]}]},"T27":{"key":"T27","title":"T27 I often went to the municipal library…","paras":[{"text":"I often went to the municipal library to review schoolwork on Wednes- day night. Last Wed after studying, I happened to meet a friend in the street.","tokens":["I","often","went","to","the","municipal","library","to","review","schoolwork","on","Wednes-","day","night.","Last","Wed","after","studying,","I","happened","to","meet","a","friend","in","the","street."]},{"text":"We had a wonderful time together until I found it would be too late to catch the last bus if we kept chatting. When I got on the bus, I found there were only four passengers.","tokens":["We","had","a","wonderful","time","together","until","I","found","it","would","be","too","late","to","catch","the","last","bus","if","we","kept","chatting.","When","I","got","on","the","bus,","I","found","there","were","only","four","passengers."]},{"text":"All of them got off on the way while my destination was still far away. It was the terminal. The bus driver began to behave strangely.","tokens":["All","of","them","got","off","on","the","way","while","my","destination","was","still","far","away.","It","was","the","terminal.","The","bus","driver","began","to","behave","strangely."]},{"text":"First, he drove at too low a speed and turned off the light in the bus. Then he began to talk to me rudely and cracked several dirty jokes.","tokens":["First,","he","drove","at","too","low","a","speed","and","turned","off","the","light","in","the","bus.","Then","he","began","to","talk","to","me","rudely","and","cracked","several","dirty","jokes."]},{"text":"I was frightened. I searched my mind what to do. We were still on the road and though it was near midnight, the streets were still brightened by car lights and neon- lights.","tokens":["I","was","frightened.","I","searched","my","mind","what","to","do.","We","were","still","on","the","road","and","though","it","was","near","midnight,","the","streets","were","still","brightened","by","car","lights","and","neon-","lights."]},{"text":"I pulled the bell strap and sternly wanted him to let me get off at the next stop. My attitude was serious because I did not want to let him sense my fear.","tokens":["I","pulled","the","bell","strap","and","sternly","wanted","him","to","let","me","get","off","at","the","next","stop.","My","attitude","was","serious","because","I","did","not","want","to","let","him","sense","my","fear."]},{"text":"Perhaps my stern attitude prevented his further bother- ing (harassment). The fat, ugly-looking bus driver let me off. I felt relieved. Then I called my father to pick me up.","tokens":["Perhaps","my","stern","attitude","prevented","his","further","bother-","ing","(harassment).","The","fat,","ugly-looking","bus","driver","let","me","off.","I","felt","relieved.","Then","I","called","my","father","to","pick","me","up."]},{"text":"I do not dare to imagine what would happen to me if the bus driver was as fierce and abnormal as those criminals described in the newspaper.","tokens":["I","do","not","dare","to","imagine","what","would","happen","to","me","if","the","bus","driver","was","as","fierce","and","abnormal","as","those","criminals","described","in","the","newspaper."]},{"text":"From then on, I still go to library but I know better than to take the last bus home. I live in Shu-Lin and I am a commuter because my school is in Taipei.","tokens":["From","then","on,","I","still","go","to","library","but","I","know","better","than","to","take","the","last","bus","home.","I","live","in","Shu-Lin","and","I","am","a","commuter","because","my","school","is","in","Taipei."]},{"text":"I have to take a train to school six days a week. Usually there is no big trouble in the early morning when I go out from Shu-Lin.","tokens":["I","have","to","take","a","train","to","school","six","days","a","week.","Usually","there","is","no","big","trouble","in","the","early","morning","when","I","go","out","from","Shu-Lin."]},{"text":"But it is hell- like when I come home after school. The train is always overcrowded like the horrible scene in Tokyo Train Station where the passengers are pushed from the door by a \"push-man.\"","tokens":["But","it","is","hell-","like","when","I","come","home","after","school.","The","train","is","always","overcrowded","like","the","horrible","scene","in","Tokyo","Train","Station","where","the","passengers","are","pushed","from","the","door","by","a","\"push-man.\""]},{"text":"Taipei Train Station is no better than that. Even worse, people are ruder and the ait-conditioning is worse. In winter, I would make light of the discomfort by telling myself that it is warmer to stick together.","tokens":["Taipei","Train","Station","is","no","better","than","that.","Even","worse,","people","are","ruder","and","the","ait-conditioning","is","worse.","In","winter,","I","would","make","light","of","the","discomfort","by","telling","myself","that","it","is","warmer","to","stick","together."]},{"text":"But during the summer, all the oily, sticky and stinky bodies make up a horrible and \"steamy\" sight! One day, I rushed to the station after school, hoping I would have a seat if I could arrive the platform earlier.","tokens":["But","during","the","summer,","all","the","oily,","sticky","and","stinky","bodies","make","up","a","horrible","and","\"steamy\"","sight!","One","day,","I","rushed","to","the","station","after","school,","hoping","I","would","have","a","seat","if","I","could","arrive","the","platform","earlier."]},{"text":"But many people were already there like ants. I was pushed in and kept being pushed all the way toward the back. Suddenly, someone stepped on my left shoe and it got stuck and left out as I pulled back","tokens":["But","many","people","were","already","there","like","ants.","I","was","pushed","in","and","kept","being","pushed","all","the","way","toward","the","back.","Suddenly,","someone","stepped","on","my","left","shoe","and","it","got","stuck","and","left","out","as","I","pulled","back"]},{"text":"my left foot. It was so packed that it was im- possible for me to turn around and bend to pick it. Nevertheless, the whole crowd kept moving forward like a river of no return.","tokens":["my","left","foot.","It","was","so","packed","that","it","was","im-","possible","for","me","to","turn","around","and","bend","to","pick","it.","Nevertheless,","the","whole","crowd","kept","moving","forward","like","a","river","of","no","return."]},{"text":"I could not but yell: \"my shoe, my shoe!\" Somebody must hear and I heard him saying: \"I got it! But where are you?\"","tokens":["I","could","not","but","yell:","\"my","shoe,","my","shoe!\"","Somebody","must","hear","and","I","heard","him","saying:","\"I","got","it!","But","where","are","you?\""]},{"text":"I answered, \"Here, right in the back!\" After a few seconds, I saw my deformed shoe being passed by the passengers, one by one, until it reached me.","tokens":["I","answered,","\"Here,","right","in","the","back!\"","After","a","few","seconds,","I","saw","my","deformed","shoe","being","passed","by","the","passengers,","one","by","one,","until","it","reached","me."]},{"text":"I felt relieved and grateful and yet very em- barrassed. People grinned at me. That was really an unforgettable exper- ience. In order to make a good impression during a job interview, you need to prepare yourself for the interviews.","tokens":["I","felt","relieved","and","grateful","and","yet","very","em-","barrassed.","People","grinned","at","me.","That","was","really","an","unforgettable","exper-","ience.","In","order","to","make","a","good","impression","during","a","job","interview,","you","need","to","prepare","yourself","for","the","interviews."]},{"text":"You must arrive in plenty of time for the interview, so that you give yourself a little time to relax before the interview begins.","tokens":["You","must","arrive","in","plenty","of","time","for","the","interview,","so","that","you","give","yourself","a","little","time","to","relax","before","the","interview","begins."]},{"text":"You have to look your best for the interview. The impression you make as you walk into the room is very important. Try to find out if the com- pany or organization has any rules about dress.","tokens":["You","have","to","look","your","best","for","the","interview.","The","impression","you","make","as","you","walk","into","the","room","is","very","important.","Try","to","find","out","if","the","com-","pany","or","organization","has","any","rules","about","dress."]},{"text":"Then try to dress accord- ing to their regulations. If they don't allow their staff to come to work in casual clothes, you may ruin your chances for a job by wearing the wrong sort of clothes to the interview.","tokens":["Then","try","to","dress","accord-","ing","to","their","regulations.","If","they","don't","allow","their","staff","to","come","to","work","in","casual","clothes,","you","may","ruin","your","chances","for","a","job","by","wearing","the","wrong","sort","of","clothes","to","the","interview."]},{"text":"You also need to plan what you are going to say. In some interviews you will have to do a lot of talking, and in others you will only have to answer a few questions about your education and experience.","tokens":["You","also","need","to","plan","what","you","are","going","to","say.","In","some","interviews","you","will","have","to","do","a","lot","of","talking,","and","in","others","you","will","only","have","to","answer","a","few","questions","about","your","education","and","experience."]},{"text":"You need to have answers ready about yourself, your school work, your strong points, your reasons for applying for the job, and the salary you expect.","tokens":["You","need","to","have","answers","ready","about","yourself,","your","school","work,","your","strong","points,","your","reasons","for","applying","for","the","job,","and","the","salary","you","expect."]},{"text":"Air pollution has probably been with us since man discovered fird, but it did not begin to be a problem until men began living in towns and cities, and had many fires burning at the same time within a small","tokens":["Air","pollution","has","probably","been","with","us","since","man","discovered","fird,","but","it","did","not","begin","to","be","a","problem","until","men","began","living","in","towns","and","cities,","and","had","many","fires","burning","at","the","same","time","within","a","small"]},{"text":"area. Today, the air pollution problem is to found in every part of the world. We are told that policemen in Tokyo who direct cars during the busiest times of the day must stop to breathe pure oxygen from containers","tokens":["area.","Today,","the","air","pollution","problem","is","to","found","in","every","part","of","the","world.","We","are","told","that","policemen","in","Tokyo","who","direct","cars","during","the","busiest","times","of","the","day","must","stop","to","breathe","pure","oxygen","from","containers"]},{"text":"placed at street crossings. One of the greatest problems facing the world today is the recent spectacular increase in the human population. As a result the advance of medicine and the improvement in living standards, people are living longer lives,","tokens":["placed","at","street","crossings.","One","of","the","greatest","problems","facing","the","world","today","is","the","recent","spectacular","increase","in","the","human","population.","As","a","result","the","advance","of","medicine","and","the","improvement","in","living","standards,","people","are","living","longer","lives,"]},{"text":"and fewer infants are dying from disease. This, of course, is a gratifying development, but it means that the world population is increasing at a faster rate than are food supplies.","tokens":["and","fewer","infants","are","dying","from","disease.","This,","of","course,","is","a","gratifying","development,","but","it","means","that","the","world","population","is","increasing","at","a","faster","rate","than","are","food","supplies."]},{"text":"Some experts are very pessimistic and declare, that at the present rate of population increase, there will not be enough food for everybody within a hundred years.","tokens":["Some","experts","are","very","pessimistic","and","declare,","that","at","the","present","rate","of","population","increase,","there","will","not","be","enough","food","for","everybody","within","a","hundred","years."]},{"text":"John McGuckian, the IDB chairman, dismissed fears about the company caused by charges of insider trading against two of the Oung brothers whose family controls the company.","tokens":["John","McGuckian,","the","IDB","chairman,","dismissed","fears","about","the","company","caused","by","charges","of","insider","trading","against","two","of","the","Oung","brothers","whose","family","controls","the","company."]},{"text":"He said the charges were a matter of public knowledge and said neither man had anything to do with the project. \"Our misgivings are allayed.\"","tokens":["He","said","the","charges","were","a","matter","of","public","knowledge","and","said","neither","man","had","anything","to","do","with","the","project.","\"Our","misgivings","are","allayed.\""]},{"text":"Oung Ta-ming, a former group chairman, has appealed against a three- and-a-half-year jail sentence for insider trading and has since been elect- ed to Taiwan's parliament.","tokens":["Oung","Ta-ming,","a","former","group","chairman,","has","appealed","against","a","three-","and-a-half-year","jail","sentence","for","insider","trading","and","has","since","been","elect-","ed","to","Taiwan's","parliament."]},{"text":"Oung Ta-ming, chairman of the textile subsidiary, went to Malaysia and has not been tried. \"Hualon Corporation is a highly-rated world class com- pany,\" the IDB chairman said.","tokens":["Oung","Ta-ming,","chairman","of","the","textile","subsidiary,","went","to","Malaysia","and","has","not","been","tried.","\"Hualon","Corporation","is","a","highly-rated","world","class","com-","pany,\"","the","IDB","chairman","said."]}]},"T28":{"key":"T28","title":"T28 It seems that drugs have become a…","paras":[{"text":"It seems that drugs have become a plague in our society overnight. Not only does the number of the drug users keep increasing but their aver- age age has been going down.","tokens":["It","seems","that","drugs","have","become","a","plague","in","our","society","overnight.","Not","only","does","the","number","of","the","drug","users","keep","increasing","but","their","aver-","age","age","has","been","going","down."]},{"text":"However, the government has failed to keep pace with this growth in its efforts to treat these cases. Drug abuse often leads to crimes.","tokens":["However,","the","government","has","failed","to","keep","pace","with","this","growth","in","its","efforts","to","treat","these","cases.","Drug","abuse","often","leads","to","crimes."]},{"text":"Juvenile delinquency, for example, is an obvious one. Drugs can do alarming damage to both users and our society. Amphe- tamine, for instance, can harm cerebral nerve system.","tokens":["Juvenile","delinquency,","for","example,","is","an","obvious","one.","Drugs","can","do","alarming","damage","to","both","users","and","our","society.","Amphe-","tamine,","for","instance,","can","harm","cerebral","nerve","system."]},{"text":"And the illegal practice will threaten the supply of our future workforce. There is a hardest lesson in Chin-Dynasty when popular opium consumption (use) des- troyed the whole social morals.","tokens":["And","the","illegal","practice","will","threaten","the","supply","of","our","future","workforce.","There","is","a","hardest","lesson","in","Chin-Dynasty","when","popular","opium","consumption","(use)","des-","troyed","the","whole","social","morals."]},{"text":"It's time to call for a war on drugs. The authorities concerned need to make more determined efforts so that the illegal practice will decline eventually.","tokens":["It's","time","to","call","for","a","war","on","drugs.","The","authorities","concerned","need","to","make","more","determined","efforts","so","that","the","illegal","practice","will","decline","eventually."]},{"text":"One of the solutions is the imposition of the harsh penalty on drug trafficking. More important are efforts to help addicts kick the habit.","tokens":["One","of","the","solutions","is","the","imposition","of","the","harsh","penalty","on","drug","trafficking.","More","important","are","efforts","to","help","addicts","kick","the","habit."]},{"text":"To establish halfway houses for these addicts is necessary. The war on drugs will require (call for ) the efforts of all citizens. Quite a number of people had already lined up at the bus stop when I arrived.","tokens":["To","establish","halfway","houses","for","these","addicts","is","necessary.","The","war","on","drugs","will","require","(call","for",")","the","efforts","of","all","citizens.","Quite","a","number","of","people","had","already","lined","up","at","the","bus","stop","when","I","arrived."]},{"text":"I walked up to the end of the waiting line, and was soon follow- ed by many others. Twenty minutes passed. Finally, a bus with a full load of passengers slowed down and came to a stop in front of","tokens":["I","walked","up","to","the","end","of","the","waiting","line,","and","was","soon","follow-","ed","by","many","others.","Twenty","minutes","passed.","Finally,","a","bus","with","a","full","load","of","passengers","slowed","down","and","came","to","a","stop","in","front","of"]},{"text":"us. Some of the impatient peo- ple, breaking from the waiting line, rushed toward the bus. A couple of girl-students came out from no-where and pushed past me.","tokens":["us.","Some","of","the","impatient","peo-","ple,","breaking","from","the","waiting","line,","rushed","toward","the","bus.","A","couple","of","girl-students","came","out","from","no-where","and","pushed","past","me."]},{"text":"I was the last to get on board and was sandwiched between the door and one of that group of girls. That girl stood so close to me that I nearly smelled a slight pleasant fragrance of shampoo.","tokens":["I","was","the","last","to","get","on","board","and","was","sandwiched","between","the","door","and","one","of","that","group","of","girls.","That","girl","stood","so","close","to","me","that","I","nearly","smelled","a","slight","pleasant","fragrance","of","shampoo."]},{"text":"I felt my heart beat violently. Suddenly, the dri- ver put on the brakes at the intersection. All the passengers moved for- ward. That girl fell into my arms!","tokens":["I","felt","my","heart","beat","violently.","Suddenly,","the","dri-","ver","put","on","the","brakes","at","the","intersection.","All","the","passengers","moved","for-","ward.","That","girl","fell","into","my","arms!"]},{"text":"My right hand got stuck between im- movable bodies, so I used my left hand to help her up. I felt the softness of her body.","tokens":["My","right","hand","got","stuck","between","im-","movable","bodies,","so","I","used","my","left","hand","to","help","her","up.","I","felt","the","softness","of","her","body."]},{"text":"How I wish time would stand still at the very moment! To my disappointment, the girl quickly stood on her feet again and gave me an an- gry stare.","tokens":["How","I","wish","time","would","stand","still","at","the","very","moment!","To","my","disappointment,","the","girl","quickly","stood","on","her","feet","again","and","gave","me","an","an-","gry","stare."]},{"text":"What an unforgettable bus ride! Tourism is a modern business, or industry. In the days before in -expensive means of transportation, only the wealthy could travel for plea- sure.","tokens":["What","an","unforgettable","bus","ride!","Tourism","is","a","modern","business,","or","industry.","In","the","days","before","in","-expensive","means","of","transportation,","only","the","wealthy","could","travel","for","plea-","sure."]},{"text":"Today, inexpensive and rapid means of travel make it possible for working people to become tourists. Leisure in the form of long weekends and paid vacation, or holidays, also make it possible for working people to take trips.","tokens":["Today,","inexpensive","and","rapid","means","of","travel","make","it","possible","for","working","people","to","become","tourists.","Leisure","in","the","form","of","long","weekends","and","paid","vacation,","or","holidays,","also","make","it","possible","for","working","people","to","take","trips."]},{"text":"Almost 80% of international tourists are from industrialized countr- ies. Millions of workers in northern countries take paid vacations in warm, sunny places. And workers in warm climates often travel to places where they can enjoy winter sports.","tokens":["Almost","80%","of","international","tourists","are","from","industrialized","countr-","ies.","Millions","of","workers","in","northern","countries","take","paid","vacations","in","warm,","sunny","places.","And","workers","in","warm","climates","often","travel","to","places","where","they","can","enjoy","winter","sports."]},{"text":"Many people also travel within their own country. This is called internal tourism. People from rural areas go to the cities for vacations; people from the city vacation in the country, at beaches, or in mountains.","tokens":["Many","people","also","travel","within","their","own","country.","This","is","called","internal","tourism.","People","from","rural","areas","go","to","the","cities","for","vacations;","people","from","the","city","vacation","in","the","country,","at","beaches,","or","in","mountains."]},{"text":"Tourism is so important that there is a special government department for tourism. This department uses the information on the immigration cards to plan facilities for tourists.","tokens":["Tourism","is","so","important","that","there","is","a","special","government","department","for","tourism.","This","department","uses","the","information","on","the","immigration","cards","to","plan","facilities","for","tourists."]},{"text":"Comfortable, clean, and convenient accom- modations and travel facilities are necessary if tourists are to visit a country. It is important that such accommodation are kept clean and in good condition.","tokens":["Comfortable,","clean,","and","convenient","accom-","modations","and","travel","facilities","are","necessary","if","tourists","are","to","visit","a","country.","It","is","important","that","such","accommodation","are","kept","clean","and","in","good","condition."]},{"text":"If a government dose not require licenses and inspections, these places may not be kept up well. The tourism department works with the government and with tourism industry as a whole to build the country's tourism business.","tokens":["If","a","government","dose","not","require","licenses","and","inspections,","these","places","may","not","be","kept","up","well.","The","tourism","department","works","with","the","government","and","with","tourism","industry","as","a","whole","to","build","the","country's","tourism","business."]},{"text":"When the people of a country know that tourism is necessary for their country's well-being and growth, they are happy to have tourists. They are polite and eager to have the visitors enjoy themselves.","tokens":["When","the","people","of","a","country","know","that","tourism","is","necessary","for","their","country's","well-being","and","growth,","they","are","happy","to","have","tourists.","They","are","polite","and","eager","to","have","the","visitors","enjoy","themselves."]},{"text":"All the flight attendants work hard to make the passengers feel welcome aboard the plane. The passengers are the people riding in the airplane.","tokens":["All","the","flight","attendants","work","hard","to","make","the","passengers","feel","welcome","aboard","the","plane.","The","passengers","are","the","people","riding","in","the","airplane."]},{"text":"Most of these passengers ate tourists people who travel to see another places, area, or country. Most tourists travel for pleasure. They enjoy seeing different places and meeting other people.","tokens":["Most","of","these","passengers","ate","tourists","people","who","travel","to","see","another","places,","area,","or","country.","Most","tourists","travel","for","pleasure.","They","enjoy","seeing","different","places","and","meeting","other","people."]},{"text":"Sue Wang is a stewardess and Sam Lee is a steward for their country's airline. Their job is to look after the comfort and safety of the pass- engers who ride in the passenger cabin of the airplane during the","tokens":["Sue","Wang","is","a","stewardess","and","Sam","Lee","is","a","steward","for","their","country's","airline.","Their","job","is","to","look","after","the","comfort","and","safety","of","the","pass-","engers","who","ride","in","the","passenger","cabin","of","the","airplane","during","the"]},{"text":"flight. On the way, the cabin attendants serve food and beverages to the pass- engers. This keeps the attendants busy on their feet during most of the flight.","tokens":["flight.","On","the","way,","the","cabin","attendants","serve","food","and","beverages","to","the","pass-","engers.","This","keeps","the","attendants","busy","on","their","feet","during","most","of","the","flight."]},{"text":"Their duties also include welcoming the passengers aboard the airlines and helping them to find their seats. A flight attendant must show the passengers where the emergency exists are and explain how to use the oxygen masks.","tokens":["Their","duties","also","include","welcoming","the","passengers","aboard","the","airlines","and","helping","them","to","find","their","seats.","A","flight","attendant","must","show","the","passengers","where","the","emergency","exists","are","and","explain","how","to","use","the","oxygen","masks."]},{"text":"They must be able to answer questions about the time of flights and the services of the airlines. A flight attendant has to enjoy taking care of and serving people.","tokens":["They","must","be","able","to","answer","questions","about","the","time","of","flights","and","the","services","of","the","airlines.","A","flight","attendant","has","to","enjoy","taking","care","of","and","serving","people."]},{"text":"All flight attendant must be able to give first-aid. Eugene Chien, Taiwan's ambassador to Britain, said his wife had told him to put on a bullet-proof jacket while visiting the province because of a 25-year conflict which has killed 3,000.","tokens":["All","flight","attendant","must","be","able","to","give","first-aid.","Eugene","Chien,","Taiwan's","ambassador","to","Britain,","said","his","wife","had","told","him","to","put","on","a","bullet-proof","jacket","while","visiting","the","province","because","of","a","25-year","conflict","which","has","killed","3,000."]},{"text":"\"But it is not like that. It is a wonderful land a peaceful environ- ment. The quality of work is welltrained and the trade unions are ex- cellent.\"","tokens":["\"But","it","is","not","like","that.","It","is","a","wonderful","land","a","peaceful","environ-","ment.","The","quality","of","work","is","welltrained","and","the","trade","unions","are","ex-","cellent.\""]},{"text":"VIENNA, Austria-Five people, including three American tourists, were killed Thursday when their tour bus collided with a tank truck on a slipp- ery Alpine mountain pass, police said.","tokens":["VIENNA,","Austria-Five","people,","including","three","American","tourists,","were","killed","Thursday","when","their","tour","bus","collided","with","a","tank","truck","on","a","slipp-","ery","Alpine","mountain","pass,","police","said."]}]},"T29":{"key":"T29","title":"T29 \"Blueprint For Prosperity\" With its burgeoning trade…","paras":[{"text":"\"Blueprint For Prosperity\" With its burgeoning trade and high foreign exchange reserves, Taiwan is already known as an economic powerhouse in East Asia. Now a hung infrastructure program has been announced that will make ita trend-setter in improving the quality","tokens":["\"Blueprint","For","Prosperity\"","With","its","burgeoning","trade","and","high","foreign","exchange","reserves,","Taiwan","is","already","known","as","an","economic","powerhouse","in","East","Asia.","Now","a","hung","infrastructure","program","has","been","announced","that","will","make","ita","trend-setter","in","improving","the","quality"]},{"text":"of life as well. In Taiwan's headlong rush to development over the past 30 years, in- frastructure and lifestyle have been neglected. Now, all that is going to change under a mammoth US$300 billion six-year development plan designed to turn","tokens":["of","life","as","well.","In","Taiwan's","headlong","rush","to","development","over","the","past","30","years,","in-","frastructure","and","lifestyle","have","been","neglected.","Now,","all","that","is","going","to","change","under","a","mammoth","US$300","billion","six-year","development","plan","designed","to","turn"]},{"text":"the island into a developed nation by the end of the century. Main areas due to benefit under the plan are transportation and commu- nications, but provision of energy and improvement of the environment will also receive large shares.","tokens":["the","island","into","a","developed","nation","by","the","end","of","the","century.","Main","areas","due","to","benefit","under","the","plan","are","transportation","and","commu-","nications,","but","provision","of","energy","and","improvement","of","the","environment","will","also","receive","large","shares."]},{"text":"Because of the high-tech nature of many of the projects, a large pro- portion of the work needed under the plan will be done by foreign firms, and they are currently lining up for lucrative contracts.","tokens":["Because","of","the","high-tech","nature","of","many","of","the","projects,","a","large","pro-","portion","of","the","work","needed","under","the","plan","will","be","done","by","foreign","firms,","and","they","are","currently","lining","up","for","lucrative","contracts."]},{"text":"In terms of spending, the Taiwan plan dwarfs that being taken by other countries, in- cluding the effort to rebuild Kuwait after the Gulf War, which only cost about a quarter of the Taiwan total.","tokens":["In","terms","of","spending,","the","Taiwan","plan","dwarfs","that","being","taken","by","other","countries,","in-","cluding","the","effort","to","rebuild","Kuwait","after","the","Gulf","War,","which","only","cost","about","a","quarter","of","the","Taiwan","total."]},{"text":"The 779 individual projects included in the overall plan will involve public works spending of US$199 billion, covering everything from high- speed railways to new universities.","tokens":["The","779","individual","projects","included","in","the","overall","plan","will","involve","public","works","spending","of","US$199","billion,","covering","everything","from","high-","speed","railways","to","new","universities."]},{"text":"And in view of Taiwan's foreign exchange reserves of US$75 billion, no one doubts that the island has the ability to pay. The government is even departing from its previous policy of not incurring debt by issuing bonds to pay","tokens":["And","in","view","of","Taiwan's","foreign","exchange","reserves","of","US$75","billion,","no","one","doubts","that","the","island","has","the","ability","to","pay.","The","government","is","even","departing","from","its","previous","policy","of","not","incurring","debt","by","issuing","bonds","to","pay"]},{"text":"for the plan. In view of the Taiwan public's thirst for investment vehicles, there is little doubt that these bonds will be popular. Apart from upgrading the infrastructure as a whole in Taiwan, the plan will also increase spending in","tokens":["for","the","plan.","In","view","of","the","Taiwan","public's","thirst","for","investment","vehicles,","there","is","little","doubt","that","these","bonds","will","be","popular.","Apart","from","upgrading","the","infrastructure","as","a","whole","in","Taiwan,","the","plan","will","also","increase","spending","in"]},{"text":"the central, southern and eastern parts of central, southern and eastern parts of the island to achieve a more equita- ble spread of wealth and prevent a migration to the overcrowded north.","tokens":["the","central,","southern","and","eastern","parts","of","central,","southern","and","eastern","parts","of","the","island","to","achieve","a","more","equita-","ble","spread","of","wealth","and","prevent","a","migration","to","the","overcrowded","north."]},{"text":"To improve transportation, for instance, a new high-speed railway from Taipei in northern Taiwan to Kaohsiung in the south will be built at a cost of US$10 billion.","tokens":["To","improve","transportation,","for","instance,","a","new","high-speed","railway","from","Taipei","in","northern","Taiwan","to","Kaohsiung","in","the","south","will","be","built","at","a","cost","of","US$10","billion."]},{"text":"This will reduce the traveling time between the two cities from five hours to two hours. The first stage of providing mass rapid transit systems for Taiwan's major cities is under way with a US$15 billion project in Taipei whose","tokens":["This","will","reduce","the","traveling","time","between","the","two","cities","from","five","hours","to","two","hours.","The","first","stage","of","providing","mass","rapid","transit","systems","for","Taiwan's","major","cities","is","under","way","with","a","US$15","billion","project","in","Taipei","whose"]},{"text":"first stage is due to be completed next year. The city of Kaohsiung re- cently followed the Taipei example of selecting a U.S. consultant for its subway project, which will cost US$7 billion.","tokens":["first","stage","is","due","to","be","completed","next","year.","The","city","of","Kaohsiung","re-","cently","followed","the","Taipei","example","of","selecting","a","U.S.","consultant","for","its","subway","project,","which","will","cost","US$7","billion."]},{"text":"Smaller systems are being planned for Taichung in central Taiwan and Tainan in the south. A branch of the Taipei subway will go to the Chiang Kai-shek International airport, where another facility under the plan will be the construction of","tokens":["Smaller","systems","are","being","planned","for","Taichung","in","central","Taiwan","and","Tainan","in","the","south.","A","branch","of","the","Taipei","subway","will","go","to","the","Chiang","Kai-shek","International","airport,","where","another","facility","under","the","plan","will","be","the","construction","of"]},{"text":"a second terminal to increase capacity from eight million to 20 million passengers a year at a cost of US$770 million. A completely new airport in Kaohsiung will be constructed at a cost of US$500 million, and facilities at Green","tokens":["a","second","terminal","to","increase","capacity","from","eight","million","to","20","million","passengers","a","year","at","a","cost","of","US$770","million.","A","completely","new","airport","in","Kaohsiung","will","be","constructed","at","a","cost","of","US$500","million,","and","facilities","at","Green"]},{"text":"Island, Orchid Island, and Hengchun close to the southern tip of the island will be upgraded. Also being studied for feasibility is new deep-water port in Kaohsiung at a cost of Us$12 billion.","tokens":["Island,","Orchid","Island,","and","Hengchun","close","to","the","southern","tip","of","the","island","will","be","upgraded.","Also","being","studied","for","feasibility","is","new","deep-water","port","in","Kaohsiung","at","a","cost","of","Us$12","billion."]},{"text":"And also in the communications sector, the whole telephone system in Taiwan will be modernized. Since reducing pollution and protecting the environment is regarded as having greatest priority among most people in Taiwan, a total of US$30 billion will be","tokens":["And","also","in","the","communications","sector,","the","whole","telephone","system","in","Taiwan","will","be","modernized.","Since","reducing","pollution","and","protecting","the","environment","is","regarded","as","having","greatest","priority","among","most","people","in","Taiwan,","a","total","of","US$30","billion","will","be"]},{"text":"spent on this sector during the period of the plan to construct an islandwide network of solid waste incinerators, a pollution monitoring system and improved sewerage systems.","tokens":["spent","on","this","sector","during","the","period","of","the","plan","to","construct","an","islandwide","network","of","solid","waste","incinerators,","a","pollution","monitoring","system","and","improved","sewerage","systems."]},{"text":"Jobs created from the projects are expected to help raise per capita income from the present US$8,000 to US$14,000 by the end of the decade, putting Taiwan well within the ranks of developed nations.","tokens":["Jobs","created","from","the","projects","are","expected","to","help","raise","per","capita","income","from","the","present","US$8,000","to","US$14,000","by","the","end","of","the","decade,","putting","Taiwan","well","within","the","ranks","of","developed","nations."]},{"text":"To reduce sky-high rents, the government will invest US$42 billion in public housing. By raising the quality of life in Taiwan, it is hoped that more technicians will be persuaded to stay and help make the island a world financial,","tokens":["To","reduce","sky-high","rents,","the","government","will","invest","US$42","billion","in","public","housing.","By","raising","the","quality","of","life","in","Taiwan,","it","is","hoped","that","more","technicians","will","be","persuaded","to","stay","and","help","make","the","island","a","world","financial,"]},{"text":"technological and commercial center. To built up better relations with its trading partners, Taiwan intends to award as many of the contracts as possible to countries with which it runs up sizable trade surpluses, notably the United States and some","tokens":["technological","and","commercial","center.","To","built","up","better","relations","with","its","trading","partners,","Taiwan","intends","to","award","as","many","of","the","contracts","as","possible","to","countries","with","which","it","runs","up","sizable","trade","surpluses,","notably","the","United","States","and","some"]},{"text":"coun- tries in Europe. Furthermore, it is expected that Taiwan will receive a big economic boost from the projects which will help to prevent a recession over the next few years.","tokens":["coun-","tries","in","Europe.","Furthermore,","it","is","expected","that","Taiwan","will","receive","a","big","economic","boost","from","the","projects","which","will","help","to","prevent","a","recession","over","the","next","few","years."]},{"text":"According to official policy objective outlined by the government, the five main aims of the plan are to raise the quality of life, increase na- tional income, provide sufficient resources for continued industrial grow- th, and promote balanced regional development.","tokens":["According","to","official","policy","objective","outlined","by","the","government,","the","five","main","aims","of","the","plan","are","to","raise","the","quality","of","life,","increase","na-","tional","income,","provide","sufficient","resources","for","continued","industrial","grow-","th,","and","promote","balanced","regional","development."]},{"text":"The government realized that efficient allocation of an ample supply of productive resources is the key to industrial modernization and sus- tained economic growth.","tokens":["The","government","realized","that","efficient","allocation","of","an","ample","supply","of","productive","resources","is","the","key","to","industrial","modernization","and","sus-","tained","economic","growth."]},{"text":"To ensure the development of more high-tech industrial establishments, the government will carefully monitor the distribution of productive resources such as land, water, energy and trans- portation facilities during the period of the plan.","tokens":["To","ensure","the","development","of","more","high-tech","industrial","establishments,","the","government","will","carefully","monitor","the","distribution","of","productive","resources","such","as","land,","water,","energy","and","trans-","portation","facilities","during","the","period","of","the","plan."]},{"text":"Priority is also being given under the plan to accelerating the devel- opment of backward areas by improving schools, housing, medical, cultural and transportation facilities.","tokens":["Priority","is","also","being","given","under","the","plan","to","accelerating","the","devel-","opment","of","backward","areas","by","improving","schools,","housing,","medical,","cultural","and","transportation","facilities."]},{"text":"To improve national wellbeing, Taiwan will be divided into 18 \"living primeters\" which will be selfcontained communities providing accommoda- tion, and medical and shopping facilities.","tokens":["To","improve","national","wellbeing,","Taiwan","will","be","divided","into","18","\"living","primeters\"","which","will","be","selfcontained","communities","providing","accommoda-","tion,","and","medical","and","shopping","facilities."]},{"text":"In addition, a national helath insurance program will be inaugurated in 1994 to provide medical insurance coverage to everyone. As well as providing a more favorable climate for economic growth, it is expected that the plan will assist social stability","tokens":["In","addition,","a","national","helath","insurance","program","will","be","inaugurated","in","1994","to","provide","medical","insurance","coverage","to","everyone.","As","well","as","providing","a","more","favorable","climate","for","economic","growth,","it","is","expected","that","the","plan","will","assist","social","stability"]},{"text":"by providing more employment. On the demand side, and increase in public investment will encourage private investment and consumption, thereby expanding domestic demand and reducing the trade surplus.","tokens":["by","providing","more","employment.","On","the","demand","side,","and","increase","in","public","investment","will","encourage","private","investment","and","consumption,","thereby","expanding","domestic","demand","and","reducing","the","trade","surplus."]},{"text":"These developments will reflect a higher de gree of economic independence and reduce vulnerability to economic turbulence. The government realizes that success of the program will depend not only on adequate funding and effective implementation, but also on whole- hearted","tokens":["These","developments","will","reflect","a","higher","de","gree","of","economic","independence","and","reduce","vulnerability","to","economic","turbulence.","The","government","realizes","that","success","of","the","program","will","depend","not","only","on","adequate","funding","and","effective","implementation,","but","also","on","whole-","hearted"]},{"text":"support by the private sector. To ensure that public and private resources are put to the best possible use, the government will introduce new fiscal incentives, encourage the relalocation of industries and update related legislation during the plan period.","tokens":["support","by","the","private","sector.","To","ensure","that","public","and","private","resources","are","put","to","the","best","possible","use,","the","government","will","introduce","new","fiscal","incentives,","encourage","the","relalocation","of","industries","and","update","related","legislation","during","the","plan","period."]},{"text":"Among the targets of the plan are that economic growth will average seven percent a year, that investment in the public sector will grow by 12.5 percent a year, manufacturing will grow by 6.5 percent annually, and that the service","tokens":["Among","the","targets","of","the","plan","are","that","economic","growth","will","average","seven","percent","a","year,","that","investment","in","the","public","sector","will","grow","by","12.5","percent","a","year,","manufacturing","will","grow","by","6.5","percent","annually,","and","that","the","service"]},{"text":"and high-tech industries will grow particularly quickly. By the end of the plan, Taiwan's power capacity will be raised from 17 million kilowatts to 27.5 million kilowatts, and on the social and recrea- tional fronts, at least one new university","tokens":["and","high-tech","industries","will","grow","particularly","quickly.","By","the","end","of","the","plan,","Taiwan's","power","capacity","will","be","raised","from","17","million","kilowatts","to","27.5","million","kilowatts,","and","on","the","social","and","recrea-","tional","fronts,","at","least","one","new","university"]},{"text":"and several high schools will be set up, as well as a number of libraries, swimming pools, parks and sports grounds. Social welfare services will be enhanced, and more creational areas will be established.","tokens":["and","several","high","schools","will","be","set","up,","as","well","as","a","number","of","libraries,","swimming","pools,","parks","and","sports","grounds.","Social","welfare","services","will","be","enhanced,","and","more","creational","areas","will","be","established."]},{"text":"\"Gardening Reaches New Heights\" Lack of space at ground level has caused many householders to look at what would otherwise be a desert to create greenery--the tops of apartment buildings.","tokens":["\"Gardening","Reaches","New","Heights\"","Lack","of","space","at","ground","level","has","caused","many","householders","to","look","at","what","would","otherwise","be","a","desert","to","create","greenery--the","tops","of","apartment","buildings."]},{"text":"Rooftop gardens are now all the rage in Taipei, allowing people to show an amazing amount of crea- tivity along with their \"green fingers.\"","tokens":["Rooftop","gardens","are","now","all","the","rage","in","Taipei,","allowing","people","to","show","an","amazing","amount","of","crea-","tivity","along","with","their","\"green","fingers.\""]},{"text":"Alongside rapid development in business and industry, Taipei has been constantly changing in decent years. High-rise buildings have replaced the old two-storied houses, and people seldom have the chance to stand on solid ground.","tokens":["Alongside","rapid","development","in","business","and","industry,","Taipei","has","been","constantly","changing","in","decent","years.","High-rise","buildings","have","replaced","the","old","two-storied","houses,","and","people","seldom","have","the","chance","to","stand","on","solid","ground."]},{"text":"The high price of land caused businesses to use every piece that becomes available to make even bigger returns. As green fields become scarcer and scarcer, the only greenery left is often in the road dividers on some main boulevards and a handful of small parks in Taipei.","tokens":["The","high","price","of","land","caused","businesses","to","use","every","piece","that","becomes","available","to","make","even","bigger","returns.","As","green","fields","become","scarcer","and","scarcer,","the","only","greenery","left","is","often","in","the","road","dividers","on","some","main","boulevards","and","a","handful","of","small","parks","in","Taipei."]}]},"T30":{"key":"T30","title":"T30 William L. Seavey's crusade can be summed…","paras":[{"text":"William L. Seavey's crusade can be summed up with his toll-free num- ber: 1-800-OUT-OF-LA. For 10 years, he has sermonized on the downfall of \"the Los Angeleses, the New Yorks and the Detroits.\"","tokens":["William","L.","Seavey's","crusade","can","be","summed","up","with","his","toll-free","num-","ber:","1-800-OUT-OF-LA.","For","10","years,","he","has","sermonized","on","the","downfall","of","\"the","Los","Angeleses,","the","New","Yorks","and","the","Detroits.\""]},{"text":"He has devoted himself to telling people to move out of a city many weren't ready to leave. But what with the crime, the crowds, the traffic-and of course the riots, fires, floods and earthquakes-Angelenos could be excuse these days","tokens":["He","has","devoted","himself","to","telling","people","to","move","out","of","a","city","many","weren't","ready","to","leave.","But","what","with","the","crime,","the","crowds,","the","traffic-and","of","course","the","riots,","fires,","floods","and","earthquakes-Angelenos","could","be","excuse","these","days"]},{"text":"if they wondered whether Seavey didn't have a point. Southern California, Seavey said in a news release he circulated after the Jan. 17 Northridge earthquake, is \"the most dangerous urban area in the United States.\"","tokens":["if","they","wondered","whether","Seavey","didn't","have","a","point.","Southern","California,","Seavey","said","in","a","news","release","he","circulated","after","the","Jan.","17","Northridge","earthquake,","is","\"the","most","dangerous","urban","area","in","the","United","States.\""]},{"text":"In the wake of the quake, Seavey shook into action. He dashed out 500 pieces of mail to San Fernando Valley residents, dropped off brochures at emergency shelters, wrote guest editorials for local newspapers.","tokens":["In","the","wake","of","the","quake,","Seavey","shook","into","action.","He","dashed","out","500","pieces","of","mail","to","San","Fernando","Valley","residents,","dropped","off","brochures","at","emergency","shelters,","wrote","guest","editorials","for","local","newspapers."]},{"text":"Convincing people to leave urban areas is Seavey's mission, and help- ing them escape is his livelihood. And he's not the only one. Entrepre- neurs like Tom Evons and Constance See are players in the dugout business.","tokens":["Convincing","people","to","leave","urban","areas","is","Seavey's","mission,","and","help-","ing","them","escape","is","his","livelihood.","And","he's","not","the","only","one.","Entrepre-","neurs","like","Tom","Evons","and","Constance","See","are","players","in","the","dugout","business."]},{"text":"Last year, when 900 people packed a room in La Jolla to hear Evons give his speech on \"Escape San Diego,\" Evons knew what his next move would be.","tokens":["Last","year,","when","900","people","packed","a","room","in","La","Jolla","to","hear","Evons","give","his","speech","on","\"Escape","San","Diego,\"","Evons","knew","what","his","next","move","would","be."]},{"text":"He expanded his operation to include \"Escape L.A.\" and \"Escape San Francisco.\" See promotes leaving any risky place. She sells a map of the United States emblazoned with the question, \"Are You Safe Where You Live?\"","tokens":["He","expanded","his","operation","to","include","\"Escape","L.A.\"","and","\"Escape","San","Francisco.\"","See","promotes","leaving","any","risky","place.","She","sells","a","map","of","the","United","States","emblazoned","with","the","question,","\"Are","You","Safe","Where","You","Live?\""]},{"text":"It is overlaid with statistics on rapes, murders, prison escapes, Superfund sites, breast cancer rates, earthquakes and other recipes for a short life- span.","tokens":["It","is","overlaid","with","statistics","on","rapes,","murders,","prison","escapes,","Superfund","sites,","breast","cancer","rates,","earthquakes","and","other","recipes","for","a","short","life-","span."]},{"text":"\"I'll show you where the cancer, crud and crime are across the United States,\" says See, who runs City Seekers out of her home in Olympia, Wash.","tokens":["\"I'll","show","you","where","the","cancer,","crud","and","crime","are","across","the","United","States,\"","says","See,","who","runs","City","Seekers","out","of","her","home","in","Olympia,","Wash."]},{"text":"After broadcast appearances in Los Angeles and San Francisco last fall, See was barraged with phone calls: 900 from Los Angeles and 700 from San Francisco.","tokens":["After","broadcast","appearances","in","Los","Angeles","and","San","Francisco","last","fall,","See","was","barraged","with","phone","calls:","900","from","Los","Angeles","and","700","from","San","Francisco."]},{"text":"About 15 percent of the callers went on to become clients. They paid See US$25 to compile information on particular cities and US$45 to be matched with their own personal Eden somewhere in the country.","tokens":["About","15","percent","of","the","callers","went","on","to","become","clients.","They","paid","See","US$25","to","compile","information","on","particular","cities","and","US$45","to","be","matched","with","their","own","personal","Eden","somewhere","in","the","country."]},{"text":"Some would say that idylls are getting harder to come by. When Matt Holbert left Galveston, Texas, for Boise, Idaho, he thought he was bidding adieu to urban clutter, gangs and graffiti.","tokens":["Some","would","say","that","idylls","are","getting","harder","to","come","by.","When","Matt","Holbert","left","Galveston,","Texas,","for","Boise,","Idaho,","he","thought","he","was","bidding","adieu","to","urban","clutter,","gangs","and","graffiti."]},{"text":"Not so, Boise is beginning to grapple with some of the name \"big city\" plagues. Growth rates in Boise have been running at six percent for the past three years-two percent is about the norm.","tokens":["Not","so,","Boise","is","beginning","to","grapple","with","some","of","the","name","\"big","city\"","plagues.","Growth","rates","in","Boise","have","been","running","at","six","percent","for","the","past","three","years-two","percent","is","about","the","norm."]},{"text":"\"If it keeps growing at this pace,\" said Holbert, \"we'll find a small- er city. But it's hard to get away from this growth.\"","tokens":["\"If","it","keeps","growing","at","this","pace,\"","said","Holbert,","\"we'll","find","a","small-","er","city.","But","it's","hard","to","get","away","from","this","growth.\""]},{"text":"At a recent rally to stop the building of a bridge across the Boise River, protesters sported T-shirts emblazoned with the word \"Boiseangeles\" enclosed in a circle with a red slash through it.","tokens":["At","a","recent","rally","to","stop","the","building","of","a","bridge","across","the","Boise","River,","protesters","sported","T-shirts","emblazoned","with","the","word","\"Boiseangeles\"","enclosed","in","a","circle","with","a","red","slash","through","it."]},{"text":"The same sentiment is widespread on the coast. About 65 percent of Allied Van Lines 1993 California relocations were outbound, up from 58 percent in 1991.","tokens":["The","same","sentiment","is","widespread","on","the","coast.","About","65","percent","of","Allied","Van","Lines","1993","California","relocations","were","outbound,","up","from","58","percent","in","1991."]},{"text":"United Van Lines reported similar figures for 1993. In Los Angeles County deportees outnumbered arrivals by more than 2-to-1. The subscription list for Seavey's quarterly newsletter has grown from 100 to 2,000 in three years with the largest growth coming","tokens":["United","Van","Lines","reported","similar","figures","for","1993.","In","Los","Angeles","County","deportees","outnumbered","arrivals","by","more","than","2-to-1.","The","subscription","list","for","Seavey's","quarterly","newsletter","has","grown","from","100","to","2,000","in","three","years","with","the","largest","growth","coming"]},{"text":"in Southern California. \"That's where the action is,\" said Seavey, a former resident of Los Angeles who now lives in Pahrump, Nev., (Population: 10.000.\"","tokens":["in","Southern","California.","\"That's","where","the","action","is,\"","said","Seavey,","a","former","resident","of","Los","Angeles","who","now","lives","in","Pahrump,","Nev.,","(Population:","10.000.\""]},{"text":"These days, he spends most of his time on the road, living out of his motor home and extolling the virtues of small town life at each stop.","tokens":["These","days,","he","spends","most","of","his","time","on","the","road,","living","out","of","his","motor","home","and","extolling","the","virtues","of","small","town","life","at","each","stop."]},{"text":"He sells all kinds of relocation accessories; audio tapes and books on everything from setting up a home-based business to \"Selling your Southern California Property When No One's Biting.\"","tokens":["He","sells","all","kinds","of","relocation","accessories;","audio","tapes","and","books","on","everything","from","setting","up","a","home-based","business","to","\"Selling","your","Southern","California","Property","When","No","One's","Biting.\""]},{"text":"He runs a \"Meet, Match and Move\" support group and oversee a network of \"Hinterland Host,\" rural folks who serve as a welcome party to the newly relocated.","tokens":["He","runs","a","\"Meet,","Match","and","Move\"","support","group","and","oversee","a","network","of","\"Hinterland","Host,\"","rural","folks","who","serve","as","a","welcome","party","to","the","newly","relocated."]},{"text":"Seavey isn't sure how to react to others, like Evons and See, who have climbed on the get-out-of-L.A. bandwagon. On one hand, he says he's re- luctunt to give out any competitors' names for fear of drawing attention to them.","tokens":["Seavey","isn't","sure","how","to","react","to","others,","like","Evons","and","See,","who","have","climbed","on","the","get-out-of-L.A.","bandwagon.","On","one","hand,","he","says","he's","re-","luctunt","to","give","out","any","competitors'","names","for","fear","of","drawing","attention","to","them."]},{"text":"But then he adds. In some sense, the more the merrier People need to Know what the alternatives are to living in big, crowded, unsafe places.","tokens":["But","then","he","adds.","In","some","sense,","the","more","the","merrier","People","need","to","Know","what","the","alternatives","are","to","living","in","big,","crowded,","unsafe","places."]},{"text":"\"And that is our mission.\" Rangoon, Burma-The Ministry of Hotels and Tourism has allowed 147 pri- vaately owned hotels and inns to operate in the country, the official news- paper New Light of Myanmar reported yesterday.","tokens":["\"And","that","is","our","mission.\"","Rangoon,","Burma-The","Ministry","of","Hotels","and","Tourism","has","allowed","147","pri-","vaately","owned","hotels","and","inns","to","operate","in","the","country,","the","official","news-","paper","New","Light","of","Myanmar","reported","yesterday."]},{"text":"There are now over 2,100 hotel rooms in Burma. Foreign investors from six countries are currently building 17 more hotels, investing over US$500 million, the newspaper re- ported.","tokens":["There","are","now","over","2,100","hotel","rooms","in","Burma.","Foreign","investors","from","six","countries","are","currently","building","17","more","hotels,","investing","over","US$500","million,","the","newspaper","re-","ported."]},{"text":"Chicago-Amoco Corp. plans to announce a major restructuring next month that will sharply reduce the size of its corporate staff and replace the company's three divisions with 17 separate groups.","tokens":["Chicago-Amoco","Corp.","plans","to","announce","a","major","restructuring","next","month","that","will","sharply","reduce","the","size","of","its","corporate","staff","and","replace","the","company's","three","divisions","with","17","separate","groups."]},{"text":"The company has said previously that the restructuring would cost jobs, but has not been spe- cific. The corporate staff would be cut to about 400 positions from more than 6,000, but many of the workers would be transferred within","tokens":["The","company","has","said","previously","that","the","restructuring","would","cost","jobs,","but","has","not","been","spe-","cific.","The","corporate","staff","would","be","cut","to","about","400","positions","from","more","than","6,000,","but","many","of","the","workers","would","be","transferred","within"]},{"text":"Amoco and won't result in layoffs, spokesman Jim Fair said Wednesday. The 17 groups will answer to three vice presidents, formerly the chiefs of the three main groups.","tokens":["Amoco","and","won't","result","in","layoffs,","spokesman","Jim","Fair","said","Wednesday.","The","17","groups","will","answer","to","three","vice","presidents,","formerly","the","chiefs","of","the","three","main","groups."]},{"text":"The separate staffs for the three divisions will be reassigned or disappear, Amoco told employees. Tel Aviv-Israel released several hundred Palestinian prisoners Thurs- day, but a watchdog group said the releases lagged far behind what was agreed.","tokens":["The","separate","staffs","for","the","three","divisions","will","be","reassigned","or","disappear,","Amoco","told","employees.","Tel","Aviv-Israel","released","several","hundred","Palestinian","prisoners","Thurs-","day,","but","a","watchdog","group","said","the","releases","lagged","far","behind","what","was","agreed."]},{"text":"The army spokesman's office said those released were not members of militant Islamic groups opposed to the peace process and had not killed Israelis.","tokens":["The","army","spokesman's","office","said","those","released","were","not","members","of","militant","Islamic","groups","opposed","to","the","peace","process","and","had","not","killed","Israelis."]},{"text":"The statement gave the number of released only at \"several hundred.\"","tokens":["The","statement","gave","the","number","of","released","only","at","\"several","hundred.\""]}]},"T31":{"key":"T31","title":"T31 Taiwan can increase its Gross National Product…","paras":[{"text":"Taiwan can increase its Gross National Product (GNP) five fold if it can successfully use the economies of the mainland and Southeast Asian countries for its future growth, a government-commissioned report said yes- terday.","tokens":["Taiwan","can","increase","its","Gross","National","Product","(GNP)","five","fold","if","it","can","successfully","use","the","economies","of","the","mainland","and","Southeast","Asian","countries","for","its","future","growth,","a","government-commissioned","report","said","yes-","terday."]},{"text":"The report, funded by the Ministry of Economic Affairs' Industrial De- velopment and Investment Center, was undertaken by the Far Eastern Club of Economic Research.","tokens":["The","report,","funded","by","the","Ministry","of","Economic","Affairs'","Industrial","De-","velopment","and","Investment","Center,","was","undertaken","by","the","Far","Eastern","Club","of","Economic","Research."]},{"text":"The research for the report was overseen by Council for Economic Plan- ning and Development Vice Chairman Chi Schive. The report, which studied ways in which Taiwan could be transformed into a regional finance and operations center, said that Taiwan","tokens":["The","research","for","the","report","was","overseen","by","Council","for","Economic","Plan-","ning","and","Development","Vice","Chairman","Chi","Schive.","The","report,","which","studied","ways","in","which","Taiwan","could","be","transformed","into","a","regional","finance","and","operations","center,","said","that","Taiwan"]},{"text":"could potentially increase its GNP from US$210.5 billion to US$1 trillion if it could use these countries as a hinterland for the island's economic deve- lopment.","tokens":["could","potentially","increase","its","GNP","from","US$210.5","billion","to","US$1","trillion","if","it","could","use","these","countries","as","a","hinterland","for","the","island's","economic","deve-","lopment."]},{"text":"Schive said in the report that Taiwan should expand its hinterlands for economic development if it wishes to replace Hong Kong and Singapore and become a business operational center in the Asia-Pacific region.","tokens":["Schive","said","in","the","report","that","Taiwan","should","expand","its","hinterlands","for","economic","development","if","it","wishes","to","replace","Hong","Kong","and","Singapore","and","become","a","business","operational","center","in","the","Asia-Pacific","region."]},{"text":"Therefore, Taiwan should pursue its \"Go South\" and mainland policies simultaneously so that it would have a large hinterland for economic deve- lopment, the report said.","tokens":["Therefore,","Taiwan","should","pursue","its","\"Go","South\"","and","mainland","policies","simultaneously","so","that","it","would","have","a","large","hinterland","for","economic","deve-","lopment,","the","report","said."]},{"text":"In 1992, Taiwan's Gross National Product (GNP) was US$210.5 billion, which was more than twice Hong Kong's US$91.4 billion and 4.5 times Singa- pore's US$46.6 billion.","tokens":["In","1992,","Taiwan's","Gross","National","Product","(GNP)","was","US$210.5","billion,","which","was","more","than","twice","Hong","Kong's","US$91.4","billion","and","4.5","times","Singa-","pore's","US$46.6","billion."]},{"text":"Taiwan, however, was behind Hong Kong and Singapore in telecommunica- tions, mail and financial services, the report said. The report cites an evaluation on the telecommunications infrastruc- tures in developing countries and said Singapore came first with a score of","tokens":["Taiwan,","however,","was","behind","Hong","Kong","and","Singapore","in","telecommunica-","tions,","mail","and","financial","services,","the","report","said.","The","report","cites","an","evaluation","on","the","telecommunications","infrastruc-","tures","in","developing","countries","and","said","Singapore","came","first","with","a","score","of"]},{"text":"97.5 on a 100 point scale. Hong Kong came in second with 94.8. Taiwan was eights on the list, with a 74.8 score. Taiwan should therefore speed up its efforts to privatize the island's telecommunications industry and ease the ruling","tokens":["97.5","on","a","100","point","scale.","Hong","Kong","came","in","second","with","94.8.","Taiwan","was","eights","on","the","list,","with","a","74.8","score.","Taiwan","should","therefore","speed","up","its","efforts","to","privatize","the","island's","telecommunications","industry","and","ease","the","ruling"]},{"text":"over state-run corporations if it wanted to become a financial and operations hub in the Asia-Pacific region. Schive also proposed that Taiwan should ease restrictions on capital flow, the stock market and non-banking financial services to make the bank- ing","tokens":["over","state-run","corporations","if","it","wanted","to","become","a","financial","and","operations","hub","in","the","Asia-Pacific","region.","Schive","also","proposed","that","Taiwan","should","ease","restrictions","on","capital","flow,","the","stock","market","and","non-banking","financial","services","to","make","the","bank-","ing"]},{"text":"and financial sector more competitive. Taiwan should also simplify the procedures for foreign or overseas Chinese investments in Taiwan's stock market, banking services and other businesses, he said.","tokens":["and","financial","sector","more","competitive.","Taiwan","should","also","simplify","the","procedures","for","foreign","or","overseas","Chinese","investments","in","Taiwan's","stock","market,","banking","services","and","other","businesses,","he","said."]},{"text":"Currently, Hong Kong dominates the market for businesses going to the mainland. Its economic strength, or GNP, could therefore jump to US$484.4 billion, he said.","tokens":["Currently,","Hong","Kong","dominates","the","market","for","businesses","going","to","the","mainland.","Its","economic","strength,","or","GNP,","could","therefore","jump","to","US$484.4","billion,","he","said."]},{"text":"Singapore, on the other hand, was the gateway to the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (Asean) markets and its economy had the potential of growing up to S$373.9 billion.","tokens":["Singapore,","on","the","other","hand,","was","the","gateway","to","the","Association","of","Southeast","Asian","Nations","(Asean)","markets","and","its","economy","had","the","potential","of","growing","up","to","S$373.9","billion."]},{"text":"Schive said that Taiwan's GNP could be expected to grow to about US$400 billion if its present investments in the mainland was taken into account.","tokens":["Schive","said","that","Taiwan's","GNP","could","be","expected","to","grow","to","about","US$400","billion","if","its","present","investments","in","the","mainland","was","taken","into","account."]},{"text":"However, if Taiwan could successfully develop its investments in Southeast Asia, its economic strength would grow by an additional US$600 billion. If this happened, then foreign companies would want to set up their business headquarters in Taiwan, the report said.","tokens":["However,","if","Taiwan","could","successfully","develop","its","investments","in","Southeast","Asia,","its","economic","strength","would","grow","by","an","additional","US$600","billion.","If","this","happened,","then","foreign","companies","would","want","to","set","up","their","business","headquarters","in","Taiwan,","the","report","said."]},{"text":"A mainland Chinese wearing a serviceman's uniform hijacked a mainland Southeast Airlines flight to Taiwan yesterday morning after he threatened the pilot with a fruit knife and a fake explosive.","tokens":["A","mainland","Chinese","wearing","a","serviceman's","uniform","hijacked","a","mainland","Southeast","Airlines","flight","to","Taiwan","yesterday","morning","after","he","threatened","the","pilot","with","a","fruit","knife","and","a","fake","explosive."]},{"text":"He had on tow his wife, two sons aged 11 and 9, and foster mother. The hijacking was the first from mainland China to Taiwan this year and the 11th since April last year.","tokens":["He","had","on","tow","his","wife,","two","sons","aged","11","and","9,","and","foster","mother.","The","hijacking","was","the","first","from","mainland","China","to","Taiwan","this","year","and","the","11th","since","April","last","year."]},{"text":"Police identified the hijacker as 35-year-old Lin Wenqiang of Fujian province. Lin was taken into custody for questioning, while the plane was allowed to continue its flight to Fujian via Hong Kong in the afternoon.","tokens":["Police","identified","the","hijacker","as","35-year-old","Lin","Wenqiang","of","Fujian","province.","Lin","was","taken","into","custody","for","questioning,","while","the","plane","was","allowed","to","continue","its","flight","to","Fujian","via","Hong","Kong","in","the","afternoon."]},{"text":"Lin told police that he decided to hijack the Boeing 737 because he was irritated over bureaucratic problems over his application to set up a company in Changsha in the southeastern province of Hunan.","tokens":["Lin","told","police","that","he","decided","to","hijack","the","Boeing","737","because","he","was","irritated","over","bureaucratic","problems","over","his","application","to","set","up","a","company","in","Changsha","in","the","southeastern","province","of","Hunan."]},{"text":"Lin's wife, 32-year-old Huang Chunlien, refused to leave the airport upon learning that her husband was taken into custody. But the prosecutor decided to hand Huang and her family over to the flight crew after he questioned them and determined","tokens":["Lin's","wife,","32-year-old","Huang","Chunlien,","refused","to","leave","the","airport","upon","learning","that","her","husband","was","taken","into","custody.","But","the","prosecutor","decided","to","hand","Huang","and","her","family","over","to","the","flight","crew","after","he","questioned","them","and","determined"]},{"text":"that they were not in- volved in the hijacking. Huang tried to resist and had to be dragged onto the plane by police officers.","tokens":["that","they","were","not","in-","volved","in","the","hijacking.","Huang","tried","to","resist","and","had","to","be","dragged","onto","the","plane","by","police","officers."]},{"text":"Vice Justice Minister Lin Shyi-hwu said Lin's family members were re- turned to the mainland because they were not involved in the hijacking and were given the same treatment as other passengers.","tokens":["Vice","Justice","Minister","Lin","Shyi-hwu","said","Lin's","family","members","were","re-","turned","to","the","mainland","because","they","were","not","involved","in","the","hijacking","and","were","given","the","same","treatment","as","other","passengers."]},{"text":"Lin said the decision may help curb hijackings. In two previous cases, family members of hijackers were allowed to remain in Taiwan because they were found to be involved in the hijackings, he said.","tokens":["Lin","said","the","decision","may","help","curb","hijackings.","In","two","previous","cases,","family","members","of","hijackers","were","allowed","to","remain","in","Taiwan","because","they","were","found","to","be","involved","in","the","hijackings,","he","said."]},{"text":"Kao Koong-lian, vice chairman of the Mainland Affairs Council, urged the mainland authorities to sign an agreement with Taiwan for the repatria- tion of hijackers as soon as possible.","tokens":["Kao","Koong-lian,","vice","chairman","of","the","Mainland","Affairs","Council,","urged","the","mainland","authorities","to","sign","an","agreement","with","Taiwan","for","the","repatria-","tion","of","hijackers","as","soon","as","possible."]},{"text":"Before the agreement is signed, Taiwan has to handle hijackings according to its own law, he said. Interior Minister Wu Po-hsiung said when the Straits Exchange Founda- tion and its mainland counterpart meet in Taipei in late March, they might","tokens":["Before","the","agreement","is","signed,","Taiwan","has","to","handle","hijackings","according","to","its","own","law,","he","said.","Interior","Minister","Wu","Po-hsiung","said","when","the","Straits","Exchange","Founda-","tion","and","its","mainland","counterpart","meet","in","Taipei","in","late","March,","they","might"]},{"text":"agree to add a retroactive clause for the repatriation of mainland hijack- ers who have come here in the past year. The plane, carrying 133 passengers and crew members, was hijacked to Taiwan shortly after it took off from Chengdu","tokens":["agree","to","add","a","retroactive","clause","for","the","repatriation","of","mainland","hijack-","ers","who","have","come","here","in","the","past","year.","The","plane,","carrying","133","passengers","and","crew","members,","was","hijacked","to","Taiwan","shortly","after","it","took","off","from","Chengdu"]},{"text":"in southwestern China on a regular flight to Fuzhou. The plane landed at the Chiang Kaishek International Airport at 10:42 am and was allowed to leave Taiwan at 2:44 pm.","tokens":["in","southwestern","China","on","a","regular","flight","to","Fuzhou.","The","plane","landed","at","the","Chiang","Kaishek","International","Airport","at","10:42","am","and","was","allowed","to","leave","Taiwan","at","2:44","pm."]},{"text":"A spokesman for the Hong Kong Government said the plane had entered the mainland at 3:30 pm.","tokens":["A","spokesman","for","the","Hong","Kong","Government","said","the","plane","had","entered","the","mainland","at","3:30","pm."]}]},"T32":{"key":"T32","title":"T32 The ceiling for foreign investment in Taiwan…","paras":[{"text":"The ceiling for foreign investment in Taiwan stock market will be raised to US$10 billion starting tomorrow, the Central Bank of China (CBC) announced yesterday.","tokens":["The","ceiling","for","foreign","investment","in","Taiwan","stock","market","will","be","raised","to","US$10","billion","starting","tomorrow,","the","Central","Bank","of","China","(CBC)","announced","yesterday."]},{"text":"\"The move signifies our commitment to promote financial liberali- zation and internationalization,\" CBC Deputy Governor Yu Cheng told a news conference. The move is expected to attract more foreign funds to the Taiwan bourse.","tokens":["\"The","move","signifies","our","commitment","to","promote","financial","liberali-","zation","and","internationalization,\"","CBC","Deputy","Governor","Yu","Cheng","told","a","news","conference.","The","move","is","expected","to","attract","more","foreign","funds","to","the","Taiwan","bourse."]},{"text":"The ceiling for total investment by foreign financial institutions, which gained permission to invest directly in the Taiwan bourse in early 1991, will be raised to US$7.5 billion from US$5 billion, Yu said.","tokens":["The","ceiling","for","total","investment","by","foreign","financial","institutions,","which","gained","permission","to","invest","directly","in","the","Taiwan","bourse","in","early","1991,","will","be","raised","to","US$7.5","billion","from","US$5","billion,","Yu","said."]},{"text":"The central bank also set a ceiling of US$2.5 billion on overseas fundraising by Taiwanese securities investment trust firms. Previously, the firms had not faced a formal ceiling.","tokens":["The","central","bank","also","set","a","ceiling","of","US$2.5","billion","on","overseas","fundraising","by","Taiwanese","securities","investment","trust","firms.","Previously,","the","firms","had","not","faced","a","formal","ceiling."]},{"text":"Yu said the reform would allow foreign funds to account for about six percent of the total stock market capitalization, roughly in line with curbs imposed by South Korea on its market and near the proportion of Japanese stocks held","tokens":["Yu","said","the","reform","would","allow","foreign","funds","to","account","for","about","six","percent","of","the","total","stock","market","capitalization,","roughly","in","line","with","curbs","imposed","by","South","Korea","on","its","market","and","near","the","proportion","of","Japanese","stocks","held"]},{"text":"by foreigners. The central bank, concerned that fund inflows could destabilize finan- cial markets and hurt exporters by pushing up the value of the Taiwan dol- lar, had resisted heavy political pressure to raise the investment ceiling for several months.","tokens":["by","foreigners.","The","central","bank,","concerned","that","fund","inflows","could","destabilize","finan-","cial","markets","and","hurt","exporters","by","pushing","up","the","value","of","the","Taiwan","dol-","lar,","had","resisted","heavy","political","pressure","to","raise","the","investment","ceiling","for","several","months."]},{"text":"The Securities and Exchange Commission, which wants to make Taiwan a regional financial center as the island prepares to join the General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade (Gatt), had pressed for a ceiling as high as US$20 billion.","tokens":["The","Securities","and","Exchange","Commission,","which","wants","to","make","Taiwan","a","regional","financial","center","as","the","island","prepares","to","join","the","General","Agreement","on","Tariffs","and","Trade","(Gatt),","had","pressed","for","a","ceiling","as","high","as","US$20","billion."]},{"text":"\"We welcome foreign funds for long-term investment, but not those for short-term profit-taking,\" said CBC Deputy Governor Yu. He said capital inflows might push the annual M2 money supply growth up to an estimated 16.7 percent.","tokens":["\"We","welcome","foreign","funds","for","long-term","investment,","but","not","those","for","short-term","profit-taking,\"","said","CBC","Deputy","Governor","Yu.","He","said","capital","inflows","might","push","the","annual","M2","money","supply","growth","up","to","an","estimated","16.7","percent."]},{"text":"\"The central bank is prepared to prevent this by absorbing liquidity in the money market to keep growth in a range of 10 to 15 percent,\" he added.","tokens":["\"The","central","bank","is","prepared","to","prevent","this","by","absorbing","liquidity","in","the","money","market","to","keep","growth","in","a","range","of","10","to","15","percent,\"","he","added."]},{"text":"Foreign financial institutions have so far received approval to bring US$4.71 billion into Taiwan, and have actually remitted US$3.36 billion. Domestic investment trust firms have been approved to remit US$1.53 billion and have brought in US$1.1 billion.","tokens":["Foreign","financial","institutions","have","so","far","received","approval","to","bring","US$4.71","billion","into","Taiwan,","and","have","actually","remitted","US$3.36","billion.","Domestic","investment","trust","firms","have","been","approved","to","remit","US$1.53","billion","and","have","brought","in","US$1.1","billion."]},{"text":"\"There is still ample room for foreign capital to flow into the local bourse,\" Yu said. Presently, foreign funds account for about two percent of Taiwan's total stock market capitalization.","tokens":["\"There","is","still","ample","room","for","foreign","capital","to","flow","into","the","local","bourse,\"","Yu","said.","Presently,","foreign","funds","account","for","about","two","percent","of","Taiwan's","total","stock","market","capitalization."]},{"text":"Securities and Exchange Commission Chairman Tai Li-ning said the ratio should be raised to 10 percent if Tai- wan wanted its stock index to be incorporated into the widely known Stanley international stock index.","tokens":["Securities","and","Exchange","Commission","Chairman","Tai","Li-ning","said","the","ratio","should","be","raised","to","10","percent","if","Tai-","wan","wanted","its","stock","index","to","be","incorporated","into","the","widely","known","Stanley","international","stock","index."]},{"text":"Local fund managers and securities analysts said the reform was ex- pected to trigger a new wave of foreign interest in the Taiwan stock mar- ket, which soared 80 percent in the final quarter of last year although it has","tokens":["Local","fund","managers","and","securities","analysts","said","the","reform","was","ex-","pected","to","trigger","a","new","wave","of","foreign","interest","in","the","Taiwan","stock","mar-","ket,","which","soared","80","percent","in","the","final","quarter","of","last","year","although","it","has"]},{"text":"fallen back since mid-February amid heavy profit-taking. Some other analysts pointed out, however, that selling pressure re- mained likely to cut short any nearterm rally sparked by the central bank's announcement.","tokens":["fallen","back","since","mid-February","amid","heavy","profit-taking.","Some","other","analysts","pointed","out,","however,","that","selling","pressure","re-","mained","likely","to","cut","short","any","nearterm","rally","sparked","by","the","central","bank's","announcement."]},{"text":"The market's weighted index closed at 5,671.46 yes- terday, and brokers expect the index to surge to 6,000 in the coming week. With economic growth officially forecast at 6.2 percent this year and corporate earnings per share expected to rise","tokens":["The","market's","weighted","index","closed","at","5,671.46","yes-","terday,","and","brokers","expect","the","index","to","surge","to","6,000","in","the","coming","week.","With","economic","growth","officially","forecast","at","6.2","percent","this","year","and","corporate","earnings","per","share","expected","to","rise"]},{"text":"by around 20 percent, some analysts said the index could hit 7,000 points by year's end. The central bank's announcement sent the New Taiwan dollar advancing 10.8 cents to close at an eight-month high of 26.32 to the US dollar","tokens":["by","around","20","percent,","some","analysts","said","the","index","could","hit","7,000","points","by","year's","end.","The","central","bank's","announcement","sent","the","New","Taiwan","dollar","advancing","10.8","cents","to","close","at","an","eight-month","high","of","26.32","to","the","US","dollar"]},{"text":"from 26.428 on Friday. Foreign exchange dealers said the New Taiwan dollar could remain un- der upward pressure next week unless the central bank intervened in the market.","tokens":["from","26.428","on","Friday.","Foreign","exchange","dealers","said","the","New","Taiwan","dollar","could","remain","un-","der","upward","pressure","next","week","unless","the","central","bank","intervened","in","the","market."]},{"text":"Premier Lien Chan, stepping up efforts to deter election fraud, called yesterday for revised polling procedures and a thorough investigation of the bribery that marred Monday's internal elections of 21 local parlia- ments.","tokens":["Premier","Lien","Chan,","stepping","up","efforts","to","deter","election","fraud,","called","yesterday","for","revised","polling","procedures","and","a","thorough","investigation","of","the","bribery","that","marred","Monday's","internal","elections","of","21","local","parlia-","ments."]},{"text":"Lein ordered the Interior Ministry to study the possibility of narrow- ing the time between the elections of councilors and the internal voting for speakers and vice speakers.","tokens":["Lein","ordered","the","Interior","Ministry","to","study","the","possibility","of","narrow-","ing","the","time","between","the","elections","of","councilors","and","the","internal","voting","for","speakers","and","vice","speakers."]},{"text":"Having the polling for both take place on the same day, which would require election law revisions, might deny candidates the time they need to manipulate the speaker and vice speaker races, Lien said.","tokens":["Having","the","polling","for","both","take","place","on","the","same","day,","which","would","require","election","law","revisions,","might","deny","candidates","the","time","they","need","to","manipulate","the","speaker","and","vice","speaker","races,","Lien","said."]},{"text":"The current procedures, which schedule the internal elections of speakers and vice speakers about a month after the councilor polls, con- tribute to the election fraud, Lien maintained.","tokens":["The","current","procedures,","which","schedule","the","internal","elections","of","speakers","and","vice","speakers","about","a","month","after","the","councilor","polls,","con-","tribute","to","the","election","fraud,","Lien","maintained."]},{"text":"The Interior Ministry may have to propose further revisions to the Election and Recall Law, even though one set of revisions has already been submitted to the Legislative Yuan.","tokens":["The","Interior","Ministry","may","have","to","propose","further","revisions","to","the","Election","and","Recall","Law,","even","though","one","set","of","revisions","has","already","been","submitted","to","the","Legislative","Yuan."]},{"text":"Lien gave his instructions during a Cabinet meeting following a con- demnation Wednesday by ruling Kuomintang leaders of the corrupt speaker and vice speaker races.","tokens":["Lien","gave","his","instructions","during","a","Cabinet","meeting","following","a","con-","demnation","Wednesday","by","ruling","Kuomintang","leaders","of","the","corrupt","speaker","and","vice","speaker","races."]},{"text":"During yesterday's meeting, Minister Without Portfolio Huang Shih- cheng proposed a radical cut in the terms of elected officials to one year, giving them little time to profit, through their elected positions, from their campaign investments.","tokens":["During","yesterday's","meeting,","Minister","Without","Portfolio","Huang","Shih-","cheng","proposed","a","radical","cut","in","the","terms","of","elected","officials","to","one","year,","giving","them","little","time","to","profit,","through","their","elected","positions,","from","their","campaign","investments."]},{"text":"Inside the Legislature, lawmakers have also stepped up efforts to de- ter election fraud. Many lawmakers have proposed to revise the Election and Recall Law in a move to prevent vote-buyers from taking office.","tokens":["Inside","the","Legislature,","lawmakers","have","also","stepped","up","efforts","to","de-","ter","election","fraud.","Many","lawmakers","have","proposed","to","revise","the","Election","and","Recall","Law","in","a","move","to","prevent","vote-buyers","from","taking","office."]},{"text":"Ruling Kuomintang lawmaker Huang Chu-wen yesterday asserted that political parties should also be punished if their members were convicted of election fraud. He said a party may be disbanded if its members are frequently involv- ed in polling irregularities.","tokens":["Ruling","Kuomintang","lawmaker","Huang","Chu-wen","yesterday","asserted","that","political","parties","should","also","be","punished","if","their","members","were","convicted","of","election","fraud.","He","said","a","party","may","be","disbanded","if","its","members","are","frequently","involv-","ed","in","polling","irregularities."]},{"text":"The alleged vote-buying and violence in Monday's speaker and vice speaker elections have embarrassed the ruling party because virtually all of the contests were between rival KMT factions, not between the KMT and opposition parties.","tokens":["The","alleged","vote-buying","and","violence","in","Monday's","speaker","and","vice","speaker","elections","have","embarrassed","the","ruling","party","because","virtually","all","of","the","contests","were","between","rival","KMT","factions,","not","between","the","KMT","and","opposition","parties."]},{"text":"Shocked by the allegations, KMT leaders on Wednesday berated the party apparatus for either turning a blind eye to the fraud or even helping KMT candidates buy votes.","tokens":["Shocked","by","the","allegations,","KMT","leaders","on","Wednesday","berated","the","party","apparatus","for","either","turning","a","blind","eye","to","the","fraud","or","even","helping","KMT","candidates","buy","votes."]},{"text":"But it remained doubtful yesterday whether the government and the rul- ing party can succeed in curbing election fraud at the grassroots level. Regional KMT factions have been a major force and source of votes for the ruling party in","tokens":["But","it","remained","doubtful","yesterday","whether","the","government","and","the","rul-","ing","party","can","succeed","in","curbing","election","fraud","at","the","grassroots","level.","Regional","KMT","factions","have","been","a","major","force","and","source","of","votes","for","the","ruling","party","in"]},{"text":"national elections. KMT Secretary General Hsu Shui-teh, admitting that the factions are beyond the control of the party, yesterday rebuked the criticisms that the party apparatus had abetted the irregularities.","tokens":["national","elections.","KMT","Secretary","General","Hsu","Shui-teh,","admitting","that","the","factions","are","beyond","the","control","of","the","party,","yesterday","rebuked","the","criticisms","that","the","party","apparatus","had","abetted","the","irregularities."]},{"text":"In a meeting of ranking KMT officials to evaluate the elections, Hsu said the criticisms were unfair and a blow to the party faithful who worked hard to win the elections.","tokens":["In","a","meeting","of","ranking","KMT","officials","to","evaluate","the","elections,","Hsu","said","the","criticisms","were","unfair","and","a","blow","to","the","party","faithful","who","worked","hard","to","win","the","elections."]},{"text":"Hsu, pinning the blame on what he said was a deterioration of social values, said winning in the elections is the first priority. He said the criticisms were apparently from people who had never ac- tually participated in campaigns and","tokens":["Hsu,","pinning","the","blame","on","what","he","said","was","a","deterioration","of","social","values,","said","winning","in","the","elections","is","the","first","priority.","He","said","the","criticisms","were","apparently","from","people","who","had","never","ac-","tually","participated","in","campaigns","and"]},{"text":"thus had never known the difficult- ies. Although there have been numerous allegations about vote-buying sur- rounding Monday's elections, judicial officials said it is difficult to obtain evidence.","tokens":["thus","had","never","known","the","difficult-","ies.","Although","there","have","been","numerous","allegations","about","vote-buying","sur-","rounding","Monday's","elections,","judicial","officials","said","it","is","difficult","to","obtain","evidence."]},{"text":"Justice Minister Ma Ying-jeou, saying a total of 32 cases of vote- buying in Monday's elections are currently being investigated, urged wit- nesses to come forward.","tokens":["Justice","Minister","Ma","Ying-jeou,","saying","a","total","of","32","cases","of","vote-","buying","in","Monday's","elections","are","currently","being","investigated,","urged","wit-","nesses","to","come","forward."]}]},"T33":{"key":"T33","title":"T33 Despite the ruling Kuomintang's landslide victory in…","paras":[{"text":"Despite the ruling Kuomintang's landslide victory in Monday's elec- tions of local council speakers and vice speakers, party leaders yester- day condemned the widespread use of violence and vote-buying.","tokens":["Despite","the","ruling","Kuomintang's","landslide","victory","in","Monday's","elec-","tions","of","local","council","speakers","and","vice","speakers,","party","leaders","yester-","day","condemned","the","widespread","use","of","violence","and","vote-buying."]},{"text":"Yu Kuo-hwa, a member of the Central Standing Committee, said the of- fenses, apparently committed by KMT candidates in the almost intraparty race, have seriously dampened the party's reputation.","tokens":["Yu","Kuo-hwa,","a","member","of","the","Central","Standing","Committee,","said","the","of-","fenses,","apparently","committed","by","KMT","candidates","in","the","almost","intraparty","race,","have","seriously","dampened","the","party's","reputation."]},{"text":"Vice Chairman Hau Peitsun questioned whether regional party offices had turned a blind eye to the rampant bribery, or had even helped KMT candidates with their illicit activities.","tokens":["Vice","Chairman","Hau","Peitsun","questioned","whether","regional","party","offices","had","turned","a","blind","eye","to","the","rampant","bribery,","or","had","even","helped","KMT","candidates","with","their","illicit","activities."]},{"text":"Both KMT leaders called for an investigation into the matter, to punish those who were involved in the illegalities. Their criticisms followed an evaluation report on Monday's elections presented at the meeting of the decisionmaking Central Standing Committee.","tokens":["Both","KMT","leaders","called","for","an","investigation","into","the","matter,","to","punish","those","who","were","involved","in","the","illegalities.","Their","criticisms","followed","an","evaluation","report","on","Monday's","elections","presented","at","the","meeting","of","the","decisionmaking","Central","Standing","Committee."]},{"text":"Responding to the censure and the report, KMT Chairman Lee Teng-hui ordered an internal investigation into the irregularities and factional clashes that were at the core of the matter.","tokens":["Responding","to","the","censure","and","the","report,","KMT","Chairman","Lee","Teng-hui","ordered","an","internal","investigation","into","the","irregularities","and","factional","clashes","that","were","at","the","core","of","the","matter."]},{"text":"According to the report, prepared by the party's Department of Organi- zation Affairs, the elections were seriously marred by violence, vote-buy- ing and factional competitions.","tokens":["According","to","the","report,","prepared","by","the","party's","Department","of","Organi-","zation","Affairs,","the","elections","were","seriously","marred","by","violence,","vote-buy-","ing","and","factional","competitions."]},{"text":"The report points out that the department had attempted to select the best candidates through coordination and negotiations between KMT fac- tions. But the factional competition was further worsened by the \"overwhelm- ing interference\" of money, causing the race to","tokens":["The","report","points","out","that","the","department","had","attempted","to","select","the","best","candidates","through","coordination","and","negotiations","between","KMT","fac-","tions.","But","the","factional","competition","was","further","worsened","by","the","\"overwhelm-","ing","interference\"","of","money,","causing","the","race","to"]},{"text":"get out of control by the party. The factional conflicts will continue to hamper the normal operation of local parliaments, and by extension, the development of the cities and counties, stated the report.","tokens":["get","out","of","control","by","the","party.","The","factional","conflicts","will","continue","to","hamper","the","normal","operation","of","local","parliaments,","and","by","extension,","the","development","of","the","cities","and","counties,","stated","the","report."]},{"text":"It is imperative for the party to seek out ways to settle factional differences. The report calls on the ruling party and the government to step up efforts to \"make evaluations and improvements\" to curb election offenses.","tokens":["It","is","imperative","for","the","party","to","seek","out","ways","to","settle","factional","differences.","The","report","calls","on","the","ruling","party","and","the","government","to","step","up","efforts","to","\"make","evaluations","and","improvements\"","to","curb","election","offenses."]},{"text":"Local media have reported that some of the candidates spent close to NT$100 million to win their campaigns. Death threats and shootings have also been reported.","tokens":["Local","media","have","reported","that","some","of","the","candidates","spent","close","to","NT$100","million","to","win","their","campaigns.","Death","threats","and","shootings","have","also","been","reported."]},{"text":"In one case, the brother of the speaker at the Tai- chung County Council was shot and seriously injured. Tough competitions between KMT's local factions were behind the de- viant break in procedure.","tokens":["In","one","case,","the","brother","of","the","speaker","at","the","Tai-","chung","County","Council","was","shot","and","seriously","injured.","Tough","competitions","between","KMT's","local","factions","were","behind","the","de-","viant","break","in","procedure."]},{"text":"The KMT, as expected, swept almost all the speaker and vice-speaker seats in the 21 county and city councils of Taiwan, in races that were actually competitions between the ruling party's local factions.","tokens":["The","KMT,","as","expected,","swept","almost","all","the","speaker","and","vice-speaker","seats","in","the","21","county","and","city","councils","of","Taiwan,","in","races","that","were","actually","competitions","between","the","ruling","party's","local","factions."]},{"text":"The local factions, with their political ambitions and alleged con- nections with gangsters, have always been a headache for the ruling party. Factional control of the councils brings not only political fame for the winning faction, but may also help","tokens":["The","local","factions,","with","their","political","ambitions","and","alleged","con-","nections","with","gangsters,","have","always","been","a","headache","for","the","ruling","party.","Factional","control","of","the","councils","brings","not","only","political","fame","for","the","winning","faction,","but","may","also","help"]},{"text":"the group manipulate government resources. At the Central Standing Committee meeting yesterday, Chairman Lee hed to acknowledge this fact when instructing party aides to study and seek out ways to solve factional conflicts.","tokens":["the","group","manipulate","government","resources.","At","the","Central","Standing","Committee","meeting","yesterday,","Chairman","Lee","hed","to","acknowledge","this","fact","when","instructing","party","aides","to","study","and","seek","out","ways","to","solve","factional","conflicts."]},{"text":"Yu Kuo-hwa, saying that the party's reputation had been seriously damaged by the corrupt election practices, demanded the party to do more than \"make evaluations and improvements,\" as suggested by the Department of Organization Affairs.","tokens":["Yu","Kuo-hwa,","saying","that","the","party's","reputation","had","been","seriously","damaged","by","the","corrupt","election","practices,","demanded","the","party","to","do","more","than","\"make","evaluations","and","improvements,\"","as","suggested","by","the","Department","of","Organization","Affairs."]},{"text":"Vice Chairman Hau Peitsun, despite lauding the department for its success in the election, called for an investigation. Hau said he could not understand why the KMT candidates still had to buy votes in an almost intra-party race.","tokens":["Vice","Chairman","Hau","Peitsun,","despite","lauding","the","department","for","its","success","in","the","election,","called","for","an","investigation.","Hau","said","he","could","not","understand","why","the","KMT","candidates","still","had","to","buy","votes","in","an","almost","intra-party","race."]},{"text":"Meanwhile, Justice Minister Ma Ying-jeou vowed to continue investi- gations into vote-buying allegations. \"These cases... have not yet been closed despite the fact that the voting is already over.","tokens":["Meanwhile,","Justice","Minister","Ma","Ying-jeou","vowed","to","continue","investi-","gations","into","vote-buying","allegations.","\"These","cases...","have","not","yet","been","closed","despite","the","fact","that","the","voting","is","already","over."]},{"text":"We will continue with the investigations,\" said Ma. But he did not specify which cases. A woman who killed her husband after he allegedly and repeatedly beat and raped her was sentenced yesterday to five and a half years in","tokens":["We","will","continue","with","the","investigations,\"","said","Ma.","But","he","did","not","specify","which","cases.","A","woman","who","killed","her","husband","after","he","allegedly","and","repeatedly","beat","and","raped","her","was","sentenced","yesterday","to","five","and","a","half","years","in"]},{"text":"jail, drawing an immediate outcry from women's rights advocates who called the sentence too harsh. A judge announced the five year, six month prison sentence against Teng Ju-wen, 22, in Panchiao yesterday afternoon in what had been consid- ered a","tokens":["jail,","drawing","an","immediate","outcry","from","women's","rights","advocates","who","called","the","sentence","too","harsh.","A","judge","announced","the","five","year,","six","month","prison","sentence","against","Teng","Ju-wen,","22,","in","Panchiao","yesterday","afternoon","in","what","had","been","consid-","ered","a"]},{"text":"judicial test case for women abused by their husbands in Taiwan's male-dominated society. Holding a string of Buddhist beads in her hands, Teng, remained silent as the judge read the verdict.","tokens":["judicial","test","case","for","women","abused","by","their","husbands","in","Taiwan's","male-dominated","society.","Holding","a","string","of","Buddhist","beads","in","her","hands,","Teng,","remained","silent","as","the","judge","read","the","verdict."]},{"text":"Teng had testified at her trial that she was first raped by her hus- band when she was 15 years old, before they were married.","tokens":["Teng","had","testified","at","her","trial","that","she","was","first","raped","by","her","hus-","band","when","she","was","15","years","old,","before","they","were","married."]},{"text":"She also testi- fied that her husband, 20 years her senior, had also raped and abused her mother and sister. Teng's attorney yesterday immediately announced he would appeal.","tokens":["She","also","testi-","fied","that","her","husband,","20","years","her","senior,","had","also","raped","and","abused","her","mother","and","sister.","Teng's","attorney","yesterday","immediately","announced","he","would","appeal."]},{"text":"Ear- lier, another defense attorney had promised to launch an appeal if Teng re- ceived a sentence of more than five years. Women's groups, who had brought the case under the public's attention, expressed disappointment and anger.","tokens":["Ear-","lier,","another","defense","attorney","had","promised","to","launch","an","appeal","if","Teng","re-","ceived","a","sentence","of","more","than","five","years.","Women's","groups,","who","had","brought","the","case","under","the","public's","attention,","expressed","disappointment","and","anger."]},{"text":"\"We have lost hope in the judges,\" Wang Ping of the Awakening Foun- dation told The China Post. Wang criticized the court for not considering the years of brutality Teng suffered from her husband before she killed him.","tokens":["\"We","have","lost","hope","in","the","judges,\"","Wang","Ping","of","the","Awakening","Foun-","dation","told","The","China","Post.","Wang","criticized","the","court","for","not","considering","the","years","of","brutality","Teng","suffered","from","her","husband","before","she","killed","him."]},{"text":"In his explanation of the verdict, the judge cited the fact against Teng that she had killed her husband, Lin Ah-chi, two hours after he had gone to sleep, and that she had remembered all the details afterward.","tokens":["In","his","explanation","of","the","verdict,","the","judge","cited","the","fact","against","Teng","that","she","had","killed","her","husband,","Lin","Ah-chi,","two","hours","after","he","had","gone","to","sleep,","and","that","she","had","remembered","all","the","details","afterward."]},{"text":"In her favor, the judge accepted that she had turned herself in to the police and commended Teng for her good behavior after she was arrested.","tokens":["In","her","favor,","the","judge","accepted","that","she","had","turned","herself","in","to","the","police","and","commended","Teng","for","her","good","behavior","after","she","was","arrested."]},{"text":"These two factors had moved the court to use Article 62 of the Criminal Code in order to reduce the verdict, the judge commented.","tokens":["These","two","factors","had","moved","the","court","to","use","Article","62","of","the","Criminal","Code","in","order","to","reduce","the","verdict,","the","judge","commented."]},{"text":"Wang said she was especially upset because Teng's two sons would re- mainin the care of Lin's brother. Before the killing on Oct. 27, the two boys had often been cared for by Teng's parents, she said.","tokens":["Wang","said","she","was","especially","upset","because","Teng's","two","sons","would","re-","mainin","the","care","of","Lin's","brother.","Before","the","killing","on","Oct.","27,","the","two","boys","had","often","been","cared","for","by","Teng's","parents,","she","said."]},{"text":"In an interview with the press before the verdict was announced, Teng had expressed the hope that her sentence would be delayed for a while so she could arrange care for her children, yet in the end that request was","tokens":["In","an","interview","with","the","press","before","the","verdict","was","announced,","Teng","had","expressed","the","hope","that","her","sentence","would","be","delayed","for","a","while","so","she","could","arrange","care","for","her","children,","yet","in","the","end","that","request","was"]},{"text":"not considered. The cost of the trial will have to be borne by Lin's relatives, the judge ruled. As to the appeal, Cheng Huei-chi, the secretary-general of the Taipei Women's Rescue Foundation said she was not very optimistic while Wang","tokens":["not","considered.","The","cost","of","the","trial","will","have","to","be","borne","by","Lin's","relatives,","the","judge","ruled.","As","to","the","appeal,","Cheng","Huei-chi,","the","secretary-general","of","the","Taipei","Women's","Rescue","Foundation","said","she","was","not","very","optimistic","while","Wang"]},{"text":"de- clared she was not overly pessimistic. Cheng said a lawyer had told her that, compared to previous cases, a minimum sentence of 10 years would have been normal.","tokens":["de-","clared","she","was","not","overly","pessimistic.","Cheng","said","a","lawyer","had","told","her","that,","compared","to","previous","cases,","a","minimum","sentence","of","10","years","would","have","been","normal."]},{"text":"Seen in this light, she said there has been some progress, though she thought the sentence should have been less than three years. Wen Yueh-mei, who had come all the way from Hsinchu to express her support for Teng, said","tokens":["Seen","in","this","light,","she","said","there","has","been","some","progress,","though","she","thought","the","sentence","should","have","been","less","than","three","years.","Wen","Yueh-mei,","who","had","come","all","the","way","from","Hsinchu","to","express","her","support","for","Teng,","said"]},{"text":"she had not expected a not-guilty verdict, since the laws of the Republic of China are still not effective enough to pro- tect the victims of wife abuse.","tokens":["she","had","not","expected","a","not-guilty","verdict,","since","the","laws","of","the","Republic","of","China","are","still","not","effective","enough","to","pro-","tect","the","victims","of","wife","abuse."]},{"text":"The women's groups will continue their efforts to increase awareness of this serious social problem, Wang promised, though no plans for any concrete actions were currently ready.","tokens":["The","women's","groups","will","continue","their","efforts","to","increase","awareness","of","this","serious","social","problem,","Wang","promised,","though","no","plans","for","any","concrete","actions","were","currently","ready."]},{"text":"Activists have repeatedly called for a law against violence in the home and for a network of shelters for battered women. The Teng case is now seen by some commentators as a possible catalyst for action to help others in","tokens":["Activists","have","repeatedly","called","for","a","law","against","violence","in","the","home","and","for","a","network","of","shelters","for","battered","women.","The","Teng","case","is","now","seen","by","some","commentators","as","a","possible","catalyst","for","action","to","help","others","in"]},{"text":"a similar situation. The Social Affairs Department of the Ministry of the Interior is in- vestigating the possibility of expanding a 24-hour shelter network for abused children to accept women as well.","tokens":["a","similar","situation.","The","Social","Affairs","Department","of","the","Ministry","of","the","Interior","is","in-","vestigating","the","possibility","of","expanding","a","24-hour","shelter","network","for","abused","children","to","accept","women","as","well."]}]},"T34":{"key":"T34","title":"T34 Many people in the world are concerned…","paras":[{"text":"Many people in the world are concerned about the dwindling size of the whale population in the oceans and seas. They are worried because the number of whales is getting so small.","tokens":["Many","people","in","the","world","are","concerned","about","the","dwindling","size","of","the","whale","population","in","the","oceans","and","seas.","They","are","worried","because","the","number","of","whales","is","getting","so","small."]},{"text":"Whales are very large aquatic animals which have been hunted since about the seventh century. However, certain types of whale have been hunted too much and there are so few now that they are in danger of becoming extinct.","tokens":["Whales","are","very","large","aquatic","animals","which","have","been","hunted","since","about","the","seventh","century.","However,","certain","types","of","whale","have","been","hunted","too","much","and","there","are","so","few","now","that","they","are","in","danger","of","becoming","extinct."]},{"text":"Fortunately, these concerned people are working to save the whales from such a fate. Why should we save the whales? There are two important reasons.","tokens":["Fortunately,","these","concerned","people","are","working","to","save","the","whales","from","such","a","fate.","Why","should","we","save","the","whales?","There","are","two","important","reasons."]},{"text":"The first is that whales help to keep a balance between plants and animals. People have disturbed this balance by throwing waste into the sea.","tokens":["The","first","is","that","whales","help","to","keep","a","balance","between","plants","and","animals.","People","have","disturbed","this","balance","by","throwing","waste","into","the","sea."]},{"text":"This sewage and garbage has increased the amount of salt in the sea water which in turn, helps the tiny plants and animals, called plankton, to grow.","tokens":["This","sewage","and","garbage","has","increased","the","amount","of","salt","in","the","sea","water","which","in","turn,","helps","the","tiny","plants","and","animals,","called","plankton,","to","grow."]},{"text":"Al- though plankton can be harmful to fish, they are necessary for whales to survive. Whale eat enormous amounts of plankton and therefore keep the ocean environment clean enough for fish.","tokens":["Al-","though","plankton","can","be","harmful","to","fish,","they","are","necessary","for","whales","to","survive.","Whale","eat","enormous","amounts","of","plankton","and","therefore","keep","the","ocean","environment","clean","enough","for","fish."]},{"text":"In addition, because fish are an important source of food for many people, people need whales, and so they try to save them. How are people working to save whales?","tokens":["In","addition,","because","fish","are","an","important","source","of","food","for","many","people,","people","need","whales,","and","so","they","try","to","save","them.","How","are","people","working","to","save","whales?"]},{"text":"Some worried people are attem- pting to save whales through legal means, by using the law. These people attend meetings of the whaling commissions to ask whalers to reduce the number of whales that can be killed in a year.","tokens":["Some","worried","people","are","attem-","pting","to","save","whales","through","legal","means,","by","using","the","law.","These","people","attend","meetings","of","the","whaling","commissions","to","ask","whalers","to","reduce","the","number","of","whales","that","can","be","killed","in","a","year."]},{"text":"They also work within coun- tries to persuade law-makers to make whaling and the use of whale products illegal. Other concerned people are working to save whales from becoming ex- tinct in another way.","tokens":["They","also","work","within","coun-","tries","to","persuade","law-makers","to","make","whaling","and","the","use","of","whale","products","illegal.","Other","concerned","people","are","working","to","save","whales","from","becoming","ex-","tinct","in","another","way."]},{"text":"These people believe that the best means to save the whales is by making whale products expensive. They think that if whale products become less economical than similar products, then whalers will kill fewer whales.","tokens":["These","people","believe","that","the","best","means","to","save","the","whales","is","by","making","whale","products","expensive.","They","think","that","if","whale","products","become","less","economical","than","similar","products,","then","whalers","will","kill","fewer","whales."]},{"text":"Consequently, the supply of whale products will de- crease because of the low demand for them. One of the most valuable whale products is whale oil which is processed from the fat, meat and bones of whales.","tokens":["Consequently,","the","supply","of","whale","products","will","de-","crease","because","of","the","low","demand","for","them.","One","of","the","most","valuable","whale","products","is","whale","oil","which","is","processed","from","the","fat,","meat","and","bones","of","whales."]},{"text":"This oil has many uses, for example, in the manufacture of mar- garine, soap and certain cosmetics. One large whale may yield 150 barrels of whale oil.","tokens":["This","oil","has","many","uses,","for","example,","in","the","manufacture","of","mar-","garine,","soap","and","certain","cosmetics.","One","large","whale","may","yield","150","barrels","of","whale","oil."]},{"text":"However, scientists have found an alternative yet similar oil from a desert plant, jojoba oil. People are trying to produce jojoba oil more economically than whale oil and hope that is this way they can help to save the whales.","tokens":["However,","scientists","have","found","an","alternative","yet","similar","oil","from","a","desert","plant,","jojoba","oil.","People","are","trying","to","produce","jojoba","oil","more","economically","than","whale","oil","and","hope","that","is","this","way","they","can","help","to","save","the","whales."]},{"text":"Concern for whales is world-wide. Some governments will not let peo- ple sell whale products in their countries. Others have changed the laws on whaling to prevent whalers from killing as many whales as before.","tokens":["Concern","for","whales","is","world-wide.","Some","governments","will","not","let","peo-","ple","sell","whale","products","in","their","countries.","Others","have","changed","the","laws","on","whaling","to","prevent","whalers","from","killing","as","many","whales","as","before."]},{"text":"Peo- ple who want to save the whales are very hopeful that the gentle giants of the ocean can be saved. Why should we save the whales?","tokens":["Peo-","ple","who","want","to","save","the","whales","are","very","hopeful","that","the","gentle","giants","of","the","ocean","can","be","saved.","Why","should","we","save","the","whales?"]},{"text":"There are two important reasons. The first is the whales help to keep a balance between plants and animals. People have disturbed this balance by throwing waste into the sea.","tokens":["There","are","two","important","reasons.","The","first","is","the","whales","help","to","keep","a","balance","between","plants","and","animals.","People","have","disturbed","this","balance","by","throwing","waste","into","the","sea."]},{"text":"This sewage and garbage has increased the amount of salt in the sea water which in turn, helps the tiny plants and animals, called plankton, to grow.","tokens":["This","sewage","and","garbage","has","increased","the","amount","of","salt","in","the","sea","water","which","in","turn,","helps","the","tiny","plants","and","animals,","called","plankton,","to","grow."]},{"text":"Al- though plankton can be harmful to fish, they are necessary for whales to survive. Whales eat enormous amounts of plankton and therefore keep the ocean environment clean enough for fish.","tokens":["Al-","though","plankton","can","be","harmful","to","fish,","they","are","necessary","for","whales","to","survive.","Whales","eat","enormous","amounts","of","plankton","and","therefore","keep","the","ocean","environment","clean","enough","for","fish."]},{"text":"In addition, because fish are an important source of food for many people, people need whales, and so they try to save them. How are people working to save whales?","tokens":["In","addition,","because","fish","are","an","important","source","of","food","for","many","people,","people","need","whales,","and","so","they","try","to","save","them.","How","are","people","working","to","save","whales?"]},{"text":"Some worried people are at- tempting to save whales through legal means, by using the law. These peo- ple attend meetings of the whaling commissions to ask whalers to reduce the number of whales that can be killed in a","tokens":["Some","worried","people","are","at-","tempting","to","save","whales","through","legal","means,","by","using","the","law.","These","peo-","ple","attend","meetings","of","the","whaling","commissions","to","ask","whalers","to","reduce","the","number","of","whales","that","can","be","killed","in","a"]},{"text":"year. They also work within coun- tries to persuade law-makers to make whaling and the use of whale products illegal. Other concerned people are working to save whales from becoming extin- ct in another way.","tokens":["year.","They","also","work","within","coun-","tries","to","persuade","law-makers","to","make","whaling","and","the","use","of","whale","products","illegal.","Other","concerned","people","are","working","to","save","whales","from","becoming","extin-","ct","in","another","way."]},{"text":"These people believe that the best means to save the whales is by making whale products expensive. They think that if whale products become less economical than similar products, then whalers will kill fewer whales.","tokens":["These","people","believe","that","the","best","means","to","save","the","whales","is","by","making","whale","products","expensive.","They","think","that","if","whale","products","become","less","economical","than","similar","products,","then","whalers","will","kill","fewer","whales."]},{"text":"Consequently, the supply of whale products will de- crease because of the low demand for them. One of the most valuable whale products is whale oil which is processed from the fat, meat and bones of whales.","tokens":["Consequently,","the","supply","of","whale","products","will","de-","crease","because","of","the","low","demand","for","them.","One","of","the","most","valuable","whale","products","is","whale","oil","which","is","processed","from","the","fat,","meat","and","bones","of","whales."]},{"text":"This oil has many uses, for example, in the manufacture of mar- garine, soap and certain cosmetics. One large whale may yield 150 barrels of whale oil.","tokens":["This","oil","has","many","uses,","for","example,","in","the","manufacture","of","mar-","garine,","soap","and","certain","cosmetics.","One","large","whale","may","yield","150","barrels","of","whale","oil."]},{"text":"However, scientists have found an alternative yet similar oil from a desert plant, jojoba oil. People are trying to produce jojoba oil more economically than whale oil and hope that in this way they can help to save the whales.","tokens":["However,","scientists","have","found","an","alternative","yet","similar","oil","from","a","desert","plant,","jojoba","oil.","People","are","trying","to","produce","jojoba","oil","more","economically","than","whale","oil","and","hope","that","in","this","way","they","can","help","to","save","the","whales."]},{"text":"Concern for whales is world-wide. Some governments will not let peo- ple sell whale products in their countries. Others have changed the laws on whaling to prevent whalers from killing as many whales as before.","tokens":["Concern","for","whales","is","world-wide.","Some","governments","will","not","let","peo-","ple","sell","whale","products","in","their","countries.","Others","have","changed","the","laws","on","whaling","to","prevent","whalers","from","killing","as","many","whales","as","before."]},{"text":"Peo- ple who want to save the whales are very hopeful that the gentle giants of the ocean can be saved. One of the famous tourist attractions situated in Kuala Lumpur is the Muzium Negara which is also one of","tokens":["Peo-","ple","who","want","to","save","the","whales","are","very","hopeful","that","the","gentle","giants","of","the","ocean","can","be","saved.","One","of","the","famous","tourist","attractions","situated","in","Kuala","Lumpur","is","the","Muzium","Negara","which","is","also","one","of"]},{"text":"the finest institutions of its kind in Southeast Asia. The Muzium Negara, barely three decades old, was charged by our first Prime Minister, Tunku Abdul Rahman with the task of helping to forge a spirit of national identity in Malaysia's","tokens":["the","finest","institutions","of","its","kind","in","Southeast","Asia.","The","Muzium","Negara,","barely","three","decades","old,","was","charged","by","our","first","Prime","Minister,","Tunku","Abdul","Rahman","with","the","task","of","helping","to","forge","a","spirit","of","national","identity","in","Malaysia's"]},{"text":"multi-racial society. This mu- seum has become the focus of this culturally rich country, a preserver of the nation's heritage. Seriously damaged during World War II, a publicity campaign was mount- ed in 1962 to rebuild the museum.","tokens":["multi-racial","society.","This","mu-","seum","has","become","the","focus","of","this","culturally","rich","country,","a","preserver","of","the","nation's","heritage.","Seriously","damaged","during","World","War","II,","a","publicity","campaign","was","mount-","ed","in","1962","to","rebuild","the","museum."]},{"text":"It was also necessary to replace the ex- hibits lost during the war. The campaign included, among other things, co- llecting artifacts, especially Malay crafts.","tokens":["It","was","also","necessary","to","replace","the","ex-","hibits","lost","during","the","war.","The","campaign","included,","among","other","things,","co-","llecting","artifacts,","especially","Malay","crafts."]},{"text":"Help came from unexpected quarters. A Malay wood carver donated 40 lengths of magnificent hand woven silk, all of them more than 60 years old.","tokens":["Help","came","from","unexpected","quarters.","A","Malay","wood","carver","donated","40","lengths","of","magnificent","hand","woven","silk,","all","of","them","more","than","60","years","old."]},{"text":"Intricately carved doors and screens and antique furniture of an entire Chinese household came from Ma- lacca. A woman donated a full bridal outfit from the golden and jewelled headband down to the beaded slippers sewn by the bride.","tokens":["Intricately","carved","doors","and","screens","and","antique","furniture","of","an","entire","Chinese","household","came","from","Ma-","lacca.","A","woman","donated","a","full","bridal","outfit","from","the","golden","and","jewelled","headband","down","to","the","beaded","slippers","sewn","by","the","bride."]},{"text":"The museum was opened in August 1963. To entice people into the museum again and again, exhibitions are held every now and then. These exhibitions range from Malaysian arts and crafts and natural history to information on public interest campaigns.","tokens":["The","museum","was","opened","in","August","1963.","To","entice","people","into","the","museum","again","and","again,","exhibitions","are","held","every","now","and","then.","These","exhibitions","range","from","Malaysian","arts","and","crafts","and","natural","history","to","information","on","public","interest","campaigns."]},{"text":"In addi- tion, foreign embassies are invited to use the museum for special travell- ing exhibits from their own countries. Live demonstrations, singers and multi-media presentations spice up the shows.","tokens":["In","addi-","tion,","foreign","embassies","are","invited","to","use","the","museum","for","special","travell-","ing","exhibits","from","their","own","countries.","Live","demonstrations,","singers","and","multi-media","presentations","spice","up","the","shows."]},{"text":"One of the most successful exhibitions was one that featured the per- sonal effects of a popular Malaysian actor, director, singer and composer, P.","tokens":["One","of","the","most","successful","exhibitions","was","one","that","featured","the","per-","sonal","effects","of","a","popular","Malaysian","actor,","director,","singer","and","composer,","P."]},{"text":"Ramlee, soon after he died. His films were screened daily during the exhibition. Popular singers and film stars were invited to perform and the museum was kept open until midnight.","tokens":["Ramlee,","soon","after","he","died.","His","films","were","screened","daily","during","the","exhibition.","Popular","singers","and","film","stars","were","invited","to","perform","and","the","museum","was","kept","open","until","midnight."]},{"text":"\"A museum should not only show the past, but also the changes of the present,\" said the then director-general of the museum. Despite many raised eyebrows, a million people visited the museum during the three weeks of the exhibition.","tokens":["\"A","museum","should","not","only","show","the","past,","but","also","the","changes","of","the","present,\"","said","the","then","director-general","of","the","museum.","Despite","many","raised","eyebrows,","a","million","people","visited","the","museum","during","the","three","weeks","of","the","exhibition."]},{"text":"As protector of the nation's heritage, the government-funded Muzium Negara stands to safeguard national monuments and to prevent important ob- jects from being exported.","tokens":["As","protector","of","the","nation's","heritage,","the","government-funded","Muzium","Negara","stands","to","safeguard","national","monuments","and","to","prevent","important","ob-","jects","from","being","exported."]},{"text":"What it is building, more than a collection of artifacts, is a sense of nationhood, and it serves as a model of what can be done with an unlimited supply of imagination, energy, flexibility and optimism.","tokens":["What","it","is","building,","more","than","a","collection","of","artifacts,","is","a","sense","of","nationhood,","and","it","serves","as","a","model","of","what","can","be","done","with","an","unlimited","supply","of","imagination,","energy,","flexibility","and","optimism."]}]},"T35":{"key":"T35","title":"T35 Musical mystery tour, from a to z,…","paras":[{"text":"Musical mystery tour, from a to z, inspired by the 200th anniversary of Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart's discordant death. Amadeus--Mozart's middle name is also the name of Peter Shaffer's acclaimed play on the life of Mozart, which was subsequently made unto","tokens":["Musical","mystery","tour,","from","a","to","z,","inspired","by","the","200th","anniversary","of","Wolfgang","Amadeus","Mozart's","discordant","death.","Amadeus--Mozart's","middle","name","is","also","the","name","of","Peter","Shaffer's","acclaimed","play","on","the","life","of","Mozart,","which","was","subsequently","made","unto"]},{"text":"the Oscar-winning film of the same name. Amadeus means just \"beloved of God,\" and Peter Shaffer used the name to emphasize that the greatest inspiration cannot be simply reasoned, that something above ourselves is the only true source of creation.","tokens":["the","Oscar-winning","film","of","the","same","name.","Amadeus","means","just","\"beloved","of","God,\"","and","Peter","Shaffer","used","the","name","to","emphasize","that","the","greatest","inspiration","cannot","be","simply","reasoned,","that","something","above","ourselves","is","the","only","true","source","of","creation."]},{"text":"The dramatic metaphor, both on stage and in film, is an impressive one. But Shaffer's poetic license offers an often false historical picture of the composer.","tokens":["The","dramatic","metaphor,","both","on","stage","and","in","film,","is","an","impressive","one.","But","Shaffer's","poetic","license","offers","an","often","false","historical","picture","of","the","composer."]},{"text":"Mozart was playful, yes; he was hardly a teetotaler, yes. But he was not simply a drunken yokel; after a childhood in the finest courts of Europe, he could put on the social graces when necessary.","tokens":["Mozart","was","playful,","yes;","he","was","hardly","a","teetotaler,","yes.","But","he","was","not","simply","a","drunken","yokel;","after","a","childhood","in","the","finest","courts","of","Europe,","he","could","put","on","the","social","graces","when","necessary."]},{"text":"Beethoven and Bach--History conveniently inserts Mozart the classicist between Bach the baroque and Beethoven the romantic. Bach was something of an old fogy, but Mozart loved imitating Bach fugues for both piano and symphony music.","tokens":["Beethoven","and","Bach--History","conveniently","inserts","Mozart","the","classicist","between","Bach","the","baroque","and","Beethoven","the","romantic.","Bach","was","something","of","an","old","fogy,","but","Mozart","loved","imitating","Bach","fugues","for","both","piano","and","symphony","music."]},{"text":"Bach's son was one of Mozart's best friends, and they must have discussed the more serious composer with a mixture of awe and humor.","tokens":["Bach's","son","was","one","of","Mozart's","best","friends,","and","they","must","have","discussed","the","more","serious","composer","with","a","mixture","of","awe","and","humor."]},{"text":"On the other hand, Beethoven played Mozart's music constantly, although he thought Mozart's own piano playing \"antiquated.\" Beethoven wrote, \"to my last breath I shall be one of Mozart's greatest admirers.\"","tokens":["On","the","other","hand,","Beethoven","played","Mozart's","music","constantly,","although","he","thought","Mozart's","own","piano","playing","\"antiquated.\"","Beethoven","wrote,","\"to","my","last","breath","I","shall","be","one","of","Mozart's","greatest","admirers.\""]},{"text":"And in a benefit for Mozart's wife, he played one of Mozart's piano concertos as a tribute. Constanze--Mozatrt's wife has been departed as unfaithful and the foolish.","tokens":["And","in","a","benefit","for","Mozart's","wife,","he","played","one","of","Mozart's","piano","concertos","as","a","tribute.","Constanze--Mozatrt's","wife","has","been","departed","as","unfaithful","and","the","foolish."]},{"text":"The reality is that Mozart could never have written music without his wife by his side. After Mozart's death she needed money, and in her exhausting rounds to get this money, she made many an enemy.","tokens":["The","reality","is","that","Mozart","could","never","have","written","music","without","his","wife","by","his","side.","After","Mozart's","death","she","needed","money,","and","in","her","exhausting","rounds","to","get","this","money,","she","made","many","an","enemy."]},{"text":"But contemporaries tell about Mozart's dependence on his wife, her understanding, the fact that never once in their nine years together did they ever separate.","tokens":["But","contemporaries","tell","about","Mozart's","dependence","on","his","wife,","her","understanding,","the","fact","that","never","once","in","their","nine","years","together","did","they","ever","separate."]},{"text":"Debts--Mozart was never as poor as later generations made him out to be. His home was comfortable, his assignments were regular, if not terribly well paid.","tokens":["Debts--Mozart","was","never","as","poor","as","later","generations","made","him","out","to","be.","His","home","was","comfortable,","his","assignments","were","regular,","if","not","terribly","well","paid."]},{"text":"But money was constantly on his mind. No, he wasn't slavish to one patron, as Haydn was. But he was never satisfied with his payments--which were invariably late.","tokens":["But","money","was","constantly","on","his","mind.","No,","he","wasn't","slavish","to","one","patron,","as","Haydn","was.","But","he","was","never","satisfied","with","his","payments--which","were","invariably","late."]},{"text":"Emperor Joseph II--Did he exploit Mozart or aid him? One of Mozart's greatest patrons, Emperor Joseph refused to offer Mozart a \"stead job.\" Mozart was of two minds about this.","tokens":["Emperor","Joseph","II--Did","he","exploit","Mozart","or","aid","him?","One","of","Mozart's","greatest","patrons,","Emperor","Joseph","refused","to","offer","Mozart","a","\"stead","job.\"","Mozart","was","of","two","minds","about","this."]},{"text":"He knew that having a reliable income would help, but he also knew that he could not respond like Haydn, simply offering notes on the spot.","tokens":["He","knew","that","having","a","reliable","income","would","help,","but","he","also","knew","that","he","could","not","respond","like","Haydn,","simply","offering","notes","on","the","spot."]},{"text":"Then, too, Mozart was too audacious to be simply an imperial courtier. Flute--Did Mozart actually despise the flute? He did write to his father, \"I become quite powerless whenever I am obliged to write for this instrument, which I cannot","tokens":["Then,","too,","Mozart","was","too","audacious","to","be","simply","an","imperial","courtier.","Flute--Did","Mozart","actually","despise","the","flute?","He","did","write","to","his","father,","\"I","become","quite","powerless","whenever","I","am","obliged","to","write","for","this","instrument,","which","I","cannot"]},{"text":"bear.\" One of the world's great flautists, Jean-Pierre Rampal, has said that Mozart actually loved the flute, but was simply in a bad mood when he wrote of his displeasure and that his solos prove how much he felt for","tokens":["bear.\"","One","of","the","world's","great","flautists,","Jean-Pierre","Rampal,","has","said","that","Mozart","actually","loved","the","flute,","but","was","simply","in","a","bad","mood","when","he","wrote","of","his","displeasure","and","that","his","solos","prove","how","much","he","felt","for"]},{"text":"the instrument. Gourmandism--Did Mozart actually enjoy the famed kugel (marzipan cake), which was names in his honor? Nobody knows. In his hundreds of letters, he never comments on the great dinners given in his honor.","tokens":["the","instrument.","Gourmandism--Did","Mozart","actually","enjoy","the","famed","kugel","(marzipan","cake),","which","was","names","in","his","honor?","Nobody","knows.","In","his","hundreds","of","letters,","he","never","comments","on","the","great","dinners","given","in","his","honor."]},{"text":"And it seems that food was of no importance to the composer. One food historian has written that he probably dined on pickled cabbage regularly.","tokens":["And","it","seems","that","food","was","of","no","importance","to","the","composer.","One","food","historian","has","written","that","he","probably","dined","on","pickled","cabbage","regularly."]},{"text":"It was cheap, popular and probably contributed to Mozart's stomach problems. On the other hand, one only need consider Don Giovanni to know that Mozart was hardly oblivious to food.","tokens":["It","was","cheap,","popular","and","probably","contributed","to","Mozart's","stomach","problems.","On","the","other","hand,","one","only","need","consider","Don","Giovanni","to","know","that","Mozart","was","hardly","oblivious","to","food."]},{"text":"The Don's last aria is nothing less than a description of a huge banquet. So magnificent is this banquet that he keeps describing the menu even as he is dragged to hell!","tokens":["The","Don's","last","aria","is","nothing","less","than","a","description","of","a","huge","banquet.","So","magnificent","is","this","banquet","that","he","keeps","describing","the","menu","even","as","he","is","dragged","to","hell!"]},{"text":"Haydn--What good friends they were, how amiable and respectful they were of each other, yet how different in their callings. Haydn was, first and last, paid to provide entertainment for courts and aristocrats of his age.","tokens":["Haydn--What","good","friends","they","were,","how","amiable","and","respectful","they","were","of","each","other,","yet","how","different","in","their","callings.","Haydn","was,","first","and","last,","paid","to","provide","entertainment","for","courts","and","aristocrats","of","his","age."]},{"text":"One somehow cannot imagine him in any other century. Mozart, though, could transmute his music into any age. Infant prodigy--Was Mozart the youngest composer?","tokens":["One","somehow","cannot","imagine","him","in","any","other","century.","Mozart,","though,","could","transmute","his","music","into","any","age.","Infant","prodigy--Was","Mozart","the","youngest","composer?"]},{"text":"While he began composing at the age of four, he was outdone by Camille Saint-Saens, who was writing a the age of three. Nobody remembers Saint-Saens' works, but Mozart's were lovingly preserved by his father in little notebooks that can","tokens":["While","he","began","composing","at","the","age","of","four,","he","was","outdone","by","Camille","Saint-Saens,","who","was","writing","a","the","age","of","three.","Nobody","remembers","Saint-Saens'","works,","but","Mozart's","were","lovingly","preserved","by","his","father","in","little","notebooks","that","can"]},{"text":"still be seen in Vienna today. Jocularity--Was Mozart as stupidly funny as Peter Shaffer made him to be? He was a notorious practical joker.","tokens":["still","be","seen","in","Vienna","today.","Jocularity--Was","Mozart","as","stupidly","funny","as","Peter","Shaffer","made","him","to","be?","He","was","a","notorious","practical","joker."]},{"text":"Yet there was often reason in his madness. In 1787, a singer playing Zerlina in the first performance of Don Giovanni confessed that she was unable to scream in the right manner and the right manner and the right place","tokens":["Yet","there","was","often","reason","in","his","madness.","In","1787,","a","singer","playing","Zerlina","in","the","first","performance","of","Don","Giovanni","confessed","that","she","was","unable","to","scream","in","the","right","manner","and","the","right","manner","and","the","right","place"]},{"text":"for the composer. Finally, Mozart asked the orchestra to repeat the work while he sneaked on stage. When she was about to sing, he pinched her bottom and she shrieked!","tokens":["for","the","composer.","Finally,","Mozart","asked","the","orchestra","to","repeat","the","work","while","he","sneaked","on","stage.","When","she","was","about","to","sing,","he","pinched","her","bottom","and","she","shrieked!"]},{"text":"\"Now that,\" said Mozart, \"is the way you should do it on stage!\" Kingdom--How great was the imagination of the prodigy Mozart? Consider the kingdom of Rucken.","tokens":["\"Now","that,\"","said","Mozart,","\"is","the","way","you","should","do","it","on","stage!\"","Kingdom--How","great","was","the","imagination","of","the","prodigy","Mozart?","Consider","the","kingdom","of","Rucken."]},{"text":"Rucken means \"back,\" and in his childhood Mozart created this kingdom with its own laws and subjects. Everybody was good, people smiled, the kings were wonderful.","tokens":["Rucken","means","\"back,\"","and","in","his","childhood","Mozart","created","this","kingdom","with","its","own","laws","and","subjects.","Everybody","was","good,","people","smiled,","the","kings","were","wonderful."]},{"text":"Mozart even drew maps of the kingdom of Rucken, though, alas, they are gone today. What is the significance of Rucken? At no time was Rucken simply a hiding place, a respite from his years as a prodigy.","tokens":["Mozart","even","drew","maps","of","the","kingdom","of","Rucken,","though,","alas,","they","are","gone","today.","What","is","the","significance","of","Rucken?","At","no","time","was","Rucken","simply","a","hiding","place,","a","respite","from","his","years","as","a","prodigy."]},{"text":"It was an artistic creation, a world of the imagination, as real as the creation of the music itself. Lachrimosa--When composing the Requiem Mass, Mozart did not compose it in order.","tokens":["It","was","an","artistic","creation,","a","world","of","the","imagination,","as","real","as","the","creation","of","the","music","itself.","Lachrimosa--When","composing","the","Requiem","Mass,","Mozart","did","not","compose","it","in","order."]},{"text":"In fact, he composed only a single movement in total, this the Introitus, the first section. Other parts were sketched out in his usual style.","tokens":["In","fact,","he","composed","only","a","single","movement","in","total,","this","the","Introitus,","the","first","section.","Other","parts","were","sketched","out","in","his","usual","style."]},{"text":"The Lachrimosa consists of only eight bars in Mozart's hand; these are almost certainly the last eight bars the composer ever wrote. Masonic connections--How could Mozart, so filled with creativity, ebullience, joy and sadness together, join an organization like the","tokens":["The","Lachrimosa","consists","of","only","eight","bars","in","Mozart's","hand;","these","are","almost","certainly","the","last","eight","bars","the","composer","ever","wrote.","Masonic","connections--How","could","Mozart,","so","filled","with","creativity,","ebullience,","joy","and","sadness","together,","join","an","organization","like","the"]},{"text":"Freemasons? Mozart belonged for many reasons. In 1784, he almost died from tuberculosis, and in this bush with death ordinary Catholicism seemed, to the composer, simply insufficient.","tokens":["Freemasons?","Mozart","belonged","for","many","reasons.","In","1784,","he","almost","died","from","tuberculosis,","and","in","this","bush","with","death","ordinary","Catholicism","seemed,","to","the","composer,","simply","insufficient."]},{"text":"For succor, he turned to the religion of the elect, with its profusion of symbols and magic. Nobility--While The Marriage of Figaro was described as Mozart's parody of the nobility, Mozart's own feelings were more complex.","tokens":["For","succor,","he","turned","to","the","religion","of","the","elect,","with","its","profusion","of","symbols","and","magic.","Nobility--While","The","Marriage","of","Figaro","was","described","as","Mozart's","parody","of","the","nobility,","Mozart's","own","feelings","were","more","complex."]},{"text":"From his first journeys to the great courts of Europe, he loved the aristocracy, aped their fashions and felt that such beauty and splendor were part of the natural order of things.","tokens":["From","his","first","journeys","to","the","great","courts","of","Europe,","he","loved","the","aristocracy,","aped","their","fashions","and","felt","that","such","beauty","and","splendor","were","part","of","the","natural","order","of","things."]},{"text":"Opera--Mozart died at 35 and composed no less than 25 works for the stage: intermezzos and serenades, comic operas, operettas, comedies. Historically, he was the first important composer to write opera to German tents.","tokens":["Opera--Mozart","died","at","35","and","composed","no","less","than","25","works","for","the","stage:","intermezzos","and","serenades,","comic","operas,","operettas,","comedies.","Historically,","he","was","the","first","important","composer","to","write","opera","to","German","tents."]},{"text":"But even in Italian he was revolutionary. One could say that along with Monteverdi and Wagner, only Mozart had the sense of characterization, orchestral color and musical ideas that gave insight into the idiosyncrasies of his characters.","tokens":["But","even","in","Italian","he","was","revolutionary.","One","could","say","that","along","with","Monteverdi","and","Wagner,","only","Mozart","had","the","sense","of","characterization,","orchestral","color","and","musical","ideas","that","gave","insight","into","the","idiosyncrasies","of","his","characters."]},{"text":"Pantheon--Where is Mozart in the musical pantheon? Bioacchino Rossini was once asked who the greatest composer was. \"Beethoven,\" he was asked. \"Oh, Mozart,\" he shrugged.","tokens":["Pantheon--Where","is","Mozart","in","the","musical","pantheon?","Bioacchino","Rossini","was","once","asked","who","the","greatest","composer","was.","\"Beethoven,\"","he","was","asked.","\"Oh,","Mozart,\"","he","shrugged."]},{"text":"\"Mozart wasn't among the great composers. He was the only composer.\" Richard Strauss, in a rare moment of humility, said that he would exchange every one of his own operas if he could have written merely two bars from a","tokens":["\"Mozart","wasn't","among","the","great","composers.","He","was","the","only","composer.\"","Richard","Strauss,","in","a","rare","moment","of","humility,","said","that","he","would","exchange","every","one","of","his","own","operas","if","he","could","have","written","merely","two","bars","from","a"]},{"text":"scene of Don Giovanni. Quickness--How fast did Mozart actually write his work? In his last year, La Clemenza Di Tito, which only recently has been considered a masterpiece, was written and orchestrated in 18 days.","tokens":["scene","of","Don","Giovanni.","Quickness--How","fast","did","Mozart","actually","write","his","work?","In","his","last","year,","La","Clemenza","Di","Tito,","which","only","recently","has","been","considered","a","masterpiece,","was","written","and","orchestrated","in","18","days."]},{"text":"In the same year, his three last symphonies were written in a total of five weeks. And in those same five weeks Mozart composed several songs and sonatas well.","tokens":["In","the","same","year,","his","three","last","symphonies","were","written","in","a","total","of","five","weeks.","And","in","those","same","five","weeks","Mozart","composed","several","songs","and","sonatas","well."]},{"text":"The Don Giovanni overture was written in a single sitting. And, yes, he did write on tablecloths, envelopes and other scraps of paper. Radical--When a publisher told him to be more accessible, more like Haydn, less dramatic, less self-absorbed, he","tokens":["The","Don","Giovanni","overture","was","written","in","a","single","sitting.","And,","yes,","he","did","write","on","tablecloths,","envelopes","and","other","scraps","of","paper.","Radical--When","a","publisher","told","him","to","be","more","accessible,","more","like","Haydn,","less","dramatic,","less","self-absorbed,","he"]},{"text":"asked why. \"If you do not write more what people want,\" said the publisher, \"you will have no market for your music.\" \"Then,\" said Mozart, \"I will write nothing more.","tokens":["asked","why.","\"If","you","do","not","write","more","what","people","want,\"","said","the","publisher,","\"you","will","have","no","market","for","your","music.\"","\"Then,\"","said","Mozart,","\"I","will","write","nothing","more."]},{"text":"And I will go hungry. Don Giovanni was not written for the public,\" he said. \"It was written for myself and few friends.\" Salieri--Did Antonio Salieri Kill Mozart?","tokens":["And","I","will","go","hungry.","Don","Giovanni","was","not","written","for","the","public,\"","he","said.","\"It","was","written","for","myself","and","few","friends.\"","Salieri--Did","Antonio","Salieri","Kill","Mozart?"]},{"text":"Mozart, ever the hypochondriac, felt that he was being poisoned. Salieri was certainly jealous of his genius. Chances are that Salieri didn't poison him, and the latest medical analysis puts Mozart's death sown to streptococcal infections, allergic hypersensitivity and a","tokens":["Mozart,","ever","the","hypochondriac,","felt","that","he","was","being","poisoned.","Salieri","was","certainly","jealous","of","his","genius.","Chances","are","that","Salieri","didn't","poison","him,","and","the","latest","medical","analysis","puts","Mozart's","death","sown","to","streptococcal","infections,","allergic","hypersensitivity","and","a"]},{"text":"decline in kidney functions. Travels/travails--Both confused Mozart's personality. He had been traveling through Europe from the age of four. When a border guard once stopped him, asking for identification, the six-year-old Mozart simply took out his violin and played it","tokens":["decline","in","kidney","functions.","Travels/travails--Both","confused","Mozart's","personality.","He","had","been","traveling","through","Europe","from","the","age","of","four.","When","a","border","guard","once","stopped","him,","asking","for","identification,","the","six-year-old","Mozart","simply","took","out","his","violin","and","played","it"]},{"text":"for the guard, who let him move on. As for Mozart's travails, they were endless. Money problems, work problems, lack of appreciation, the list is endless.","tokens":["for","the","guard,","who","let","him","move","on.","As","for","Mozart's","travails,","they","were","endless.","Money","problems,","work","problems,","lack","of","appreciation,","the","list","is","endless."]},{"text":"And yet, on the same day that Mozart would write a letter lamenting his personal hardships, he would compose a concerto, a sonata or a symphony of charm or ebullience.","tokens":["And","yet,","on","the","same","day","that","Mozart","would","write","a","letter","lamenting","his","personal","hardships,","he","would","compose","a","concerto,","a","sonata","or","a","symphony","of","charm","or","ebullience."]},{"text":"The dividing line between catastrophe and creation is not for mortal man to comprehend. Understanding--Mozart often said that he wrote music mainly for himself, but he needed adulation, he needed appreciation.","tokens":["The","dividing","line","between","catastrophe","and","creation","is","not","for","mortal","man","to","comprehend.","Understanding--Mozart","often","said","that","he","wrote","music","mainly","for","himself,","but","he","needed","adulation,","he","needed","appreciation."]},{"text":"In a moment of rare confession, he wrote to his father: \"Give me the best instrument in Europe, but listeners who understand nothing or do not wish to understand and who do not feel with me in what I am","tokens":["In","a","moment","of","rare","confession,","he","wrote","to","his","father:","\"Give","me","the","best","instrument","in","Europe,","but","listeners","who","understand","nothing","or","do","not","wish","to","understand","and","who","do","not","feel","with","me","in","what","I","am"]},{"text":"playing, and all my pleasure is spoiled.\" Vienna--Was Vienna really the one true inspiration for Mozart? while virtually every 18th-and 19th-century Central European musician settled here for long periods, during Mozart's time Vienna was dominated by politics.","tokens":["playing,","and","all","my","pleasure","is","spoiled.\"","Vienna--Was","Vienna","really","the","one","true","inspiration","for","Mozart?","while","virtually","every","18th-and","19th-century","Central","European","musician","settled","here","for","long","periods,","during","Mozart's","time","Vienna","was","dominated","by","politics."]},{"text":"The emperor, while admiring Mozart, was miserly and loved his own intrigues. Mozart did not die a pauper here, but his happiness in creation was diminished by Vienna itself.","tokens":["The","emperor,","while","admiring","Mozart,","was","miserly","and","loved","his","own","intrigues.","Mozart","did","not","die","a","pauper","here,","but","his","happiness","in","creation","was","diminished","by","Vienna","itself."]},{"text":"Working habits--Mozart never had working habits. He had no days or nights when inspiration came. Inspiration was unstoppable! When he was four, his father, Leopold Mozart, found him writing notes for a clavier concerto.","tokens":["Working","habits--Mozart","never","had","working","habits.","He","had","no","days","or","nights","when","inspiration","came.","Inspiration","was","unstoppable!","When","he","was","four,","his","father,","Leopold","Mozart,","found","him","writing","notes","for","a","clavier","concerto."]},{"text":"When asked to see the work in progress, Mozart gave it to his father for a few minutes, then took it back and, even while talking, finished it.","tokens":["When","asked","to","see","the","work","in","progress,","Mozart","gave","it","to","his","father","for","a","few","minutes,","then","took","it","back","and,","even","while","talking,","finished","it."]},{"text":"When Mozart was 10, his father became dangerously ill, and the family was not allowed to touch the barber complained that he couldn't give Mozart a haircut, because at any moment the composer might run to the clavier and jot","tokens":["When","Mozart","was","10,","his","father","became","dangerously","ill,","and","the","family","was","not","allowed","to","touch","the","barber","complained","that","he","couldn't","give","Mozart","a","haircut,","because","at","any","moment","the","composer","might","run","to","the","clavier","and","jot"]},{"text":"down a new piece of inspiration. X--Who was that masked man who appeared at Mozart's door and commissioned him to write the Requiem in February 1791?","tokens":["down","a","new","piece","of","inspiration.","X--Who","was","that","masked","man","who","appeared","at","Mozart's","door","and","commissioned","him","to","write","the","Requiem","in","February","1791?"]},{"text":"It was Count von Walsegg, who often commissioned that he would put under his own name. Youth--Was father Leopold Mozart exploiting his precocious son?","tokens":["It","was","Count","von","Walsegg,","who","often","commissioned","that","he","would","put","under","his","own","name.","Youth--Was","father","Leopold","Mozart","exploiting","his","precocious","son?"]},{"text":"Twentieth-century sociologists and psychologists may analyze all they want to, but not a word of anger or doubt was ever written by Mozart against his father.","tokens":["Twentieth-century","sociologists","and","psychologists","may","analyze","all","they","want","to,","but","not","a","word","of","anger","or","doubt","was","ever","written","by","Mozart","against","his","father."]},{"text":"Zaide--Permit me to end on a personal note. If Richard Strauss could choose two of Mozart's bar s to be the greatest ever written, I can choose three movements that seem archetypal Mozart.","tokens":["Zaide--Permit","me","to","end","on","a","personal","note.","If","Richard","Strauss","could","choose","two","of","Mozart's","bar","s","to","be","the","greatest","ever","written,","I","can","choose","three","movements","that","seem","archetypal","Mozart."]},{"text":"For simplicity that somehow transforms itself into a depth of tragedy and compassion, there is the almost naive theme from the A Minor Rondo, K.511.","tokens":["For","simplicity","that","somehow","transforms","itself","into","a","depth","of","tragedy","and","compassion,","there","is","the","almost","naive","theme","from","the","A","Minor","Rondo,","K.511."]},{"text":"Second, I nominate a rare recording of the 40th symphony performed by Bruno Walter and the Columbia Symphony Orchestra. At the climax of the first movement, Walter takes a most forgivable liberty, by actually stopping the orchestra for half a","tokens":["Second,","I","nominate","a","rare","recording","of","the","40th","symphony","performed","by","Bruno","Walter","and","the","Columbia","Symphony","Orchestra.","At","the","climax","of","the","first","movement,","Walter","takes","a","most","forgivable","liberty,","by","actually","stopping","the","orchestra","for","half","a"]},{"text":"beat. It is as if he had ascended Mount Everest and, instead of moving down, says, \"Look about us. Look at the universe we have conquered.\"","tokens":["beat.","It","is","as","if","he","had","ascended","Mount","Everest","and,","instead","of","moving","down,","says,","\"Look","about","us.","Look","at","the","universe","we","have","conquered.\""]},{"text":"That silence is as beautiful as the notes that encompass it. My third choice is a relatively unknown aria that seems to rise from the unfinished opera, Zaide.","tokens":["That","silence","is","as","beautiful","as","the","notes","that","encompass","it.","My","third","choice","is","a","relatively","unknown","aria","that","seems","to","rise","from","the","unfinished","opera,","Zaide."]},{"text":"Dame Kiri Te Kanawa has recorded Ruhe Sanft, mein holdes Leben, an aria that seems to rise from the depths of the earth. Serious and lyrical, soaring and dignified, its personality comes from the penetration of Mozart's own immortal soul.","tokens":["Dame","Kiri","Te","Kanawa","has","recorded","Ruhe","Sanft,","mein","holdes","Leben,","an","aria","that","seems","to","rise","from","the","depths","of","the","earth.","Serious","and","lyrical,","soaring","and","dignified,","its","personality","comes","from","the","penetration","of","Mozart's","own","immortal","soul."]}]},"T36":{"key":"T36","title":"T36 My name is Lemuel Gulliver and my…","paras":[{"text":"My name is Lemuel Gulliver and my father was a land-owner in England. His estate was not a large one and as he had five sons there was little money for our education.","tokens":["My","name","is","Lemuel","Gulliver","and","my","father","was","a","land-owner","in","England.","His","estate","was","not","a","large","one","and","as","he","had","five","sons","there","was","little","money","for","our","education."]},{"text":"My own ambition was to travel and in order to make this possible I persuaded my father to have me trained as a doctor.","tokens":["My","own","ambition","was","to","travel","and","in","order","to","make","this","possible","I","persuaded","my","father","to","have","me","trained","as","a","doctor."]},{"text":"When I was young doctors were not thought very important, but the work suited me because at the end of my training I was able to become a ship's doctor and to travel all over the world.","tokens":["When","I","was","young","doctors","were","not","thought","very","important,","but","the","work","suited","me","because","at","the","end","of","my","training","I","was","able","to","become","a","ship's","doctor","and","to","travel","all","over","the","world."]},{"text":"Even when I married and had a family I did not stay on land for long and there are many tales I could tell you of the strange things I saw abroad.","tokens":["Even","when","I","married","and","had","a","family","I","did","not","stay","on","land","for","long","and","there","are","many","tales","I","could","tell","you","of","the","strange","things","I","saw","abroad."]},{"text":"But the strangest story of all began in May, 1699, when the voyage began which I shall now describe to you. The journey started well and our sailing ship had traveled many months and half way round the world before","tokens":["But","the","strangest","story","of","all","began","in","May,","1699,","when","the","voyage","began","which","I","shall","now","describe","to","you.","The","journey","started","well","and","our","sailing","ship","had","traveled","many","months","and","half","way","round","the","world","before"]},{"text":"anything unusual happened. It was near the coast of Sumatra that our luck changed. A terrible storm arose and for many days the ship was driven through seas which were unknown to our captain.","tokens":["anything","unusual","happened.","It","was","near","the","coast","of","Sumatra","that","our","luck","changed.","A","terrible","storm","arose","and","for","many","days","the","ship","was","driven","through","seas","which","were","unknown","to","our","captain."]},{"text":"Many of the crew died. At last the strong wind drove the ship on to a rock where it was broken to pieces by the waves.","tokens":["Many","of","the","crew","died.","At","last","the","strong","wind","drove","the","ship","on","to","a","rock","where","it","was","broken","to","pieces","by","the","waves."]},{"text":"Only six of the crew were able to escape in a small boat. I was one of them. We managed to row three miles but our efforts were in vain.","tokens":["Only","six","of","the","crew","were","able","to","escape","in","a","small","boat.","I","was","one","of","them.","We","managed","to","row","three","miles","but","our","efforts","were","in","vain."]},{"text":"The boat was turned over by a mountainous wave and I was the only man who was able to swim to land. It was a strange and lonely place in which I found myself.","tokens":["The","boat","was","turned","over","by","a","mountainous","wave","and","I","was","the","only","man","who","was","able","to","swim","to","land.","It","was","a","strange","and","lonely","place","in","which","I","found","myself."]},{"text":"There was no sign of any people and, after looking in vain for a house where I could get help, I lay down to rest.","tokens":["There","was","no","sign","of","any","people","and,","after","looking","in","vain","for","a","house","where","I","could","get","help,","I","lay","down","to","rest."]},{"text":"My struggles had made me so tired that very soon I was fast asleep on the grass. It was morning when I woke and tried to get up.","tokens":["My","struggles","had","made","me","so","tired","that","very","soon","I","was","fast","asleep","on","the","grass.","It","was","morning","when","I","woke","and","tried","to","get","up."]},{"text":"But some thing strange had happened while I was asleep. I could not move an inch. My arms and legs were now tied down to the ground and even my hair, which was long and thick, had been tied down","tokens":["But","some","thing","strange","had","happened","while","I","was","asleep.","I","could","not","move","an","inch.","My","arms","and","legs","were","now","tied","down","to","the","ground","and","even","my","hair,","which","was","long","and","thick,","had","been","tied","down"]},{"text":"with string so that I could not move my head to see what had happened to me. All around me was the hum of little voices--but I could see nothing except the empty sky.","tokens":["with","string","so","that","I","could","not","move","my","head","to","see","what","had","happened","to","me.","All","around","me","was","the","hum","of","little","voices--but","I","could","see","nothing","except","the","empty","sky."]},{"text":"I knew there were people around me, but as far as my eyes could reach there was no one to see. As I lay there, frightened and puzzled, there was a movement on my left leg.","tokens":["I","knew","there","were","people","around","me,","but","as","far","as","my","eyes","could","reach","there","was","no","one","to","see.","As","I","lay","there,","frightened","and","puzzled,","there","was","a","movement","on","my","left","leg."]},{"text":"Something alive was moving up my body towards my chin. It felt like a large insect and I looked anxiously down to see what was coming.","tokens":["Something","alive","was","moving","up","my","body","towards","my","chin.","It","felt","like","a","large","insect","and","I","looked","anxiously","down","to","see","what","was","coming."]},{"text":"It came into sight and there I could see a tiny man, less than six inches high, marching up my chest with a bow and arrow in his hand.","tokens":["It","came","into","sight","and","there","I","could","see","a","tiny","man,","less","than","six","inches","high,","marching","up","my","chest","with","a","bow","and","arrow","in","his","hand."]},{"text":"I could hardly believe my eyes. But after him came forty more little men who marched up my body as though it was a battlefield.","tokens":["I","could","hardly","believe","my","eyes.","But","after","him","came","forty","more","little","men","who","marched","up","my","body","as","though","it","was","a","battlefield."]},{"text":"In my fright at seeing these astonishing people I cried out so loudly that all the little men ran away. Many of them were hurt jumping from my side down to the ground; but soon the others came back and","tokens":["In","my","fright","at","seeing","these","astonishing","people","I","cried","out","so","loudly","that","all","the","little","men","ran","away.","Many","of","them","were","hurt","jumping","from","my","side","down","to","the","ground;","but","soon","the","others","came","back","and"]},{"text":"climbed over me again. One of the bravest came far enough to see my face and called out to his friends with admiration. I could not understand his language, however, and my fright increased.","tokens":["climbed","over","me","again.","One","of","the","bravest","came","far","enough","to","see","my","face","and","called","out","to","his","friends","with","admiration.","I","could","not","understand","his","language,","however,","and","my","fright","increased."]},{"text":"Struggling hard, I was able to free my left arm and to loosen my hair a little so that I could turn my head.","tokens":["Struggling","hard,","I","was","able","to","free","my","left","arm","and","to","loosen","my","hair","a","little","so","that","I","could","turn","my","head."]},{"text":"Before I could seize them, all the little people ran away and a hundred arrows hit my hand like needles. Others fell on my face so that I cried out with pain and fought to get free.","tokens":["Before","I","could","seize","them,","all","the","little","people","ran","away","and","a","hundred","arrows","hit","my","hand","like","needles.","Others","fell","on","my","face","so","that","I","cried","out","with","pain","and","fought","to","get","free."]},{"text":"More arrows came, however, and at last I decided it was safer to lie still. As soon as I was quiet the soldiers stopped shooting arrows at me, but more and more little people were joining the crowded around me.","tokens":["More","arrows","came,","however,","and","at","last","I","decided","it","was","safer","to","lie","still.","As","soon","as","I","was","quiet","the","soldiers","stopped","shooting","arrows","at","me,","but","more","and","more","little","people","were","joining","the","crowded","around","me."]},{"text":"Now that I could move my head a little I could see hundreds of workmen building a stage about eighteen inches high, near my right ear.","tokens":["Now","that","I","could","move","my","head","a","little","I","could","see","hundreds","of","workmen","building","a","stage","about","eighteen","inches","high,","near","my","right","ear."]},{"text":"I watched them working and was amazed by their skill and speed. Though they were no bigger than my thumb these people seemed able to do everything that men of our own size can do.","tokens":["I","watched","them","working","and","was","amazed","by","their","skill","and","speed.","Though","they","were","no","bigger","than","my","thumb","these","people","seemed","able","to","do","everything","that","men","of","our","own","size","can","do."]},{"text":"When the stage was finished a well dressed man, who seemed to be an important officer, climbed to the top with three servants. From there he was able to speak directly into my ear and leaning towards me he made","tokens":["When","the","stage","was","finished","a","well","dressed","man,","who","seemed","to","be","an","important","officer,","climbed","to","the","top","with","three","servants.","From","there","he","was","able","to","speak","directly","into","my","ear","and","leaning","towards","me","he","made"]},{"text":"a long speech. I could not understand one word, of course, but from the repetition of the name \"Lilliput\" I guessed that this must be the name of the country to which I had come.","tokens":["a","long","speech.","I","could","not","understand","one","word,","of","course,","but","from","the","repetition","of","the","name","\"Lilliput\"","I","guessed","that","this","must","be","the","name","of","the","country","to","which","I","had","come."]},{"text":"Later I learned that this was correct. The officer's manner seemed friendly and when he had finished I felt less frightened. I was very hungry, however, and I put my finger in my mouth to show that I needed food.","tokens":["Later","I","learned","that","this","was","correct.","The","officer's","manner","seemed","friendly","and","when","he","had","finished","I","felt","less","frightened.","I","was","very","hungry,","however,","and","I","put","my","finger","in","my","mouth","to","show","that","I","needed","food."]},{"text":"At once the officer understood me and shouted orders to his men. Soon ladders were placed at my side and a hundred little men climbed up to my mouth with baskets of food.","tokens":["At","once","the","officer","understood","me","and","shouted","orders","to","his","men.","Soon","ladders","were","placed","at","my","side","and","a","hundred","little","men","climbed","up","to","my","mouth","with","baskets","of","food."]},{"text":"The meat and the vegetables looked much like our own food, but everything was very small. I took two or three baskets at a mouthful and then ate some loaves of bread which were smaller than marbles.","tokens":["The","meat","and","the","vegetables","looked","much","like","our","own","food,","but","everything","was","very","small.","I","took","two","or","three","baskets","at","a","mouthful","and","then","ate","some","loaves","of","bread","which","were","smaller","than","marbles."]},{"text":"They brought me barrels of water which were no larger than nuts and the little people were so amazed at the number of barrels that I drank that they danced on my chest with excitement.","tokens":["They","brought","me","barrels","of","water","which","were","no","larger","than","nuts","and","the","little","people","were","so","amazed","at","the","number","of","barrels","that","I","drank","that","they","danced","on","my","chest","with","excitement."]},{"text":"It would have been easy now to seize forty or fifty men and throw them to the ground, but as I had tasted their food and drink I felt I was now their guest.","tokens":["It","would","have","been","easy","now","to","seize","forty","or","fifty","men","and","throw","them","to","the","ground,","but","as","I","had","tasted","their","food","and","drink","I","felt","I","was","now","their","guest."]},{"text":"More and more I admire bravery in coming so close to me. Now another official came up my chest and showed me a piece of paper smaller than my thumb nail.","tokens":["More","and","more","I","admire","bravery","in","coming","so","close","to","me.","Now","another","official","came","up","my","chest","and","showed","me","a","piece","of","paper","smaller","than","my","thumb","nail."]},{"text":"It seemed to be important, but I did not understand then that it was an order from the King of Lilliput that I should be taken to his capital city, which was called Mildendo.","tokens":["It","seemed","to","be","important,","but","I","did","not","understand","then","that","it","was","an","order","from","the","King","of","Lilliput","that","I","should","be","taken","to","his","capital","city,","which","was","called","Mildendo."]},{"text":"As I did not know of this plan I did not worry about it. Instead I began to feel very sleepy because the little people had put in my water a medicine to make me sleep.","tokens":["As","I","did","not","know","of","this","plan","I","did","not","worry","about","it.","Instead","I","began","to","feel","very","sleepy","because","the","little","people","had","put","in","my","water","a","medicine","to","make","me","sleep."]},{"text":"Now they loosened a little the ropes that me and they put more medicine on the places where their poisoned arrows had hurt me.","tokens":["Now","they","loosened","a","little","the","ropes","that","me","and","they","put","more","medicine","on","the","places","where","their","poisoned","arrows","had","hurt","me."]},{"text":"I felt more comfortable when this had been done and soon I fell asleep again. While I was asleep five hundred carpenters and engineers set to work building a car big enough to carry me to Mildendo.","tokens":["I","felt","more","comfortable","when","this","had","been","done","and","soon","I","fell","asleep","again.","While","I","was","asleep","five","hundred","carpenters","and","engineers","set","to","work","building","a","car","big","enough","to","carry","me","to","Mildendo."]},{"text":"Can you imagine a wooden cart strong enough to carry two elephants? We would find this difficult to build, but the Lilliputians found it just as difficult to build a cart to carry me.","tokens":["Can","you","imagine","a","wooden","cart","strong","enough","to","carry","two","elephants?","We","would","find","this","difficult","to","build,","but","the","Lilliputians","found","it","just","as","difficult","to","build","a","cart","to","carry","me."]},{"text":"Some of them were skilled engineers, however, and even before I had fallen asleep they had almost finished building the biggest cart ever known in Lilliput.","tokens":["Some","of","them","were","skilled","engineers,","however,","and","even","before","I","had","fallen","asleep","they","had","almost","finished","building","the","biggest","cart","ever","known","in","Lilliput."]},{"text":"It was seven feet long and four feet wide and had twenty-two wheels. The cart was brought by my side and then, while I was fast asleep, nine hundred of the strongest men in the country lifted me on to","tokens":["It","was","seven","feet","long","and","four","feet","wide","and","had","twenty-two","wheels.","The","cart","was","brought","by","my","side","and","then,","while","I","was","fast","asleep,","nine","hundred","of","the","strongest","men","in","the","country","lifted","me","on","to"]},{"text":"the cart with ropes. Fifteen hundred horses, each about four inches high, were fastened to the cart and we started on our way to Mildendo.","tokens":["the","cart","with","ropes.","Fifteen","hundred","horses,","each","about","four","inches","high,","were","fastened","to","the","cart","and","we","started","on","our","way","to","Mildendo."]},{"text":"I slept while all this noise and activity went on around me. It was not until after we started that I was woken in the following way.","tokens":["I","slept","while","all","this","noise","and","activity","went","on","around","me.","It","was","not","until","after","we","started","that","I","was","woken","in","the","following","way."]},{"text":"One or two young men were anxious to see what I looked like when I was asleep and they climbed up on to the car to look at me.","tokens":["One","or","two","young","men","were","anxious","to","see","what","I","looked","like","when","I","was","asleep","and","they","climbed","up","on","to","the","car","to","look","at","me."]},{"text":"They were very bold and one of them put the sharp end of his spear up my nose to see what would happen. This made me sneeze violently and I woke up at once -- while the young men crept","tokens":["They","were","very","bold","and","one","of","them","put","the","sharp","end","of","his","spear","up","my","nose","to","see","what","would","happen.","This","made","me","sneeze","violently","and","I","woke","up","at","once","--","while","the","young","men","crept"]},{"text":"away feeling very brave and successful. We traveled for two days. At night when we rested, five hundred guards stood on either side of me ready to shoot if I tried to escape.","tokens":["away","feeling","very","brave","and","successful.","We","traveled","for","two","days.","At","night","when","we","rested,","five","hundred","guards","stood","on","either","side","of","me","ready","to","shoot","if","I","tried","to","escape."]},{"text":"But I saw no reason to be violent and lay quietly on my cart until we reached the gates of Mildendo. The news of my arrival had spread quickly and everyone had come out of the city to see the","tokens":["But","I","saw","no","reason","to","be","violent","and","lay","quietly","on","my","cart","until","we","reached","the","gates","of","Mildendo.","The","news","of","my","arrival","had","spread","quickly","and","everyone","had","come","out","of","the","city","to","see","the"]},{"text":"marvelous \"Man-Mountain\" as they called me. First of all came the King himself, with all his family and servants. But until I was securely fastened the King's advisers would not let him come near me.","tokens":["marvelous","\"Man-Mountain\"","as","they","called","me.","First","of","all","came","the","King","himself,","with","all","his","family","and","servants.","But","until","I","was","securely","fastened","the","King's","advisers","would","not","let","him","come","near","me."]},{"text":"A house was ready for me. It was one of the biggest buildings in the city--an old temple into which I was just able to creep and to lie down on the floor.","tokens":["A","house","was","ready","for","me.","It","was","one","of","the","biggest","buildings","in","the","city--an","old","temple","into","which","I","was","just","able","to","creep","and","to","lie","down","on","the","floor."]},{"text":"The walls were very thick and there were two windows through which the King's workmen had tied more than ninety chains. These were fastened to my leg with thirty-six locks.","tokens":["The","walls","were","very","thick","and","there","were","two","windows","through","which","the","King's","workmen","had","tied","more","than","ninety","chains.","These","were","fastened","to","my","leg","with","thirty-six","locks."]},{"text":"When everything had been tested then, at last, the ropes which tied me to my cart were out. While all the people shouted with astonishment I was able to get slowly to my feet and to look around me.","tokens":["When","everything","had","been","tested","then,","at","last,","the","ropes","which","tied","me","to","my","cart","were","out.","While","all","the","people","shouted","with","astonishment","I","was","able","to","get","slowly","to","my","feet","and","to","look","around","me."]},{"text":"I never saw a prettier sight. The country was like a garden, with green fields of grass surrounding fields of wheat and vegetables which looked like flower beds.","tokens":["I","never","saw","a","prettier","sight.","The","country","was","like","a","garden,","with","green","fields","of","grass","surrounding","fields","of","wheat","and","vegetables","which","looked","like","flower","beds."]},{"text":"The roads were no wider than garden paths and the tallest trees were just seven feet high. At my feet lay the great city of Mildendo, like the painted scene in a doll's theatre.","tokens":["The","roads","were","no","wider","than","garden","paths","and","the","tallest","trees","were","just","seven","feet","high.","At","my","feet","lay","the","great","city","of","Mildendo,","like","the","painted","scene","in","a","doll's","theatre."]},{"text":"Thousands of handsome little people crowded round me. They were all less than six inches high and the animals were even smaller. Horses and cows were four inches high, sheep only an inch high and the hens and geese looked","tokens":["Thousands","of","handsome","little","people","crowded","round","me.","They","were","all","less","than","six","inches","high","and","the","animals","were","even","smaller.","Horses","and","cows","were","four","inches","high,","sheep","only","an","inch","high","and","the","hens","and","geese","looked"]},{"text":"like many-coloured flies. The King and his family had been watching me from a tower nearby. Now the King came down by himself to look at me more closely.","tokens":["like","many-coloured","flies.","The","King","and","his","family","had","been","watching","me","from","a","tower","nearby.","Now","the","King","came","down","by","himself","to","look","at","me","more","closely."]},{"text":"At first he approached on horseback, but the horse was so frightened that the royal rider was almost thrown to the ground. At last the King got down from his horse and walked round me at a safe distance to","tokens":["At","first","he","approached","on","horseback,","but","the","horse","was","so","frightened","that","the","royal","rider","was","almost","thrown","to","the","ground.","At","last","the","King","got","down","from","his","horse","and","walked","round","me","at","a","safe","distance","to"]},{"text":"examine me on all sides. I was as interested in him as he was in me and lay down in order to see him better.","tokens":["examine","me","on","all","sides.","I","was","as","interested","in","him","as","he","was","in","me","and","lay","down","in","order","to","see","him","better."]},{"text":"Putting my face three yards from him I was able to get a good view. The King was half an inch taller than any of his people and his face was strong and manly.","tokens":["Putting","my","face","three","yards","from","him","I","was","able","to","get","a","good","view.","The","King","was","half","an","inch","taller","than","any","of","his","people","and","his","face","was","strong","and","manly."]},{"text":"His complexion was fair and he held himself very straight while walking with graceful and kingly movements. The uniform he wore was very plain, but his head-dress was made of gold and ornamented with jewels and feathers.","tokens":["His","complexion","was","fair","and","he","held","himself","very","straight","while","walking","with","graceful","and","kingly","movements.","The","uniform","he","wore","was","very","plain,","but","his","head-dress","was","made","of","gold","and","ornamented","with","jewels","and","feathers."]},{"text":"The sword, which he held ready to defend himself if I should escape, was almost three inches long and rich with gold and jewels.","tokens":["The","sword,","which","he","held","ready","to","defend","himself","if","I","should","escape,","was","almost","three","inches","long","and","rich","with","gold","and","jewels."]},{"text":"The King spoke to me several times while we examined each other--and I replied--but neither of us could understand the other. Several of his priests and lawyers then tried to speak to me, but although I answered in all the","tokens":["The","King","spoke","to","me","several","times","while","we","examined","each","other--and","I","replied--but","neither","of","us","could","understand","the","other.","Several","of","his","priests","and","lawyers","then","tried","to","speak","to","me,","but","although","I","answered","in","all","the"]},{"text":"many languages I knew, they did not know one of them. After several hours the King and his servants went home, leaving me with a strong guard.","tokens":["many","languages","I","knew,","they","did","not","know","one","of","them.","After","several","hours","the","King","and","his","servants","went","home,","leaving","me","with","a","strong","guard."]},{"text":"Some of the great crowd of citizens which remained were foolish enough to shoot arrows at me, when they thought I could not defend myself because of my chains.","tokens":["Some","of","the","great","crowd","of","citizens","which","remained","were","foolish","enough","to","shoot","arrows","at","me,","when","they","thought","I","could","not","defend","myself","because","of","my","chains."]},{"text":"The Captain of the Guard, however, was quick to prevent this and he seized six of the leaders. As a punish- ment he bound the prisoners and gave them to me.","tokens":["The","Captain","of","the","Guard,","however,","was","quick","to","prevent","this","and","he","seized","six","of","the","leaders.","As","a","punish-","ment","he","bound","the","prisoners","and","gave","them","to","me."]},{"text":"While the crowded watched fearfully I took them all in my right hand and put five of them in my coat pocket. Then I made a terrible face at the sixth as if I meant to eat him alive.","tokens":["While","the","crowded","watched","fearfully","I","took","them","all","in","my","right","hand","and","put","five","of","them","in","my","coat","pocket.","Then","I","made","a","terrible","face","at","the","sixth","as","if","I","meant","to","eat","him","alive."]},{"text":"The poor man shouted with fear and even the guard pitied him--especially when I took out my penknife. But I soon relieved them when, cutting the ropes which bound him, I put him gently on the ground and let him","tokens":["The","poor","man","shouted","with","fear","and","even","the","guard","pitied","him--especially","when","I","took","out","my","penknife.","But","I","soon","relieved","them","when,","cutting","the","ropes","which","bound","him,","I","put","him","gently","on","the","ground","and","let","him"]},{"text":"run away. One by one I treated the other five prisoners in the same way and I could see that the soldiers and people were all pleased by my kindness.","tokens":["run","away.","One","by","one","I","treated","the","other","five","prisoners","in","the","same","way","and","I","could","see","that","the","soldiers","and","people","were","all","pleased","by","my","kindness."]},{"text":"After that no one else tried to hurt me. When the news of my arrival spread through the kingdom of Lilliput great crowds of people came to see me from every corner of the island.","tokens":["After","that","no","one","else","tried","to","hurt","me.","When","the","news","of","my","arrival","spread","through","the","kingdom","of","Lilliput","great","crowds","of","people","came","to","see","me","from","every","corner","of","the","island."]},{"text":"Villages were almost emptied and the farms would have been completely neglected if the King had not made a law that no one could visit me more than once.","tokens":["Villages","were","almost","emptied","and","the","farms","would","have","been","completely","neglected","if","the","King","had","not","made","a","law","that","no","one","could","visit","me","more","than","once."]},{"text":"Meanwhile the King himself could not decide what to do with me. Many of his advisers warned him of the danger of keeping me alive.","tokens":["Meanwhile","the","King","himself","could","not","decide","what","to","do","with","me.","Many","of","his","advisers","warned","him","of","the","danger","of","keeping","me","alive."]},{"text":"They said I might escape and destroy the kingdom with my great strength. Even if I did not escape I would ruin Lilliput if the people had to provide the amount of food I needed.","tokens":["They","said","I","might","escape","and","destroy","the","kingdom","with","my","great","strength.","Even","if","I","did","not","escape","I","would","ruin","Lilliput","if","the","people","had","to","provide","the","amount","of","food","I","needed."]},{"text":"These advisers wanted to starve me or to kill me at once with poisoned arrows.","tokens":["These","advisers","wanted","to","starve","me","or","to","kill","me","at","once","with","poisoned","arrows."]}]},"T37":{"key":"T37","title":"T37 Change on a large scale is often…","paras":[{"text":"Change on a large scale is often difficult to manage. The economic development of industrial society caused hard ship and suffering for some groups and individuals whose jobs were threatened.","tokens":["Change","on","a","large","scale","is","often","difficult","to","manage.","The","economic","development","of","industrial","society","caused","hard","ship","and","suffering","for","some","groups","and","individuals","whose","jobs","were","threatened."]},{"text":"The storm of rapid change that swept over these people at the beginning of the industrial era uprooted their way of life. The Luddites, for example, were such a group of discontented British workers in the early nineteenth century.","tokens":["The","storm","of","rapid","change","that","swept","over","these","people","at","the","beginning","of","the","industrial","era","uprooted","their","way","of","life.","The","Luddites,","for","example,","were","such","a","group","of","discontented","British","workers","in","the","early","nineteenth","century."]},{"text":"The introduction of labor- saving technology in the textile industry had affected their jobs. They protested against the lowered wages and unemployment that resulted by smashing the new machinery.","tokens":["The","introduction","of","labor-","saving","technology","in","the","textile","industry","had","affected","their","jobs.","They","protested","against","the","lowered","wages","and","unemployment","that","resulted","by","smashing","the","new","machinery."]},{"text":"Similarly, in the last quarter of the twentieth century, electronicing world. As a result, an economic storm is again threatening industrial society. In North America, technological change has been an accepted part of economic development.","tokens":["Similarly,","in","the","last","quarter","of","the","twentieth","century,","electronicing","world.","As","a","result,","an","economic","storm","is","again","threatening","industrial","society.","In","North","America,","technological","change","has","been","an","accepted","part","of","economic","development."]},{"text":"People invent new machines to replace workers, and therefore jobs are lost. However, so far the new technology has created enough new jobs for almost everyone.","tokens":["People","invent","new","machines","to","replace","workers,","and","therefore","jobs","are","lost.","However,","so","far","the","new","technology","has","created","enough","new","jobs","for","almost","everyone."]},{"text":"Like the Luddites today suffer, both are forgotten in the general prosperity. Since the onset of the Industrial Revolution, the economies New but different jobs have replaced those jobs that machines have taken over.","tokens":["Like","the","Luddites","today","suffer,","both","are","forgotten","in","the","general","prosperity.","Since","the","onset","of","the","Industrial","Revolution,","the","economies","New","but","different","jobs","have","replaced","those","jobs","that","machines","have","taken","over."]},{"text":"According to G. G. Schwartz and W. Neikirk, the fear that factory workers would be displaced by machines caused an automation scare in the United States in the 1950s and 1960s.","tokens":["According","to","G.","G.","Schwartz","and","W.","Neikirk,","the","fear","that","factory","workers","would","be","displaced","by","machines","caused","an","automation","scare","in","the","United","States","in","the","1950s","and","1960s."]},{"text":"However, those workers who were displaced found jobs in the service sector, for example in offices, banks or government service. In Schwartz and Neikirk's view, the electronics revolution has now reached sector as well as the factory.","tokens":["However,","those","workers","who","were","displaced","found","jobs","in","the","service","sector,","for","example","in","offices,","banks","or","government","service.","In","Schwartz","and","Neikirk's","view,","the","electronics","revolution","has","now","reached","sector","as","well","as","the","factory."]},{"text":"Offices using microcomputers, word processors, and photocopiers can produce much more with other same number displaced factory workers can no longer turn to the service sector for new jobs.","tokens":["Offices","using","microcomputers,","word","processors,","and","photocopiers","can","produce","much","more","with","other","same","number","displaced","factory","workers","can","no","longer","turn","to","the","service","sector","for","new","jobs."]},{"text":"Both industries and services can now maintain and even increase production without hiring new workers. Many observers dispute this pessimistic conclusion. In their opinion, increased production will bring lower prices, which will allow people to buy additional items.","tokens":["Both","industries","and","services","can","now","maintain","and","even","increase","production","without","hiring","new","workers.","Many","observers","dispute","this","pessimistic","conclusion.","In","their","opinion,","increased","production","will","bring","lower","prices,","which","will","allow","people","to","buy","additional","items."]},{"text":"This increased buying will then stimulate more production, and this in turn will create more jobs. However, Schwartz and Neikirk argue that people today might instead spend their extra money on services that do not add new jobs, or they","tokens":["This","increased","buying","will","then","stimulate","more","production,","and","this","in","turn","will","create","more","jobs.","However,","Schwartz","and","Neikirk","argue","that","people","today","might","instead","spend","their","extra","money","on","services","that","do","not","add","new","jobs,","or","they"]},{"text":"might buy goods that are made in automated factories. They conclude that the scenario of the Industrial Revolution may no longer be valid for today's conditions.","tokens":["might","buy","goods","that","are","made","in","automated","factories.","They","conclude","that","the","scenario","of","the","Industrial","Revolution","may","no","longer","be","valid","for","today's","conditions."]},{"text":"Let us look more closely at how technological change in indus- trialized societies can involve both a loss of jobs in some sectors and a change in the kinds of jobs available to workers.","tokens":["Let","us","look","more","closely","at","how","technological","change","in","indus-","trialized","societies","can","involve","both","a","loss","of","jobs","in","some","sectors","and","a","change","in","the","kinds","of","jobs","available","to","workers."]},{"text":"We have already discussed the broad reasons for the loss of jobs. It is worthwhile, however, to look at specific examples of the process.","tokens":["We","have","already","discussed","the","broad","reasons","for","the","loss","of","jobs.","It","is","worthwhile,","however,","to","look","at","specific","examples","of","the","process."]},{"text":"Cordell points to two kinds of change in manufacturing that affect employment. The product itself is being simplified, and the methods of production are becoming automated.","tokens":["Cordell","points","to","two","kinds","of","change","in","manufacturing","that","affect","employment.","The","product","itself","is","being","simplified,","and","the","methods","of","production","are","becoming","automated."]},{"text":"In either case, fewer people are needed to make a product. As Cordell points out, \"the type of production that simplified the product makes it less expensive to produce and sell.","tokens":["In","either","case,","fewer","people","are","needed","to","make","a","product.","As","Cordell","points","out,","\"the","type","of","production","that","simplified","the","product","makes","it","less","expensive","to","produce","and","sell."]},{"text":"Industries that fail to adopt the new technologies will be greatly affected.\" His examples are the Swiss watch industry, where employment fell by 46,000 in the mid-1970s, and the West German watch industry, where jobs decreased by 40 percent at","tokens":["Industries","that","fail","to","adopt","the","new","technologies","will","be","greatly","affected.\"","His","examples","are","the","Swiss","watch","industry,","where","employment","fell","by","46,000","in","the","mid-1970s,","and","the","West","German","watch","industry,","where","jobs","decreased","by","40","percent","at"]},{"text":"the same time. An electronic watch requires the assembly of five components; a mechanical watch requires one thousand assembly operations. Another example of a simplified product that Cordell cites is the staffs by 50 percent.","tokens":["the","same","time.","An","electronic","watch","requires","the","assembly","of","five","components;","a","mechanical","watch","requires","one","thousand","assembly","operations.","Another","example","of","a","simplified","product","that","Cordell","cites","is","the","staffs","by","50","percent."]},{"text":"A second reason for the loss of jobs is the use of microelectronics in all phased of industry. New plants are being built that use robots instead of people.","tokens":["A","second","reason","for","the","loss","of","jobs","is","the","use","of","microelectronics","in","all","phased","of","industry.","New","plants","are","being","built","that","use","robots","instead","of","people."]},{"text":"Cordell's example is the Yamazaki factory at Nagoya, Japan, which would have needed 2,500 workers without microelectronics and robots. With this technology, however, it will need only 215 workers.","tokens":["Cordell's","example","is","the","Yamazaki","factory","at","Nagoya,","Japan,","which","would","have","needed","2,500","workers","without","microelectronics","and","robots.","With","this","technology,","however,","it","will","need","only","215","workers."]},{"text":"While some jobs will disappear as a result of these changes, others will change, and still others will be created. The new jobs, however, will not be of the same types as the old ones.","tokens":["While","some","jobs","will","disappear","as","a","result","of","these","changes,","others","will","change,","and","still","others","will","be","created.","The","new","jobs,","however,","will","not","be","of","the","same","types","as","the","old","ones."]},{"text":"As Cordell suggests, machines are becoming \"smarter,\" so workers will not need to know as much to do their work. This is known as de-skilling.","tokens":["As","Cordell","suggests,","machines","are","becoming","\"smarter,\"","so","workers","will","not","need","to","know","as","much","to","do","their","work.","This","is","known","as","de-skilling."]},{"text":"Because of automation, more and more jobs will require unskilled labor, and jobs for semiskilled workers will disappear. On the other hand, the new technologies may create employment for people who design and program machines, or those who perform professional","tokens":["Because","of","automation,","more","and","more","jobs","will","require","unskilled","labor,","and","jobs","for","semiskilled","workers","will","disappear.","On","the","other","hand,","the","new","technologies","may","create","employment","for","people","who","design","and","program","machines,","or","those","who","perform","professional"]},{"text":"services. These jobs will require a high degree of knowledge and training. Consequently the job market is becoming polarized, for unskilled workers will no longer be able to become semiskilled workers by acquiring experience.","tokens":["services.","These","jobs","will","require","a","high","degree","of","knowledge","and","training.","Consequently","the","job","market","is","becoming","polarized,","for","unskilled","workers","will","no","longer","be","able","to","become","semiskilled","workers","by","acquiring","experience."]},{"text":"Only training and knowledge will enable a person to perform a skilled job. The will create an unbridgeable gap between the skilled and unskilled members of the work force.","tokens":["Only","training","and","knowledge","will","enable","a","person","to","perform","a","skilled","job.","The","will","create","an","unbridgeable","gap","between","the","skilled","and","unskilled","members","of","the","work","force."]},{"text":"Cordell notes that these changes in the conditions of work in industrial societies can lead to important changes in the social structures and attitudes in these societies.","tokens":["Cordell","notes","that","these","changes","in","the","conditions","of","work","in","industrial","societies","can","lead","to","important","changes","in","the","social","structures","and","attitudes","in","these","societies."]},{"text":"He concludes that \"the future of work and working in the evolving information society is subject to much debate. The new technologies will change the nature of work, the place of work, and the importance of work to society.\"","tokens":["He","concludes","that","\"the","future","of","work","and","working","in","the","evolving","information","society","is","subject","to","much","debate.","The","new","technologies","will","change","the","nature","of","work,","the","place","of","work,","and","the","importance","of","work","to","society.\""]},{"text":"In his view, workers will have to share jobs and income, for there will not be enough jobs for everyone. To maintain an economy, members of an society must have the income to be consumers.","tokens":["In","his","view,","workers","will","have","to","share","jobs","and","income,","for","there","will","not","be","enough","jobs","for","everyone.","To","maintain","an","economy,","members","of","an","society","must","have","the","income","to","be","consumers."]},{"text":"However, Cordell points out that economic changes might be easier to achieve than other changes. Instead of learning how to make a living, people will need education in how to live.","tokens":["However,","Cordell","points","out","that","economic","changes","might","be","easier","to","achieve","than","other","changes.","Instead","of","learning","how","to","make","a","living,","people","will","need","education","in","how","to","live."]},{"text":"People will have to change their attitudes about work. They will have to learn not to see value in the idea of work itself.","tokens":["People","will","have","to","change","their","attitudes","about","work.","They","will","have","to","learn","not","to","see","value","in","the","idea","of","work","itself."]},{"text":"And they will have to learn not to regard paid work as more important than voluntary work. Industrial nations seem to be in transition from societies based on work to societies in which the meaning of with a minimum of","tokens":["And","they","will","have","to","learn","not","to","regard","paid","work","as","more","important","than","voluntary","work.","Industrial","nations","seem","to","be","in","transition","from","societies","based","on","work","to","societies","in","which","the","meaning","of","with","a","minimum","of"]},{"text":"disruption to the individuals who need society's protection. Genetic engineering is such a new field that its potential is only beginning to be understood.","tokens":["disruption","to","the","individuals","who","need","society's","protection.","Genetic","engineering","is","such","a","new","field","that","its","potential","is","only","beginning","to","be","understood."]},{"text":"Ever since the first product of genetic engineering-human insulin-was tested in 1988, the new technology has reached into many diverse fields. Many companies that have used genetic engineering have begun to make significant profits.","tokens":["Ever","since","the","first","product","of","genetic","engineering-human","insulin-was","tested","in","1988,","the","new","technology","has","reached","into","many","diverse","fields.","Many","companies","that","have","used","genetic","engineering","have","begun","to","make","significant","profits."]},{"text":"In fact, genetic engineering is rapidly becoming the most important form of engineering. Great advances are already being made in such fields as food production, industry, and medicine.","tokens":["In","fact,","genetic","engineering","is","rapidly","becoming","the","most","important","form","of","engineering.","Great","advances","are","already","being","made","in","such","fields","as","food","production,","industry,","and","medicine."]},{"text":"The use of biogenetic technology in food production can be divided roughly into two main categories: genetic agriculture and genetic food processing. The application of genetic engineering to agriculture can be further subdivided into land-based techniques and techniques of aquaculture","tokens":["The","use","of","biogenetic","technology","in","food","production","can","be","divided","roughly","into","two","main","categories:","genetic","agriculture","and","genetic","food","processing.","The","application","of","genetic","engineering","to","agriculture","can","be","further","subdivided","into","land-based","techniques","and","techniques","of","aquaculture"]},{"text":"and mariculture. Many of the most recent techniques of land-based agriculture are important in animal farming, but some apply mainly to vegetable farming. A few techniques are useful to both.","tokens":["and","mariculture.","Many","of","the","most","recent","techniques","of","land-based","agriculture","are","important","in","animal","farming,","but","some","apply","mainly","to","vegetable","farming.","A","few","techniques","are","useful","to","both."]},{"text":"Animal farming already uses the process of in vitro fertilization to increase the number of offspring. In this process, scientists remove the egg from the female's body and fertilize it with sperm from the male.","tokens":["Animal","farming","already","uses","the","process","of","in","vitro","fertilization","to","increase","the","number","of","offspring.","In","this","process,","scientists","remove","the","egg","from","the","female's","body","and","fertilize","it","with","sperm","from","the","male."]},{"text":"After a few days, the egg is placed in the uterus grows to term and has a normal birth. Another process that farmers and scientists may eventually use to produce offspring is cloning.","tokens":["After","a","few","days,","the","egg","is","placed","in","the","uterus","grows","to","term","and","has","a","normal","birth.","Another","process","that","farmers","and","scientists","may","eventually","use","to","produce","offspring","is","cloning."]},{"text":"In cloning, offspring develop from the cells of one parent only and become physically identical to that parent. Although it may be many years before it become some simpler creatures such as frogs.","tokens":["In","cloning,","offspring","develop","from","the","cells","of","one","parent","only","and","become","physically","identical","to","that","parent.","Although","it","may","be","many","years","before","it","become","some","simpler","creatures","such","as","frogs."]},{"text":"Farther into the future, researchers hope to use a process called cell fusion, or selfing, to produce offspring in a way that rapidly then be corrected by genetic engineering.","tokens":["Farther","into","the","future,","researchers","hope","to","use","a","process","called","cell","fusion,","or","selfing,","to","produce","offspring","in","a","way","that","rapidly","then","be","corrected","by","genetic","engineering."]},{"text":"And research is already producing new or improved species of cattle and other farm animals. Genetically engineered species will also benefit fruit and vegetable farming, which has made use of cloning and species mixing for many years.","tokens":["And","research","is","already","producing","new","or","improved","species","of","cattle","and","other","farm","animals.","Genetically","engineered","species","will","also","benefit","fruit","and","vegetable","farming,","which","has","made","use","of","cloning","and","species","mixing","for","many","years."]},{"text":"The relatively simple process of grafting enables farmers to clone plants or to produce hybrids that are ideally suited to local conditions. This technique brought about the so-called Green Revolution, which greatly increased the food production of many Third World","tokens":["The","relatively","simple","process","of","grafting","enables","farmers","to","clone","plants","or","to","produce","hybrids","that","are","ideally","suited","to","local","conditions.","This","technique","brought","about","the","so-called","Green","Revolution,","which","greatly","increased","the","food","production","of","many","Third","World"]},{"text":"countries. The next major genetic breakthrough in cereal crop production will perhaps be a new species of wheat that does not require expensive fertilizer.","tokens":["countries.","The","next","major","genetic","breakthrough","in","cereal","crop","production","will","perhaps","be","a","new","species","of","wheat","that","does","not","require","expensive","fertilizer."]},{"text":"Unlike genetic agriculture, genetic food processing has used biotechnology for centuries. People have used yeasts to ferment foods for at least six thousand years.","tokens":["Unlike","genetic","agriculture,","genetic","food","processing","has","used","biotechnology","for","centuries.","People","have","used","yeasts","to","ferment","foods","for","at","least","six","thousand","years."]},{"text":"Today genetic food technology has two main purposes; to create the modern sweeteners, flavors, and fragrances of mass-produced convenience foods; and to develop new kinds of foods.","tokens":["Today","genetic","food","technology","has","two","main","purposes;","to","create","the","modern","sweeteners,","flavors,","and","fragrances","of","mass-produced","convenience","foods;","and","to","develop","new","kinds","of","foods."]},{"text":"Scientists have found ways not only to improve the user of yeasts but also to create new sources of nutrition. In the near future, scientists expect to use the new technology to create completely new kinds of food.","tokens":["Scientists","have","found","ways","not","only","to","improve","the","user","of","yeasts","but","also","to","create","new","sources","of","nutrition.","In","the","near","future,","scientists","expect","to","use","the","new","technology","to","create","completely","new","kinds","of","food."]},{"text":"Already they have created a nutritional substance called single-cell protein, which is commonly added to animal feeds. Genetic techniques have found applications in at least two other important fields; the mining industry and pollution control.","tokens":["Already","they","have","created","a","nutritional","substance","called","single-cell","protein,","which","is","commonly","added","to","animal","feeds.","Genetic","techniques","have","found","applications","in","at","least","two","other","important","fields;","the","mining","industry","and","pollution","control."]},{"text":"Miners could use genetically produced bacteria with appetites for heavy metals and oil to extract these minerals from mines and wells. However important genetic engineering may be for industry, its effects are likely to be still greater in the field","tokens":["Miners","could","use","genetically","produced","bacteria","with","appetites","for","heavy","metals","and","oil","to","extract","these","minerals","from","mines","and","wells.","However","important","genetic","engineering","may","be","for","industry,","its","effects","are","likely","to","be","still","greater","in","the","field"]},{"text":"of medicine. Medical biotechnology is providing both new medical substances and new medical techniques. Among the substances, the most important have been drugs, enzymes, and hormones.","tokens":["of","medicine.","Medical","biotechnology","is","providing","both","new","medical","substances","and","new","medical","techniques.","Among","the","substances,","the","most","important","have","been","drugs,","enzymes,","and","hormones."]},{"text":"Human insulin, a hormone produced by genetically engineered bacteria, became, in 1988, the first genetically engineered product to be licensed for human use. The included the human growth hormone, which is helpful in treat in certain kinds of growth defects","tokens":["Human","insulin,","a","hormone","produced","by","genetically","engineered","bacteria,","became,","in","1988,","the","first","genetically","engineered","product","to","be","licensed","for","human","use.","The","included","the","human","growth","hormone,","which","is","helpful","in","treat","in","certain","kinds","of","growth","defects"]},{"text":"in children, and an improved version of the antibiotic penicillin. Eventually, new antibiotics have learned how to use biotechnology to produce cortisone cheaply and in large quantities.","tokens":["in","children,","and","an","improved","version","of","the","antibiotic","penicillin.","Eventually,","new","antibiotics","have","learned","how","to","use","biotechnology","to","produce","cortisone","cheaply","and","in","large","quantities."]},{"text":"Doctors use this substance to treat arthritis and several other disorders. To control pain, genetic engineering has yielded a group of chemicals called endorphins.","tokens":["Doctors","use","this","substance","to","treat","arthritis","and","several","other","disorders.","To","control","pain,","genetic","engineering","has","yielded","a","group","of","chemicals","called","endorphins."]},{"text":"These are twelve hundred morphine, they are very safe to use, improved version of the enzyme L-asparaginase, a chemical used to treat leukemia. As the advances in biotechnology occur at an ever increasing rate, public attitudes toward recombinant DNA technology","tokens":["These","are","twelve","hundred","morphine,","they","are","very","safe","to","use,","improved","version","of","the","enzyme","L-asparaginase,","a","chemical","used","to","treat","leukemia.","As","the","advances","in","biotechnology","occur","at","an","ever","increasing","rate,","public","attitudes","toward","recombinant","DNA","technology"]},{"text":"will have trouble keeping up with the latest knowledge. Polls indicate that a significant number of people have little understanding of current biotechnology. And the breakthroughs are coming with such speed that education and the media will have difficulty keeping","tokens":["will","have","trouble","keeping","up","with","the","latest","knowledge.","Polls","indicate","that","a","significant","number","of","people","have","little","understanding","of","current","biotechnology.","And","the","breakthroughs","are","coming","with","such","speed","that","education","and","the","media","will","have","difficulty","keeping"]},{"text":"the public informed. A widening gap between scientific knowledge and public understanding could, at the very least, have serious ethical and legal consequences.","tokens":["the","public","informed.","A","widening","gap","between","scientific","knowledge","and","public","understanding","could,","at","the","very","least,","have","serious","ethical","and","legal","consequences."]}]},"T38":{"key":"T38","title":"T38 Western Europe is already sick of its…","paras":[{"text":"Western Europe is already sick of its poor relations. This summer, thousands of holidaymakers from Poland and Czechoslovakia crammed onto dilapidated tour buses and headed west for a break, much to the chagrin of local hoteliers, the cashstrapped visitors also","tokens":["Western","Europe","is","already","sick","of","its","poor","relations.","This","summer,","thousands","of","holidaymakers","from","Poland","and","Czechoslovakia","crammed","onto","dilapidated","tour","buses","and","headed","west","for","a","break,","much","to","the","chagrin","of","local","hoteliers,","the","cashstrapped","visitors","also"]},{"text":"used their buses as dormitories. Nor did restaurateurs fare much better. Fearing western European prices, the tourists brought their own food with them. Dubbed \"Trabant tourists\" in a slighting reference to the infamous East German box-shaped car, the visitors received","tokens":["used","their","buses","as","dormitories.","Nor","did","restaurateurs","fare","much","better.","Fearing","western","European","prices,","the","tourists","brought","their","own","food","with","them.","Dubbed","\"Trabant","tourists\"","in","a","slighting","reference","to","the","infamous","East","German","box-shaped","car,","the","visitors","received"]},{"text":"a frosty welcome. Paris mayor Jacques Chirac ordered police to clear out those sleeping in the city's parks. The exasperated keeper of the Notre Dame souvenir kiosk commented, \"They don't buy less than other tourists; they simply don't buy at","tokens":["a","frosty","welcome.","Paris","mayor","Jacques","Chirac","ordered","police","to","clear","out","those","sleeping","in","the","city's","parks.","The","exasperated","keeper","of","the","Notre","Dame","souvenir","kiosk","commented,","\"They","don't","buy","less","than","other","tourists;","they","simply","don't","buy","at"]},{"text":"all.\" After protracted discussions, U.S. and Philippine negotiators agreed on a proposal allowing the U.S. military to use its bases for then more years.","tokens":["all.\"","After","protracted","discussions,","U.S.","and","Philippine","negotiators","agreed","on","a","proposal","allowing","the","U.S.","military","to","use","its","bases","for","then","more","years."]},{"text":"Under the terms of the agreement, the U.S.A. would have given $23 million in annual aid. In addition, President Bush promised to provide surplus military equipment and medical supplies.","tokens":["Under","the","terms","of","the","agreement,","the","U.S.A.","would","have","given","$23","million","in","annual","aid.","In","addition,","President","Bush","promised","to","provide","surplus","military","equipment","and","medical","supplies."]},{"text":"However, a majority of Philippine senators joined forces to throw out the new treaty. They argued that the aid figure was almost insult- ingly low.","tokens":["However,","a","majority","of","Philippine","senators","joined","forces","to","throw","out","the","new","treaty.","They","argued","that","the","aid","figure","was","almost","insult-","ingly","low."]},{"text":"Equally, the very presence of American forces on Philippine soil rankled them as an infringement of national sovereignty. Even so, the Philippines' poverty could ultimately leave it at the mercy of East Asia's economic giants.","tokens":["Equally,","the","very","presence","of","American","forces","on","Philippine","soil","rankled","them","as","an","infringement","of","national","sovereignty.","Even","so,","the","Philippines'","poverty","could","ultimately","leave","it","at","the","mercy","of","East","Asia's","economic","giants."]},{"text":"Countries like Japan, concerned about regional security, are continuing to use their financial leverage to urge the Philippines to extend the bases' lease. The DPP's draft constitution for a \"Republic of Taiwan\" has quickly fallen afoul of KMT criticism.","tokens":["Countries","like","Japan,","concerned","about","regional","security,","are","continuing","to","use","their","financial","leverage","to","urge","the","Philippines","to","extend","the","bases'","lease.","The","DPP's","draft","constitution","for","a","\"Republic","of","Taiwan\"","has","quickly","fallen","afoul","of","KMT","criticism."]},{"text":"Legislators called the proposed consti- tution \"infantile,\" arguing that it would merely fuel tension across the Taiwan Straits. Huang Chu-wen, leader of the KMT's Wisdom Coalition cautioned that with the R.O.C.","tokens":["Legislators","called","the","proposed","consti-","tution","\"infantile,\"","arguing","that","it","would","merely","fuel","tension","across","the","Taiwan","Straits.","Huang","Chu-wen,","leader","of","the","KMT's","Wisdom","Coalition","cautioned","that","with","the","R.O.C."]},{"text":"already standing on the threshold of historic constitutional reform, this was the wrong time to rock the boat. At nearly 90 years of age, W.","tokens":["already","standing","on","the","threshold","of","historic","constitutional","reform,","this","was","the","wrong","time","to","rock","the","boat.","At","nearly","90","years","of","age,","W."]},{"text":"Eduards Deming is one of the seminal forces in world business. He is the man credited with remaking the me- aning of the words \"Made in Japan.\"","tokens":["Eduards","Deming","is","one","of","the","seminal","forces","in","world","business.","He","is","the","man","credited","with","remaking","the","me-","aning","of","the","words","\"Made","in","Japan.\""]},{"text":"Deming is the person who taught quality control to Japanese industry. Over a 40-year period, he has taught his management philosophy to thou- sands of Japanese executives, engineers and business people.","tokens":["Deming","is","the","person","who","taught","quality","control","to","Japanese","industry.","Over","a","40-year","period,","he","has","taught","his","management","philosophy","to","thou-","sands","of","Japanese","executives,","engineers","and","business","people."]},{"text":"The emperor himself presented a medal to Deming in acknowledgment of the hefty con- tribution he made to Japan's postwar recovery. A prestigious annual in- dustrial quality award \"The Deming Prize\" was named after him.","tokens":["The","emperor","himself","presented","a","medal","to","Deming","in","acknowledgment","of","the","hefty","con-","tribution","he","made","to","Japan's","postwar","recovery.","A","prestigious","annual","in-","dustrial","quality","award","\"The","Deming","Prize\"","was","named","after","him."]},{"text":"You can see the results of Dr. Deming's teaching in the glittering ar- rays of consumer goods all around you marked \"Made in Japan.\"","tokens":["You","can","see","the","results","of","Dr.","Deming's","teaching","in","the","glittering","ar-","rays","of","consumer","goods","all","around","you","marked","\"Made","in","Japan.\""]},{"text":"Oh, he's the person responsible for all of this, Yes. In the United States, the Malcolm Baldridge National Quality Award was inspired by the success of the Deming Prize.","tokens":["Oh,","he's","the","person","responsible","for","all","of","this,","Yes.","In","the","United","States,","the","Malcolm","Baldridge","National","Quality","Award","was","inspired","by","the","success","of","the","Deming","Prize."]},{"text":"The product may be stamped \"Made in Japan,\" but the techniques for creating the quality were made in the U.S.A.. It is the result of applying a management philosophy which might be called a \"Deming Doctrine.\"","tokens":["The","product","may","be","stamped","\"Made","in","Japan,\"","but","the","techniques","for","creating","the","quality","were","made","in","the","U.S.A..","It","is","the","result","of","applying","a","management","philosophy","which","might","be","called","a","\"Deming","Doctrine.\""]},{"text":"It has 14 points in all but boils down to a single key word: quality. According to Deming, quality is the key to success.","tokens":["It","has","14","points","in","all","but","boils","down","to","a","single","key","word:","quality.","According","to","Deming,","quality","is","the","key","to","success."]},{"text":"Not cost, quotas or faster production. Quality. Furthermore, quality isn't expensive. Designing a manufacturing system to produce quality actually lowers costs and increases productivity.","tokens":["Not","cost,","quotas","or","faster","production.","Quality.","Furthermore,","quality","isn't","expensive.","Designing","a","manufacturing","system","to","produce","quality","actually","lowers","costs","and","increases","productivity."]},{"text":"Deming's philosophy trashes some hallowed icons of American manage- ment practice: merit bonuses, performance reviews, management by object and (that cherished old wheeze) \"competition is the secret to better service and lower costs.\"","tokens":["Deming's","philosophy","trashes","some","hallowed","icons","of","American","manage-","ment","practice:","merit","bonuses,","performance","reviews,","management","by","object","and","(that","cherished","old","wheeze)","\"competition","is","the","secret","to","better","service","and","lower","costs.\""]},{"text":"Not so, according to Deming. Quality itself is what lowers costs. By building quality into the system, you eliminate waste in the form of rejects.","tokens":["Not","so,","according","to","Deming.","Quality","itself","is","what","lowers","costs.","By","building","quality","into","the","system,","you","eliminate","waste","in","the","form","of","rejects."]},{"text":"And you end up with a product customers are eager to buy. Deming's philosophy stems from the work of a man who influenced him enormously.","tokens":["And","you","end","up","with","a","product","customers","are","eager","to","buy.","Deming's","philosophy","stems","from","the","work","of","a","man","who","influenced","him","enormously."]},{"text":"A Bell labs scientist named Walter A. Shewart developed a new way of using statistics to control manufacturing processes. Deming championed Shewart's ideas to anyone who would listen.","tokens":["A","Bell","labs","scientist","named","Walter","A.","Shewart","developed","a","new","way","of","using","statistics","to","control","manufacturing","processes.","Deming","championed","Shewart's","ideas","to","anyone","who","would","listen."]},{"text":"The basics are quite simple. All processes suffer from some degree of variation. By using statistical analyses, you can measure these variations and find out what causes them.","tokens":["The","basics","are","quite","simple.","All","processes","suffer","from","some","degree","of","variation.","By","using","statistical","analyses,","you","can","measure","these","variations","and","find","out","what","causes","them."]},{"text":"Then by eliminating the causes of the variations you improve the quality of the finished product by making sure it comes out right to begin with.","tokens":["Then","by","eliminating","the","causes","of","the","variations","you","improve","the","quality","of","the","finished","product","by","making","sure","it","comes","out","right","to","begin","with."]},{"text":"Obvious, perhaps, but not common practice. The usual method was to inspect the finished product and throw out the subjects. This idea drives Deming right up the wall.","tokens":["Obvious,","perhaps,","but","not","common","practice.","The","usual","method","was","to","inspect","the","finished","product","and","throw","out","the","subjects.","This","idea","drives","Deming","right","up","the","wall."]},{"text":"According to him, if you're inspecting the finished product, you're too late. The damage has already been done. The bottom-line types in the U.S.","tokens":["According","to","him,","if","you're","inspecting","the","finished","product,","you're","too","late.","The","damage","has","already","been","done.","The","bottom-line","types","in","the","U.S."]},{"text":"loved \"planned obsolescence.\" Nobody cared to listen to Dr. Deming, or his 14 points, or his ideas about quell. But the Japanese were listening.","tokens":["loved","\"planned","obsolescence.\"","Nobody","cared","to","listen","to","Dr.","Deming,","or","his","14","points,","or","his","ideas","about","quell.","But","the","Japanese","were","listening."]},{"text":"Rebuilding industries that had been flattened during the war, and with a huge population to feed, they were desperate to find a way to make their products saleable in the world marketplace.","tokens":["Rebuilding","industries","that","had","been","flattened","during","the","war,","and","with","a","huge","population","to","feed,","they","were","desperate","to","find","a","way","to","make","their","products","saleable","in","the","world","marketplace."]},{"text":"They were well aware that the words \"Made in Japan\" evoked the image of ticky-tacky paper flowers that opened when you dropped them in water.","tokens":["They","were","well","aware","that","the","words","\"Made","in","Japan\"","evoked","the","image","of","ticky-tacky","paper","flowers","that","opened","when","you","dropped","them","in","water."]},{"text":"In 1950, the Union of Japanese Scientists and Engineers invited Deming to Japan because of his reputation for using statistics to improve the quality of data at the United States Census Bureau, where he had been working.","tokens":["In","1950,","the","Union","of","Japanese","Scientists","and","Engineers","invited","Deming","to","Japan","because","of","his","reputation","for","using","statistics","to","improve","the","quality","of","data","at","the","United","States","Census","Bureau,","where","he","had","been","working."]},{"text":"Deming assured his hosts they could use statistical analyses to im- prove their manufacturing, and if they concentrated on producing products of high quality, they would find a ready market for them around the world.","tokens":["Deming","assured","his","hosts","they","could","use","statistical","analyses","to","im-","prove","their","manufacturing,","and","if","they","concentrated","on","producing","products","of","high","quality,","they","would","find","a","ready","market","for","them","around","the","world."]},{"text":"The rest, as they say, is history. So historical, in fact, that even American industry, tired of taking a shellacking from Japanese competitors, is starting to listen to Dr.","tokens":["The","rest,","as","they","say,","is","history.","So","historical,","in","fact,","that","even","American","industry,","tired","of","taking","a","shellacking","from","Japanese","competitors,","is","starting","to","listen","to","Dr."]},{"text":"Deming's ideas about quality. The coveted new Malcolm Baldridge National Quality Award proves it. And listening they are. Deming is now one of the most sought-after consultants in American business, which is eager now to play catch-up-ball with Japanese.","tokens":["Deming's","ideas","about","quality.","The","coveted","new","Malcolm","Baldridge","National","Quality","Award","proves","it.","And","listening","they","are.","Deming","is","now","one","of","the","most","sought-after","consultants","in","American","business,","which","is","eager","now","to","play","catch-up-ball","with","Japanese."]},{"text":"A checklist of management must for creating quality. In his book out of Crisis, published by MIT, Dr. Deming elaborates on his famous 14 mana- gerial points.","tokens":["A","checklist","of","management","must","for","creating","quality.","In","his","book","out","of","Crisis,","published","by","MIT,","Dr.","Deming","elaborates","on","his","famous","14","mana-","gerial","points."]},{"text":"Some of the most important: Purchase materials on the basis of quality, not cost. Don't let low bid be the basis for choice. Establish long-term ties with suppliers who provide the best material.","tokens":["Some","of","the","most","important:","Purchase","materials","on","the","basis","of","quality,","not","cost.","Don't","let","low","bid","be","the","basis","for","choice.","Establish","long-term","ties","with","suppliers","who","provide","the","best","material."]},{"text":"Don't rely on inspections to provide quality control. Instead, improve and control the manufacturing process itself. Use statistical evidence not managerial judgment to upgrade the system.","tokens":["Don't","rely","on","inspections","to","provide","quality","control.","Instead,","improve","and","control","the","manufacturing","process","itself.","Use","statistical","evidence","not","managerial","judgment","to","upgrade","the","system."]},{"text":"Eliminate numerical quotas as the benchmark for success. You can sacrifice quality striving to meet quotas. And a quota creates a mental cutoff point.","tokens":["Eliminate","numerical","quotas","as","the","benchmark","for","success.","You","can","sacrifice","quality","striving","to","meet","quotas.","And","a","quota","creates","a","mental","cutoff","point."]},{"text":"Make quality itself the goal. Eliminate barriers between departments so that, for example, the sales department isn't designing pro- ducts the factory can't produce.","tokens":["Make","quality","itself","the","goal.","Eliminate","barriers","between","departments","so","that,","for","example,","the","sales","department","isn't","designing","pro-","ducts","the","factory","can't","produce."]},{"text":"Encourage teamwork, not competition. Get rid of merit bonuses and ratings that encourage bickering and backstabbing. Provide managers and workers with all the training and retraining they need to participate in the improvement process.","tokens":["Encourage","teamwork,","not","competition.","Get","rid","of","merit","bonuses","and","ratings","that","encourage","bickering","and","backstabbing.","Provide","managers","and","workers","with","all","the","training","and","retraining","they","need","to","participate","in","the","improvement","process."]},{"text":"Finally, but most important of all, management must commit itself to a that the customer and the level of customer satisfaction are the most commit itself to a continuing and never ending quest for quality, based on the realization that","tokens":["Finally,","but","most","important","of","all,","management","must","commit","itself","to","a","that","the","customer","and","the","level","of","customer","satisfaction","are","the","most","commit","itself","to","a","continuing","and","never","ending","quest","for","quality,","based","on","the","realization","that"]},{"text":"the customer the level of customer satisfaction are the most critical elements in the entire production cycle. Quality and productivity are everybody's job, but management must lead in establishing the pursuit of quality as a corporate goal and in charting","tokens":["the","customer","the","level","of","customer","satisfaction","are","the","most","critical","elements","in","the","entire","production","cycle.","Quality","and","productivity","are","everybody's","job,","but","management","must","lead","in","establishing","the","pursuit","of","quality","as","a","corporate","goal","and","in","charting"]},{"text":"good strategies for continuous improvement and as our venerable founder came to the chapter which deals with Scooge's change of heart and charity to his clerk's family, he broke down in tears and vowed that he would never have the","tokens":["good","strategies","for","continuous","improvement","and","as","our","venerable","founder","came","to","the","chapter","which","deals","with","Scooge's","change","of","heart","and","charity","to","his","clerk's","family,","he","broke","down","in","tears","and","vowed","that","he","would","never","have","the"]},{"text":"reputation of a Scrooge. The gruff yet polished voice droned on. Sitting around the boardroom solid oak table, the 12 partners of Benson and Benson Law Offices tried hard not to doze off.","tokens":["reputation","of","a","Scrooge.","The","gruff","yet","polished","voice","droned","on.","Sitting","around","the","boardroom","solid","oak","table,","the","12","partners","of","Benson","and","Benson","Law","Offices","tried","hard","not","to","doze","off."]},{"text":"A few too many generous glasses of cognac made the task difficult. \"Josiah Benson stipulated in his will that every Christmas Eve, Benson and Benson would randomly select a needy family in this city of London and give them a","tokens":["A","few","too","many","generous","glasses","of","cognac","made","the","task","difficult.","\"Josiah","Benson","stipulated","in","his","will","that","every","Christmas","Eve,","Benson","and","Benson","would","randomly","select","a","needy","family","in","this","city","of","London","and","give","them","a"]},{"text":"turkey. Today, that honor has fallen to our youngest partner, Michael.\" This announcement stirred a halfhearted ripple of applause. To the senior partners, Michael, with his Gucci shoes and riviera tan, was a yuppie, not a gentleman.","tokens":["turkey.","Today,","that","honor","has","fallen","to","our","youngest","partner,","Michael.\"","This","announcement","stirred","a","halfhearted","ripple","of","applause.","To","the","senior","partners,","Michael,","with","his","Gucci","shoes","and","riviera","tan,","was","a","yuppie,","not","a","gentleman."]},{"text":"His aggressive selfpromotion did not go down well. There was no doubt, however, that his dynamism had dragged the dusty old firm into the modern age with a corresponding upswing in profits.","tokens":["His","aggressive","selfpromotion","did","not","go","down","well.","There","was","no","doubt,","however,","that","his","dynamism","had","dragged","the","dusty","old","firm","into","the","modern","age","with","a","corresponding","upswing","in","profits."]},{"text":"\"This wretched turkey,\" Michael hissed under his breath. It was six o'clock, and he had been stuck in traffic for over an hour. He'd never set foot in east London before.","tokens":["\"This","wretched","turkey,\"","Michael","hissed","under","his","breath.","It","was","six","o'clock,","and","he","had","been","stuck","in","traffic","for","over","an","hour.","He'd","never","set","foot","in","east","London","before."]},{"text":"To Michael, it was one of those places you avoided for fear of being mugged. He glanced at his watch. His girlfriend, Natasha, expected him for dinner at her parents' country mansion at seven.","tokens":["To","Michael,","it","was","one","of","those","places","you","avoided","for","fear","of","being","mugged.","He","glanced","at","his","watch.","His","girlfriend,","Natasha,","expected","him","for","dinner","at","her","parents'","country","mansion","at","seven."]},{"text":"Blocked by yet another red light, he dreamed of what she might be warming tonight her long, silk skirts from Bond Street, her Pierre Cardin accessories, the enticing hint of Chaneel No.5.","tokens":["Blocked","by","yet","another","red","light,","he","dreamed","of","what","she","might","be","warming","tonight","her","long,","silk","skirts","from","Bond","Street,","her","Pierre","Cardin","accessories,","the","enticing","hint","of","Chaneel","No.5."]},{"text":"And of the presents heaped around the tree, steaming plum pudding, and Natasha's adoring smile... Am impatient honk jolted him out of his reverie.","tokens":["And","of","the","presents","heaped","around","the","tree,","steaming","plum","pudding,","and","Natasha's","adoring","smile...","Am","impatient","honk","jolted","him","out","of","his","reverie."]},{"text":"He did not belong here. At least he had found the address. Fishing the turkey out of his BMW's trunk, Michael checked the card his boss had given him.","tokens":["He","did","not","belong","here.","At","least","he","had","found","the","address.","Fishing","the","turkey","out","of","his","BMW's","trunk,","Michael","checked","the","card","his","boss","had","given","him."]}]},"T39":{"key":"T39","title":"T39 There can be few destinations more appealing…","paras":[{"text":"There can be few destinations more appealing and exotic than Nepal's Kathmandu Valley. A fertile plain, ringed by mist-shrouded mountains, set in the flanks of the snowy Himalayas, the valley encompasses three royal cities of unworldly beauty.","tokens":["There","can","be","few","destinations","more","appealing","and","exotic","than","Nepal's","Kathmandu","Valley.","A","fertile","plain,","ringed","by","mist-shrouded","mountains,","set","in","the","flanks","of","the","snowy","Himalayas,","the","valley","encompasses","three","royal","cities","of","unworldly","beauty."]},{"text":"Here, in the only Hindu kingdom on-earth, the cultural traditions of South and Central Asia meet and merge in a rich, fascinating and uniquely Nepalese whole.","tokens":["Here,","in","the","only","Hindu","kingdom","on-earth,","the","cultural","traditions","of","South","and","Central","Asia","meet","and","merge","in","a","rich,","fascinating","and","uniquely","Nepalese","whole."]},{"text":"Most travelers to Nepal arrive by air at the bright, new terminus of Tribhuwan International Airport, just five kilometers east of Kathmandu city center.","tokens":["Most","travelers","to","Nepal","arrive","by","air","at","the","bright,","new","terminus","of","Tribhuwan","International","Airport,","just","five","kilometers","east","of","Kathmandu","city","center."]},{"text":"But you can choose to make the harder (and more adventurous) journey overland from the Indian border at Birganj. In either case, your first experience of the country--before starting on a trek into the steep mountain valleys, or heading west","tokens":["But","you","can","choose","to","make","the","harder","(and","more","adventurous)","journey","overland","from","the","Indian","border","at","Birganj.","In","either","case,","your","first","experience","of","the","country--before","starting","on","a","trek","into","the","steep","mountain","valleys,","or","heading","west"]},{"text":"to relax by Pokhara's Lake Phewa--is likely to be of Kathmandu Valley. This is as it should be; Kathmandu is more than just a point of arrival; it is an experience in its own right, a destination few visitors can","tokens":["to","relax","by","Pokhara's","Lake","Phewa--is","likely","to","be","of","Kathmandu","Valley.","This","is","as","it","should","be;","Kathmandu","is","more","than","just","a","point","of","arrival;","it","is","an","experience","in","its","own","right,","a","destination","few","visitors","can"]},{"text":"ever forget. According to legend, Kathmandu Valley was once a holy lake, encircled by mountains. To this body of sacred water, inhabited by giant serpents and nags, came the first Buddha who threw a lotus seed into the lake.","tokens":["ever","forget.","According","to","legend,","Kathmandu","Valley","was","once","a","holy","lake,","encircled","by","mountains.","To","this","body","of","sacred","water,","inhabited","by","giant","serpents","and","nags,","came","the","first","Buddha","who","threw","a","lotus","seed","into","the","lake."]},{"text":"The seed sprouted and burst into a lotus flower with a thousand petals. When the Buddha saw the beauty of the flower, he caused the hills to part, draining the lake and forming a valley, so that the lotus would","tokens":["The","seed","sprouted","and","burst","into","a","lotus","flower","with","a","thousand","petals.","When","the","Buddha","saw","the","beauty","of","the","flower,","he","caused","the","hills","to","part,","draining","the","lake","and","forming","a","valley,","so","that","the","lotus","would"]},{"text":"always be protected by a rim of mountains. Many years later a Buddhist monk came to settle in the valley, where he built a tall pagoda with a gilded spire.","tokens":["always","be","protected","by","a","rim","of","mountains.","Many","years","later","a","Buddhist","monk","came","to","settle","in","the","valley,","where","he","built","a","tall","pagoda","with","a","gilded","spire."]},{"text":"This became the central stupa of Swayambhunath, which stands on a hill just west of the city of Katmandu, marking the site where the first lotus flower bloomed.","tokens":["This","became","the","central","stupa","of","Swayambhunath,","which","stands","on","a","hill","just","west","of","the","city","of","Katmandu,","marking","the","site","where","the","first","lotus","flower","bloomed."]},{"text":"To this day, the people of Kathmandu believe, the spire of Swayambhunath radiates a sacred light that protects the entire valley. Swayambhunath, set on a conical hill, provides a fine vantage to see the expanse of Kathmandu Valley.","tokens":["To","this","day,","the","people","of","Kathmandu","believe,","the","spire","of","Swayambhunath","radiates","a","sacred","light","that","protects","the","entire","valley.","Swayambhunath,","set","on","a","conical","hill,","provides","a","fine","vantage","to","see","the","expanse","of","Kathmandu","Valley."]},{"text":"From its sacred steps, looking east and south, you can see broad valley vistas, from the snaking Bagmati River to the pagodas of distant Bhaktapur.","tokens":["From","its","sacred","steps,","looking","east","and","south,","you","can","see","broad","valley","vistas,","from","the","snaking","Bagmati","River","to","the","pagodas","of","distant","Bhaktapur."]},{"text":"Kathmandu is an enigma. It seems caught in mediaeval times, yet it offers a wide variety of regional and international cuisine. First-class hotels compete with an array of mid-priced guest houses in the popular tourist district of Thamel--yet if you","tokens":["Kathmandu","is","an","enigma.","It","seems","caught","in","mediaeval","times,","yet","it","offers","a","wide","variety","of","regional","and","international","cuisine.","First-class","hotels","compete","with","an","array","of","mid-priced","guest","houses","in","the","popular","tourist","district","of","Thamel--yet","if","you"]},{"text":"walk five minutes in any direction you'll find yourself in another city, rich in the smell of spices and as old as time. This is the real Kathmandu: an unexpected, extravagant mix- ture of people and religion, child goddesses, barefoot","tokens":["walk","five","minutes","in","any","direction","you'll","find","yourself","in","another","city,","rich","in","the","smell","of","spices","and","as","old","as","time.","This","is","the","real","Kathmandu:","an","unexpected,","extravagant","mix-","ture","of","people","and","religion,","child","goddesses,","barefoot"]},{"text":"porters and sacred cows. The Kathmandu most people come to see is the \"Old City\", a tangled network of narrow alleys, stores and temples located around central durbar square.","tokens":["porters","and","sacred","cows.","The","Kathmandu","most","people","come","to","see","is","the","\"Old","City\",","a","tangled","network","of","narrow","alleys,","stores","and","temples","located","around","central","durbar","square."]},{"text":"The rambling Hanuman Dhoka, or royal palace, takes up most of the eastern side of the square. It was built almost four centuries ago by Nepal's Malla kings; today only a small part of the complex is open to the","tokens":["The","rambling","Hanuman","Dhoka,","or","royal","palace,","takes","up","most","of","the","eastern","side","of","the","square.","It","was","built","almost","four","centuries","ago","by","Nepal's","Malla","kings;","today","only","a","small","part","of","the","complex","is","open","to","the"]},{"text":"general public. At the left of the entrance stands a statue of Hanuman, the monkey god of Hindu mythology, after which the palace is named.","tokens":["general","public.","At","the","left","of","the","entrance","stands","a","statue","of","Hanuman,","the","monkey","god","of","Hindu","mythology,","after","which","the","palace","is","named."]},{"text":"Just within the main courtyard is a likeness of Narasimha, the half-man, half-lion incarnation of Vishnu, disemboweling a demon. Directly in front of the gates stands a large, tiered pagoda dedicated to Jagannath, a manifestation of Vishnu as Lord of","tokens":["Just","within","the","main","courtyard","is","a","likeness","of","Narasimha,","the","half-man,","half-lion","incarnation","of","Vishnu,","disemboweling","a","demon.","Directly","in","front","of","the","gates","stands","a","large,","tiered","pagoda","dedicated","to","Jagannath,","a","manifestation","of","Vishnu","as","Lord","of"]},{"text":"the Universe, bearing an inscription dated \"1564\". Clearly, you are within the royal precincts of a Hindu kingdom. On the southern side of the square you'll find the ornate doorway to the Kumari Bahal.","tokens":["the","Universe,","bearing","an","inscription","dated","\"1564\".","Clearly,","you","are","within","the","royal","precincts","of","a","Hindu","kingdom.","On","the","southern","side","of","the","square","you'll","find","the","ornate","doorway","to","the","Kumari","Bahal."]},{"text":"This entrance leads to one of the loveliest and most elegant courtyards in the capital. All four sides are lavishly decorated with wooden fretwork windows, ornamental brackets and carved doorways.","tokens":["This","entrance","leads","to","one","of","the","loveliest","and","most","elegant","courtyards","in","the","capital.","All","four","sides","are","lavishly","decorated","with","wooden","fretwork","windows,","ornamental","brackets","and","carved","doorways."]},{"text":"This is the home of Nepal's living goddess, the Kumari. According to tradition, a virgin female child of the Shakya community, carrying appro- priate auspicious signs, is chosen to become the Kumari and carried in state to her new home","tokens":["This","is","the","home","of","Nepal's","living","goddess,","the","Kumari.","According","to","tradition,","a","virgin","female","child","of","the","Shakya","community,","carrying","appro-","priate","auspicious","signs,","is","chosen","to","become","the","Kumari","and","carried","in","state","to","her","new","home"]},{"text":"at the Kumari Bahal. Here she remains as a living goddess, appearing in state to bless the people of Kathmandu and the royal family on festive occasions or at important religious ceremonies.","tokens":["at","the","Kumari","Bahal.","Here","she","remains","as","a","living","goddess,","appearing","in","state","to","bless","the","people","of","Kathmandu","and","the","royal","family","on","festive","occasions","or","at","important","religious","ceremonies."]},{"text":"As soon as she reaches puberty, she ceases to be considered divine, and is returned to normal life. Meanwhile, another little girl will have been chosen to become the Kumari, extending continuing protection and blessing over the Kingdom of Nepal.","tokens":["As","soon","as","she","reaches","puberty,","she","ceases","to","be","considered","divine,","and","is","returned","to","normal","life.","Meanwhile,","another","little","girl","will","have","been","chosen","to","become","the","Kumari,","extending","continuing","protection","and","blessing","over","the","Kingdom","of","Nepal."]},{"text":"Passing back into Durbar Square, directly opposite the Kumari Bahal, is a gorgeous temple dedicated to the lovers Shiva and Parvati. Statues of the divine couple stand at a first-floor window, gazing down onto the crowded square as though watching","tokens":["Passing","back","into","Durbar","Square,","directly","opposite","the","Kumari","Bahal,","is","a","gorgeous","temple","dedicated","to","the","lovers","Shiva","and","Parvati.","Statues","of","the","divine","couple","stand","at","a","first-floor","window,","gazing","down","onto","the","crowded","square","as","though","watching"]},{"text":"those passing by. Nearby stands the huge Kasthamandap, the oldest building in Kathmandu, from which the name of the city is derived. Other Hindu elements closely associated with this central area are an octagonal temple dedicated to Krishna, and--of abiding","tokens":["those","passing","by.","Nearby","stands","the","huge","Kasthamandap,","the","oldest","building","in","Kathmandu,","from","which","the","name","of","the","city","is","derived.","Other","Hindu","elements","closely","associated","with","this","central","area","are","an","octagonal","temple","dedicated","to","Krishna,","and--of","abiding"]},{"text":"interest--a four-metre-high figure of Kalabhairab, a manifestation of Shiva as the terrifying \"Lord of Time\". This figure is renowned throughout Kathmandu Valley as a true test of honesty: Local people are convinced that its is impossible to tell a lie","tokens":["interest--a","four-metre-high","figure","of","Kalabhairab,","a","manifestation","of","Shiva","as","the","terrifying","\"Lord","of","Time\".","This","figure","is","renowned","throughout","Kathmandu","Valley","as","a","true","test","of","honesty:","Local","people","are","convinced","that","its","is","impossible","to","tell","a","lie"]},{"text":"in Kalabhairab's presence. Before leaving the durbar square, take note of a stone inscription set in the outer wall of the royal palace just to the side of the main entrance.","tokens":["in","Kalabhairab's","presence.","Before","leaving","the","durbar","square,","take","note","of","a","stone","inscription","set","in","the","outer","wall","of","the","royal","palace","just","to","the","side","of","the","main","entrance."]},{"text":"Carved in 1664 by King Pratap Malla, who was clearly something of a linguist, the text includes 15 languages (including two words in French and one in English), and is supposed to be a poem to the goddess Kali.","tokens":["Carved","in","1664","by","King","Pratap","Malla,","who","was","clearly","something","of","a","linguist,","the","text","includes","15","languages","(including","two","words","in","French","and","one","in","English),","and","is","supposed","to","be","a","poem","to","the","goddess","Kali."]},{"text":"According to legend, should anyone manage to translate the entire poem correctly, milk will gush from the spout in the middle of the inscription.","tokens":["According","to","legend,","should","anyone","manage","to","translate","the","entire","poem","correctly,","milk","will","gush","from","the","spout","in","the","middle","of","the","inscription."]},{"text":"However, intoxicating though the durbar square may be, Kathmandu's appeal is not limited to palaces and religious monuments. Immediately south of the square, lying behind the Kasthamandap, lies the quarter known to the Nepalese as Jhochhen, and to a generation","tokens":["However,","intoxicating","though","the","durbar","square","may","be,","Kathmandu's","appeal","is","not","limited","to","palaces","and","religious","monuments.","Immediately","south","of","the","square,","lying","behind","the","Kasthamandap,","lies","the","quarter","known","to","the","Nepalese","as","Jhochhen,","and","to","a","generation"]},{"text":"of young western travelers as \"Freak Street\". Once the haunt of wide-eyed hippies high on a strange mixture of marijuana and mysticism, the area has been cleaned up since King Birendra came to the throne in 1972, and \"sightings\" of","tokens":["of","young","western","travelers","as","\"Freak","Street\".","Once","the","haunt","of","wide-eyed","hippies","high","on","a","strange","mixture","of","marijuana","and","mysticism,","the","area","has","been","cleaned","up","since","King","Birendra","came","to","the","throne","in","1972,","and","\"sightings\"","of"]},{"text":"genuine, old-fashioned hippies have become rare indeed. Still, a walk through Jhochhen is a stroll down memory lane, where designer cafes and \"pie shops\" strive to recreate the atmosphere of the late '60s.","tokens":["genuine,","old-fashioned","hippies","have","become","rare","indeed.","Still,","a","walk","through","Jhochhen","is","a","stroll","down","memory","lane,","where","designer","cafes","and","\"pie","shops\"","strive","to","recreate","the","atmosphere","of","the","late","'60s."]},{"text":"Ganga Path is the place to go for shopping. Fine handicrafts are on sale everywhere, including statues of deities, cast in brass and bronze or carved in scented woods.","tokens":["Ganga","Path","is","the","place","to","go","for","shopping.","Fine","handicrafts","are","on","sale","everywhere,","including","statues","of","deities,","cast","in","brass","and","bronze","or","carved","in","scented","woods."]},{"text":"Thanka, Tibetan religious paintings, are endur- ingly popular--though genuinely antique specimens are hard to find. Hand- woven textiles in linen, cotton and silk are everywhere, piled high on counters, and Tibetan, Chinese and Nepalese carpets hang from walls and doors.","tokens":["Thanka,","Tibetan","religious","paintings,","are","endur-","ingly","popular--though","genuinely","antique","specimens","are","hard","to","find.","Hand-","woven","textiles","in","linen,","cotton","and","silk","are","everywhere,","piled","high","on","counters,","and","Tibetan,","Chinese","and","Nepalese","carpets","hang","from","walls","and","doors."]},{"text":"The Nepalese are renowned for their jewellery-making skills, and the gold and silver rings, necklaces and bracelets of the Patan smiths carry intricate traceries that shown a complete mastery of the art.","tokens":["The","Nepalese","are","renowned","for","their","jewellery-making","skills,","and","the","gold","and","silver","rings,","necklaces","and","bracelets","of","the","Patan","smiths","carry","intricate","traceries","that","shown","a","complete","mastery","of","the","art."]},{"text":"Kathmandu may be the largest town in Nepal and capital of the realm, but it is only one of three \"royal cities\" clustered at the heart of Kathmandu Valley.","tokens":["Kathmandu","may","be","the","largest","town","in","Nepal","and","capital","of","the","realm,","but","it","is","only","one","of","three","\"royal","cities\"","clustered","at","the","heart","of","Kathmandu","Valley."]},{"text":"Just to the south of the capital directly across the Bagmati River, Patan--also known as \"Lalitpur\", or \"city of beauty\"--is the second largest town in the valley.","tokens":["Just","to","the","south","of","the","capital","directly","across","the","Bagmati","River,","Patan--also","known","as","\"Lalitpur\",","or","\"city","of","beauty\"--is","the","second","largest","town","in","the","valley."]},{"text":"While Kathmandu provides a unique com- bination of Hinduism and Buddhism both in its architecture and in its daily life, Patan has a distinctly Buddhist flavour.","tokens":["While","Kathmandu","provides","a","unique","com-","bination","of","Hinduism","and","Buddhism","both","in","its","architecture","and","in","its","daily","life,","Patan","has","a","distinctly","Buddhist","flavour."]},{"text":"Easily reached by taxi, bicycle or on foot, Patan is best visited on day trips from Kathmandu; hotels here are markedly inferior to those of the capital.","tokens":["Easily","reached","by","taxi,","bicycle","or","on","foot,","Patan","is","best","visited","on","day","trips","from","Kathmandu;","hotels","here","are","markedly","inferior","to","those","of","the","capital."]},{"text":"Accommodation aside, Patan is a treat for the senses--visual, spiritual and (in the spice market, at least) olfactory. It's literally packed with historical monuments.","tokens":["Accommodation","aside,","Patan","is","a","treat","for","the","senses--visual,","spiritual","and","(in","the","spice","market,","at","least)","olfactory.","It's","literally","packed","with","historical","monuments."]},{"text":"Where Patan is Buddhist, Bhaktapur--\"city of the pious\"--is predomi- nantly Hindu. Located about 16 km east of Kathmandu on the old trade route between India and Tibet, Bhaktapur is the least modernised of the three royal cities.","tokens":["Where","Patan","is","Buddhist,","Bhaktapur--\"city","of","the","pious\"--is","predomi-","nantly","Hindu.","Located","about","16","km","east","of","Kathmandu","on","the","old","trade","route","between","India","and","Tibet,","Bhaktapur","is","the","least","modernised","of","the","three","royal","cities."]},{"text":"Strict controls ensure that new buildings are rarely con- structed, and then only in an appropriate style. Motor traffic rarely enters Bhaktapur. The city was devastated by a powerful earthquake in 1934; since that time dedicated work by the Nepalese-German","tokens":["Strict","controls","ensure","that","new","buildings","are","rarely","con-","structed,","and","then","only","in","an","appropriate","style.","Motor","traffic","rarely","enters","Bhaktapur.","The","city","was","devastated","by","a","powerful","earthquake","in","1934;","since","that","time","dedicated","work","by","the","Nepalese-German"]},{"text":"Bhaktapur Development Project has restored much that was damaged or destroyed, and at the same time pro- tected the city from unrestrained development. Bhaktapur is an essential experience--a trip back to mediaeval Nepal.","tokens":["Bhaktapur","Development","Project","has","restored","much","that","was","damaged","or","destroyed,","and","at","the","same","time","pro-","tected","the","city","from","unrestrained","development.","Bhaktapur","is","an","essential","experience--a","trip","back","to","mediaeval","Nepal."]},{"text":"Finally, no visit to Kathmandu Valley would be complete without a visit to Bodhnath, also known as Bauha, the largest and most important Tibetan Buddhist monument outside Tibet.","tokens":["Finally,","no","visit","to","Kathmandu","Valley","would","be","complete","without","a","visit","to","Bodhnath,","also","known","as","Bauha,","the","largest","and","most","important","Tibetan","Buddhist","monument","outside","Tibet."]},{"text":"Set squarely in the siddhi--a zone of supernatural power where guardian deities dwell and wishes are granted--Bodhnath is just 6 km east of Kathmandu, along the old trade road to Lhasa.","tokens":["Set","squarely","in","the","siddhi--a","zone","of","supernatural","power","where","guardian","deities","dwell","and","wishes","are","granted--Bodhnath","is","just","6","km","east","of","Kathmandu,","along","the","old","trade","road","to","Lhasa."]},{"text":"Known to the Tibetans as Chorten Chempo, or \"Great Stupa\", it has been the Mecca of Tibetans in exile since the occupation of their homeland in 1950.","tokens":["Known","to","the","Tibetans","as","Chorten","Chempo,","or","\"Great","Stupa\",","it","has","been","the","Mecca","of","Tibetans","in","exile","since","the","occupation","of","their","homeland","in","1950."]}]},"T40":{"key":"T40","title":"T40 On the book jacket, author John Naisbitt…","paras":[{"text":"On the book jacket, author John Naisbitt is said to be \"one of the world's top social forecasters\". What's more, says the blurb, Naisbitt's first book, Megatrends, \"accurately predicted 10 major patterns of change which would shape the world in","tokens":["On","the","book","jacket,","author","John","Naisbitt","is","said","to","be","\"one","of","the","world's","top","social","forecasters\".","What's","more,","says","the","blurb,","Naisbitt's","first","book,","Megatrends,","\"accurately","predicted","10","major","patterns","of","change","which","would","shape","the","world","in"]},{"text":"the 1980s\". But away from the context of book jackets and promotional blurbs, Naisbitt, the man, brushes side any notion that he is a modern-day prophet.","tokens":["the","1980s\".","But","away","from","the","context","of","book","jackets","and","promotional","blurbs,","Naisbitt,","the","man,","brushes","side","any","notion","that","he","is","a","modern-day","prophet."]},{"text":"\"People think I'm talking about the future, but my books are not about predicting what lies ahead. Rather I see myself as an observer of global trends and a teacher.\"","tokens":["\"People","think","I'm","talking","about","the","future,","but","my","books","are","not","about","predicting","what","lies","ahead.","Rather","I","see","myself","as","an","observer","of","global","trends","and","a","teacher.\""]},{"text":"\"Not many people have the interest to see what's going on in the world, what are the big shifts taking place and where, and to study what the connections are.","tokens":["\"Not","many","people","have","the","interest","to","see","what's","going","on","in","the","world,","what","are","the","big","shifts","taking","place","and","where,","and","to","study","what","the","connections","are."]},{"text":"It's actually hard work and painstaking research,\" he notes. But the returns have been worth the trouble. Naisbitt has since developed the megatrends franchise into a lucrative book formula--the original Megatrends, written in 1982, has spawned Megatrends 2000 and Megatrends","tokens":["It's","actually","hard","work","and","painstaking","research,\"","he","notes.","But","the","returns","have","been","worth","the","trouble.","Naisbitt","has","since","developed","the","megatrends","franchise","into","a","lucrative","book","formula--the","original","Megatrends,","written","in","1982,","has","spawned","Megatrends","2000","and","Megatrends"]},{"text":"Women, among others. His latest and eighth book highlights eight developments in Asia that will position the region as the centre of the world.","tokens":["Women,","among","others.","His","latest","and","eighth","book","highlights","eight","developments","in","Asia","that","will","position","the","region","as","the","centre","of","the","world."]},{"text":"It's appropriately titled Mgeatrends Asia. Naisbitt, like many other thinkers, believes that an Asian renaissance is dawning. In his book, the new Asia will be a network of nations working together for mutual economic gain.","tokens":["It's","appropriately","titled","Mgeatrends","Asia.","Naisbitt,","like","many","other","thinkers,","believes","that","an","Asian","renaissance","is","dawning.","In","his","book,","the","new","Asia","will","be","a","network","of","nations","working","together","for","mutual","economic","gain."]},{"text":"The old Asia was divided by culture, language, political ideology, religious philosophies an geography. The new Asia, he believes, will be forged by economic integration, technology--in particular telecommunications--and intra-Asia mobility.","tokens":["The","old","Asia","was","divided","by","culture,","language,","political","ideology,","religious","philosophies","an","geography.","The","new","Asia,","he","believes,","will","be","forged","by","economic","integration,","technology--in","particular","telecommunications--and","intra-Asia","mobility."]},{"text":"The eight big sociological shifts listed in Megatrends Asia focus on an evolution--of networks from nation states; of a consumer-driven economy from an export-led economy; of Asian values from Western values; of market- driven trade from government-controlled trade; of supercities","tokens":["The","eight","big","sociological","shifts","listed","in","Megatrends","Asia","focus","on","an","evolution--of","networks","from","nation","states;","of","a","consumer-driven","economy","from","an","export-led","economy;","of","Asian","values","from","Western","values;","of","market-","driven","trade","from","government-controlled","trade;","of","supercities"]},{"text":"from villages; of high-tech industries from labour-intensive industries; of women as a societal force from the traditional male-dominated society; and the shifting of the global axis of influence from the West to the East.","tokens":["from","villages;","of","high-tech","industries","from","labour-intensive","industries;","of","women","as","a","societal","force","from","the","traditional","male-dominated","society;","and","the","shifting","of","the","global","axis","of","influence","from","the","West","to","the","East."]},{"text":"\"What's happening in Asia is by far the most important development in the world today. Nothing else comes close,\" says Naisbitt . \"The economic growth of Asia will drive the global economy to the benefit of all as we move","tokens":["\"What's","happening","in","Asia","is","by","far","the","most","important","development","in","the","world","today.","Nothing","else","comes","close,\"","says","Naisbitt",".","\"The","economic","growth","of","Asia","will","drive","the","global","economy","to","the","benefit","of","all","as","we","move"]},{"text":"through the balance of this century. The Moder- nisation of Asia--as opposed to the westernisation of Asia--will reshape the world as we move towards the next millennium.\"","tokens":["through","the","balance","of","this","century.","The","Moder-","nisation","of","Asia--as","opposed","to","the","westernisation","of","Asia--will","reshape","the","world","as","we","move","towards","the","next","millennium.\""]},{"text":"But Naisbitt is more than rhetoric. He's well grounded in his knowledge of the region, and his book is well researched and backed up with credible examples and statistics.","tokens":["But","Naisbitt","is","more","than","rhetoric.","He's","well","grounded","in","his","knowledge","of","the","region,","and","his","book","is","well","researched","and","backed","up","with","credible","examples","and","statistics."]},{"text":"A political scientist by training, Naisbitt first came to Asia in 1967 as advisor to the Thai government on accelerating agricultural growth in the northeastern part of Thailand.","tokens":["A","political","scientist","by","training,","Naisbitt","first","came","to","Asia","in","1967","as","advisor","to","the","Thai","government","on","accelerating","agricultural","growth","in","the","northeastern","part","of","Thailand."]},{"text":"Since then, he has been a regular visi- tor, well regarded by various Asian governments. Malaysia's think tank, the Institute of Strategic and International Studies, has made him a Distinguished International Fellow of the institute.","tokens":["Since","then,","he","has","been","a","regular","visi-","tor,","well","regarded","by","various","Asian","governments.","Malaysia's","think","tank,","the","Institute","of","Strategic","and","International","Studies,","has","made","him","a","Distinguished","International","Fellow","of","the","institute."]},{"text":"Reflecting on his first impressions of the region, Naisbitt says: \"Thirty years ago, Thailand was what you'd call the third world in the old vocabulary.","tokens":["Reflecting","on","his","first","impressions","of","the","region,","Naisbitt","says:","\"Thirty","years","ago,","Thailand","was","what","you'd","call","the","third","world","in","the","old","vocabulary."]},{"text":"Just look at how far Bangkok has come today.\" And as the region has grown, so have the people. \"Asians are today much more assertive and confident.","tokens":["Just","look","at","how","far","Bangkok","has","come","today.\"","And","as","the","region","has","grown,","so","have","the","people.","\"Asians","are","today","much","more","assertive","and","confident."]},{"text":"After years of playing second-fiddle to the West, they now have a real sense of self and a sense of destiny,\" he notes. Naisbitt says it is the new Asians--primarily the overseas Chinese entrepreneurs--who will drive and fuel the growth","tokens":["After","years","of","playing","second-fiddle","to","the","West,","they","now","have","a","real","sense","of","self","and","a","sense","of","destiny,\"","he","notes.","Naisbitt","says","it","is","the","new","Asians--primarily","the","overseas","Chinese","entrepreneurs--who","will","drive","and","fuel","the","growth"]},{"text":"or the region. He's put his money squarely on the increasing trade links between overseas Chinese and the hitherto slumbering dragon, China, as the key to Asia's future prosperity.","tokens":["or","the","region.","He's","put","his","money","squarely","on","the","increasing","trade","links","between","overseas","Chinese","and","the","hitherto","slumbering","dragon,","China,","as","the","key","to","Asia's","future","prosperity."]},{"text":"\"The metaphor for the overseas Chinese network is the Internet,\" he points out. \"Like the 'Net, the overseas Chinese network is totally decentralised; no one is in charge, everyone is at the centre.","tokens":["\"The","metaphor","for","the","overseas","Chinese","network","is","the","Internet,\"","he","points","out.","\"Like","the","'Net,","the","overseas","Chinese","network","is","totally","decentralised;","no","one","is","in","charge,","everyone","is","at","the","centre."]},{"text":"People operate out off self-interest and cooperate with each other with the aim to mutually profit. \"When I'm on the Internet in my mountain home in Tellurid, Colorado, I experience being in the centre of the 'Net.","tokens":["People","operate","out","off","self-interest","and","cooperate","with","each","other","with","the","aim","to","mutually","profit.","\"When","I'm","on","the","Internet","in","my","mountain","home","in","Tellurid,","Colorado,","I","experience","being","in","the","centre","of","the","'Net."]},{"text":"What is so powerful about the Internet is that each of the 50 million people experience the same thing. Similarly that's what makes the 57 million overseas Chinese (54 million of whom are in Asia) network so powerful.\"","tokens":["What","is","so","powerful","about","the","Internet","is","that","each","of","the","50","million","people","experience","the","same","thing.","Similarly","that's","what","makes","the","57","million","overseas","Chinese","(54","million","of","whom","are","in","Asia)","network","so","powerful.\""]},{"text":"No discussion on Asia today would be complete without the controver- sial debate over Asian values--a topic described by many Western opinion- makers as a \"red herring\" or \"fire blanket\" or issues such as democracy and human rights.","tokens":["No","discussion","on","Asia","today","would","be","complete","without","the","controver-","sial","debate","over","Asian","values--a","topic","described","by","many","Western","opinion-","makers","as","a","\"red","herring\"","or","\"fire","blanket\"","or","issues","such","as","democracy","and","human","rights."]},{"text":"Naisbitt injects his perspective: \"Hearing the debate over Asian values reminds me of the worlds of Marshall McLuhan, a famous Cana- dian sociologist. He said he did not know who discovered water but he was sure it was not a","tokens":["Naisbitt","injects","his","perspective:","\"Hearing","the","debate","over","Asian","values","reminds","me","of","the","worlds","of","Marshall","McLuhan,","a","famous","Cana-","dian","sociologist.","He","said","he","did","not","know","who","discovered","water","but","he","was","sure","it","was","not","a"]},{"text":"fish. When you're on the inside, you can't see the forest for the trees. \"Looking from the outside, it's so clear to me what Asian values are: they're about family, hard work, thrift, and the importance of a good edu-","tokens":["fish.","When","you're","on","the","inside,","you","can't","see","the","forest","for","the","trees.","\"Looking","from","the","outside,","it's","so","clear","to","me","what","Asian","values","are:","they're","about","family,","hard","work,","thrift,","and","the","importance","of","a","good","edu-"]},{"text":"cation for the children. That's not radically different from the West and elsewhere.\" The difference, he notes, lies in the execution. \"People live their beliefs and values in different ways, to different intensities, and they have different fidelities to their","tokens":["cation","for","the","children.","That's","not","radically","different","from","the","West","and","elsewhere.\"","The","difference,","he","notes,","lies","in","the","execution.","\"People","live","their","beliefs","and","values","in","different","ways,","to","different","intensities,","and","they","have","different","fidelities","to","their"]},{"text":"values. Asians truly live family values.\" In Naisbitt's opinion, the welfare state in the West has gone a long way toward undermining qualities such as hard work, self reliance, and personal and family responsibilities.","tokens":["values.","Asians","truly","live","family","values.\"","In","Naisbitt's","opinion,","the","welfare","state","in","the","West","has","gone","a","long","way","toward","undermining","qualities","such","as","hard","work,","self","reliance,","and","personal","and","family","responsibilities."]},{"text":"\"That's an unintended consequence. Asians now have a model that the West never had; so they can learn from it,\" he adds. \"Some politicians do raise Asian values as a blanket to shut up debate on issues such as democracy,","tokens":["\"That's","an","unintended","consequence.","Asians","now","have","a","model","that","the","West","never","had;","so","they","can","learn","from","it,\"","he","adds.","\"Some","politicians","do","raise","Asian","values","as","a","blanket","to","shut","up","debate","on","issues","such","as","democracy,"]},{"text":"human rights and so on. But the point is, democracy is not a neat product that you buy or don't buy. It is a process that involves everyone.","tokens":["human","rights","and","so","on.","But","the","point","is,","democracy","is","not","a","neat","product","that","you","buy","or","don't","buy.","It","is","a","process","that","involves","everyone."]},{"text":"You can't rush it; it has a life and speed of development of its own and that differs from country to country.\" Naisbitt observes that Asia is moving from traditions to options.","tokens":["You","can't","rush","it;","it","has","a","life","and","speed","of","development","of","its","own","and","that","differs","from","country","to","country.\"","Naisbitt","observes","that","Asia","is","moving","from","traditions","to","options."]},{"text":"\"The more Asian value are challenged by change, the more Asians are learning about what those values are and what they mean.\" Interestingly, Naisbitt does not count Japan as an Asian country.","tokens":["\"The","more","Asian","value","are","challenged","by","change,","the","more","Asians","are","learning","about","what","those","values","are","and","what","they","mean.\"","Interestingly,","Naisbitt","does","not","count","Japan","as","an","Asian","country."]},{"text":"(\"It's part of the G7 yet it is not part of the West; it's in a class by itself.\") He argues that Japan's economic dominance has peaked and unless it reinvents itself, the country is heading on a downward slide.","tokens":["(\"It's","part","of","the","G7","yet","it","is","not","part","of","the","West;","it's","in","a","class","by","itself.\")","He","argues","that","Japan's","economic","dominance","has","peaked","and","unless","it","reinvents","itself,","the","country","is","heading","on","a","downward","slide."]},{"text":"\"What Japan has achieved is unbelievable. But the world has changed, and so has Japan, which is currently in a spiritual crisis. The generation that built the economy of Japan is now retiring.","tokens":["\"What","Japan","has","achieved","is","unbelievable.","But","the","world","has","changed,","and","so","has","Japan,","which","is","currently","in","a","spiritual","crisis.","The","generation","that","built","the","economy","of","Japan","is","now","retiring."]},{"text":"They worked hard and were extremely dedicated. Unfortunately, their successors are mere caretakers who are not willing to take risks. The world has since gone on; the young generation have different values, they are not willing to sacrifice their lives","tokens":["They","worked","hard","and","were","extremely","dedicated.","Unfortunately,","their","successors","are","mere","caretakers","who","are","not","willing","to","take","risks.","The","world","has","since","gone","on;","the","young","generation","have","different","values,","they","are","not","willing","to","sacrifice","their","lives"]},{"text":"on the altar of commerce.\" It's clear that Megatrends Asia is written for a Western audience. Says Naisbitt: \"The majority of people in the West don't have a clue about what's going on in Asia.","tokens":["on","the","altar","of","commerce.\"","It's","clear","that","Megatrends","Asia","is","written","for","a","Western","audience.","Says","Naisbitt:","\"The","majority","of","people","in","the","West","don't","have","a","clue","about","what's","going","on","in","Asia."]},{"text":"Indeed, there are far greater numbers of people in positions of power and influence in Asia who know about the West than there are in the West who know about the East.\"","tokens":["Indeed,","there","are","far","greater","numbers","of","people","in","positions","of","power","and","influence","in","Asia","who","know","about","the","West","than","there","are","in","the","West","who","know","about","the","East.\""]},{"text":"But for all that, Naisbitt maintains that he wrote the book from an Asian point of view. \"After working to get a sense of how Asians feel and think, I some- times feel I've become Chinese.","tokens":["But","for","all","that,","Naisbitt","maintains","that","he","wrote","the","book","from","an","Asian","point","of","view.","\"After","working","to","get","a","sense","of","how","Asians","feel","and","think,","I","some-","times","feel","I've","become","Chinese."]},{"text":"Indeed, in the process of studying global trends and changes, I've become a free-floating citizen of the world. After all, when you come to think of it, people are more similar than they are different.","tokens":["Indeed,","in","the","process","of","studying","global","trends","and","changes,","I've","become","a","free-floating","citizen","of","the","world.","After","all,","when","you","come","to","think","of","it,","people","are","more","similar","than","they","are","different."]},{"text":"But we tend to focus on the differences because they're more interesting.\"","tokens":["But","we","tend","to","focus","on","the","differences","because","they're","more","interesting.\""]}]},"T41":{"key":"T41","title":"T41 He is part priest, part scientist and…","paras":[{"text":"He is part priest, part scientist and part interior designer. He will will work for anyone from the humblest hawker to the grandest millionaire.","tokens":["He","is","part","priest,","part","scientist","and","part","interior","designer.","He","will","will","work","for","anyone","from","the","humblest","hawker","to","the","grandest","millionaire."]},{"text":"There are centuries of tradition behind his art. And as technology makes more inroads into modern living, even the feng shui master, a seemingly tradition-bound figure, is moving with the times.","tokens":["There","are","centuries","of","tradition","behind","his","art.","And","as","technology","makes","more","inroads","into","modern","living,","even","the","feng","shui","master,","a","seemingly","tradition-bound","figure,","is","moving","with","the","times."]},{"text":"The modern practitioner is more likely to be wearing a Versace suit than traditional robes. He will carry a portable phone in one hand and his compass, or lo p'an in the other.","tokens":["The","modern","practitioner","is","more","likely","to","be","wearing","a","Versace","suit","than","traditional","robes.","He","will","carry","a","portable","phone","in","one","hand","and","his","compass,","or","lo","p'an","in","the","other."]},{"text":"And for many masters a computer is al- most as important for calculations and analysis as his \"ten-thousand-year calendar\". The ancient art is getting a facelift.","tokens":["And","for","many","masters","a","computer","is","al-","most","as","important","for","calculations","and","analysis","as","his","\"ten-thousand-year","calendar\".","The","ancient","art","is","getting","a","facelift."]},{"text":"Skeptics may dismiss it as hocus-pocus but feng shui (literally wind-water), or geomancy, is a thriving multimillion dollar business. Property developers pay homage--not to mention hundreds of thousands of dollars--to the art of balancing physical and spiritual forces, as do","tokens":["Skeptics","may","dismiss","it","as","hocus-pocus","but","feng","shui","(literally","wind-water),","or","geomancy,","is","a","thriving","multimillion","dollar","business.","Property","developers","pay","homage--not","to","mention","hundreds","of","thousands","of","dollars--to","the","art","of","balancing","physical","and","spiritual","forces,","as","do"]},{"text":"the businessmen and other believers. Even the Hong Kong Government is prag- matic about its existence--the 1994 report by the Director of Audit revealed that HK$515,000 (US$67,000) was paid out for two tun fu ceremonies because local villagers were upset","tokens":["the","businessmen","and","other","believers.","Even","the","Hong","Kong","Government","is","prag-","matic","about","its","existence--the","1994","report","by","the","Director","of","Audit","revealed","that","HK$515,000","(US$67,000)","was","paid","out","for","two","tun","fu","ceremonies","because","local","villagers","were","upset"]},{"text":"that construction projects in the New Territories had unbalanced the feng shui. British retailer Marks and Spencer also subscribes to the principles and practice of geomancy.","tokens":["that","construction","projects","in","the","New","Territories","had","unbalanced","the","feng","shui.","British","retailer","Marks","and","Spencer","also","subscribes","to","the","principles","and","practice","of","geomancy."]},{"text":"Lucky gold coins are buried is strategic positions beneath the floors of all Marks and Spencer stores in Hong Kong. Floor plans are drawn up in consultation with geomancy experts to ensure that the buildings are feng shui friendly, which","tokens":["Lucky","gold","coins","are","buried","is","strategic","positions","beneath","the","floors","of","all","Marks","and","Spencer","stores","in","Hong","Kong.","Floor","plans","are","drawn","up","in","consultation","with","geomancy","experts","to","ensure","that","the","buildings","are","feng","shui","friendly,","which"]},{"text":"in turn will promote a continuous ringing of the cash registers. The design of Hong Kong's five-star Regent Hotel was governed by feng shui.","tokens":["in","turn","will","promote","a","continuous","ringing","of","the","cash","registers.","The","design","of","Hong","Kong's","five-star","Regent","Hotel","was","governed","by","feng","shui."]},{"text":"Proponents of the art believed that the hotel was blocking the path of the nine dragons of Kowloon as they made their way from the mountains to the sea for their morning bath.","tokens":["Proponents","of","the","art","believed","that","the","hotel","was","blocking","the","path","of","the","nine","dragons","of","Kowloon","as","they","made","their","way","from","the","mountains","to","the","sea","for","their","morning","bath."]},{"text":"To counter this, a fountain was construct- ed at the main entrance of the hotel and floor-to-ceiling windows replaced the solid walls at the side of the building facing the waters.","tokens":["To","counter","this,","a","fountain","was","construct-","ed","at","the","main","entrance","of","the","hotel","and","floor-to-ceiling","windows","replaced","the","solid","walls","at","the","side","of","the","building","facing","the","waters."]},{"text":"The rationale was that the dragons would be lured to the hotel by the fountain, which symbolised a pearl. Having snatched the pearl, the creatures would march through the hotel lobby and through the windows to the sea, but only","tokens":["The","rationale","was","that","the","dragons","would","be","lured","to","the","hotel","by","the","fountain,","which","symbolised","a","pearl.","Having","snatched","the","pearl,","the","creatures","would","march","through","the","hotel","lobby","and","through","the","windows","to","the","sea,","but","only"]},{"text":"after making generous deposits of wealth at the hotel reception. For the unbeliever these are fanciful notions. But support for the idea of feng shui comes from the most prosaic organizations.","tokens":["after","making","generous","deposits","of","wealth","at","the","hotel","reception.","For","the","unbeliever","these","are","fanciful","notions.","But","support","for","the","idea","of","feng","shui","comes","from","the","most","prosaic","organizations."]},{"text":"Secretary- general of the International Urban Development Association, Michael Sudarkis, says: \"The cultural element of feng shui has a sound principle, which is to try to accommodate man and nature.","tokens":["Secretary-","general","of","the","International","Urban","Development","Association,","Michael","Sudarkis,","says:","\"The","cultural","element","of","feng","shui","has","a","sound","principle,","which","is","to","try","to","accommodate","man","and","nature."]},{"text":"This is one of the lessons we [the West] could learn. The Chinese have a cultural instinct for living in the community and, therefore, to organize space, but alway with nature.","tokens":["This","is","one","of","the","lessons","we","[the","West]","could","learn.","The","Chinese","have","a","cultural","instinct","for","living","in","the","community","and,","therefore,","to","organize","space,","but","alway","with","nature."]},{"text":"Indeed, the first settlement in the world to have a master plan was a town in China.\" Lai Kar-fai, who works in the science department of a Hong Kong Uni- versity would be expect to have an explanation for all","tokens":["Indeed,","the","first","settlement","in","the","world","to","have","a","master","plan","was","a","town","in","China.\"","Lai","Kar-fai,","who","works","in","the","science","department","of","a","Hong","Kong","Uni-","versity","would","be","expect","to","have","an","explanation","for","all"]},{"text":"natural phenomena. Yet he, too, is a believer. When family pressure mounted on him to get married, he ignored the small ads and introductions by friends and went straight to the feng shui man instead.","tokens":["natural","phenomena.","Yet","he,","too,","is","a","believer.","When","family","pressure","mounted","on","him","to","get","married,","he","ignored","the","small","ads","and","introductions","by","friends","and","went","straight","to","the","feng","shui","man","instead."]},{"text":"\"I believe in destiny and it mutability,\" he says. \"I don't believe that we are born with a defined destiny and I wanted to know what could be done to find a wife.\"","tokens":["\"I","believe","in","destiny","and","it","mutability,\"","he","says.","\"I","don't","believe","that","we","are","born","with","a","defined","destiny","and","I","wanted","to","know","what","could","be","done","to","find","a","wife.\""]},{"text":"Not content to let the augur do his job, Lai installed a program in his computer which checked the compatibility of potential brides. By marrying the ancient art with new tech he is echoing a trend in feng shui.","tokens":["Not","content","to","let","the","augur","do","his","job,","Lai","installed","a","program","in","his","computer","which","checked","the","compatibility","of","potential","brides.","By","marrying","the","ancient","art","with","new","tech","he","is","echoing","a","trend","in","feng","shui."]},{"text":"Scores of Taiwanese computer software companies have designed various programs for feng shui and astrology buffs. Instead of shunning such devices as gimmicks, many feng shui masters have incorporated technology into their repertoire.","tokens":["Scores","of","Taiwanese","computer","software","companies","have","designed","various","programs","for","feng","shui","and","astrology","buffs.","Instead","of","shunning","such","devices","as","gimmicks,","many","feng","shui","masters","have","incorporated","technology","into","their","repertoire."]},{"text":"After all, most younger practitioners are computer- literate and would be lost without the modern necessities of life, such as a mobile telephone. \"Technology can help us up to a point,\" says Kwong Wai-hung, a feng shui and divination master.","tokens":["After","all,","most","younger","practitioners","are","computer-","literate","and","would","be","lost","without","the","modern","necessities","of","life,","such","as","a","mobile","telephone.","\"Technology","can","help","us","up","to","a","point,\"","says","Kwong","Wai-hung,","a","feng","shui","and","divination","master."]},{"text":"\"There are various calculations which can be performed more accurately and faster using a software program, but I would never trust a computer to perform any type of analysis because it is not a living entity.","tokens":["\"There","are","various","calculations","which","can","be","performed","more","accurately","and","faster","using","a","software","program,","but","I","would","never","trust","a","computer","to","perform","any","type","of","analysis","because","it","is","not","a","living","entity."]},{"text":"Prediction depends upon the experience of years. \"It is easier to use the software, especially if I have to prepare a number of horoscopes.","tokens":["Prediction","depends","upon","the","experience","of","years.","\"It","is","easier","to","use","the","software,","especially","if","I","have","to","prepare","a","number","of","horoscopes."]},{"text":"It saves time and reduces the human error factor because you just plug in the necessary information and the computer comes up with the numbers.\"","tokens":["It","saves","time","and","reduces","the","human","error","factor","because","you","just","plug","in","the","necessary","information","and","the","computer","comes","up","with","the","numbers.\""]},{"text":"One of Kwong's clients is a prominent textile magnate heading his own consortium. His group's profits began sliding and Kwong was called in to fix the problem.","tokens":["One","of","Kwong's","clients","is","a","prominent","textile","magnate","heading","his","own","consortium.","His","group's","profits","began","sliding","and","Kwong","was","called","in","to","fix","the","problem."]},{"text":"Here, he points out, is the quintessential case of experience and tradition winning over technology--the site of the textile magnate's office was facing a massive land reclamation and construction project and that was disturbing the feng shui.","tokens":["Here,","he","points","out,","is","the","quintessential","case","of","experience","and","tradition","winning","over","technology--the","site","of","the","textile","magnate's","office","was","facing","a","massive","land","reclamation","and","construction","project","and","that","was","disturbing","the","feng","shui."]},{"text":"Kwong told the businessman that he would have to relocate his entire head office. The tycoon moved to a new office with sweeping views of the harbour.","tokens":["Kwong","told","the","businessman","that","he","would","have","to","relocate","his","entire","head","office.","The","tycoon","moved","to","a","new","office","with","sweeping","views","of","the","harbour."]},{"text":"Profits began to rise again. Despite the convenience of computer software, Kwong still swears by his traditional ten-thousand-year calendar. The calendar not only helps him calculate the four numbers of a client's birth date but also allows him to analyse","tokens":["Profits","began","to","rise","again.","Despite","the","convenience","of","computer","software,","Kwong","still","swears","by","his","traditional","ten-thousand-year","calendar.","The","calendar","not","only","helps","him","calculate","the","four","numbers","of","a","client's","birth","date","but","also","allows","him","to","analyse"]},{"text":"them, something which the computer cannot do--yet. For absolute accuracy, Kwong seeks help from another scientific source--the local observatory--for precise information on astronomical positions at an person's time of birth.","tokens":["them,","something","which","the","computer","cannot","do--yet.","For","absolute","accuracy,","Kwong","seeks","help","from","another","scientific","source--the","local","observatory--for","precise","information","on","astronomical","positions","at","an","person's","time","of","birth."]},{"text":"Kwong will use technology when it helps him but he is no slave to it. He insists that all mobile telephones and pagers be switched off while he is working on a reading--the vibrations generated by electronic and tele- communications","tokens":["Kwong","will","use","technology","when","it","helps","him","but","he","is","no","slave","to","it.","He","insists","that","all","mobile","telephones","and","pagers","be","switched","off","while","he","is","working","on","a","reading--the","vibrations","generated","by","electronic","and","tele-","communications"]},{"text":"equipment could affect the accuracy of his geomancer's compass, the lo p'an. For feng shui master Chan Ho-yan it is a case of have lo p'an will travel.","tokens":["equipment","could","affect","the","accuracy","of","his","geomancer's","compass,","the","lo","p'an.","For","feng","shui","master","Chan","Ho-yan","it","is","a","case","of","have","lo","p'an","will","travel."]},{"text":"Chan regards the compass as an essential tool and is never without it. But in a bow to technology, he acknowledges he has used software for ascertaining the four birth reference points.","tokens":["Chan","regards","the","compass","as","an","essential","tool","and","is","never","without","it.","But","in","a","bow","to","technology,","he","acknowledges","he","has","used","software","for","ascertaining","the","four","birth","reference","points."]},{"text":"He has also incorporated the use of crystals in his practice--this new age addition is prompted by the belief that crystals possess various beneficial properties.","tokens":["He","has","also","incorporated","the","use","of","crystals","in","his","practice--this","new","age","addition","is","prompted","by","the","belief","that","crystals","possess","various","beneficial","properties."]},{"text":"When called to perform feng shui calculations, Chan usually packs instruments to measure electromagnetic signals and, in one case, levels of radiation. \"Modern technology has affected the art of feng shui,\" he says.","tokens":["When","called","to","perform","feng","shui","calculations,","Chan","usually","packs","instruments","to","measure","electromagnetic","signals","and,","in","one","case,","levels","of","radiation.","\"Modern","technology","has","affected","the","art","of","feng","shui,\"","he","says."]},{"text":"\"We are dealing with invisible forces. A satellite TV receiver receives signals--that affects feng shui. So I use other instruments to check before using the lo p'an to ensure as accurate a reading as possible.\"","tokens":["\"We","are","dealing","with","invisible","forces.","A","satellite","TV","receiver","receives","signals--that","affects","feng","shui.","So","I","use","other","instruments","to","check","before","using","the","lo","p'an","to","ensure","as","accurate","a","reading","as","possible.\""]},{"text":"Not all feng shui and divination masters have taken to technology. Eschewing the trend is Lam Ping-Nam who studied with successive masters in China before setting out on his own.","tokens":["Not","all","feng","shui","and","divination","masters","have","taken","to","technology.","Eschewing","the","trend","is","Lam","Ping-Nam","who","studied","with","successive","masters","in","China","before","setting","out","on","his","own."]},{"text":"He is a proponent of the traditional (if somewhat slower) methods of augury. Lam maintains that any feng shui master worth his salt uses his experience to compensate for any incorrect readings arising from disturbances in natural forces.","tokens":["He","is","a","proponent","of","the","traditional","(if","somewhat","slower)","methods","of","augury.","Lam","maintains","that","any","feng","shui","master","worth","his","salt","uses","his","experience","to","compensate","for","any","incorrect","readings","arising","from","disturbances","in","natural","forces."]},{"text":"\"I do not use soft- ware programs to calculated horoscopes. I do not believe that it is any faster than using the traditional calendar.","tokens":["\"I","do","not","use","soft-","ware","programs","to","calculated","horoscopes.","I","do","not","believe","that","it","is","any","faster","than","using","the","traditional","calendar."]},{"text":"I just use the compass when looking at feng shui,\" he says. Just as today's seers have changed with the times by adopting and adapting to technology, it is now rare to find a feng shui master dressed in the","tokens":["I","just","use","the","compass","when","looking","at","feng","shui,\"","he","says.","Just","as","today's","seers","have","changed","with","the","times","by","adopting","and","adapting","to","technology,","it","is","now","rare","to","find","a","feng","shui","master","dressed","in","the"]},{"text":"traditional robes. More often than not, feng shui masters are clad in a designer suit. Audrey Norton, an aficionado of feng shui, recalls how disappointed she was when a feng shui master turned up to check her new apartment.","tokens":["traditional","robes.","More","often","than","not,","feng","shui","masters","are","clad","in","a","designer","suit.","Audrey","Norton,","an","aficionado","of","feng","shui,","recalls","how","disappointed","she","was","when","a","feng","shui","master","turned","up","to","check","her","new","apartment."]},{"text":"He was dressed like a bank executive. \"The fellow was in a business suit and spent half of the time taking readings with his compass and the other half talking on his mobile telephone.","tokens":["He","was","dressed","like","a","bank","executive.","\"The","fellow","was","in","a","business","suit","and","spent","half","of","the","time","taking","readings","with","his","compass","and","the","other","half","talking","on","his","mobile","telephone."]},{"text":"I was expecting more ceremony so it was all rather disappointing,\" she says. \"I think that employing technology in this area goes a long way to de- mystifying everything.","tokens":["I","was","expecting","more","ceremony","so","it","was","all","rather","disappointing,\"","she","says.","\"I","think","that","employing","technology","in","this","area","goes","a","long","way","to","de-","mystifying","everything."]},{"text":"In a way it is good because it puts modern science to work with something which many believe has no scientific basis but it also takes the fun out of it.\"","tokens":["In","a","way","it","is","good","because","it","puts","modern","science","to","work","with","something","which","many","believe","has","no","scientific","basis","but","it","also","takes","the","fun","out","of","it.\""]},{"text":"Advertising professional Sally Chow also misses the mysticism. Software programs are too scientific, she observes. \"The ability to read feng shui is like second sight, a gift which one has or one hasn't,\" she says.","tokens":["Advertising","professional","Sally","Chow","also","misses","the","mysticism.","Software","programs","are","too","scientific,","she","observes.","\"The","ability","to","read","feng","shui","is","like","second","sight,","a","gift","which","one","has","or","one","hasn't,\"","she","says."]},{"text":"\"It's intuitive. I would be very skeptical about a feng shui man who used a software program to run his readings. I'd want a second opinion.\"","tokens":["\"It's","intuitive.","I","would","be","very","skeptical","about","a","feng","shui","man","who","used","a","software","program","to","run","his","readings.","I'd","want","a","second","opinion.\""]},{"text":"But for a growing number of followers the ancient art needs a shot of youth. \"Why not use computers or whatever type of technology is available so that predictions can be more precise?\"","tokens":["But","for","a","growing","number","of","followers","the","ancient","art","needs","a","shot","of","youth.","\"Why","not","use","computers","or","whatever","type","of","technology","is","available","so","that","predictions","can","be","more","precise?\""]},{"text":"says 78-year-old grandmother Chan Lai-Keun. \"That way I can be better informed as to what the new year holds and can make appropriate arrangements.\"","tokens":["says","78-year-old","grandmother","Chan","Lai-Keun.","\"That","way","I","can","be","better","informed","as","to","what","the","new","year","holds","and","can","make","appropriate","arrangements.\""]}]},"T42":{"key":"T42","title":"T42 Going through the paper this morning, I…","paras":[{"text":"Going through the paper this morning, I came on a story that said that a large urban development in the New Jersey meadows near New York City would not upset the ecology of the region.","tokens":["Going","through","the","paper","this","morning,","I","came","on","a","story","that","said","that","a","large","urban","development","in","the","New","Jersey","meadows","near","New","York","City","would","not","upset","the","ecology","of","the","region."]},{"text":"A few pages further on I came on another story that said that the importation of tropical fish into Florida, where many of them escaped into the local waterways, was upsetting the ecology of the area.","tokens":["A","few","pages","further","on","I","came","on","another","story","that","said","that","the","importation","of","tropical","fish","into","Florida,","where","many","of","them","escaped","into","the","local","waterways,","was","upsetting","the","ecology","of","the","area."]},{"text":"There was another story about an oil spill; and still another about the development of a car that would not pollute the air. On the editorial page, both the cartoon and the lead editorial urged the development of exhaust-free automobiles","tokens":["There","was","another","story","about","an","oil","spill;","and","still","another","about","the","development","of","a","car","that","would","not","pollute","the","air.","On","the","editorial","page,","both","the","cartoon","and","the","lead","editorial","urged","the","development","of","exhaust-free","automobiles"]},{"text":"as soon as possible; if not, they warned, we wouldn't have to worry about ecology at all any more. Ecology is the branch of science which deals with the balance between living things and their natural environment; as it was","tokens":["as","soon","as","possible;","if","not,","they","warned,","we","wouldn't","have","to","worry","about","ecology","at","all","any","more.","Ecology","is","the","branch","of","science","which","deals","with","the","balance","between","living","things","and","their","natural","environment;","as","it","was"]},{"text":"used in the news- paper stories that I had been reading, it referred to the balance of nature itself. It is something that everyone is concerned with nowadays because we've suddenly awakened to find that man is destroying the balance","tokens":["used","in","the","news-","paper","stories","that","I","had","been","reading,","it","referred","to","the","balance","of","nature","itself.","It","is","something","that","everyone","is","concerned","with","nowadays","because","we've","suddenly","awakened","to","find","that","man","is","destroying","the","balance"]},{"text":"of nature more rapidly than nature can repair the damage. The wastes from our factories, from our automobiles, from our airplanes, from our power plants are polluting our lakes and rivers, the soil of our farms, the animals who share","tokens":["of","nature","more","rapidly","than","nature","can","repair","the","damage.","The","wastes","from","our","factories,","from","our","automobiles,","from","our","airplanes,","from","our","power","plants","are","polluting","our","lakes","and","rivers,","the","soil","of","our","farms,","the","animals","who","share"]},{"text":"the earth with us, and even the great oceans and the air we breathe. We face a great danger to our world, and we have discovered it at the eleventh hour.","tokens":["the","earth","with","us,","and","even","the","great","oceans","and","the","air","we","breathe.","We","face","a","great","danger","to","our","world,","and","we","have","discovered","it","at","the","eleventh","hour."]},{"text":"Let's take some examples. The industrial cities on the Great Lakes pour out their wastes into the streams that run into the lakes. One, of these streams, the Guyahoga River that goes through Cleveland, Ohio is so filled with oil","tokens":["Let's","take","some","examples.","The","industrial","cities","on","the","Great","Lakes","pour","out","their","wastes","into","the","streams","that","run","into","the","lakes.","One,","of","these","streams,","the","Guyahoga","River","that","goes","through","Cleveland,","Ohio","is","so","filled","with","oil"]},{"text":"that it is a fire hazard! Think of that--a river that can catch on fire, indeed that has caught on fire! Many of the wastes that run into the lakes are rich in the foods that are used by algae,","tokens":["that","it","is","a","fire","hazard!","Think","of","that--a","river","that","can","catch","on","fire,","indeed","that","has","caught","on","fire!","Many","of","the","wastes","that","run","into","the","lakes","are","rich","in","the","foods","that","are","used","by","algae,"]},{"text":"plants that live in the water; they become too well fed. As they multiply and then die, they choke off the oxygen which is needed by the fish and other living things in the lakes.","tokens":["plants","that","live","in","the","water;","they","become","too","well","fed.","As","they","multiply","and","then","die,","they","choke","off","the","oxygen","which","is","needed","by","the","fish","and","other","living","things","in","the","lakes."]},{"text":"The great Lakes are dying, in other words; their waters are polluted and fewer and fewer forms of life can survive in them. Another killer that we release in the water is oil.","tokens":["The","great","Lakes","are","dying,","in","other","words;","their","waters","are","polluted","and","fewer","and","fewer","forms","of","life","can","survive","in","them.","Another","killer","that","we","release","in","the","water","is","oil."]},{"text":"A huge tanker broke up off the south coast of England. Not only did it dirty the beaches, some of the best in England, but it caused the death of thousands of birds and fish.","tokens":["A","huge","tanker","broke","up","off","the","south","coast","of","England.","Not","only","did","it","dirty","the","beaches,","some","of","the","best","in","England,","but","it","caused","the","death","of","thousands","of","birds","and","fish."]},{"text":"The birds, their feathers coated with oil so that they could not fly, were a particularly sad sight. Many people tried to clean the oil from the birds, but many of them were beyond saving.","tokens":["The","birds,","their","feathers","coated","with","oil","so","that","they","could","not","fly,","were","a","particularly","sad","sight.","Many","people","tried","to","clean","the","oil","from","the","birds,","but","many","of","them","were","beyond","saving."]},{"text":"A similar disaster occurred when an off-shore oil well spilled thousands of gallons of oil into the Santa Barbara Channel, off the coast of California.","tokens":["A","similar","disaster","occurred","when","an","off-shore","oil","well","spilled","thousands","of","gallons","of","oil","into","the","Santa","Barbara","Channel,","off","the","coast","of","California."]},{"text":"California, with its rapid growth and its millions of automobiles, has had some particularly bad problems with air pollution. In fact, the word \"smog\" was coined to describe the combination of smoke and fog which often fills the air over","tokens":["California,","with","its","rapid","growth","and","its","millions","of","automobiles,","has","had","some","particularly","bad","problems","with","air","pollution.","In","fact,","the","word","\"smog\"","was","coined","to","describe","the","combination","of","smoke","and","fog","which","often","fills","the","air","over"]},{"text":"Los Angeles to the extent that the eyes hurt and brea- thing becomes difficult. The word may come from Los Angeles, but the con- dition is familiar to such other cities as Tokyo, Mexico City, Dusseldorf, and London.","tokens":["Los","Angeles","to","the","extent","that","the","eyes","hurt","and","brea-","thing","becomes","difficult.","The","word","may","come","from","Los","Angeles,","but","the","con-","dition","is","familiar","to","such","other","cities","as","Tokyo,","Mexico","City,","Dusseldorf,","and","London."]},{"text":"The chief cause of smog is the exhaust from cars and smoke from factory chimneys or apartment house incinerators. When you fly over any large city nowadays, you are aware of the dirty haze that hangs over it -- and","tokens":["The","chief","cause","of","smog","is","the","exhaust","from","cars","and","smoke","from","factory","chimneys","or","apartment","house","incinerators.","When","you","fly","over","any","large","city","nowadays,","you","are","aware","of","the","dirty","haze","that","hangs","over","it","--","and"]},{"text":"into which you must descend. But what to do about it? Give up automobiles and airplanes? Give up electricity (for power plants are major sources of air pollution)?","tokens":["into","which","you","must","descend.","But","what","to","do","about","it?","Give","up","automobiles","and","airplanes?","Give","up","electricity","(for","power","plants","are","major","sources","of","air","pollution)?"]},{"text":"Give up factories? None of these seems very probable; yet it is necessary to cut the amount of pollution in the air or the earth may become uninhabitable.","tokens":["Give","up","factories?","None","of","these","seems","very","probable;","yet","it","is","necessary","to","cut","the","amount","of","pollution","in","the","air","or","the","earth","may","become","uninhabitable."]},{"text":"People have already died when smog has settled too long and too thickly over one area. Some scientists believe that the haze in the air is block- ing out some of the heat from the sun, and that may cause","tokens":["People","have","already","died","when","smog","has","settled","too","long","and","too","thickly","over","one","area.","Some","scientists","believe","that","the","haze","in","the","air","is","block-","ing","out","some","of","the","heat","from","the","sun,","and","that","may","cause"]},{"text":"great changes in the climate. Perhaps we are bringing a new Ice Age upon ourselves. DDT seemed to be one of man's great success stories.","tokens":["great","changes","in","the","climate.","Perhaps","we","are","bringing","a","new","Ice","Age","upon","ourselves.","DDT","seemed","to","be","one","of","man's","great","success","stories."]},{"text":"DDT is an insecticide, a chemical used for killing insects. It first came into wide use about the time of World War II. It promised to bring two of mankind's most dreaded diseases, typhus and malaria, under control because it","tokens":["DDT","is","an","insecticide,","a","chemical","used","for","killing","insects.","It","first","came","into","wide","use","about","the","time","of","World","War","II.","It","promised","to","bring","two","of","mankind's","most","dreaded","diseases,","typhus","and","malaria,","under","control","because","it"]},{"text":"killed the insects that carried those diseases. It was part of the \"green revolution\" in the United States; it was used to spray the fields and kill the insects that might damage the growing crops.","tokens":["killed","the","insects","that","carried","those","diseases.","It","was","part","of","the","\"green","revolution\"","in","the","United","States;","it","was","used","to","spray","the","fields","and","kill","the","insects","that","might","damage","the","growing","crops."]},{"text":"The huge agricultural production of the united States was in part due to this new protection against insects. An enormous part of the earth's surface was sprayed with DDT at one time or another.","tokens":["The","huge","agricultural","production","of","the","united","States","was","in","part","due","to","this","new","protection","against","insects.","An","enormous","part","of","the","earth's","surface","was","sprayed","with","DDT","at","one","time","or","another."]},{"text":"After a few years, however, the first notes of warning were sounded. Wonderful as DDT was, it was also doing harm. One of the most dramatic warnings came from the American naturalist Rachel Carson in a book called The Silent","tokens":["After","a","few","years,","however,","the","first","notes","of","warning","were","sounded.","Wonderful","as","DDT","was,","it","was","also","doing","harm.","One","of","the","most","dramatic","warnings","came","from","the","American","naturalist","Rachel","Carson","in","a","book","called","The","Silent"]},{"text":"Spring. She warned that a day might come when there would be no more birds because DDT was killing the insects which were the natural food of the birds.","tokens":["Spring.","She","warned","that","a","day","might","come","when","there","would","be","no","more","birds","because","DDT","was","killing","the","insects","which","were","the","natural","food","of","the","birds."]},{"text":"By changing one part of the natural environment, we were, without realizing it, causing other changes to take place--and we might not find these changes desirable.","tokens":["By","changing","one","part","of","the","natural","environment,","we","were,","without","realizing","it,","causing","other","changes","to","take","place--and","we","might","not","find","these","changes","desirable."]},{"text":"When her book appeared, most people did not take Miss Carson's warning too seriously. The good that DDT was doing was too apparent; its bad effects had not yet become evident.","tokens":["When","her","book","appeared,","most","people","did","not","take","Miss","Carson's","warning","too","seriously.","The","good","that","DDT","was","doing","was","too","apparent;","its","bad","effects","had","not","yet","become","evident."]},{"text":"Now, however, no one is inclined any more to say that she was seeing danger where there was none to see. The effects of DDT have been dis- covered in the last few years to be even more damaging than","tokens":["Now,","however,","no","one","is","inclined","any","more","to","say","that","she","was","seeing","danger","where","there","was","none","to","see.","The","effects","of","DDT","have","been","dis-","covered","in","the","last","few","years","to","be","even","more","damaging","than"]},{"text":"she predicted. In nature, there is usually a natural balance between living things. One kind of insect will keep another from becoming too common by using the first one as food; or the birds will help to keep the insect","tokens":["she","predicted.","In","nature,","there","is","usually","a","natural","balance","between","living","things.","One","kind","of","insect","will","keep","another","from","becoming","too","common","by","using","the","first","one","as","food;","or","the","birds","will","help","to","keep","the","insect"]},{"text":"population from growing too large. Other kinds of animals will keep the birds from multiplying too rapidly. All this natural balance of one life form against another is endangered in the places where DDT has been used too much because","tokens":["population","from","growing","too","large.","Other","kinds","of","animals","will","keep","the","birds","from","multiplying","too","rapidly.","All","this","natural","balance","of","one","life","form","against","another","is","endangered","in","the","places","where","DDT","has","been","used","too","much","because"]},{"text":"the natural food supply has been changed or destroyed. But DDT has had another unexpected effect. Many chemicals break down into their different elements very quickly.","tokens":["the","natural","food","supply","has","been","changed","or","destroyed.","But","DDT","has","had","another","unexpected","effect.","Many","chemicals","break","down","into","their","different","elements","very","quickly."]},{"text":"DDT is not one of these. When it enters into the \"food chain,\" it can be passed along from one plant or animal to another without disappearing or breaking down into less harmful chemicals.","tokens":["DDT","is","not","one","of","these.","When","it","enters","into","the","\"food","chain,\"","it","can","be","passed","along","from","one","plant","or","animal","to","another","without","disappearing","or","breaking","down","into","less","harmful","chemicals."]},{"text":"Cows feeding on grass that has been sprayed with DDT take some of it into their systems, and they pass it along to us in their milk: And remember that DDT is a poison.","tokens":["Cows","feeding","on","grass","that","has","been","sprayed","with","DDT","take","some","of","it","into","their","systems,","and","they","pass","it","along","to","us","in","their","milk:","And","remember","that","DDT","is","a","poison."]},{"text":"The most widely publicized example of DDT'S toxic, or poisonous, effect is on birds. Many birds have taken in large amounts of the insecti- cide.","tokens":["The","most","widely","publicized","example","of","DDT'S","toxic,","or","poisonous,","effect","is","on","birds.","Many","birds","have","taken","in","large","amounts","of","the","insecti-","cide."]},{"text":"The eggs that are laid by some of these birds have shells that are thinner than normal. Many of the eggs are broken or do not develop, so that some species, or kinds, of birds are in danger of not","tokens":["The","eggs","that","are","laid","by","some","of","these","birds","have","shells","that","are","thinner","than","normal.","Many","of","the","eggs","are","broken","or","do","not","develop,","so","that","some","species,","or","kinds,","of","birds","are","in","danger","of","not"]},{"text":"being able to reproduce themselves. We may indeed some day have a silent spring, without the familiar songs of the birds. The dangers of DDT have become so well known that it is now against the law to use it","tokens":["being","able","to","reproduce","themselves.","We","may","indeed","some","day","have","a","silent","spring,","without","the","familiar","songs","of","the","birds.","The","dangers","of","DDT","have","become","so","well","known","that","it","is","now","against","the","law","to","use","it"]},{"text":"in many places. But what substitutes are taking its place, and what will they do to our environment? We don't really know. The chemical effect of DDT was to kill insects; it also had side-effects other than those for which","tokens":["in","many","places.","But","what","substitutes","are","taking","its","place,","and","what","will","they","do","to","our","environment?","We","don't","really","know.","The","chemical","effect","of","DDT","was","to","kill","insects;","it","also","had","side-effects","other","than","those","for","which"]},{"text":"it was used. Aspirin, to take a familiar chemical, has the effect of stopping pain; with many people, however, it has the side-effect of inducing nausea of stomach disorder.","tokens":["it","was","used.","Aspirin,","to","take","a","familiar","chemical,","has","the","effect","of","stopping","pain;","with","many","people,","however,","it","has","the","side-effect","of","inducing","nausea","of","stomach","disorder."]},{"text":"We have often rushed in with chemicals and processes or engineering projects which were intended to have particular effects. But almost as often we have not waited long enough to find out what their side-effects would turn out to be.","tokens":["We","have","often","rushed","in","with","chemicals","and","processes","or","engineering","projects","which","were","intended","to","have","particular","effects.","But","almost","as","often","we","have","not","waited","long","enough","to","find","out","what","their","side-effects","would","turn","out","to","be."]},{"text":"And often enough they have turned out to be harmful. The ecological picture isn't one of total disaster, though it will take centuries perhaps to make sure that we can live on our own earth with- out destroying ourselves and","tokens":["And","often","enough","they","have","turned","out","to","be","harmful.","The","ecological","picture","isn't","one","of","total","disaster,","though","it","will","take","centuries","perhaps","to","make","sure","that","we","can","live","on","our","own","earth","with-","out","destroying","ourselves","and"]},{"text":"the other living things that share our world with us. Probably the most hopeful part of the ecological picture is that people throughout the world are aroused to the problem.","tokens":["the","other","living","things","that","share","our","world","with","us.","Probably","the","most","hopeful","part","of","the","ecological","picture","is","that","people","throughout","the","world","are","aroused","to","the","problem."]},{"text":"The word ecology is no longer unfamiliar; it occurs frequently on the pages of newspapers, on the radio and television, in magazine articles. When I was in college, not so many years ago, ecology was a very specialized branch of","tokens":["The","word","ecology","is","no","longer","unfamiliar;","it","occurs","frequently","on","the","pages","of","newspapers,","on","the","radio","and","television,","in","magazine","articles.","When","I","was","in","college,","not","so","many","years","ago,","ecology","was","a","very","specialized","branch","of"]},{"text":"biology; in fact, I had never heard the term before I went to college--and I forgot it for a good many years thereafter. When the people become aware of a problem, and further, aroused by it, government and industry are","tokens":["biology;","in","fact,","I","had","never","heard","the","term","before","I","went","to","college--and","I","forgot","it","for","a","good","many","years","thereafter.","When","the","people","become","aware","of","a","problem,","and","further,","aroused","by","it,","government","and","industry","are"]},{"text":"much more apt to take action. A new power generating plant is being considered for New York, for example. A few years ago the major considerations would have been cost, location, and capacity.","tokens":["much","more","apt","to","take","action.","A","new","power","generating","plant","is","being","considered","for","New","York,","for","example.","A","few","years","ago","the","major","considerations","would","have","been","cost,","location,","and","capacity."]},{"text":"Nowadays, however, another factor is sure to be discussed--what the plant will do to the environment. What kind of fuel will it use? How much pollution will waste from that fuel add to the air and the water?","tokens":["Nowadays,","however,","another","factor","is","sure","to","be","discussed--what","the","plant","will","do","to","the","environment.","What","kind","of","fuel","will","it","use?","How","much","pollution","will","waste","from","that","fuel","add","to","the","air","and","the","water?"]},{"text":"Will the plant heat up the water surrounding it so that fish will be endangered? Are all possible steps being taken to cut down pollution from the plant?","tokens":["Will","the","plant","heat","up","the","water","surrounding","it","so","that","fish","will","be","endangered?","Are","all","possible","steps","being","taken","to","cut","down","pollution","from","the","plant?"]},{"text":"All these questions will be publicly debated, and the harmful effects of the proposed plant will be weighed against the benefits that it will bring.","tokens":["All","these","questions","will","be","publicly","debated,","and","the","harmful","effects","of","the","proposed","plant","will","be","weighed","against","the","benefits","that","it","will","bring."]}]}};
